x_comment(x_molarMass,"(#$molarMass CHEMICAL MOLAR-MASS) means that the mass of a quantity of CHEMICAL is considered as MOLAR-MASS (denoted in grams/mole) times the number of moles of CHEMICAL.  The term \"molar mass\" is sometimes expressed merely in grams, with the \"per mole\" understood.  The term \"molecular mass\" is expressed either in terms of #$AtomicMassUnits or in terms of grams/mole, in which case its value is the same as the #$molarMass.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a976b).
