x_comment('x_inheritRolePlayers-SubSitTypeToSubSitType',"'(#$inheritRolePlayers-SubSitTypeToSubSitType SIT-TYPE ROLE1 SUBSIT-TYPE1 ROLE2 SUBSIT-TYPE2)' means that in any instance SIT of SIT-TYPE whatever things play ROLE1 in the sub-situation SUB1 (an instance of SUBSIT-TYPE1) will also play ROLE2 in sub-situation SUB2 (an instance of SUBSIT-TYPE2).  Note that this predicate does not require that there be a unique player of ROLE1 and ROLE2 in SUB1 and SUB2.  There could be multiple such role players.  For a similar predicate that does have a uniqueness presupposition, see #$inheritRolePlayers-SubSitTypeToSubSitType-Unique.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a97c2).
