x_comment(x_someAndOnlyTypePlaysRoleInSubSituationType,"<code>(#$someAndOnlyTypePlaysRoleInSubSituationType SIT-TYPE TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE ROLE)</code> means that for any instance of <code>SIT-TYPE</code>, there exists an instance of <code>TYPE</code> that plays the role <code>ROLE</code> in the sub-situation that instantiates <code>SUBSIT-TYPE</code>, and that only an instance of <code>TYPE</code> plays that role. Cf. the more general predicate #$onlyTypePlaysRoleInSubSituationType, which does not require an instance of <code>TYPE</code> to play <code>ROLE</code> in instances of <code>SUBSIT-TYPE</code>, but rather requires that whatever plays <code>ROLE</code> in <code>SUBSIT-TYPE</code> be of <code>TYPE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a97cd).
