x_comment(x_SuicideAttack,"A specialization of #$AttackOnTangible in which a perpetrator intentionally kills himself as a means of executing the attack. #$SuicideAttack includes both attacks that take place in military operations - such as Kamikaze attacks - as well as the more familiar terrorist tactic.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a97eb).
