x_comment(x_eventPlannedBy,"(#$eventPlannedBy EVNT AGNT) means that AGNT intentionally carried out at least some significant portion of the planning required for EVNT to occur. AGNT might be an individual person or a group of people (e.g. an organization).") :- x_cid(a65b16517a97ec).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a97ec,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
