xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517a97f2,[]).
x_comment(x_animalBLOInjuredIn,"(#$animalBLOInjuredIn EVENT ANIMAL-BLO) means that, during\nthe course of EVENT, ANIMAL-BLO -- which may be either an #$Animal or\nan #$AnimalBodyPart -- suffers damage sufficient to qualify as an\n'injury'.  The injury may be due to the actions of an outside actor, as when a person is struck by a falling rock, or not, as when a person strains a calf muscle while jogging.  When\nANIMAL-BLO is an #$AnimalBodyPart, the animal of which it is a part is\nalso injured.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a97f3).
