x_comment(x_SecondOfMinuteFn,"(#$SecondOfMinuteFn k) with 0 <= k <= 59 is the collection of every (k+1)-th second of a minute.  For example, (#$TimeOfDayFn #$TimeOfDay-10AM (#$TimeOfHourFn (#$MinuteOfHourFn 30) (#$SecondOfMinuteFn 0))) is the collection of all `10:30:00am-10:30:01am' time intervals.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9803).
