x_comment(x_TimeOfDayFn,"(#$TimeOfDayFn X Y) is the subcollection of Y (a #$TimeOfHourType) containing all and only those members of Y which intersect, in fact are subsumed by, some member of X (a #$HourOfDayType), i.e., (#$TimeOfDayFn X Y) = {y: y is a member of Y, and (#$temporallySubsumes x y) for some member x of X}.  For example, (#$TimeOfDayFn #$TimeOfDay-10AM (#$MinuteOfHourFn 30)) is the collection of all `10:30am-10:31am' time intervals, and (#$TimeOfDayFn #$TimeOfDay-10AM (#$TimeOfHourFn (#$MinuteOfHourFn 30) (#$SecondOfMinuteFn 0))) is the collection of all `10:30:00am-10:30:01am' time intervals.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a980b).
