x_comment('x_PurposefulAction-ResourceDrivenWithTransfer',"A specialization of #$PurposefulAction-ResourceDriven.  Each instance of #$PurposefulAction-ResourceDrivenWithTransfer is a complex event in which an agent emplaces controlled resources and then uses them to accomplish a goal.  In other words, #$PurposefulAction-ResourceDrivenWithTransfer is a script with two scenes: #$GeneralizedTransfer and #$PurposefulAction (qq.v).  An illustrative example specialization of #$PurposefulAction-ResourceDrivenWithTransfer is #$BrushingTeeth.  Each instance of #$BrushingTeeth is an event in which a person brushes his/her teeth.  In such an event the resources controlled are a toothpaste tube and a tooth brush.  The toothpaste is emplaced appropriately on the toothbrush and the toothbrush is emplaced in the tooth-brusher's hand.  Finally, the tooth-brusher uses the toothbrush with toothpaste on it to clean his/her teeth.  Note that the resources that \"drive\" an instance of #$PurposefulAction-ResourceDrivenWithTransfer need not be consumed -- they may merely be used.  For example, in a tooth-brushing event, some toothpaste is consumed, but a toothbrush is only used.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a98ad).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a98ad,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517a98ad,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
xc_source_line(a65b16517a98ad,515).
xc_kb_names(a65b16517a98ad,[]).
xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517a98ad,[]).
x_comment(x_HiringSomeoneToDoSomething,"A specialization of #$PurposefulPhysicalAction and #$SocialOccurrence and an instance of #$LearnedActivityType.  Each instance of #$HiringSomeoneToDoSomething is  an event in which one agent hires another agent to perform a service, and in which that service is performed.  Do not confuse this collection with either #$ContractingAService or #$ServiceEvent, instances of each of which are always sub-events of instances of #$HiringSomeoneToDoSomething: in an instance of #$HiringSomeoneToDoSomething, the hirer contracts a service and pays for it, and the person hired performs the service and gets paid.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a98ae).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a98ae,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517a98ae,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
xc_source_line(a65b16517a98ae,516).
