x_comment('x_ConventionallyClassifiedTimeIntervalSeries-Disjoint',"A specialization of #$ConventionallyClassifiedTimeIntervalSeries (q.v.) and #$TemporallyDisjointTemporalObjectType.  Each instance TYPE of #$ConventionallyClassifiedTimeIntervalSeries-Disjoint is a `series' of `solid' intervals, which is conventionally named, such that members of TYPE are temporally disjoint with each other but may or may not have gaps between them.  Examples of members of this collection are #$Friday (with `gaps'), #$TimeOfDay-10AM (with `gaps'), #$CalendarYear (without `gaps') etc.  A useful specialization of this collection is #$ConventionallyClassifiedTimeIntervalSeries-DisjointWithGaps.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a98c3).
