x_comment(x_DayOfWeekInMonthFn,"A function of type #$TimeOfCyclicalIntervalGroupFunction. (#$DayOfWeekInMonthFn DAY-OF-WEEK k) is a #$DayOfMonthType containing all the calendar days each of which is the k-th DAY-OF-WEEK of a month.  For example, (#$DayOfWeekInMonthFn #$Sunday 1) is the collection of all `the 1st Sunday of the month' time intervals, and (#$DayOfWeekInMonthFn #$Monday 2) is the collection of all `the 2nd Monday of the month' time intervals.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a98cc).
