x_comment(x_CyclicalIntervalTypeOnCalendarScale,"A specialization of #$ConventionallyClassifiedTimeIntervalSeries, and a specialization of the union of all members of #$CyclicalIntervalGroupType.  Each instance of #$CyclicalIntervalTypeOnCalendarScale is a type TYPE of time intervals that recur throughout all of calendar history based on a calendar scale CS (year, month, week, day, hour etc.), i.e., TYPE intersects CS with a unique member.  Examples of specializations of this collection are #$TimeOfYearType, #$DayOfWeekType, #$TimeOfDayType etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a98cd).
