x_comment(x_performsActsOfType,"(#$performsActsOfType AGENT ACTION-TYPE) holds just in case AGENT tends to\nperform acts of ACTION-TYPE.  Performing only one action of ACTION-TYPE is probably \nnot sufficient for this relation to hold of AGENT and the ACTION-TYPE.  Requiring that the\nagent perform the acts on a regular basis is probably too strong a requirement.  The happy \nmiddle most likely depends on the context and the ACTION-TYPE.  A positive example \nwould be (#$performsActsOfType FredFlintstone BowlingActivity).") :- x_cid(a65b16517a997d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a997d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
