x_comment(x_sourceClaims,"This predicate relates a structured knowledge source with a CycL sentence that expresses something the knowledge source claims, in some sense, to be true.  This is distinguished from #$rowInSourceClaims in that the sentence claimed to be true need not express \"one or more of the physical field values which appear in some row of the knowledge source.\"  The CycL sentence could, for example, be (#$greaterThan 2380000 2000000).  In this case, the claim would not be in a row of the knowledge source but rather in how the knowledge source evaluates #$greaterThan.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a99a5).
