x_comment(x_typesNeedToBeSimilarInScalar,"(#$typesNeedToBeSimilarInScalar COL1 COL2 ATTR-TYPE) means that instances of COL1 need the same degree of an instance of ATTR-TYPE as instances of COL2. Typically, assertions using this predicate will be made in a context in which there is a presupposed goal. COL1 needs to have the same degree of ATTR-TYPE as COL2 in order to help achieve some goal or purpose.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a99b2).
