x_comment(x_genlsWRTSubSituations,"(#$genlsWRTSubSituations SPEC-TYPE SPEC-SUBTYPE1 GENL-TYPE GENL-SUBTYPE1) means that (#$genls SPEC-TYPE GENL-TYPE), SPEC-SUBTYPE1 is a scene of SPEC-TYPE, GENL-SUBTYPE1 is a scene of GENL-TYPE, and for any other SPEC-SUBTYPE and GENL-SUBTYPE where (#$genlsWRTSubSituations SPEC-TYPE SPEC-SUBTYPE GENL-TYPE GENL-SUBTYPE) holds, the quasi-temporal partial ordering in SPEC-TYPE of SPEC-SUBTYPE1 relative to SPEC-SUBTYPE is the partial ordering in GENL-TYPE of GENL-SUBTYPE1 relative to GENL-SUBTYPE, and the role-player identity constraints across GENL-SUBTYPE and GENL-SUBTYPE1 for GENL-TYPE apply to SPEC-SUBTYPE and SPEC-SUBTYPE for SPEC-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a99b7).
