x_comment(x_mainColorTingeOfObject,"(#$mainColorTingeOfObject OBJ COLOR-TINGE) holds just in case the main color tinge\nof object is COLOR-TINGE.  To express that OBJ is a particular color and not a tinge use\n#$mainColorOfObject.  This is the broadest predicate in the tinge predicate suite that\nis a specialization of #$isa.  For a more general or specific predicate, respectively, see \n#$objectHasColorTinge and #$uniformColorTingeOfObject.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9aac).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9aac,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
