x_comment(x_fiveDigitFIPSCode,"(#$fiveDigitFIPSCode LOC FIPS) relates a location LOC to the five digit code FIPS that represents the state and county of LOC.  The first two numbers of FIPS correspond to a state code and the last three numbers of FIPS correspond to the county code.  Note that county codes on their own are not necessarily unique for every county in the US.  They are unique for every county within a particular state and the combination of the state and county codes creates a unique identifier for each county in the US.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9aaf).
