x_comment(x_CourtCase,"The collection of all legal conflicts [#$LegalConflict] that come before a court.  This includes civil and criminal cases, but excludes uncontested traffic citations and official duties by justices of the peace such as marriages that do not involve judicial rulings.  Legal cases that are worked out between attorneys without involving courts, cases arbitrated outside the court system (unless under court order), and impeachment cases are not included in this collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9ad2).
