x_comment(x_NoContestPlea,"A #$NoContestPlea is an acceptance of a charge  that an person has committed a crime.  It is not an admission that that the person actually committed the crime, but an assertion that the person will not legally contest the accusation.  Such a plea normally leads to a guilty conviction.  A person may choose such a plea for a number of different reasons, including lack of resources to carry on a defense, a plea bargain resulting in the dropping of stronger or additional charges, a proffered lighter sentence than the proscecutor would seek if the defendant were convicted, to prevent the person from being held indefinitely without charges, or similar reasons.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9ad3).
