x_comment(x_LegalAppeal,"The collection of all appeals of decisions handed down by judicial bodies by the party that was maleficiary of the decision.  Such appeals are made to appellate courts [#$AppealsCourt], which may reject or hear the appeal.  A decision of an appeals court can be appealed to a \"higher\" appeals court.  A legal appeal is normally part of the case that started in the court of initial jurisdiction.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9ad6).
