x_comment(x_candidateProperSubSituationTypes,"<code>(#$candidateProperSubSituationTypes SIT-TYPE SUB-SIT-TYPE)</code> means that instances of <code>SIT-TYPE</code> (a specialization of #$Situation) may have instances of <code>SUB-SIT-TYPE</code> as proper sub-situations. (Instantiations of the script might not have a sub-situation of type <code>SUB-SIT-TYPE</code>, but the possibility that any given instantiation does have such a scene is sufficiently large or salient enough to be worth asserting.) For instance, (#$candidateProperSubSituationTypes #$DailyMorningRoutine (#$ApplyingStuffFn #$Makeup)).") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9ade).
