x_comment(x_HomoSapiens,"A specialization of #$HomoGenus and an instance of #$BiologicalSpecies: this is the species to which modern humans belong, though strictly speaking (and not entirely uncontroversially amongst paleontologists) they comprise only a subset of it (namely \"homo sapiens sapiens\"). The species also contains Neanderthal and Cro-Magnon sub-species (both now extinct). Given the evidence of sophisticated tool-use, burial practices etc. even amongst the latter two sub-species, this collection is a specialization of #$Person. See also #$HumanBody.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9adf).
