x_comment(x_denies,"The opposite of #$claims. This predicate relates an agent to a proposition \nthat s/he has denied or otherwise publicly repudiated. (#$denies AGENT SENT) means that \nAGENT claims that the proposition PROP expressed by SENT is false. Typically, AGENT \nwants others to believe PROP is false and will take action to convince others that it \nis false. Note that AGENT need not know or believe PROP to be false. For example, a \nperson might knowingly deny involvement in a crime they committed.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9b01).
