x_comment(x_ToxicityOfTypeForFn,"An instance of #$UnaryFunction.  (#$ToxicityOfTypeForFn SLOT) returns an instance PRED of #$TernaryPredicate, used to state the toxicity level (the arg3) of some type of substance (the arg1) for some organism-type (the arg2).  ((#$ToxicityOfTypeForFn SLOT) SUBSTANCE ORGANISM-TYPE TOXICITY) says that for instances ORG of the #$OrganismClassificationType ORGANISM-TYPE, the toxicity level with respect to SLOT -- an instance of #$ToxicitySlot -- for an instance SAMPLE of SUBSTANCE is TOXICITY.  In other words, (SLOT SAMPLE TOXICITY) holds for ORG.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9b0d).
