xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517a9b68,[]).
x_comment(x_ExclusiveUserRights,"A collection of instances of #$Situation-.  Each instance of this collection is a situation that consists of an agent having an exclusive right to some object.  Consider the exclusive user rights I enjoy with respect to my car.  This is a particular instance of #$Situation.  It started when I bought the car and ends when I sell it or otherwise transfer ownership.  That situation is an instance of this collection and this collection represents the kind of user right an agent has to an object when they have the sole right to use that object. There can be only one such #$Agent-Generic at a given time; that agent may be an #$Organization or an individual person. When you rent a car, you expect #$ExclusiveUserRights of it for the duration of your rental, even though you don't own the car.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9b69).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9b69,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517a9b69,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
