x_comment(x_PrimaryDetonatorExplosiveType,"A specialization of #$ExplosiveMaterialTypeByChemicalSubstance. Each instance of #$PrimaryDetonatorExplosiveType is a kind of explosive substance whose instances are typically used as the primary detonators in #$ExplosiveDevices.  These explosives are very sensitive and require a relatively small quantity of energy to initiate their explosive decomposition.  Primary detonators are typically used in to initiate the detonation of secondary explosives (see #$SecondaryDetonatorExplosiveType). Some of the most widely used primary explosives include #$Tetryl, #$LeadAzide, #$MercuryFulminate, #$LeadStyphnate, and  #$MannitolHexanitrate.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9bb8).
