x_comment(x_SecondaryDetonatorExplosiveType,"A specialization of #$ExplosiveMaterialTypeByChemicalSubstance. Each instance of #$SecondaryDetonatorExplosiveType is a kind of explosive substance whose instances are typically used as the secondary detonator in #$ExplosiveDevices.  These explosives are very insensitive.  For these substances, a relatively large quantity of energy is required in order to initiate the explosive reaction.  They have much more power than primary explosives (see #$PrimaryDetonatorExplosiveType).  They require a detonator to explode. Explosives typically used as secondary detonators include #$Dynamite, #$Trinitrotoluene, #$RDXExplosive, #$PETN, #$HMXExplosive, and #$PicricAcid.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9bba).
