x_comment(x_BlowingSomethingUp,"A specialization of both #$PhysicalDestructionEvent and #$ActionOnObject. In each instance of #$BlowingSomethingUp, some instance of #$PartiallyTangible is damaged by an instance of #$Explosion.  This collection includes the notable specialization #$Bombing, as well as instances of blowing up a mountain to make room for a road, or blowing up a piece of land in order to make a mine shaft.  Also included in this collection are naturally occuring instances of #$BlowingSomethingUp.  Lightning hitting an object may cause the object to explode under the right circumstances.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9bbc).
