x_comment('x_LethalInjection-Execution',"A specialization of #$Execution-Judicial.  Each instance of\n#$LethalInjection-Execution is an execution of an agent in punishment\nfor some crime in which drugs are administered to the agent to induce\ndeath.  First the agent is hooked up to #$IntravenousEquipment and\nstarted on a saline solution.  The agent is anesthesized, typically\nwith the barbituate sodium thiopental.  A saline solution will flush\nthe IV again, and the the agent usually receives a paralyzing agent\nlike pancuronium bromide to stop the breathing.  After another IV\nflush, some states also include a final toxic agent to induce cardiac\narrest with something like potassium chloride.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9bbf).
