x_comment(x_NonExclusiveUserRights,"A specialization of #$Situation. Each instance of this collection is a situation that consists of someone having non exclusive user rights to an object. See the comments on #$ExclusiveUserRights and #$SituationTypeByUserRights for a fuller explanation of how this is cashed out.  This collection represents a user right that obtains when an agent has a non-exclusive right to use something.  All #$Agent-Generic can claim this use-right to an object if any #$Agent-Generic can. This right is not the same as any instance of #$SituationTypeByGroupUserRight, as there is no specific group to which agents must belong in order to claim this right. This is typically used for things so fundamental we hardly consider them `rights.' E.g., the right to breathe air, use public parking lots, walk the streets as a free person, drive on public roads, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9be3).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9be3,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
