x_comment('x_MarkingOnASurfaceWithAPen-Uninterrupted',"An instance of #$TemporalStuffType and a specialization of\n#$FluidFlow-Translation. Each instance of\n#$MarkingOnASurfaceWithAPen-Uninterrupted is an event in which some\n#$Ink flows from inside of a #$WritingPen onto part of the surface of\none instance of #$Partially-Tangible. In each such instance, the flow\noccurs as a result of the use of the pen in an event of type\n#$MarkingOnASurfaceWithAPen. The flow does not occur in a way that is\natypical for writing or drawing; it does not occur, for example, as a\nresult of a leak in the pen that causes the ink to drip onto the\nsurface.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9be8).
