x_comment(x_CarryingFn,"An instance of #$CollectionDenotingFunction.  When applied to a specialization MATERIAL of #$PartiallyTangible, #$CarryingFn returns the collection of all events in which an instance of MATERIAL is conveyed bodily from one location to another by a locomoting #$Animal (the function is thus more specific than #$ConveyFn, which returns all events in which an instance of MATERIAL is moved by any means whatsoever).  For example, (#$CarryingFn #$Beer) is the collection of all events in which beer is carried from one location to another (usually by some instance of #$HomoSapiens).") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9bea).
