x_comment(x_ExistenceDependentNonInitialIntermittentCollection,"A specialization of both #$ExistenceDependentIntermittentCollection and #$NonInitialCollection (qq.v.).  Each instance EDNIIC of #$ExistenceDependentNonInitialIntermittentCollection is a collection such that: (i) a thing can be an instance of EDNIIC only while the thing exists, (ii) nothing can be an instance of EDNIIC at the start of the thing's existence, and (iii) a thing can be an instance of EDNIIC during several non-overlapping periods of the thing's existence.  For example, #$USSenator is such a collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9bf2).
