x_comment(x_definitionalDisplayAssertion,"(#$definitionalDisplayAssertion TERM ASSERTION) means that ASSERTION has been deemed one of the assertions that should be displayed when Cyc offers a concise definition of TERM. #$definitionalDisplayAssertion can be used by Cyc to generate #$comments automatically, or in response to user's requests for a summary of a concept.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9bf8).
