x_comment(x_ELRelation,"A specialization of #$MacroRelation (q.v.) instances of which appear only at the \"epistemological level\" (or EL) of the Cyc system.  Each instance of #$ELRelation is associated, via the #$expansion or #$expansionDefn relation, to a sentence template to which the former is essentially equivalent and for which the former serves as a convenient alternative.  Some assertions using instances of #$ELRelation are irretrievable after being input to the Cyc System (#$ELRelation-OneWay), and others' EL forms are reconstructed dynamically by the system (#$ELRelation-Reversible).") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9bf9).
