x_comment(x_meaningSentencePredicateForSource,"This predicate relates a structured knowledge source to the\nrelations which appear in the arg0 of the meaning sentences associated\nwith the source. Each sks is associated with one or more physical\nschemas via #$physicalSchemaSourceMap. Each physical schema is associated with\none or more logical schemas via #$logicalPhysicalSchemaMap. Each\nlogical schema is associated with one or more meaning sentences via\n#$meaningSentenceOfSchema. So for each sks, there are one or more\nmeaning sentences which can be found by tracing through the (KS --->\nPS ---> LS ---> MS) path. Finally, the arg0 of the meaning sentence is\nassociated with the KS. The functionality of this predicate is\nimplemented by a forward rule. See the #$salientAssertions for this\npredicate.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9c3a).
