x_comment('x_foreignKeyMap-Restrict',"This specialization of #$foreignKeyMap entails an additional\nconstraint on deleting or modifying the rows of the\nreferenced schema. That is (#$foreignKeyMap-Restrict REFERENCED_SCHEMA\nREFERENCED_KEY REFERENCING_SCHEMA REFERENCING_FIELD_LIST) means in\naddition to the constraints inherited from #$foreignKeyMap, deleting a\nrow of REFERENCED_SCHEMA is not permitted if there is any row of\nREFERENCING_SCHEMA which references it. Contrast this behavior with\n#$foreignKeyMap-Cascade, #$foreignKeyMap-SetNull, and #$foreignKeyMap-SetDefault.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9c49).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9c49,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
