x_comment(x_CollectionRelatingFunction,"A specialization of #$CollectionDenotingFunction.  Each instance of #$CollectionRelatingFunction is a function that takes a collection as (one of) its argument(s), and always returns a collection as value.  If the latter (returned) collection is always a subcollection of the former (argument) collection, then the function is an instance of the more specialized function-type #$SubcollectionDenotingFunction.  Another notable specialization of #$CollectionRelatingFunction is #$GenlsPreservingFunction.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9c4e).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9c4e,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
