x_comment(x_RecapitalizeSmartFn,"(#$RecapitalizeSmartFn STRING) capitalizes all but\nnon-initial, closed-lexical-class words in STRING. Additionally it\nensures that any capitalized characters which appear in the middle or\nend of a word are properly uncapitalized. For instance, (#$equals\n(#$RecapitalizeSmartFn 'the TAMINg oF tHe sHrew') 'The Taming of the\nShrew'). Compare this function with #$CapitalizeSmartFn which has\nsimilar behavior but leaves capitalized characters in the middle or\nend of a word alone.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9c51).
