x_comment(x_HidingOneself,"The collection of #$HidingAnObject events in which the performer is also the #$objectHidden; i.e., the collection of events in  which one agent hides herself from others. #$HidingOneself events are unusual in one other respect.  Instances of #$HidingAnObject, which involve taking steps to obscure an object's location, are typically followed by a static situation during which the object remains hidden.  However, instances of #$HidingOneself often persist over the full length of the 'hiding' period, as the agent continues to take or refrain from certain actions in an attempt to remain hidden.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9c8b).
