x_comment(x_DisasterFn,"<code>(#$DisasterFn SIT-TYPE)</code> is a subcollection denoting function which takes as its argument a subcollection of #$DangerousSituation, <code>SIT-TYPE</code>, and returns a collection of events that is both a subcollection of #$DisasterEvent and of the collection <code>SIT-TYPE</code>.  The collection which is returned contains those instances of the <code>SIT-TYPE</code> where large numbers of persons have been harmed or large quantities of property have been damaged.  For example, (#$DisasterFn #$Earthquake) would pick out the subcollection of #$Earthquake in which significant harm or damage occurs.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9c8e).
