x_comment('x_ChemicalReaction-IntentionalFn',"#$ChemicalReaction-IntentionalFn is a collection denoting function.  It takes as its argument an instance of #$ChemicalSubstanceType and returns a subcollection of the script #$ChemicalReaction-Intentional for which the #$outputsCreated are instances of that #$ChemicalSubstanceType.  It should be noted that the #$ChemicalSubstanceType that bear the relation #$precursors-Chemical to the #$outputsCreated  will be #$inputs for the resultant collection of scripts.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9c90).
