x_comment(x_DeliveryOfWeaponToTarget,"#$DeliveryOfWeaponToTarget is the collection of events in which a weapon is delivered to a location prior to use. For example, the delivery phase of an missile involves a launch and rocket propulsion before detonation. Delivery of an AerialBomb on the other hand involves being flown to a place above the target and then dropping. In some cases the weapon is transported to the target, in other cases it undergoes projectile motion or propels itself to the target.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9c92).
