x_comment(x_chromaInRange,"(#$chromaInRange BRIGHT VALUE-1 VALUE-2) means that CHROMA\nis a #$MunsellChroma with a value somewhere between VALUE-1 and\nVALUE-2 on the Munsell scale of saturation. Munsell chromas are\nrepresented using #$MunsellChromaFn. For further information,\nplease see #$MunsellChroma and the\n#$SharedNoteOnMunsellSystemOfColorClassification.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9c99).
