x_comment(x_hueInRange,"(#$hueInRange BETWEEN-HUE HUE-1 HUE-2) means that\nBETWEEN-HUE is a #$MunsellHue with a value somewhere between\nHUE-1 and HUE-2 on the Munsell scale of hue. Munsell hues are\nrepresented using group of functions that return instances of\ninstances of #$MunsellHue.  For further information, please see\n#$MunsellHue, and the\n#$SharedNoteOnMunsellSystemOfColorClassification.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9c9a).
