x_comment(x_VerySlightlyTranslucent,"A specialization of #$Translucent representing a\nspecific degree of transparency.  Objects that are\n#$VerySlightlyTranslucent will block all but the brightest light\nand transmit no images.  Poster board that can be penetrated by a\nflash bulb would be considered #$VerySlightlyTranslucent.  Please\nsee #$ObjectTypeByTransparency and #$transparencyOfObject for more information.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9c9d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9c9d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
