x_comment(x_transparencyOfType,"(#$transparencyOfType TYPE TRANS) holds just in case every\ninstance of TYPE INS, is such that (#$transparencyOfObject INS TRANS).\nThat is, just in case each instance is an instance of ?TRANS. Given\nthat #$transparencyOfObject is a specialization of #$genls, it then\nfollows that (#$genls TYPE TRANS).") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9ca2).
