x_comment(x_transparencyRangeOfType,"(#$transparencyRangeOfType TYPE TRANS-1 TRANS-2) means that all instances of TYPE have some transparency between TRANS-1 and TRANS-2. For example, (#$transparencyRangeOfType #$Glass #$ModeratelyTranslucent #$Transparent) means that individual pieces of glass will have a transparency somewhere between moderately translucent and completely transparent. Note that 'between' here means 'equal to or more than the lower limit and less than or equal to the upper limit.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9ca3).
