x_comment('x_recipientOfPost-Intended',"This predicate relates a #$SendingTangibleMail event to the agent receiving\nthe mail, or at least the agent intended to receive it by the agent sending the mail.\nMore precisely, (#$recipientOfPost-Intended MAILING RECIPIENT) means that an agent playing \neither the #$performedBy or #$directingAgent role in the #$SendingTangibleMail MAILING \nintends that some #$MailableObject playing the #$objectOfPossessionTransfer role in \nMAILING be possessed by RECIPEINT upon the completion of MAILING. Obviously, this does \nnot entail that the #$MailableObject actually end up in RECIPIENT's possession, but the\nagent in the #$performedBy or #$directingAgent role can have a reasonable expectation\nthat the event conclude in that manner.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9cfb).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9cfb,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
