x_comment('x_imitationOf-CollColl',"An instance of #$BinaryPredicate and\n#$StrictlyFunctionalPredicate.  (imitationOf-CollColl COPY-COLL\nORIGINAL-COLL) says that COPY-COLL is the collection of all and only\nthings that have been created or (in the case of imitation of\nsituations) performed with the intention that they seem like instances of\nORIGINAL-COLL to someone. For example, (imitationOf-CollColl\nImitationFruit #$EdibleFruit) says that ImitationFruit is the\ncollection of all and only things that were designed to seem like\nedible fruit. See #$seemsLikeTo. See also #$ImitationOfCollection,\n#$ImitationOfCollectionFn, #$ImitationOfIndividual,\n#$ImitationOfIndividualFn, #$imitationOf-IndColl,\n#$imitationOf-IndInd, and #$imitationOf-CollInd") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9cfe).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9cfe,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
