x_comment('x_imitationOf-IndColl',"An instance of #$BinaryPredicate, (imitationOf-IndColl COPY\nORIGINAL-COLL) says that COPY has been created or (in the case of\nimitation of situations) performed with the intention that it seem like\ninstances of ORIGINAL-COLL to someone. For example,\n(imitationOf-IndColl WaxApple-001 #$EdibleFruit) says that\nWaxApple-001 was designed to seem like edible fruit. See\n#$seemsLikeTo. See also #$ImitationOfCollection,\n#$ImitationOfCollectionFn, #$ImitationOfIndividual,\n#$ImitationOfIndividualFn, #$imitationOf-CollColl,\n#$imitationOf-IndInd, and #$imitationOf-CollInd") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9cff).
