x_comment('x_imitationOf-CollInd',"An instance of #$BinaryPredicate, (imitationOf-CollInd\nCOPY-COLL ORIGINAL) says that COPY-COLL is the collection of all and\nonly individuals that have been created or (in the case of imitation of\nan event) performed with the intention that they\nseem like ORIGINAL to someone. For example, (imitationOf-IndColl\nImitationsOfApple-001 Apple-001) says that all and only instances of\nImitationsApple-001 were designed to seem like Apple-001.  See\n#$seemsLikeTo. See also #$ImitationOfCollection,\n#$ImitationOfCollectionFn, #$ImitationOfIndividual,\n#$ImitationOfIndividualFn, #$imitationOf-CollColl,\n#$imitationOf-IndInd, and #$imitationOf-CollInd") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9d00).
