x_comment('x_imitationDeception-IndColl',"An instance of #$BinaryPredicate and a specialization of\nimitationOf-IndColl, (imitationDeception-IndColl COPY ORIGINAL) says\nthat COPY has been created or (in the case of imitation of situations)\nwith the intention that it seem to be an instance of ORIGINAL-COLL to\nsomeone. Unlike #$imitationOf-IndColl, imitationDeception-IndColl\nrequires that the imitator intends to deceive someone into believing\nthat the imitation *is* an instance of the collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9d02).
