x_comment(x_scheduledDepartingTime,"(#$scheduledDepartingTime MOVEMENT TIME) relates an instance of\n#$TransportationEvent MOVEMENT to the intended departure time, TIME,\nan instance of #$Date. This predicate is intended to correspond\nto the notion of scheduled departures of instances of\n#$TransportationEvent. Positive examples include the scheduled\ndeparture of Northwestern Flight 668 at 9:25 on January 7th, 2004 or\nGreyhound bus departure to Los Angeles from Austin at 3:23 pm on April\n19th, 1997. This predicate also assumes local time. For example, if (scheduledDepartingTime Flight001 Time001) is true in #$CentralUSATimeZone,\nthen the departing time is one hour earlier in the #$EasternUSATimeZone.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9d09).
