x_comment(x_DeviceTypeByFunction,"A collection of collections; a subcollection of #$ArtifactTypeByFunction. Instances of #$DeviceTypeByFunction are mutually unique with respect to the full set of primary functions that their instances perform. Examples include #$CookingRange and #$Freezer. Counter-examples include #$ElectricCookingRange and #$Freezer-Upright. There may be cases where two instances of #$DeviceTypeByFunction (PROD1 and PROD2) are related by (#$genls PROD1 PROD2); but this will only happen in cases where instances of PROD1 have some additional primary function(s) to those of PROD2. For example, the collections #$Radio and #$ClockRadio are both instances of #$DeviceTypeByFunction, and (#$genls #$ClockRadio #$Radio) is true.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9d2a).
