x_comment('x_SituationTypeJoinerMeta-Expansion',"#$SituationTypeJoinerMeta-Expansion is a #$ScenGenMeta-ExpansionSpecification.  Its goal is to examine hypotheses that were previously produced by the expansion and refinement modules.  This particular module is looking for two scripts that might connect together to form a single, larger narrative.  Specifically, it looks for a specialization of #$Situation whose final scene could be the first scene of a instance of some other specialization of #$Situation. If it finds two such script instances, it will assert that the two scripts share a common #$subSituations.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9d69).
