x_comment(x_HostedFileNamedFn,"A function which takes #$ComputerServer HOST and string STR as its arguments and returns an instance of #$HostedComputerFile that has an associated ComputerFileCopy on HOST and that has STR as its remainder path. The remainder path is appended to the HOST system's file system base path and/or URL base path to determine the full pathname to the file on HOST. For example, the HOST #$Doc-Cyc-Com has a url base path of 'http://doc.cyc.com/' and a httpd base path of '/cyc/httpd/htdocs/', so (HostFileNamedFn Doc-Cyc-Com 'project-files/project1.txt') denotes a file which can be accessed at 'http://doc.cyc.com/project-files/project1.txt' or through the file system (with the proper privileges) at '/cyc/httpd/htdocs/project-files/project1.txt'.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9d6e).
