x_comment(x_WithArgInRoleFn,"When PRED is an instance of #$EventPredicate-FrameTemplate of arity\nN and SLOT is a binary predicate and an instance of ActorSlot,\n(#$WithArgInRoleFn PRED SLOT) denotes the (unique) instance of\n#$EventPredicate-FrameTemplate of arity N+1 such that: (1) for every K\ngreater than 1 and less than N, it is the case that (#$coordinateSlot PRED\n(#$WithArgInRoleFn PRED SLOT) K), and (2) (#$associateSlotInArg\n(#$WithArgInRoleFn PRED SLOT) SLOT N+1). For instance:\n(#$WithArgInRoleFn #$does #$objectActedOn) is semantically equivalent to\n#$doesTo.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9d88).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9d88,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
