x_comment(x_EdibleStuffTypeContaminatedWithSubstanceTypeFn,"A binary collection-denoting function that creates specializations of PartiallyTangible from specializations of #$EdibleStuff and specializations of #$BiochemicallyHarmfulSubstance. (#$EdibleStuffTypeContaminatedWithSubstanceTypeFn EDIBLE-STUFF-TYPE SUBSTANCE-TYPE) denotes the collection of all instances of EDIBLE-STUFF-TYPE which are contaminated with SUBSTANCE-TYPE. For example, (ContaminatedWithFn #$Meat #$Anthrax-Bacterium) denotes the collection of all instances of #$Meat contaminated with #$Anthrax-Bacterium.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9d8e).
