x_comment(x_edibleStuffContaminatedWithSubstanceType,"A binary predicate relating instances of #$EdibleStuff to specializations of #$PartiallyTangible. (#$edibleStuffContaminatedWithSubstanceType EDIBLE-STUFF SUBSTANCE-TYPE) means just that EDIBLE-STUFF is contaminated with SUBSTANCE-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9d8f).
