x_comment(x_durationBetweenSubSituationTypes,"(#$durationBetweenSubSituationTypes SITTYPE SUBSITTYPE1 SUBSITTYPE2 DUR) means that if INST is an instance of SITTYPE where SIT1 and SIT2 are any two #$properSubSituations of INST such that (#$startsAfterEndingOf SIT2 SIT1) and (#$isa SIT1 SUBSITTYPE1) and (#$isa SIT2 SUBSITTYPE2), there exists a time interval INT of #$duration DUR such that (#$timeIntervalBetween INT SIT1 SIT2).") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9d90).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9d90,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
