x_comment('x_durationBetweenSubSituationTypes-Existential',"(#$durationBetweenSubSituationTypes-Existential SITTYPE SUBSITTYPE1 SUBSITTYPE2\nDUR) means that for any instantiation INST of SITTYPE there exists an\ninstance, SIT1, of SUBSITTYPE1 that is a #$properSubSituations of INST, and an\ninstance, SIT2, of SUBSITTYPE2 that is a #$properSubSituations of INST and such that (#$startsAfterEndingOf SIT2 SIT1), and such that there is a time\ninterval INT of #$duration DUR such that(#$timeIntervalBetween INT\nSIT1 SIT2).") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9d91).
