x_comment(x_subSituationOfType,"(#$subSituationOfType SIT-INSTANCE SUBSIT SUBSIT-TYPE) is true iff (#$subSituations SIT-INSTANCE SUBSIT) and (#$isa SIT SUBSIT-TYPE) where, for some SITTYPE, both (#$isa SIT-INSTANCE SITTYPE) and (#$properSubSituationTypes SITTYPE SUBSIT-TYPE) are true. That is, this relation holds between the instance of a situation type and the sub-situation uniquely instantiating a given sub-situation type in it") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9d95).
