x_comment(x_dietPrescribesExclusively,"A #$FirstOrderCollectionPredicate and a specialization of #$dietPrescribes that relates a given #$DietProgram (q.v.) to a type of food or drink whose consumption the diet prescribes or recommends exclusively.  (#$dietPrescribesExclusively DIET STUFFTYPE) means that DIET instructs the dieter to consume only STUFFTYPE (some specialization of #$EdibleStuff).  For example, a fasting diet might prescribe clear liquids exclusively.  See also #$dietRestricts and its specialization #$dietProscribes.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9d9d).
