x_comment(x_dislikesSensoriallyObjectsOfType,"(#$dislikesSensoriallyObjectsOfType AGT OB-TYPE) means that the #$PerceptualAgent AGT feels some physical discomfort from the sensory experiences associated with objects of type OB-TYPE).  For instance, if OB-TYPE is the collection of salty things then the statement says that I dislike the taste of salty things.\nNote: this is a stronger statement than (#$not (#$likesSensoriallyObjectsOfType AGT OB-TYPE)), as there may be many #$ObjectTypeBySensibleFeature which one neither particularly likes nor dislikes.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9da9).
