x_comment(x_scheduledNumberOfStops,"(#$scheduledNumberOfStops TRANSPORTING NUMBER) is used to\nrelate an instance of #$TransportationEvent to the number of stops\nNUMBER made during the journey. Stops are those subevents of any\ninstance of #$TransportationEvent in which the #$driverActor is\nscheduled or intends to halt for a period of time. This predicate maybe used to\nrelate the number of stops a person intends to make while running\nerrands aa well as the number of scheduled stops on a train or bus trip.\nDuring the course of the actual trip, more or fewer stops may\noccur.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9db1).
