x_comment(x_dietUnsuitedTo,"A #$FirstOrderCollectionPredicate and a specialization of #$dietRestricts (q.v.) that relates a given #$DietProgram (q.v.) to the types of food, drink, or ingredient whose consumption the diet is largely incompatible with.  (#$dietUnsuitedTo DIET TYPE) means that DIET severely restricts or prohibits (see #$dietProscribes) the consumption of many items of TYPE (some specialization of #$EdibleStuff) so that TYPE is by-and-large unsuitable for someone on DIET.  For example, while the #$BasicVegetarianDiet does not strictly prohibit #$BBQCuisine as such, (#$dietUnsuitedTo #$BasicVegetarianDiet #$BBQCuisine) certainly holds.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9db8).
