x_comment(x_flawAccordingToAgent,"This predicate relates things to the flaw attribute that they are deemed to have according to some agent.  (#$flawAccordingToAgent THING FLAWATT AGENT) means that AGENT believes THING to be flawed at flaw level FLAWATT or with a flaw kind, FLAWATT.  This allows us to take into account the fact that within the same context things can be deemed flawed according to one agent and not another or that the degree or kind of flaw may depend upon one's perspective. Compare with #$hasFlawAttributes, #$flawedWRTRoleInSitType, #$complianceStatus.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9dc2).
