xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517a9dc2,[]).
x_comment(x_CardiacArrest,"An instance of #$PhysiologicalConditionType and a specialization of #$HeartCondition. #$CardiacArrest denotes the collection of all physiological conditions in which the heart has stopped beating or is otherwise unable to pump a quantity of blood sufficient to sustain vital organs. Note that #$CardiacArrest is different from #$HeartAttack, which denotes the physiological condition in which some region of the heart muscle is (merely) damaged due to an inadequate supply of oxygen.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9dc3).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9dc3,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
