x_comment(x_exposureLimitOverTime,"(#$exposureLimitOverTime SUBSTANCE LIMIT EXP-DURATION\nEXP-PARAMETER OVER-DURATION OVER-PARAMETER) means that LIMIT is the\nlimit of SUBSTANCE a normal, healthy adult may be exposed to in the\nduration of EXP-DURATION for the parameter EXP-PARAMETER over the\nperiod of OVER-DURATION for OVER-PARAMETER.  Essentially, (exposureLimitOverTime ?SUBSTANCE (PartsPerMillion 400) (HoursDuration 8) Weekday (HoursDuration 40) CalendarWorkWeek) means that a healthy human adult should not be exposed to more than 400 ppm of SUBSTANCE during an 8 hour work day for any given 40 hour work week.  Substances may have more than one exposure limit.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9dc6).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9dc6,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
