x_comment(x_objectHarmed,"An #$ActorSlot and a specialization of both #$objectActedOn and #$thingHarmed (qq.v.).  <code>(#$objectHarmed EVENT OBJECT)</code> means that <code>OBJECT</code> has been harmed in <code>EVENT</code>.  The harm to <code>OBJECT</code> might be in the form of damage (see the specialization #$damages) or, if <code>OBJECT</code> is an #$Agent-Generic, the harm might consist in the interests or well-being of <code>OBJECT</code> being thwarted or blocked (see the specialization #$maleficiary).") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9dcc).
