x_comment(x_medicalRecommendationForRoleInType,"An instance of #$QuaternaryPredicate. (#$medicalRecommendationForRoleInType SIT-TYPE ROLE-IN-SIT-TYPE RECOMMENDATION PRESCRIBED-ROLE) means that it is medically recommended that a biological living object playing ROLE-IN-SIT-TYPE in SIT-TYPE play the role PRESCRIBED-ROLE in RECOMMENDATION. For instance, (#$medicalRecommendationForRoleInType #$PoisonIvyPoisoning #$actorPartsInvolved (#$DrugTherapyUseFn #$Calamine) #$bodilyActedOn).") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9dcd).
