x_comment(x_thingHarmed,"A binary predicate that relates a given event to any of the temporal things harmed in the course of that event.  <code>(#$thingHarmed EVENT THING)</code> means that <code>THING</code> has been harmed in <code>EVENT</code>.  If <code>THING</code> is a #$SomethingExisting (e.g. a #$PartiallyTangible object or an #$Agent-Generic), see the more specialized predicate #$objectHarmed (and its specializations).  If <code>THING</code> is a #$Situation, then <code>EVENT</code> has resulted in <code>THING</code>'s somehow becoming less desirable or less valuable, or has made <code>THING</code>'s continuing to obtain less likely.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9dcf).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9dcf,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
