x_comment(x_ColorPerceptionCategoryType,"A collection of collections.  Each instance of\n#$ColorPerceptionCategoryType is a specialization of #$SpatialThing-Localized\nthat is a category of color perception.  This collection includes all\nthe specializations of #$Color, as well as #$ColorlessThing.  In\naddition, this collection includes ranges of colors (See #$colorPerceptionCategoryRangeOfType).") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9dd4).
