x_comment(x_colorPerceptionCategoryBelongsInRange,"An instance of #$TransitiveBinaryPredicate. (#$colorPerceptionCategoryBelongsInRange CATEGORY RANGE) says that the #$ColorPerceptionCategoryType CATEGORY falls within the range of #$ColorPerceptionCategoryTypes that define RANGE.  For example, (#$colorPerceptionCategoryBelongsInRange #$RedColor  (#$ColorPerceptionCategoryRangeFn #$RedColor #$DarkOrangeYellow-Color)) says that #$RedColor falls within the range of colors from red to dark orange-yellow.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9ddb).
