x_comment(x_ImposingEconomicSanctions,"#$ImposingSanctions #$Events in which a political body imposes economic sanctions, i.e., sanctions whose primary intended effect is to apply financial pressure or punishment to some organization, country, or individual.  Note that diplomatic sanctions can be imposed whose primary role is not economic; for example, #$SanctionsOnLibya-March1992 were specifically sanctions against air travel to and from #$Libya.  Also note that #$ImposingSanctions events have an even broader meaning.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9de1).
