x_comment(x_LevelOfSubstanceInSystem,"A specialization of #$PhysicalQuantity, each instance of #$LevelOfSubstanceInSystem is a qualitative or quantitative \"measure\" of the level of some substance in a system, for example, the amount or level of water in an #$Organism-Whole. See also #$LevelOfStandardSubstanceFoundInSystem.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9de2).
