x_comment(x_LevelOfSubstanceTypeInSysTypeFn,"A ternary function used for denoting specializations of #$SystemCondition based on the level of some type of substance in some type of system. (#$LevelOfSubstanceTypeInSysTypeFn SUB-TYPE SYS-TYPE LEVEL) denotes the specialization of #$SystemCondition for instances SYS of SYS-TYPE in which levels of SUB-TYPE are at LEVEL.  For example, (#$LevelOfSubstanceTypeInSysTypeFn #$Iron #$HomoSapiens #$LowLevelOfStandardSubstanceInSystem) denotes the collection of conditions in which a #$HomoSapiens has a lower than normal level of #$Iron for typical #$HomoSapiens.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9de7).
