x_comment('x_Goodness-Functional',"A linear-ordered specialization of #$Goodness-Generic whose instances reflect assessments of the relative functional (utility) worth of a particular thing.  Such assessments are usually made in relation to some (often implicit) standard held by the assessor.    Particular instances of this collection can be obtained via the various #$GenericValueFunctions.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9def).
