x_comment(x_IsotopeStuffTypeByAtomicMass,"A collection of collections and a specialization of #$IsotopeStuffType. \nEach instance of IsotopeStuffTypeByAtomicMass is a specialization of #$Isotope which is defined \n_only_ by the isotopic composition of its instances -- neither the physical state of the substances\nnor any other additional feature determines membership in an instance of \nIsotopeStuffTypeByAtomicMass. All that matters is that the instances of that collection are entirely \ncomposed of atoms having a particular number of protons and neutrons in each atomic nucleus. \nThe collection #$IsotopeCarbon14, for example, is an instance of IsotopeStuffTypeByAtomicMass.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9df3).
