x_comment(x_DetectingSomethingPhysical,"An instance of FirstOrderCollection and a specialization of\nPhysicalEvent. An instance of DetectingSomething is an event in which\nsome tangible thing is determined to be an instance of a particular\ncollection. Consider, for example, an event in which some stuff is\ndetermined to be smoke. Such an event is an instance of\nDetectingSomething in which some #$SmokeAlarm would probably play the\nrole of #$detector and so would stand in the #$detects relation to the\nrelevant instance of #$Smoke. See also #$typeDetected.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9e0b).
