x_comment('x_detectsType-Exact',"(#$detectsType-Exact DEVICE-TYPE THING-TYPE) means that\ninstances of DEVICE-TYPE can be used to decide whether or not\nsomething is an instance of THING-TYPE. That is, it means that for\nany instance, DEVICE, of DEVICE-TYPE, (i) for and any instance,\nTHING, of THING-TYPE, DEVICE can be used to determine that THING is\nan instance of THING-TYPE, and (ii) for anything, THING, that is not\nan instance of THING-TYPE, DEVICE can be used to determine that THING\nis not an instance of THING-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9e0f).
