x_comment(x_jurisdictionOverIndividual,"(#$jurisdictionOverIndividual AGENT THING) means that the\nLegalAgent AGENT has jurisdiction over the PartiallyTangible\nTHING. This is a high level and vague notion of jurisdiction that will\nfill a gap in the KB until the notion of jurisdiction can properly be\ndissected into its more specific meanings.  Proper use of this\nconstant, for example, would be to express that a government AGENT has\njurisdiction over a citizen of that government, THING.  Even though the\narg constraints are very loose, however, this constant is not to be\nused to say that a person has jurisdiction over their hand.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9e57).
