x_comment('x_SituationTypeRelation-SubSitTypes-Dependencies',"#$SituationTypeRelation-SubSitTypes-Dependencies is the sub-collection of #$SituationTypeRelation-SubSitTypes-QuasiTemporal whose instances represent dependencies among sub-situation types.  These include causal dependencies, as well as other relations that might not deserve the label \"causal\" but which affect the temporal ordering of subsituations within instances of specializations of #$Situation. Its instances include, #$necConditionFor-Ternary and #$causes-SubSitTypeSubSitType.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9e7d).
