x_comment(x_SituationTypeRelationTypeByLogicalForce,"#$SituationTypeRelationTypeByLogicalForce is a second-order collection.  Its instances are all subcollections of #$SituationTypeRelation-Predicate whose memberships are based on whether (for any given script-instance to which they apply) they posit the existence of entities (such as scenes, actors), represent conditional relationships amongst such entities as do exist, or describe entities and relationships which might (but do not necessarily) obtain..  Instances of #$SituationTypeRelationTypeByLogicalForce include #$SituationTypeRelation-Existential, #$SituationTypeRelation-Conditional, and #$SituationTypeRelation-NonEssential.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9e83).
