x_comment('x_SituationTypeRelation-Existential',"#$SituationTypeRelation-Existential is a sub-collection of #$SituationTypeRelation.  Assertions using these relations entail the existence of sub-situation types or actors in all instances of the relevant specialization of #$Situation. For example, an assertion of the form (#$someTypePlaysRoleInSituationType SITTYPE TYPE SUBSITTYPE ROLE) states that for any instance SIT of SITTYPE, there exists an instance of the #$Collection TYPE that plays ROLE in the sub-situation of SIT SUBSIT (an instance of SUBSITTYPE). Contrast this collection with #$SituationTypeRelation-Conditional and #$SituationTypeRelation-NonEssential.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9e84).
