x_comment('x_inheritRolePlayers-SubSitTypeToSubSitType-Unique',"<code>(#$inheritRolePlayers-SubSitTypeToSubSitType-Unique SITTYPE ROLE1 SUBSITTYPE1 ROLE2 SUBSITTYPE2)</code> means that in any instance of <code>SITTYPE</code> whatever single entity plays <code>ROLE1</code> in the instantiation of <code>SUBSITTYPE1</code> is identical to the entity that plays <code>ROLE2</code> in the instantiation of <code>SUBSITTYPE2</code>.  For a similar predicate without the uniqueness presupposition, see the more general #$inheritRolePlayers-SubSitTypeToSubSitType.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9eae).
