x_comment(x_typeRequiredForEventType,"#$typeRequiredForEventType is an instance of #$ResourcePredicate. (#$typeRequiredForEventType EXISTING-THING-TYPE EVENT-TYPE) means that, in the context of the assertion, any #$Event EVENT-TYPE requires a #$SomethingExisting of type EXISTING-THING-TYPE as resource.  For example, baking a chocolate cake is type of event that requires chocolate (and, indeed, any making of a thing requires the ingredients for the type of thing made).  Also, baking a cake requires a source of heat.  And eating a cake requires cake.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9eba).
