x_comment(x_CognitiveAttitudePredicate,"A specialization of both #$CognitivePredicate and #$PropositionPredicate (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$CognitiveAttitudePredicate is a (binary or higher-arity) relation that holds among (at least) an #$IntelligentAgent and a sentence expressing a proposition in connection with which the agent bears a certain (\"de dicto\" or \"de re\") propositional attitude (e.g. belief, doubt, or knowledge).  Two important specializations of #$CognitiveAttitudePredicate are #$PropositionalAttitudeSlot and #$DeReAttitudePredicate (qq.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9ebf).
