x_comment(x_PredicateTypeByArgumentType,"#$PredicateTypeByArgumentType is a specialization of #$PredicateType.  It is the collection of collections of predicates which are defined solely in terms of the kinds of things they relate.  For example, #$FirstOrderCollectionPredicate is an instance of #$PredicateTypeByArgumentType because it is defined as the collection of predicates that are used to make statements about first-order collections.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9ed6).
