x_comment(x_hasAccessory,"A specialization of #$possessiveRelation. (#$hasAccessory OBJECT ACCESSORY) means that the the OBJECT has ACCESSORY as an accessory (cf. #$accessoryFor).  E.g., this predicate can be used to describe the relation between a particular #$CellularTelephone and the #$PowerCord with which it was packaged. In constrast with #$instanceAccessoryFor (its #$genlInverse) this predicate relates only specific pairs of the objects of appropriate types.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9ed7).
