xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517a9edf,[]).
x_comment(x_roleCardinalityForSubsituationType,"(#$roleCardinalityForSubsituationType SITTYPE SUBSITTYPE ROLE EXTENT) means that for any situation, SIT, that is an instance of SUBSITTYPE and a subsituation of an instance of SITTYPE, if anything plays ROLE in SIT, then the number of things that play ROLE in SIT is within the range EXTENT (that is, the number of things that play ROLE in SIT is between the minimum and the maximum of EXTENT, inclusive--see #$minQuantValue and #$maxQuantValue)") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9ee0).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9ee0,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
