x_comment(x_DevelopingAilment,"The collection of events in which some \n#$Organism-Whole ORG develops an\n#$AilmentCondition AIL-COND.  Note that the ORG does\nnot have AIL-COND while developing it but only\n(immediately) after the development has occurred.  See\n#$AilmentCondition for more information.\nSee also #$RecoveringFromAilment.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9ee1).
