x_comment(x_HijackingAFn,"The #$CollectionDenotingFunction #$HijackingAFn is used to represent subcollections of #$Hijacking based on the specific type of #$TransportationDevice which is the #$transporterHijacked in the event. For example, (#$HijackingAFn #$CruiseShip) would represented the set of complex events in which instances of #$CruiseShip play the role  #$transporterHijacked.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9ee8).
