x_comment(x_TerminatedEmployeeFn,"(#$TerminatedEmployeeFn ORG) is the collection of terminated employees of ORG.  (#$employmentStatus AGENT (#$TerminatedEmployeeFn ORG)) means that AGENT was once an employee of ORG. but has resigned, been fired or otherwise terminated from his/her job working for ORG.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9eec).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9eec,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
