x_comment(x_InactiveEmployeeFn,"(#$InactiveEmployeeFn ORG) is the collection of inactive employees of ORG.  (#$employmentStatus AGENT (#$InactiveEmployeeFn ORG)) means that AGENT is a current employee of ORG, but is at present on leave. ") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9eed).
