x_comment(x_CycHistoricalPossibilityTheoryMt,"This microtheory is Cyc's historical possibility theory,\ni.e., all Cyc's `knowledge' concerning code-supported inference\ninvolving historical possibility/necessity (usually with temporal\ninference).") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9eee).
