x_comment(x_hasPoliticalAsylumIn,"(hasPoliticalAsylumIn AGENT HOST) means that the Person AGENT has been granted political asylum by the Country HOST. Political asylum shields the recipient from seizure by authorities of the country s/he is fleeing. The granting and recognition of political asylum is common international practice, even though there is no formal worldwide international law that governs asylum.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9efc).
