x_comment(x_AssemblingFoodIngredients,"A specialization of #$PreparingFoodItem.  Each instance of #$AssemblingFoodIngredients is an event in which some item of #$Food (q.v.) is prepared by combining ingredients.  For example, a step in making an instance of #$SpaghettiMarinara is an instance of #$AssemblingFoodIngredients, when the spaghetti noodles are combined with the marinara sauce.  Also, a step in making bread is an instance of #$AssemblingFoodIngredients, when, prior to kneading, the ingredients such as salt and flour are combined.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9eff).
