x_comment(x_subterritoryOf,"(#$subterritoryOf GEO-AGT TERRITORY) means that the complete planetary region [see #$GeographicalRegion] occupied by and considered part of the instance GEO-AGT of #$GeographicalAgent includes the instance TERRITORY of #$GeographicalRegion. This applies to any region that is considered part of territory of GEO-AGENT, excluding colonies, trust territories, or territories occupied by GEO-AGENT's military, but which are the territory of some other country.   #$subterritoryOf will specify different regions in different microtheories for countries which have territorial disputes with their neighbors.  See #$territoryOf.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9f0b).
