x_comment(x_TerrainTypeBySurfaceLevel,"Instances of #$TerrainTypeBySurfaceLevel are collections that relate to military concepts about the surface level of a terrain. Instances include #$TerrainHighGround and #$TerrainLowGround. The surface level of a terrain is important for military tactical reasoning involving observation, mobility, cover, concealment, etc..") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9f19).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9f19,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
