x_comment('x_sitTypeIsIteratedSubSitType-ForEach',"(#$sitTypeIsIteratedSubSitType-ForEach SITTYPE SUBSIT-TYPE BINPRED                                      \nSUBSIT-TYPE-ROLE)  means that each instance, SIT, of SITTYPE consists of one                                     \ninstance of SUBSIT-TYPE for each thing, THING, such that (BINPRED SIT                                        \nTHING). Moreover, each such thing plays the role SUBSIT-TYPE-ROLE in exactly                                      \none such instance of SUBSIT-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9f1d).
