x_comment(x_withinRangeForRolesInType,"(#$withinRangeForRolesInType OBJECT1 ROLE1 OBJECT2 ROLE2\nSITTYPE) means that at some time, OBJECT1 is within range of OBJECT2\nsuch that OBJECT1 may play the #$Role ROLE1 and OBJECT2 may play the\n#$Role ROLE2 in an instance of SITTYPE. For example, many times during\nthe #$USPresidentialElection-2000 it is true that (#$withinRangeForRolesInType #$AlbertGore #$performedBy #$GeorgeWBush #$performedBy #$ShakingHands). This does not mean that in fact OBJECT1 and OBJECT2 play said roles, only that the two are within range to do so.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9f33).
