x_comment(x_PackageBomb,"A #$PackageBomb is disguised to look like a typical parcel, \nand is delivered to its target by a legitimate #$ShippingOrganization \nwithout that organization's knowledge. A #$PackageBomb may be designed \nto detonate at a specific time, or upon opening. They are intended to \nkill the recipient, cause damage at the delivery location, or both.\nThis type of weapon is not typically employed by regular modern militaries,\nand is usually used by civilians in #$CriminalActs, and most notably \n#$TerroristAttacks.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9f3d).
