x_comment(x_SpatialIntersectionFn,"This function takes a set of #$SpatialThings and denotes\ntheir intersection, if such exists. For example,\n(#$SpatialIntersectionFn (#$The Set #$Transmed-Pipeline (#$TerritoryFn\n#$Sicily))) denotes the spatial intersection of the pipeline the\nterritory. Similar to #$BorderBetweenFn, #$SpatialIntersectionFn is a\npartial function and is undefined for sets of things that do not\nintersect. For... Note that INTERSECTION is a SpatialThing, but need\nnot be continuous.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9f3e).
