x_comment(x_ReformulationListParameterPredicate,"A collection of predicates used to pass individual values to certain #$ReformulationParameters. Some of these parameters take lists of assertions or CycL constants as values,  and using a list in the arg2 position of #$parameterValueForReformulation creates an opaque object for the WFF-checker. By using one of these predicates to designate each member of the value list we can ensure that no non-WFF rules are passed to the reformulator parameters.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9fbe).
