x_comment(x_parameterValueForReformulation,"A specPred of #$softwareParameterValueInSpecification. (#$parameterValueForReformulation PARAM VAL CALL) means that #$ReformulationSpecification CALL has value VALUE in parameter PARAMETER. For example, (#$parameterValueForReformulation #$SubformulaRFParameter (SubLQuoteFn :TRUE) #$SomeRFCallSpec001) means that in the reformulation #$SomeRFCallSpec001, #$SubformulaRFParameter is set to 'true,' which means the #$CycLReformulator will reformulate the input CycL expression and its subformulas. See also #$ReformulationParameter.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9fc2).
