x_comment(x_defaultValueForParameter,"(#$defaultValueForParameter PROGRAM PARAMETER VALUE) means that in program PROGRAM, the parameter PARAMETER has a default value of VALUE. Assertions on this predicate are descriptive, not prescriptive. So, to assert (#$defaultValueForParameter #$CycLReformulator #$WFFEnforcementRFParameter #$RelationInMtWFFCheckInReformulation) does not set the default value for that parameter, but rather merely reports that the WFF-enforcement parameter of the reformulator is set by default to #$RelationInMtWFFCheckInReformulation.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9fc4).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9fc4,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
