x_comment(x_WFFEnforcementRFParameter,"A reformulator parameter that governs the level of well-formedness to be enforced during reformulation. These constraints are imposed on the EL input expression and the reformulator rules, not on intermediate results or the output expression. The default value for this setting is ':kb', which checks the arg0 position to ensure it is a relation in that Mt. Other values are ':none', for no wff-checking, ':arity', which checks the arg0 position and the arity, and ':all', which performs full semantic wff-checking, including arg-type constraints.") :- x_cid(a65b16517a9fc5).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517a9fc5,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
