xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517aa000,[]).
x_comment(x_recommendedRoleInType,"An instance of #$TernaryPredicate.  #$recommendedRoleInType relates an instance of #$SomethingExisting, a specialization of #$Situation, and an instance of #$BinaryRolePredicate, so as to express the recommendation that the arg1 play that role in an event of that type.  For example, (#$recommendedRoleInType Person001 #$CharitableDonation #$giver) says that it is recommended that Person001 make a donation to some charity.  The source of the recommendation (the agent, conceptual work, moral code, etc.) is unspecified with this predicate; accordingly, assertions should be made in a #$Microtheory (such as the #$PITOfIBTFn Mt for a work that contains recommendations) that can reflect the source.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa001).
