x_comment(x_NewsMagazineSeries,"The collection of all #$MagazineSeries which have signficant #$News content.  The main purpose of such magazines is to convey information about current events, primarily (though not exclusively) in a relatively objective, non-partisan style.  This distinguishes these magazines from magazines such as #$TheNation-TheMagazine and #$NationalReview-TheMagazine, which offer an openly partisan perspective on current events.  Instances of #$NewsMagazineSeries include #$Newsweek-TheMagazine, #$Time-TheMagazine, and #$USNewsAndWorldReport-TheMagazine.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa026).
