x_comment(x_TypographicalStructure,"A specialization of both #$AbstractInformationStructure and #$GraphicalStructure (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$TypographicalStructure is an abstract structure comprising abstract typographic symbols (e.g. #$Character-Abstracts), as well as conventionally meaningful features of and typographical relations between them.  An important specialization of #$TypographicalStructure is #$CharacterString.  A typographical structure might also include details regarding the style or appearance of characters, when that can affect meaning (see e.g. #$ItalicizedFormat).  Also see the comment on #$AbstractInformationStructure.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa029).
