x_comment(x_CalendarMilliSecond,"A subcollection of #$Date (q.v.) and an instance of #$CalendarCoveringType (q.v.). #$CalendarMilliSecond is the collection of milliseconds that make up the calendar.  Each #$CalendarSecond (q.v.) is divided into one thousand contiguous #$CalendarMilliSeconds. Note that (as with any instance of an instance of calendar-covering-type) a given instance of #$CalendarMilliSecond is a temporally continuous individual that occurs only _once_.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa02f).
