x_comment('x_foreignKeyMap-SetNull',"This specialization of #$foreignKeyMap entails an additional\nconstraint on deleting or modifying the rows of the\nreferenced schema. That is (#$foreignKeyMap-SetNull REFERENCED_SCHEMA\nREFERENCED_KEY REFERENCING_SCHEMA REFERENCING_FIELD_LIST) means in\naddition to the constraints inherited from #$foreignKeyMap, on deleting a\nrow of REFERENCED_SCHEMA with a row of\nREFERENCING_SCHEMA that references it, the referencing fields in REFERENCING_SCHEMA are set to null. Contrast this behavior with\n#$foreignKeyMap-Cascade, #$foreignKeyMap-Restrict, and #$foreignKeyMap-SetDefault.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa03c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa03c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
