x_comment(x_summaryPredicateWRTSetOrCollection,"(#$summaryPredicateWRTSetOrCollection SET-OR-COLLECTION PREDICATE) relates an instance of #$SetOrCollection SET-OR-COLLECTION to a #$Predicate PREDICATE that may be useful for summarizing information on instances of SET-OR-COLLECTION.  Thus (#$summaryPredicateWRTSetOrCollection #$BaseballPlayer battingAverage) means that when asked to summarize information on an instance of #$BaseballPlayer, battingAverage is useful information to return.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa040).
