x_comment(x_ScheduledAction,"A specialization of #$PurposefulAction.  Each instance of #$ScheduledAction is an event that is intended by some agent to occur at a certain (at least vaguely specified) time.  For example, #$OlympicGames is a specialization of #$ScheduledAction because a necessary condition for the occurrence of an instance of #$OlympicGames is that it be scheduled to occur.  For a general script that encompasses waiting for the time of a scheduled event and its performance, see #$PerformingAScheduledAction.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa044).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa044,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
