x_comment(x_WaitingForTemporalThingOfTypeFn,"<code>(#$WaitingForTemporalThingOfTypeFn TEMP-THING-TYPE)</code> denotes a specialization of #$Waiting whose instances are events in which an agent waits for an some instance of <code>TEMP-THING-TYPE</code> to occur (where <code>TEMP-THING-TYPE</code> is a specialization of #$TemporalThing).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa045).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa045,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
