x_comment(x_subSituationTypeIteratesEventTypeOverSetWRTSlot,"(#$subSituationTypeIteratesEventTypeOverSetWRTSlot SITTYPE SUBSITTYPE SUB-EVENT-TYPE SET SLOT) means that in every instance of SITTYPE each instance INST of SUBSITTYPE consists of one instance of SUB-EVENT-TYPE for each thing THING such that (#$elementOf THING SET). Also, each element of SET is related by SLOT via an assertion of the form (SLOT SUB-EVENT THING) to exactly one instance SUB-EVENT of SUB-EVENT-TYPE that is a sub-event of INST.  Cf. #$situationTypeIsIteratedSubSituationType-OverSet.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa059).
