x_comment('x_situationTypeIsIteratedSubSituationType-OverSet',"(#$situationTypeIsIteratedSubSituationType-OverSet SITTYPE SUBSITTYPE SET SUBSITTYPE-ROLE) means that each instance, SIT, of SITTYPE consists of one instance of SUBSITTYPE for each element of SET. Moreover, each such thing plays the role SUBSITTYPE-ROLE in exactly one such instance of SUBSITTYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa087).
