x_comment(x_orthogonalityCandidates,"A binary, irreflexive and symmetric #$KBDependentRelation that takes a pair of collections as arguments.  (#$orthogonalityCandidates COLL-A COLL-B) holds just in case COLL-A is not known to be  disjoint with, a specialization of, or a generalization of COLL-B.  That is, it holds just in case:\n<p>\n(#$and\n(#$unknownSentence (#$disjointWith COLL-A COLL-B))\n(#$unknownSentence (#$genls COLL-A COLL-B))\n(#$unknownSentence (#$genls COLL-B COLL-A))).\n<p>\nSee also #$orthogonalSetsOrCollections.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa088).
