x_comment('x_hourOfDayIndex-12Hour',"#$hourOfDayIndex-12Hour is used to relate an #$HourOfDayType to an integer and a #$TimeOfDayType. For example, the assertion (#$hourOfDayIndex-12Hour #$TimeOfDay-6AM 6 #$TimeOfDay-AM) states (1) that instances of the sub-collection of #$CalendarHour #$TimeOfDay-6AM are all represented with the integer '6' on a clock that shows time in a 12-hour format and (2) that the instances of #$TimeOfDay-AM are associated with the #$TimeOfDayType #$TimeOfDay-AM.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa08e).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa08e,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
