x_comment('x_hourOfDayIndex-24Hour',"#$hourOfDayIndex-24Hour is used to relate an #$HourOfDayType to an integer. For example, the assertion (#$hourOfDayIndex-24Hour TimeOfDay-6AM 6) states that the instances of the the sub-collection of #$CalendarHour #$TimeOfDay-6AM are all represented with the number '6' on a clock that represents time in a 24-hour format.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa08f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa08f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
