x_comment(x_CompletenessPredicate,"A collection of #$MetaKnowledgePredicates that are applicable to collections or predicates whose extents are in some sense \"inferentially complete\".  There are a variety of degrees to which such an extent (see #$extent and #$relationExtension) can be inferentially complete; see the specialization #$InferenceCompletenessPredicate and its instances.  Also, a given extent's completeness (of whatever degree) can derive from any one of several sources; see the specialization #$CompletenessGroundsPredicate and its instances.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa0a8).
