x_comment(x_TerminalCoexistencePredicate,"A specialization of #$CotemporalPredicate (q.v.).  A cotemporal predicate PRED is a #$TerminalCoexistencePredicate if and only if it has the following property: if any given sentence of the form (PRED ARG1 ... ARGN) is true at time index T (see #$mtTimeIndex) it remains true until, and only until, at least one of the ARGi ends -- i.e. ceases to exist (if a #$SomethingExisting) or occur (if an #$Event) or obtain (if a #$StaticSituation).\n<p>\nFor example, #$olderThan is a #$TerminalCoexistencePredicate.  Once a sentence of the form (#$olderThan OLD YOUNG) becomes true, it remains true until one of the relata dies or ceases to exist.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa0bb).
