x_comment(x_incapableOfRoleInSituationType,"An assertion of the form (#$incapableOfRoleInSituationType THING ROLE SIT-TYPE) asserts that THING, an instance of #$SomethingExisting, cannot play ROLE, an instance of #$BinaryRolePredicate, in some instance of SIT-TYPE, a specialization of #$Situation.  The conditions that would explain why THING cannot play ROLE in an instance of SIT-TYPE, would be carried in an assertion using the predicate #$roleInScriptRequires-Neg.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa0c7).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa0c7,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
