x_comment(x_subSituationTypeConditionedOn,"An assertion of the form  (#$subSituationTypeConditionedOn SITTYPE SIT-TYPE QUERY) is used to represent the conditions under which an instance of SITTYPE  will have an instance of SIT-TYPE, some sub-collection of #$Situation as a #$subSituations.  Specifically, the conditions for the realization of of the instance of SIT-TYPE are represented via QUERY, some sub-collection of #$CycLQuerySpecification, and the #$InferenceSentenceParameter of the #$softwareParameterValueInSpecification associated with QUERY.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa0cc).
