x_comment(x_analysisVariableConstraints,"(#$analysisVariableConstraints ANALYSIS VAR MEANING-SENT)\nmeans that VAR is an open or existentially bound #$CycLVariable in the\n#$CycLFormula representing a question asked during ANALYSIS, and\nMEANING-SENT expresses the constraints on VAR. In other words, VAR is\na placeholder for something whose identity is to be discovered during\nANALYSIS, and MEANING-SENT is a #$CycLExpression representing some\nconditions that must be met by that thing.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa120).
