x_comment(x_analysisTypeVariableConstraints,"(#$analysisTypeVariableConstraints ANALYSIS-TYPE VAR\nMEANING-SENT) means that VAR is an open or existentially bound\n#$CycLVariable in the #$CycLFormula representing a question asked\nduring events of type ANALYSIS-TYPE, and MEANING-SENT expresses the\nconstraints on VAR. In other words, VAR is a placeholder for something\n;whose identity is to be discovered during ANALYSIS-TYPE events, and\nMEANING-SENT is a #$CycLExpression representing some conditions that\nmust be met by that thing.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa121).
