x_comment(x_RamadanHoliday,"An instance of #$AnnualHolidayType.  Each instance of #$RamadanHoliday is an #$IslamicHoliday which is #$cotemporal with an instance of #$Ramadan-IslamicMonth, the ninth month of the #$IslamicLunarCalendar.  For Muslims (see #$MuslimPerson), each instance of #$RamadanHoliday is an extended period of #$Fasting (from dawn to sunset) and spiritual reflection.  In light of this, some may not consider #$RamadanHoliday to be a \"holiday\" in the colloquial sense.  It is, however, a #$Holiday our (semi-technical) sense.  Note that #$RamadanHoliday is disjoint with #$IslamicMonth.  For the month of Ramadan, use #$Ramadan-IslamicMonth.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa12d).
