x_comment('x_LaylatAlQadr-IslamicHoliday',"An instance of #$AnnualHolidayType and a specialization of #$IslamicHoliday.  Each instance of #$LaylatAlQadr-IslamicHoliday is one of the last ten nights of an instance of #$Ramadan-IslamicMonth.  Though Laylat al-Qadr is believed to fall on the 23rd, 25th, or 27th night of Ramadan, no one is sure of the exact date.  Muslims [see #$MuslimPerson] believe that on this date in (#$YearFn 610), #$MuhammadTheProphet first received the revelations of the #$Koran.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa133).
