x_comment(x_substituteArgPositionIn,"A predicate that relates an  argument-position and a CycL term to a CycL formula in which the term appears (in that position) and a second CycL formula in which has identical arguments to the first in every argument position save the one represented by the integer; #$substituteArgPositionIn is a #$QuaternaryPredicate that relates an instance of #$FormulaArgPosition to an instance of #$CycLTerm and two instances of #$CycLFormula.  (#$substituteArgPositionIn POSITION TERM FORMULA-OLD FORMULA-NEW) means that TERM occurs as in POSITION of FORMULA-NEW and that otherwise FORMULA-OLD and FORMULA-NEW are identical.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa13e).
