x_comment('x_contentOfCreatedIBO-AIS',"An assertion of the form (#$contentOfCreatedIBO-AIS EVENT AIS)  is used to relate an instance of #$AbstractInformationStructure to an  instance of #$IBOCreation.   Specifically, if IBO is a created  #$InformationBearingObject within EVENT such that (#$iboCreated EVENT IBO)  and IBO contains the information of  AIS (such that  (#$containsInfoStructure-IBT IBO AIS), then it is the case that AIS plays  this role within EVENT (#$contentOfCreatedIBO-AIS EVENT AIS).  For  example, the process of writing an email is the creation of an   #$InformationBearingObject within some hardware somewhere. However, that  object is different from the abstract entity that is the content of that  object. #$contentOfCreatedIBO-AIS is intended to represent the abstract  entity's role in the creation process.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa156).
