x_comment(x_actualHoursWorked,"(#$actualHoursWorked AGENT TASK TIME-AMOUNT) means that AGENT, an instance of #$IntelligentAgent, has worked on the task TASK for a total of TIME-AMOUNT, a #$Time-Quantity.  Thus, if it is true that (#$MtSpace (#$ProjectManagementMicrotheoryFn SomeProject) (#$MtTimeWithGranularityDimFn (#$MonthFn #$January (#$YearFn 2004)) #$Null-TimeParameter)) that (#$actualHoursWorked JohnSmith Task001 (#$HoursDuration 5)), this means that JohnSmith has worked a total of 5 hours on Task001 for SomeProject.  Note that #$actualHoursWorked is an instance of #$TemporallyQualifiableRelation; assertions using this predicate should be made in a temporally qualified microtheory.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa1e0).
