x_comment(x_AcademicTerm,"A specialization of #$Situation-Localized. An instance of this collection is the complex of planned activities constituting an academic term at a given educational institution: e.g., the 2003 spring semester at the University of Texas, Austin (cf. #$AcademicSemester). Note that this is not a pure time interval. A certain course, for instance, is a part (cf. #$subSituations) of a certain academic term. Salient specializations are #$AcademicYear and #$AcademicQuarter (qq.v).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa1ec).
