x_comment('x_logicalPhysicalFieldMap-EncodeClosed',"(#$logicalPhysicalFieldMap-EncodeClosed LF PF)\nis true if and only if i) LFI is a logical field indexical associated\nwith the logical field LF via #$indexicalForLogicalField; ii) PFI is a\nphysical field indexical associated with the physical field PF via\n#$indexicalForPhysicalField; and iii) there is some #$fieldEncoding\nassertion of the form (#$fieldEncoding PS PFI LS FORMULA) such that\nLFI appears as a term in FORMULA. (Note it is possible that LFI ==\nFORMULA.) See also the related\n#$logicalPhysicalFieldMap-DecodeClosed.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa1f4).
