x_comment('x_equivalentRolePlayersOfType-SubSitTypeToSubSitType',"<code>(#$equivalentRolePlayersOfType-SubSitTypeToSubSitType SITTYPE SUBSITTYPE1 ROLE1 SUBSITTYPE2 ROLE2 TYPE)</code> means that in any instance <code>SIT</code> of <code>SITTYPE</code>, where <code>SUBSIT1</code> and <code>SUBSIT2</code> are subsituations of <code>SIT</code> and are instances of <code>SUBSITTYPE1</code> and  <code>SUBSITTYPE2</code>, respectively, whatever things of type <code>TYPE</code> play <code>ROLE1</code> in <code>SUBSIT1</code> also play <code>ROLE2</code> in <code>SUBSIT2</code>, and vice versa.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa1f6).
