x_comment('x_differentRolePlayersOfType-SubSitTypeToSubSitType',"'(#$differentRolePlayersOfType-SubSitTypeToSubSitType SITTYPE SUBSITTYPE1 ROLE1 SUBSITTYPE2 ROLE2 TYPE)' means that, in any instance SIT of SITTYPE, whatever thing of type TYPE plays the role ROLE1 in the sub-situation SUBSIT1 of  SIT  which is an instance of SUBSITTYPE1 is different from whatever plays the role ROLE2 in the sub-situation SUBSIT2 which is an instance of SUBSITTYPE2.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa1f7).
