x_comment(x_superTopics,"An instance of #$TransitiveBinaryPredicate and a specialization of #$genls.  #$superTopics relates a #$Topic to a #$Topic.  (#$superTopics TOPIC1 TOPIC2) means that TOPIC2 is a supertopic of TOPIC1, i.e. TOPIC1 is a subtopic of TOPIC2.  More specifically, it means that everything that is in (or \"falls under\") TOPIC1 is in (or \"falls under\") TOPIC2.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa205).
