x_comment(x_relatedTopics,"An instance of #$SymmetricBinaryPredicate and #$IrreflexiveBinaryPredicate, and a specialization of #$conceptuallyCoRelated.  #$relatedTopics relates a #$Topic to a #$Topic.  (#$relatedTopics TOPIC1 TOPIC2) means that TOPIC1 and TOPIC2 have significant overlap, though neither is a subtopic of the other.  Note that #$relatedTopics is *not* transitive: (#$relatedTopics TOPIC1 TOPIC2) and (#$relatedTopics TOPIC2 TOPIC3) do not jointly entail (#$relatedTopics TOPIC1 TOPIC3).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa206).
