x_comment(x_relevanceInformingTerm,"An assertion of the form (#$relevanceInformingTerm TERM) is used to inform a Cyc inference of the appropriate term ranking to use.  That is, when a Cyc query is run, all of the assertions using the predicate #$relevanceInformingTerm that are visible from the #$Microtheory in which that query is run will contribute to the calculation of the term ranking to be used by that query. More specifically, the instances of #$CycLTerm associated with #$relevanceInformingTerm will be equal valued in the weighting vector, while all other terms not associated will have a null value. The weight vector governs how new value enters into the term ranking, so terms that are inferentially related to terms that are #$relevanceInformingTerms will be more highly valued than those that are not.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa253).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa253,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517aa253,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
