x_comment(x_argIsaInstanceOfType,"An assertion of the form (#$argIsaInstanceOfType RELN N COLL) asserts that in any assertion using the relation RELN, the Nth argument slot must be filled by some instance of #$Thing  that is an instance of one of the collections that is an instance of the #$Collection COLL; otherwise the assertion is not semantically well-formed.  For example, the assertion (#$argIsaInstanceOfType #$solute 2 #$ExistingStuffType) asserts that anything that fills the second argument place in an assertion using the predicate #$solute must be an instance of one of the collections that is an instance of #$ExistingStuffType.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa25b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa25b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
