x_comment(x_HostileSeizure,"The sub-collection of #$TransferOfControl whose instances are also instance of #$HostileSocialAction.  As with all instance of  #$TransferOfControl, the instances of #$HostileSeizure require the roles #$losesControl, #$takesControl, and #$objectOfControlTransfer.  However, the instances of this collection are events where the transfer is against the will of the agent who fills the #$losesControl. It is important to note that these events are not all instances of #$ActsCommonlyConsideredCriminal, though several sub-collections of  #$ActsCommonlyConsideredCriminal are sub-collections of #$HostileSeizure.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa260).
