x_comment(x_mtSpindleCollector,"(#$mtSpindleCollector SPINDLE COLLECTOR) identifies COLLECTOR as the \ncollector instance of #$Microtheory in SPINDLE, an instance of #$MicrotheorySpindle SPINDLE. This means that COLLECTOR is the spindle member from which the contents of all other spindle members are visible.  See also #$mtSpindleMember and #$mtSpindleHead.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa263).
