x_comment(x_ChangeOfPropertyHoldings,"#$ChangeOfPropertyHoldings is a sub-collection of #$GeneralizedTransfer where there is some change in the state of property.  This includes both rights over that property, as well as the current disposition of that property relative to a constant owner.  The most numerous sub-collections of this collection are the sub-collections of #$ChangeInUserRights.  However, a smaller segment involves changes in the state of property without a change in rights.  Thus, transferring money from a checking account to a savings account (both held with the same #$BankOrganization) would be an instance of #$ChangeOfPropertyHoldings without being an instance of #$ChangeInUserRights.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa270).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa270,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
