xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517aa272,[]).
x_comment(x_IntegrationOfFundsDuringLaundering,"#$IntegrationOfFundsDuringLaundering is a sub-collection of #$ChangeOfPropertyHoldings that is associated with #$MoneyLaundering.  Specifically, an event of this sort represents the completion of a successful instance of #$MoneyLaundering.  After having obscured the source of some funds, the performer situates the laundered funds such that they are accessible for future use.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa273).
