x_comment('x_irExpansionSet-DefinitionalSelectedWRTProperty',"An instance of #$IRExpansionPredicate. (#$irExpansionSet-DefinitionalSelectedWRTProperty TERM PRED INT SET) identifies SET as the set of collections that (i) are definitional #$isas for TERM, and (ii) are no more general than the argtype constraint(s) applicable to PRED in the INT-th argument place. This predicate represents an attempt to limit expansions for IR queries to those terms that might be more relevant given what other information is known about TERM -- assuming, in particular, that the property expressed by the predicate PRED is relevant to a given IR context. Contrast with #$irExpansionSet-Definitional-CoarseGrained.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa297).
