x_comment(x_HarmfulPlantType,"A specialization of #$PlantTypeByEffectOnOrganism. Each\ninstance of this collection is a collection of #$Plant such that\nplants of that type are harmful to some type of organism. 'Harmful' is\nbroadly defined in this case; what may be harmful to one organism type\nmay not be to another. In addition, harm is underspecified wrt how the\nplants may be harmful. Some plants, like #$PoisonIvy-Plant, are\nharmful to organisms when contact is made with plant instances, and\nother types or plant are harmful upon ingestion.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa29c).
