x_comment(x_MedicinalPlantType,"A specialization of #$PlantTypeByEffectOnOrganism.  Each\ninstance of this collection is a collection of #$Plant such that\nplants of that type are considered medicinal to some kinds of\norganisms.  In this case, 'medicinal' is broadly defined.  Not only\nwill the medicinal properties of plant types change depending on\norganism types, but how the plant is used medicinally will change.  In\ndifferent contexts, medicinal plants are ingested or smoked or put into\ncontact with a wound.  Note, too, that the concepts of 'medicinal' will also be\ndependant on culture.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa29d).
