x_comment(x_confirmationMt,"An assertion of the form (#$confirmationMt STATE MT) asserts that when evaluating the satisfaction of the contents of the #$TaskState STATE, the truth of its contents should be evaluated relative to the #$Microtheory MT.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa2ca).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa2ca,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
