x_comment(x_goalDescription,"An assertion of the form (#$goalDescription GOAL STRING) represents that STRING is a nautral language representation of the contents of GOAL, some instance of #$TaskState, which describe the state of affairs that  would satisfy GOAL.  The content of this string will be determined by the task (some type of #$PurposefulAction, to which STATE bears the relation #$taskToAchieve.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa2cb).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa2cb,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
