x_comment(x_RealizedTaskState,"The collection #$RealizedTaskState is a sub-collection of #$TaskState.  A #$TaskState, STATE, is an instance of #$RealizedTaskState just in case every assertion P which is asserted within STATE is true within the #$Microtheory to which STATE bears the relation #$confirmationMt.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa2d5).
