x_comment(x_constraintDescription,"An assertion of the form (#$constraintDescription STATE STRING) represents that STRING is a natural language representation of the contents of STATE, some instance of #$TaskState, which describe how the world would be were STATE to be satisfied. The content of this string, will be determined by the task (some type of #$PurposefulAction, to which STATE bears the relation #$taskConstraints.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa2d6).
