x_comment(x_hasProjectForGoal,"An assertion of the from (#$hasProjectForGoal AGENT PROJECT GOAL) is used to assert that AGENT, an instance of #$IntelligentAgent plans PROJECT as the overall task for achieving GOAL.  This predicate assumes (#$hasGoals AGENT GOAL) such that GOAL has independent motivation and is not wholly motivated by a desire to perform some further (although GOAL may be in line with or somehow help achieve other goals).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa2db).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa2db,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
