x_comment(x_keStrengtheningSuggestion,"(#$keStrengtheningSuggestion WEAK-SENTENCE STRONG-SENTENCE) means that, STRONG-SENTENCE entails WEAK-SENTENCE (and hopefully more) and is therefore a suitable suggestion to strengthen it (not necessarily strictly).  As a corollary, WEAK-SENTENCE is a suitable suggestion to weaken STRONG-SENTENCE.  This predicate does not require that either sentence have any particular truth value.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa2e0).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa2e0,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517aa2e0,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
