x_comment('x_keRelationStrengthensViaAllArgs-Inverse',"If (#$keRelationStrengthensViaAllArgs-Inverse RELATION BINPRED ARGNUM) and (BINPRED STRONG WEAK), then (#$keStrengtheningSuggestion (RELATION ... WEAK ...) (RELATION ... STRONG ...)).  In other words, (#$keRelationStrengthensViaAllArgs-Inverse RELATION BINPRED ARGNUM) means that the binary predicate BINPRED can be used to weaken a sentence with arg0 RELATION (or used inversely to strengthen it) by replacement of any argument (except arg0).  It is not a requirement that all potential replacement sentences be well-formed.  RELATION will typically have variable arity.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa2e4).
