x_comment(x_nthExpressionOfSession,"(#$nthExpressionOfSession SESSION PEG N) means that the #$LinguisticExpressionPeg PEG is the Nth peg introduced in the #$MySentientSoftwareInteractionSession SESSION.  In general, the numbering of pegs should reflect interaction precedence (i.e. pegs of more recent interactions should ordered higher), as well as ordering within user inputs.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa2e6).
