x_comment(x_taskToAvoid,"An assertion of the form (#$taskToAvoid TASK STATE) asserts that TASK, a type of #$PurposefulAction, has been planned in order to avoid a situation in which the assertions contained in STATE, an instance of #$TaskState, become true. Therefore, TASK is aimed at keeping those assertions false.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa2e7).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa2e7,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
