x_comment(x_avoidanceAttitudeTo,"An assertion of the form (#$avoidanceAttitudeTo AGENT STATE) is used to relate an #$IntelligentAgent to an instance of #$TaskState.  It effectively means that AGENT does not believe that any of the content assertions of STATE are true and that AGENT intends for them to remain false.  This predicate is neutral on the position of STATE within the hierarchy of AGENT's goals.  Those properties are represented using the predicates #$hasGoals and #$hasSupportingGoalWRTGoal.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa2ea).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa2ea,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
