x_comment(x_maintenanceAttitudeTo,"An assertion of the form (#$maintenanceAttitudeTo AGENT STATE) is used to relate an #$IntelligentAgent to an instance of #$TaskState.  It effectively means that AGENT believes that the contents of STATE are true and that AGENT intends for them to remain true.  This predicate is neutral on the position of STATE within the hierarchy of AGENT's goals.  Those properties are represented using the predicates #$hasGoals and #$hasSupportingGoalWRTGoal.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa2eb).
