x_comment(x_achievementAttitudeTo,"An assertion of the form (#$achievementAttitudeTo AGENT STATE) is used to relate an #$IntelligentAgent to an instance of #$TaskState.  It effectively means that AGENT does not believe that the contents of STATE are true, but that AGENT intends for them to become true.  This predicate is neutral on the position of STATE within the hierarchy of AGENT's goals.  Those properties are represented using the predicates #$hasGoals and #$hasSupportingGoalWRTGoal.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa2ec).
