x_comment(x_bugzillaBugDuplicatesBug,"This predicate relates a Bugzilla bug report to another which is a 'duplicate' of the original. (#$bugzillaBugDuplicatesBug DUPLICATE BUG) means that DUPLICATE is a bug report which describes a bug that has been reported in BUG. Often, BUG was reported chronologically earlier than DUPLICATE, however this is not necessary.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa2ff).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa2ff,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
