x_comment(x_typePreparesForRoleInType,"The #$functionCorrespondingPredicate of #$PreparingToPlayRoleInSituationFn (#$typePreparesForRoleInSituation PREPARATION-TYPE ROLE SITUATION) identifies PREPARATION-TYPE as the collection of events in which an intelligent agent prepares to play the role ROLE in the situation SITUATION.  For example, (#$typePreparesForRoleInSituation <i>TrainingForTheBigRaceOnJanuary10</i> #$competingAgents <i>TheBigRaceOnJanuary10</i>) says that <i>TrainingForTheBigRaceOnJanuary10</i> is the collection of all events in which someone prepares to compete in the big race.  See also #$typePreparesForRoleInType.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa311).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa311,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
