xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517aa31a,[]).
x_comment('x_termPhrases-CaseInsensitive',"(#$termPhrases-CaseInsensitive TERM CONSTRAINT STRING) means that STRING's sequence of characters, without regard to case, matches a word or phrase that denotes TERM and that meets CONSTRAINT (see #$termPhrases).  This predicate is #$notAssertible, since it depends on the current state of the KB.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa31b).
