x_comment(x_cycLExpressionOfPropositionVerified,"A #$BinaryRolePredicate that relates events in which an intelligent agent verifies the truth of a proposition to CycL expressions of the propositions that the agent verifies. (#$cycLExpressionOfPropositionVerified VERIF SENTENCE) means that during VERIF (an instance of #$Verification) an agent who performs VERIF determines whether or not the proposition expressed by SENTENCE (an instance of #$ELSentence-Assertible) is true.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa31e).
