x_comment(x_SeriesOfTypeFn,"A #$CollectionDenotingFunction from collections of temporal things to collections of series of instances of those collections.  (#$SeriesOfTypeFn COLL) is the collection of all #$Series (q.v.) such that each item in the series is an instance of COLL.  For example, (#$SeriesOfTypeFn #$GameEvent) is the collection of series of game-playing events, and the playing of the 2003 World Series is an instance of this collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa327).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa327,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
