x_comment(x_relationAllExistsAndOnly,"An instance of #$RuleMacroPredicate. (#$relationAllExistsAndOnly PRED TYPE-1 TYPE-2) says that for every instance INSTANCE of TYPE-1 there exists a thing THING such that (PRED INSTANCE THING) where the fact that (PRED INSTANCE THING) guarantees that (#$isa THING TYPE-2).  So, for example,   (#$relationAllExistsAndOnly #$premeditatedMurderer #$PremeditatedMurder #$Person) says that only people carry out premediated murders, every instance of which must have at least one person who carries it out.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa32a).
