x_comment('x_Separation-Geopolitical',"A specialization of #$GainingPoliticalIndependence. Each\ninstance of #$Separation-Geopolitical involves a change in formal\npolitical control over a #$GeographicalRegion.  The two kinds of such\nchanges which are subsumed by #$Separation-Geopolitical are: (i) a\nsubordinate political entity (see #$geopoliticalSubdivision) secedes\nfrom a larger #$GeopoliticalEntity, and thereby assumes greater\ncontrol over its own territory, and (ii) a proper sub-region of\na #$GeopoliticalEntity is 'broken off' and made the\n#$territoryOf a completely new political entity.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa32b).
