x_comment('x_Vote-CollectiveDecision',"An instance of #$TemporalObjectType and a specialization of #$Deciding-Collectively.  Each instance of #$Vote-CollectiveDecision is an event in which many members of some #$Organization (e.g. a #$Country) cast their votes to decide something--e.g., who should be the next president of the organization or whether a certain policy should be enacted.  Each instance of #$Vote-CollectiveDecision has many instances of #$Voting as proper subevents.  Two important specializations of #$Vote-CollectiveDecision are #$Election and #$BallotInitiative.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa357).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa357,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517aa357,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
