x_comment(x_AtLeastPartiallyCommutativeRelation,"A collection of #$Relations and an instance of #$RelationTypeByLogicalFeature (q.v.).  Each instance of #$AtLeastPartiallyCommutativeRelation <code>RELN</code> is a predicate or function that is commutative in at least two of its argument-places (see #$commutativeInArgs).  If <i>all</i> of <code>RELN</code>'s argument-places are mutually commutative, then it's an instance of the specialization #$CommutativeRelation (q.v.); otherwise it's an instance of the specialization #$PartiallyCommutativeRelation (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa365).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa365,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
