x_comment(x_urlListReturned,"An #$InformationRetrievalPredicate that is used to relate an interent search using a search engine to the list of URLs that the search engine returns.  (#$urlListReturned SEARCH LIST) means that the #$SearchEngine used (see #$searchEngineUsed) in SEARCH returns, for the query specification passed to it in SEARCH (see #$searchCriteriaSpecification) the list of URLs in LIST.  The URLs ranked more highly in LIST are the URLs that the search engine deemed more relevant than the rest.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa374).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa374,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
