x_comment(x_geographicallySubsumes,"(#$geographicallySubsumes GEO-THING-1 GEO-THING-2) holds just in case either of the following hold:\n<p>\n(1) GEO-THING-1 has as a #$geographicalSubRegions either GEO-THING-2 or the\nterritory (c.f #$territoryOf) of GEO-THING-2.\n<p>\n(2) GEO-THING-1 has as a #$geopoliticalSubdivision GEO-THING-2 or the territory of GEO-THING-1 has as a #$geographicalSubRegions GEO-THING-2.\n<p>\nAn example of this relation holding from case (1) would be (#$geographicallySubsumes #$NorthernHemisphere-Region #$Israel).  An example of this relation holding from case (2) would be (#$geographicallySubsumes #$UnitedStatesOfAmerica #$MississippiRiver).\n<p>") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa379).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa379,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
