x_comment('x_Liberalism-Classical',"An instance of #$PoliticalBeliefSystem.  Agents with this ideology emphasize individual liberty and the importance of limiting a government's power over its citizens.  Famous classical liberals include #$JohnLocke, #$AdamSmith, and #$ThomasJefferson.  #$Liberalism-Classical should not be confused with #$Liberalism-SocialDemocratic (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa382).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa382,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
