x_comment(x_repropagateAssertion,"(#$repropagateAssertion ASSERTION) tells the system to repropogate the #$CycLAssertion ASSERTION.  Note that #$repropagateAssertion is an instance of #$ELRelation-OneWay, and so (#$repropagateAssertion ASSERTION) expands to (#$performSubL\n    (#$ExpandSubLFn (ASSERTION)\n      (pwhen (forward-assertion? ASSERTION)\n        (repropagate-forward-assertion ASSERTION))).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa386).
