x_comment(x_thingsObserved,"An instance of #$BinaryRolePredicate.  <code>(#$thingsObserved OBSERVING THING)</code> means that <code>THING</code> is a #$TemporallyExistingThing observed in the instance of #$Observing <code>OBSERVING</code>.  For cases in which <code>THING</code> is an instance of #$PartiallyTangible, use the more specific #$objectsObserved.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa387).
