x_comment('x_Singing-SingleDoerAction',"An instance of #$TemporalStuffType and a specialization of #$MakingMusicalSound.  This is a generalization of #$Singing-Human which includes singing performed by other types of beings, e.g. #$Birds.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa38a).
