x_comment(x_subExpressions,"A predicate used to relate an instance of #$LinguisticExpressionPeg to instances of #$LinguisticExpressionPeg that are introduced in the dialogue model as part of its linguistic decomposition.  For example, (#$subExpressions Peg001-HowMuchShouldIFeedMyDog? Peg002-MyDog) says that the linguistic peg for a particular utterance of \"how much should I feed my dog?\" contains a linguistic peg for \"my dog.\"") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa39a).
