x_comment(x_pegIsOfUtteranceWithForce,"An instance of #$BinaryPredicate used to record the illocutionary force of an utterance being tracked in a dialogue model.  (#$pegIsOfUtteranceWithForce PEG FORCE) says that the #$LinguisticExpressionPeg PEG is a peg for an utterance that originated in an #$InformationTransferEvent with the #$IllocutionaryForce, FORCE.  For example, (#$pegIsOfUtteranceWithForce PEG-HowMuchShouldIFeedMyDog #$Query) says that the particular utterance-event being modelled in which \"how much should I feed my dog?\" was generated had the illocutionary force of a query.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa39d).
