x_comment(x_roleTypesForEventType,"A #$MetaPredicate and a typed-specialization (see #$typedGenlPreds) of #$requiredArg1Pred (q.v.). #$roleTypesForEventType relates a specialization of #$Event to a #$BinaryRoleTypePredicate.  <code>(#$roleTypesForEventType EVENT-TYPE PRED)</code> means that for any instance <code>EVENT</code> of <code>EVENT-TYPE</code>, there is some #$Collection <code>COL</code> such that <code>(PRED EVENT COL)</code>.  For example, (#$roleTypesForEventType #$UsingADevice #$deviceTypeUsed) means that in every instance of #$UsingADevice some <i>type</i> of device is used.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa3a8).
