xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517aa3bf,[]).
x_comment(x_thereExistsRolePlayer,"This predicate is used as a convenient means of asserting\nthe existence of a particular role player for a certain stage of a\ncomplex situation type.  Where the arg2Isa of ROLE is COL,\n(#$thereExistsRolePlayer SIT-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE ROLE) means that in any\ninstance of SUBSIT-TYPE that is a #$subSituations of an instance of\nSIT-TYPE, there exists an actor of type COL that plays the role\nROLE.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa3c0).
