x_comment(x_binPredBetweenRolePlayers,"(#$binPredBetweenRolePlayers SIT-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE1 SUBSIT-TYPE2 ROLE1 ROLE2 BINPRED) means that any actor that plays ROLE1 in an instance of SUBSIT-TYPE1 that is a #$subSituations of an instance of SIT-TYPE is related to any actor that plays ROLE2 in an instance of SUBSIT-TYPE2 that is a #$subSituations of the same instance of SIT-TYPE by BIN-PRED.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa3c2).
