x_comment(x_equivRolePlayersOfType,"This is a type-constrained version of the primitive role\nequivalence predicate, #$equivRolePlayers. (#$equivRolePlayersOfType\nSIT-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE1 SUBSIT-TYPE2 ROLE1 ROLE2 ACTOR-TYPE) means that\nwhere SIT is an instance of SIT-TYPE, any actor of type ACTOR-TYPE\nthat plays the role ROLE1 in an instance of SUBSIT-TYPE1 that is a\n#$subSituations of SIT is equivalent to any actor that plays the role\nROLE2 in an instance of SUBSIT-TYPE2 that is a #$subSituations of\nSIT.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa3c4).
