x_comment(x_FluidFiltrationProcess,"An instance of #$TemporalStuffType and a specialization of #$FluidFlow-Translation and #$PurificationProcess.  Each instance of #$FluidFiltrationProcess is an event in which a #$FluidTangibleThing (e.g. #$Air or (#$LiquidFn #$Water)) passes through a (natural or artificial) filtering mechanism.  During this process, any particles in the fluid that are too large to pass through the filter's pores are removed by the filter; the fluid is thereby purified.  Specializations include #$FluidFiltrationProcess-Artificial and #$FluidFiltrationProcess-Natural.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa3c7).
