x_comment('x_FluidFiltrationProcess-Natural',"An instance of #$TemporalStuffType and a specialization of #$FluidFiltrationProcess.  Each instance of #$FluidFiltrationProcess-Natural is a natural process in which a #$FluidTangibleThing (e.g. #$Air or (#$LiquidFn #$Water)) passes through a natural filtering mechanism.  An example would be leaves being filtered from water as it passes through soil.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa3c9).
