x_comment(x_SKSIRemovalModule,"This is the collection intersection of Cyc\n#$CycRemovalModule and #$SKSIHLModule. Instances of\n#$SKSIRemovalModule are generated for some structured knowledge\nsource. When generated, these modules are used to remove one or more\nquery literals which may be translated into a query against the\nknowledge source. The modules provide bindings and HL supports for the\nremoval. This collection is partitioned into two specializations,\n#$SKSISingleLiteralRemovalModule and #$SKSIMultiLiteralRemovalModule.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa3cd).
