x_comment('x_performsActsOfTypeInLocation-Ratio',"(#$performsActsOfTypeInLocation-Ratio AGENT ACTION-TYPE LOCATION PERCENT) holds just in case PERCENT of the instances of ACTION-TYPE that AGENT is known by Cyc to perform are performed in (#$eventOccursAt) location.  For instance, if 40% of the instances of #$TerroristAttack that Hamas is known to perform are performed in #$Israel, then (#$performsActsOfTypeInLocation-Ratio #$TerroristOrganization-Hamas #$TerroristAttack #$Israel .40) holds.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa3d3).
