x_comment(x_researchTypeOfField,"<code>(#$researchTypeOfField FIELD RESEARCH-TYPE)</code> means that researchers working in the #$FieldOfStudy <code>FIELD</code> regularly perform instances of <code>RESEARCH-TYPE</code> (a specialization of #$Research).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa3e2).
