x_comment(x_ambientHeatIndex,"This predicate relates an object to the ambient heat index\ntemperature in the region 'around' the object. (#$ambientHeatIndex\nPLACE TEMP) means that given the current atmospheric conditions\n'around' PLACE, the temperature feels like TEMP. The Heat Index (HI)\nis the temperature the body feels when heat and humidity are combined.\nIt is directly proportional to the (#$ambientRelativeHumidity and\n#$ambientTemperature)") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa3fe).
