x_comment(x_SituationTypeByPropositionalContent,"A #$SecondOrderCollection, #$SituationTypeByPropositionalContent is a collection of types of #$Situation.  Each instance is a collection of situations that share the common feature of having a particular proposition be constitutively true of them.  A sufficient condition for membership in one of the instances of #$SituationTypeByPropositionalContent is that the situation itself or some of the instances of #$SomethingExisting which are actors in that situation have a set of properties that entail the relevant proposition.  So, if Running001 is an instance of #$Running in which #$BillClinton plays the role #$performedBy, then Running001 is an instance of thes collection (#$SituationTypeInWhichFn  (#$relationExistsExists #$performedBy #$Running #$MaleHuman)) and (#$SituationTypeInWhichFn (#$relationExistsExists #$actors #$Event #$SomethingExisting)).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa404).
