x_comment(x_pegHasCandidatePQInterpretations,"(#$pegHasCandidatePQInterpretations UTTERANCE-PEG QUERY-TEMPLATE) says that QUERY is a parameterized query template that is a reasonable candidate interpretation of the #$LinguisticExpressionPeg UTTERANCE-PEG in the context of the current dialogue.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa406).
