x_comment(x_relevantPQsForPeg,"(#$relevantPQsForPeg QUERY-TEMPLATE UTTERANCE-PEG)  says that QUERY-TEMPLATE is a parameterized query template that is semantically relevant to the semantics of UTTERANCE-PEG.  Specifically, the formula for QUERY-TEMPLATE is sufficiently \"semantically close\" to the content of UTTERANCE-PEG that it is worth presenting to the utterer as a possible interpretation of UTTERANCE-PEG, or as a building block from which to construct the right interpretation.  If the formula for QUERY-TEMPLATE is a reasonable interpretation of UTTERANCE-PEG, use the more specific #$pegHasCandidatePQInterpretations.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa407).
