x_comment(x_relationInstanceExistsAndOnly,"An instance of #$RuleMacroPredicate. <code>(#$relationInstanceExistsAndOnly PRED THING-1 TYPE-2)</code> says that  there exists a thing <code>THING-2</code> such that <code>(PRED THING-1 THING-2)</code> where the fact that <code>(PRED THING-1 THING-2)</code> guarantees that <code>(#$isa THING-2 TYPE-2)</code> and that there is at least one <code>THING-2</code> such that <code>(PRED THING-1 THING-2)</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa40a).
