x_comment(x_UnitOfCountFn,"A unary #$UnitOfMeasureDenotingFunction that takes any instance of #$ObjectType to its corresponding #$UnitOfCount (q.v.).  <code>(#$UnitOfCountFn OBJTYPE)</code> is the unit-of-count for counting instances of <code>OBJTYPE</code>.\n<p>\nFor example, (#$UnitOfCountFn #$Person) is a unit-of-count for counting persons, and ((#$UnitOfCountFn #$Person) 4) is the #$CountQuantity (q.v.) of four persons: the count (e.g.) of all four-person groups (such as the classic lineup of #$TheBeatles-MusicGroup).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa426).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa426,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
