x_comment(x_Trawling,"An instance of #$TemporalStuffType and a specialization of #$Fishing.  Each instance of #$Trawling is an event in which a large #$FishingNet is pulled through the water behind a boat (see #$Trawler) in order to catch a #$Mob of #$Fish.  Most instances of #$Trawling are instances of #$CommercialFishing.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa42a).
