x_comment(x_TriggeringSomething,"A specialization of #$Action.  Each instance of #$TriggeringSomething is an event the most notable feature of which is that it sets some other event or process into motion.  Specializations include #$PullingATrigger and #$TrapTrippingEvent.  An instance of #$TriggeringSomething need not be a #$PurposefulAction (think of a #$Mouse-Rodent triggering a #$MouseTrap).  See also #$TriggeringMechanism.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa432).
