x_comment(x_outOfOfficeDueToEvent,"An instance of #$TemporallyQualifiableRelation that relates\nan instance of #$Agent-Generic to the instance of #$Event that was the\nreason for an absence from their usual workplace, as defined within\nthe context of the assertion.  (outOfOfficeDueToEvent AGENT EVENT)\nmeans that AGENT was out of the office due to EVENT. EVENT may be a an\ninstance of #$ScheduledAction, such as #$VacationLeave, or some\nunscheduled event, such as IceStorm001 that prevents employees from\nreaching the office. However, EVENT should only mean AGENT is\ntemporarily out of the office. Thus, EVENT should not be a termination\nof employment. Statements using this predicate should be temporally\nqualified.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa442).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa442,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
