x_comment('x_fieldValueComparison-Inverse',"This predicate is a generalization of #$fieldValue which\nadds the #$SKSISupportedComparisonPredicate as an additional argument.\nThat is, (#$fieldValueComparison-Inverse PFI VAL PRED) means that the\nreferent REF of the indexical PFI satisfies (PRED VAL REF). Like\n#$fieldValue, the ground formulas of this predicate usually occur within a\n#$rowInSourceClaims sentence which determines the referent value of\nPFI. See also #$fieldValueComparison, which differs from this\npredicate only in the order of the arguments of PRED.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa447).
