x_comment(x_fieldValueComparison,"This predicate is a generalization of #$fieldValue which\nadds the #$SKSISupportedComparisonPredicate as an additional argument.\nThat is, (#$fieldValueComparison PFI VAL PRED) means that the referent\nREF of the indexical PFI satisfies (PRED REF VAL). Like #$fieldValue,\nthe ground formulas of this predicate usually occur within a #$rowInSourceClaims \nsentence which determines the referent value of PFI. See also\n#$fieldValueComparison-Inverse, which differs from this predicate only\nin the order of the arguments of PRED.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa448).
