x_comment('x_prohibits-Underspecified',"A binary #$UnderspecifiedPredicate that represents the notion of one thing prohibiting another.  <code>(#$prohibits-Underspecified PROHIBITER THING)</code> means that <code>PROHIBITER</code> somehow prohibits, forbids, bans, or disallows <code>THING</code> or -- if <code>THING</code> is a collection or a conceptual work -- instances or instantiations of <code>THING</code>.  <code>PROHIBITER</code> might be an agent, a law, an agreement, an order, or something else.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa44c).
