x_comment(x_actFulfillsDistributedAssignmentForAgent,"An assertion of the form (#$actFulfillsDistributedAssignmentForAgent ACT ASSIGN AGENT) represents the fact that the #$Situation ACT satisfies the portion of the #$DistributedAssignment ASSIGN which applies to the #$IntelligentAgent AGENT.  In a #$DistributedAssignment, every agent who is an assignee must complete the task specified by the assignment.  This predicate allows one to represent how individual agent's have fared in completing their obligations with regard to the assignment.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa464).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa464,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
