x_comment(x_ProfileReferentPeg,"A specialization of #$DiscourseReferentPeg used to facilitate user profiling with #$TheMySentientSystem. Instances of this collection are referents which should have their content assertions lifted from their session Mt (#$MySentientAnswersSessionRecordMicrotheory) to the user profile (#$MySentientUserProfileMicrotheory). For a given chain of coreferent expressions, there should be a unique #$ProfileReferentPeg; and this referent should be linked to each expression in the chain via the #$intendedReferents relation.  In general, #$ProfileReferentPegs will be the #$naiveReferent of the.least recently mentioned expression in the coreference chain.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa467).
