x_comment(x_TextCommunication,"A collection of information-transfer events; a specialization of #$Communicating.  Each instance of #$TextCommunication is a transmission of information that is primarily via written text.  Thus this collection is #$disjointWith both #$SpokenCommunicating and #$NonVerbalCommunicating.  Specializations of #$TextCommunication include #$EMailCommunication and #$TextMessagingViaCellPhone.  Text communication also encompasses skywriting, passing notes in class, letter-writing, and sending Morse-encoded messages by telegraph.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa474).
