x_comment(x_allotmentWhollyReservesIndForInterval,"An assertion of the form (#$allotmentWhollyReservesIndForInterval ALLOT INDIVIDUAL INTERVAL) is used to relate an instance of #$Allotment to an #$Individual and a #$TimeInterval.  This refers to the particular interval which is being reserved and has the implication that there cannot be another #$Allotment that lays some claim to INDIVIDUAL during INTERVAL.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa489).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa489,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
