x_comment(x_SpecificationOfProjectEventFn,"A #$UnaryFunction and #$IndividualDenotingFunction, #$SpecificationOfProjectEventFn is used to convert between two senses of the term 'project.'  An expression of the form (#$SpecificationOfProjectEventFn PROJ-EVENT) denotes an instance of #$Project-NormativeSpecification.  The denoted individual is the specification that guides the behavior of at least some of the agent's who are actors in PROJ-EVENT, which is an instance of #$Project, a sub-collection of #$Event.  So, if succeed in fulfilling (#$SpecificationOfProjectEventFn PROJ-EVENT), then PROJ-EVENT will have the properties described by (#$SpecificationOfProjectEventFn PROJ-EVENT).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa495).
