x_comment(x_suspectedOfType,"A #$BinaryPredicate.  Where <code>AGT</code> is a #$LegalAgent and <code>ACT-TYPE</code> is a specialization of #$PurposefulAction, <code>(#$suspectedOfType AGT ACT-TYPE)</code> means that some relevant authority, e.g. a #$LawEnforcementOrganization, suspects that <code>AGT</code> has committed at least one instance of <code>ACT-TYPE</code>.  (What counts as a \"relevant authority\" is of course context-dependent.)") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa4ae).
