x_comment(x_MultipleDoerAction,"A specialization of #$Action. Each instance of #$MultipleDoerAction is an action which must have more than one \"doer\" (see the predicate #$doneBy).  In order for a type of action (i.e., a specialization of #$Action) to be a specialization of #$MultipleDoerAction, it must be true to assert, for any instance ACT of that type of action, both (doneBy ACT X) and (doneBy ACT Y), for some X and Y that are different.  Notable specializations of #$MultipleDoerAction include #$TeamSportsCompetition and #$MeetingSomeone.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa4e5).
