x_comment(x_intendsByUtterancePeg,"(#$intendsByUtterancePeg SPEAKER PEG INTERPRETATION) says that SPEAKER, an instance of #$IntelligentAgent, intended to refer to INTERPRETATION when introducing the instance of #$LinguisticExpressionPeg PEG in discourse.  For example, (#$intendsByUtterancePeg #$DaveS #$MyDog-Peg #$Bailey) says that Dave S intended to refer to his dog Bailey when he uttered \"my dog.\"  For a version of #$intendsByUtterancePeg that makes explicit some of the larger context in which the interpreted peg is introduced, see #$intendsByInUtterancePegContext.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa501).
