x_comment(x_BinaryArgInRelnPredicate,"A collection of predicates.  Each instance of #$BinaryArgInRelnPredicate is a binary predicate PRED that relates a predicate P to a positive integerINT, where the well-formedness of assertions using PRED requires that INT fall within the range of integers given by the arity (see #$arity) of P.  Knowledge that a predicate is an instance of #$BinaryArgInRelnPredicate enables Cyc to conclude the relevant well-formedness constraints.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa509).
