x_comment(x_individualPlaysRoleInSubSituationType,"An assertion of the form (individualPlaysRoleInSubSituationType SUPER-TYPE IND SUB-TYPE ROLE) means that if SUPER is an instance of SUPER-TYPE, a type of #$Situation, and SUB is both an instance of SUB-TYPE, a type of #$Situation, and a #$subSituations of SUPER, then IND, an instance of #$SomethingExisting, will be playing ROLE, a #$BinarySituationPredicate, in SUB.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa517).
