x_comment(x_situationConformsToSpecification,"(#$situationConformsToSpecification SIT SPECIFICATION) says that the situation SIT, an instance of #$ConformingToASpecification conforms to the guidelines set forth in the instance of #$Specification SPECIFICATION.  This might mean that SIT is an action that was performed -- perhaps unknowingly by the performer (c.f., #$performedBy) -- in accordance with those guidelines, or that the relevant consituents of SIT (c.f., #$situationConstituents) are \"arranged\" in such a way that the specification is met, e.g., SIT might be the situation where people at a wedding party are actually seated in the spots prescribed by SPECIFICATION, which is the wedding planner's seating chart.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa51a).
