x_comment(x_specificationFulfilled,"(#$specificationFulfilled SIT SPEC) means that the #$Situation SIT satisfies the #$NormativeSpecification SPEC.  Instances of #$NormativeSpecification describe types of #$Situation, usually quite specifically.  An assertion of this amounts to saying that an individual event satsifies the description represented by SPEC.  As an example, Joe can imagine having his apartment be clean.  If it turns out that his roommate cleans it, then that particular #$NormativeSpecification is satisfied by the fact that the apartment is cleaned.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa51f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa51f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
