x_comment(x_credibilityOfAssertion,"This predicate relates a #$CycLAssertion to some instance of #$Credibility (q.v.).  (#$credibilityOfAssertion ASSERTION CREDIBILITY) holds just in case the degree to which ASSERTION can be independently confirmed is CREDIBILITY.  A (#$VeryLowAmountFn #$Credibility) means that the truth of the assertion cannot be confirmed by other reliable sources.  A (#$VeryHighAmountFn #$Credibility) means that the truth of the assertion is confirmed by other sources each with high reliability.  A (#$MediumAmountFn #$Credibility) means that the assertion has some confirmation, but the source is not reliable enough to warrant a higher credibility rating.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa524).
