x_comment('x_NormativeSpecification-DirectAchievement',"A subcollection of #$NormativeSpecification-Achievement, instances of #$NormativeSpecification-DirectAchievement describe a specific type of #$Situation that some agent wants to occur.  The subcollections of #$NormativeSpecification are differentiated based on their satisfaction conditions.  The instances of #$NormativeSpecification-DirectAchievement specify the details of the kind of situation.  This collection should be contrasted with the collections #$NormativeSpecification-Avoidance and #$NormativeSpecification-IndirectAchievement.  Instances of #$NormativeSpecification-Avoidance specify the kind of situation that some agent does not want to occur.  Instances of #$NormativeSpecification-IndirectAchievement point to the kind of situation that the #$motivatedAgents want to occur as an effect of the occurrence of some other, unspecified, type of situation.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa536).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa536,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517aa536,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
xc_source_line(a65b16517aa536,6765).
