xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517aa536,[]).
x_comment('x_NormativeSpecification-IndirectAchievement',"A subcollection of #$NormativeSpecification-Achievement, instances of #$NormativeSpecification-IndirectAchievement describe some agents being actors in some situation (where the type of this situation is unspecified) which #$causes-SitSit an instance of a particular type of #$Situation to occur.   The subcollections of #$NormativeSpecification are differentiated based on their satisfaction conditions.  #$NormativeSpecification-IndirectAchievement should be contrasted with the collections #$NormativeSpecification-Avoidance and #$NormativeSpecification-DirectAchievement.  Instances of #$NormativeSpecification-Avoidance specify the kind of situation that some agent does not want to occur.  Alternatively, instances of #$NormativeSpecification-DirectAchievement point to the specific kind of situation that the some agents want to occur.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa537).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa537,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
