x_comment(x_NormativeSpecificationTypeBySatisfactionMethod,"A #$SecondOrderCollection, #$NormativeSpecificationTypeBySatisfactionMethod is used to facet the collection #$NormativeSpecification into collections who instances resemble each other based on the means by which the #$Motivation can be satisfied.  For example, the collection #$NormativeSpecification-DirectAchievement has as instances, instances of  #$NormativeSpecification that require the bringing about of some type of #$Situation. Alternatively, #$NormativeSpecification-Avoidance has instances of #$NormativeSpecification that will be satisfied only if it is not the case that an specified type of event occurs.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa53e).
