xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517aa540,[]).
x_comment(x_AIGoneWrongMovie,"#$AIGoneWrongMovie is the collection of movies which depict a disaster or tragedy caused by some AI. The classic example would be #$2001-ASpaceOdyssey-TheMovie. A negative example would be Spielberg's 'A.I.', which is an AI movie gone wrong. Stories about pernicious #$IntelligentAgents that are somehow translated into software, such as #$TheLawnmowerMan-TheMovie, are not technically #$AIGoneWrongMovies") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa541).
