x_comment(x_DirectoryPathname,"#$DirectoryPathname is the collection of computer filesystem directory pathnames.  Pathnames are intended to identify directories on a given filesystem.  For example, '/cyc/ke/' is a directory pathname which denotes a directory on the #$Cycorp unix filesystem. Similarly, '/cyc/foobar/' is a syntactically legal pathname.  However, if '/cyc/foobar/' is not a directory on any unix filesystem, it is not a semantically valid pathname.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa549).
