x_comment(x_BestSupportSentenceFn,"A unary #$IndividualDenotingFunction that takes for its\nvalue an instance of #$CycLSentence-Askable, ASK, and returns an\nindividual #$CycLSentence SENTENCE that is consider a best support\nsentence for ASK. This function clues the system to search further for\na supporting sentence on ASK and allows the system to return a\nsupporting sentence that is more informative than ASK alone.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa54d).
