x_comment(x_documentURLBasePath,"(documentURLBasePath APP COMPUTER BASEPATH) means that an instantiation of APP is installed on COMPUTER, and that BASEPATH is the default base URL of all document files managed by APP on COMPUTER. The absolute URL of a file can be determined by appending its full relative pathname to its base URL. The full relative pathname for a file 'FILE' can be determined by combining the relative directory pathname for 'FILE' (c.f. #$documentRelativeBasePath) with the relative file pathname (c.f. #$accessFilenameOfAIS) of 'FILE'.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa54f).
