x_comment(x_remainderDirectoryPathnameOfAIS,"(#$remainderDirectoryPathnameOfAIS FILE NAME) means that the #$CharacterString NAME can be used as a #$DirectoryPathname (that is a #$RelativePathname) to designate the directory containing #$ComputerFile-AIS FILE. The full (absolute) directory pathname can be determined by prepending a document base path (c.f. #$documentBasePath, #$documentURLBasePath, #$applicationBasePath). Note that, through the use of symbolic links, there can be multiple directories associated with the same file.  Note also that a single #$ComputerFile-AIS can have multiple corresponding instances of #$ComputerFileCopy stored in different areas of memory or on multiple computers or networks.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa550).
