x_comment(x_Forgery,"An instance of #$ActTypeCommonlyConsideredCriminal and a specialization of #$Fraud.  Each instance of #$Forgery is an event in which an agent makes, alters, or imitates something with the intent of defrauding or swindling another agent.  Some examples: producing counterfeit currency, forging another person's signature on a check or credit card form, producing fake ID, signing another artist's name to one's painting to increase its perceived value.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa563).
