x_comment(x_primaryConstituent,"A #$BinaryPredicate that relates objects to further objects which are their primary constituents. <code>(#$primaryConstituent WHOLE PART)</code> means that <code>PART</code> constitutes more of <code>WHOLE</code> than any other (non-arbitrary) part of <code>WHOLE</code>.  For example, (#$primaryConstituent BobsBody WaterInBobsBody).  It is important to note that #$primaryConstituent is neither a specialization nor a generalization of #$mainConstituent (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa567).
