x_comment(x_MeasurableQuantityType,"A collection of collections and a specialization of both #$TotallyOrderedQuantityType and #$MeasurableScalarIntervalType (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$MeasurableQuantityType is a totally-ordered collection of #$MeasurableQuantity[ies] (q.v.) that is #$closedUnder addition (see #$PlusFn) and subtraction (see #$DifferenceFn).\n<p>\nInstances of #$MeasurableQuantityType include #$Distance, #$RateOfRotation, and #$Time-Quantity.  Specializations include #$PrimitiveMeasurableQuantityType and #$DerivedMeasurableQuantityType.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa568).
