x_comment(x_nthSubSituationOfType,"(#$nthSubSituationOfType NTH-SUBSITUATION SUPER-SITUATION N TYPE) says that the instance of #$Situation NTH-SUBSITUATION is the Nth proper subsituation (see #$properSubSituations) of SUPER-SITUATION that is an instance of the collection TYPE.  For example, (#$nthSubSituationOfType SecondInningOfBaseballGame001 BaseballGame001 2 #$BaseballInning) says that the second inning of the baseball game denoted by BaseballGame001 is the second instance of #$BaseballInning of that game.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa56f).
