x_comment(x_stageCoversAtMostOneInstanceOfSubSitType,"An assertion of the form (#$stageCoversAtMostOneInstanceOfSubSitType TEMP-STAGE SUBSIT-TYPE) is used to relate an instance of #$TemporalStageSpecification TEMP-STAGE to a sub-collection of #$Situation, SUBSIT-TYPE.   Instances of #$TemporalStageSpecification are used to give a type-level representaton of the temporal features of all the individuals of a particular sub-collection of #$Situation. (That sub-collection would be picked out using an assertion of the form (#$sitTypeHasTemporalStage SIT-TYPE TEMP-STAGE).   This predicate asserts that in any instance of SIT-TYPE, call it SIT-INST, there is at most one instance of SUBSIT-TYPE, call it SUB-INST,  which is a subsituation of SIT-INST such that the assertion (#$situationFallsUnderStage SUB-INST TEMP-STAGE).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa58e).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa58e,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517aa58e,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
