x_comment(x_sitTypeHasInterStageSpec,"An assertion of the form (#$sitTypeHasInterStageSpec SIT-TYPE INTER-SPEC) is used to relate a type of #$Situation to an instance of #$InterStageSpecification.  This assertion is part of providing a type-level description of the duration of time intervals that subsume or separate the subsituations of instances of SIT-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa590).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa590,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
