x_comment('x_stageDuration-Max',"An assertion of the form (#$stageDuration-Max TEMP-STAGE QUANT) is used to relate an instance of #$TemporalStageSpecification TEMP-STAGE to an instance of #$Time-Quantity QUANT.  TEMP-STAGE will be part of a type-level representation of some type of #$Situation (let's call it SIT-TYPE), such that (#$sitTypeHasTemporalStage SIT-TYPE TEMP-STAGE) holds.  This asserts that in any instance of SIT-TYPE, the duration of all the individual situations that are subsituations of that instance and which bear the relation #$situationFallsUnderStage to TEMP-STAGE cannot have a total duration greater than QUANT.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa593).
