x_comment(x_subSpecification,"The predicate #$subSpecification is used to relate one instance of #$SituationSpecification to another instance of #$SituationSpecification. This is the most general predicate for representing this relationship, most of the relevant representations depend on its specializations.  Instances of #$SituationSpecification are used to represent complex structural features that are common to an entire sub-class of #$Situation.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa597).
