x_comment(x_SitRoleSpecFn,"A #$BinaryFunction, #$SitRoleSpecFn is used to denote an instance of #$RoleSpecification-SitType, an abstract individual which is used to pick out a particular role in the instances of a type of #$Situation. Specifically, an expression of the form (#$SitRoleSpecFn SIT-TYPE ROLE) designates the #$RoleSpecification-SitType that is the representation of the #$BinaryRolePredicate ROLE when played in any instance of the #$Situation type SIT-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa599).
