x_comment('x_RoleSpecification-SitType',"A #$FirstOrderCollection and a sub-collection of #$RoleSpecification, #$RoleSpecification-SitType is a collection of abstract individuals that are used for representing roles within complex situations of a given type.  This sub-collection is aimed at the representation of roles in instances of the relevant situation type and not for roles in the subsituations of those instances.  That representational function is covered by the collection #$RoleSpecification-SubSitType.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa59a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa59a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
