x_comment(x_specificationRole,"The predicate #$specificationRole is used to relate an instance of #$SituationSpecification to an instance of #$BinaryRolePredicate. Instances of #$SituationSpecification are used to represent complex structural features that are common to the instances of an entire sub-class of #$Situation.  This is the most generic predicate for picking out an actor by its role.  It plays a significant role in relation to instances of #$RoleSpecification where it is used to specify the type of #$BinaryRolePredicate which an instance of #$RoleSpecification represents.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa59b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa59b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
