x_comment('x_roleCardinality-Max',"An assertion of the form (#$roleCardinality-Max ROLE-SPEC INT) is used to represent the minimum number of actors which will fill the role represented by the #$RoleSpecification ROLE-SPEC.  If ROLE-SPEC is a  #$RoleSpecification-SubSitType, given the assertions (#$sitTypeHasSpecification SIT-TYPE ROLE-SPEC) , (#$specificationSubSitType ROLE-SPEC SUB-TYPE), (#$specificationRole ROLE-SPEC ROLE), and (#$specificationStage ROLE-SPEC STAGE), then in any instance of SIT-TYPE in any subsituation of type SUB-TYPE that bears the relation  #$situationFallsUnderStage to the #$TemporalStageSpecification STAGE, then there will exist at most INT things playing ROLE in that subsituation.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa59c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa59c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
