x_comment(x_existentialActorType,"An assertion of the form (#$existentialActorType ROLE-SPEC TYPE) is used to represent the existence of actors of the type TYPE within the role represented by the #$RoleSpecification ROLE-SPEC.   If ROLE-SPEC is a #$RoleSpecification-SubSitType, given the assertions (#$sitTypeHasSpecification SIT-TYPE ROLE-SPEC) , (#$specificationSubSitType ROLE-SPEC SUB-TYPE), (#$specificationRole ROLE-SPEC ROLE), and (#$specificationStage ROLE-SPEC STAGE), then in any instance of SIT-TYPE in any subsituation of type SUB-TYPE that bears the relation  #$situationFallsUnderStage to the #$TemporalStageSpecification STAGE, then there exists an instance of TYPE that plays ROLE in that subsituation") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa59d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa59d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
