x_comment(x_RoleSpecification,"A #$FirstOrderCollection and a sub-collection of #$SituationSpecification, #$RoleSpecification is a collection of abstract individuals that are used for representing roles within situations.  There specific purpose is to allow an easy means for representing roles within the subsituations of the instances of a given sub-collection of #$Situation. In conjunction with instances of #$RoleMappingSpecification, logical relationships among these roles can be represented (e.g., identity, entailment, difference).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa59e).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa59e,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517aa59e,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
