xc_kb_names(a65b16517aa59e,[]).
xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517aa59e,[]).
x_comment(x_specificationPredicate,"The predicate #$specificationPredicate is used to relate an instance of #$SituationSpecification to an instance of #$BinaryPredicate.  The purpose of this predicate is to help represent the structural features of a complex type of #$Situation.  Specifically, it is used to introduce a #$BinaryPredicate into the representation, for the purposes of depicting a relation between constituents of the instances of that type of #$Situation.  Most commonly, it will be used with an instance of #$InterActorRelationSpecification to represent a relationship between two actors.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa59f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa59f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
