x_comment(x_InterActorRelnSpecFn,"A #$BinaryFunction and #$IndividualDenotingFunction, the function #$InterActorRelnSpecFn is used to represent instances of #$InterActorRelationSpecification.  So, an expression of the form (#$InterActorRelnSpecFn SIT-TYPE N) is used to pick out an instance of #$InterActorRelationSpecification, which will bear the relation #$sitTypeHasSpecification to SIT-TYPE, some sub-collection of #$Situation.  For this function, the second argument, an instance of #$PositiveInteger, is not significant.  It serves only to differentiate instances.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa5a2).
