x_comment(x_sitTypeHasRoleSpecification,"The predicate #$sitTypeHasRoleSpecification is used to relate a sub-collection of #$Situation to an instance of #$RoleSpecification.  This predicate is a specialization of the predicate #$sitTypeHasSpecification and is used for inferences involving roles in individual situations based on type-level knowledge of that situation.  Specifically, this predicate relates the type of situation to abstract individuals that are used to represent the properties of and  relations among roles in the instances of that type of situation.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa5a3).
