x_comment(x_specificationStage,"The predicate #$specificationStage is used to relate an instance of #$SituationSpecification to an instance of #$TemporalStageSpecification.  Instances of #$SituationSpecification are used to represent complex structural features that are common to the instances of an entire sub-class of #$Situation.  It can play a significant role in relation to instances of #$RoleSpecification where it is used to specify the relevant #$TemporalStageSpecification which a particular type of subsituation falls under.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa5a4).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa5a4,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
