x_comment('x_RoleSpecification-SubSitType',"A #$FirstOrderCollection and a sub-collection of #$RoleSpecification, #$RoleSpecification-SubSitType is a collection of abstract individuals that are used for representing roles within complex situations of a given type.  This sub-collection is aimed at the representation of roles in the subsituations of instances of the relevant situation type and not for roles in the 'top-level' situations.  The  function of representing top-level is covered by the collection #$RoleSpecification-SitType.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa5a5).
