x_comment(x_SitTypeRoleMappingFn,"An #$IndividualDenotingFunction and #$BinaryFunction, an expression of the form (#$SitTypeRoleMappingFn SIT-TYPE N) represents an instance of #$RoleMappingSpecification which will bear the relation #$sitTypeHasRoleSpecification from SIT-TYPE.  This will be used to represent relationships among the actors that play roles in instances of SIT-TYPE.  The argument N is introduced to create unique results and does not have a specific meaning.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa5a9).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa5a9,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
