x_comment(x_RoleMappingSpecification,"A #$FirstOrderCollection and a sub-collection of #$SituationSpecification, #$RoleMappingSpecification is a collection of abstract individuals that are used for representing the relationships among roles in the instances of a given type of #$Situation and in the subsituations of those instances.  Instances of #$RoleMappingSpecification typically relate several instances of #$RoleSpecification to establish logical connections among roles, where these connections include entailment, identity, and difference.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa5aa).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa5aa,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
