x_comment(x_SubSitRoleSpecFn,"A #$TernaryFunction, #$SubSitRoleSpecFn is used to denote an instance of #$RoleSpecification-SubSitType, an abstract individual which is used to pick out a particular role in the subsituations of a type of #$Situation.  Specifically, an expression of the form (#$SubSitRoleSpecFn SIT-TYPE SUBSIT-TYPE ROLE) designates the #$RoleSpecification-SubSitType that is the representation of the #$BinaryRolePredicate ROLE when played in an instance of the #$Situation type SUBSIT-TYPE when it is a subsituation of some instance of the #$Situation type, SIT-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa5b6).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa5b6,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
