x_comment('x_javaClassName-LongForm',"(#$javaClassName-LongForm CLASS STRING) identifies STRING as the long-form name of the java class CLASS.  Because long-form java class names are fully qualified, For example, (#$javaClassName-LongForm OpenType-JavaClass \"javax.management.openmbean.OpenType\") identifies \"javax.management.openmbean.OpenType\" as the class name of the public abstract class <code>OpenType</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa5b9).
