x_comment(x_termStringsViaWordNet,"<code>(#$termStringsViaWordNet THING STRING)</code> means that <code>THING</code>  is a denotation of <code>STRING</code> via #$WordNet-1997Version.  In other words,  THING is directly linked to STRING in #$WordNet-1997Version.  STRING is present in one of the synsets of WordNet-1997Version and the synset corresponds (see  #$synonymousExternalConcept) to THING in the Cyc World.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa5d0).
