x_comment(x_ChiefOfStaff,"A specialization of #$PublicOfficial (q.v.).  Typically, a #$ChiefOfStaff heads the office or personal staff of an important public official.  For example, the White House Chief of Staff is the highest-ranking member of the Executive Office of the President of the United States; a Congressional Chief of Staff heads the office of a member of the United States Congress.\n<p>\nNote that a #$ChiefOfStaff in the present sense is not to be confused with a military chief of staff.  Cf. #$chiefOfStaff-Military, and see the specializations of #$CoordinatingStaffMember-USArmy.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa5d6).
