x_comment(x_mostRequestedInstanceOfCollForOrgDuring,"An assertion of the form (#$mostRequestedInstanceOfCollForOrgDuring INDIVIDUAL COLLECTION ORGANIZATION INTERVAL) is used to express the most 'in demand' element of a collection of resources for a particular organization during a particular time interval.  So, INDIVDIUAL would be the instance of the #$FirstOrderCollection COLLECTION that the #$Organization has some rights over (i.e., #$employees) during the #$ContinuousTimeInterval INTERVAL. So, the assertion (#$mostRequestedInstanceOfCollForOrgDuring #$Goolsbey #$CurrentCycorpEmployee #$Cycorp (#$MonthFn #$March (#$YearFn 2004))) would mean that #$Goolsbey is the most requested instance of #$CurrentCycorpEmployee by #$Cycorp for March, 2004.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa5f8).
