x_comment(x_crashTypeOfTransporterType,"<code>(#$crashTypeOfTransporterType TRANS-TYPE CRASH-TYPE)</code> means that <code>CRASH-TYPE</code> is the specialization of #$TransporterCrashEvent in which transporters of type <code>TRANS-TYPE</code> (a specialization of #$TransportationDevice) crash.  For example,(#$crashTypeOfTransporterType #$Airplane #$AirplaneCrash) is true, and it means that #$AirplaneCrash is the collection of transporter crash events in which airplanes crash.  #$crashTypeOfTransporterType is the predicate corresponding to #$CrashOfTransporterTypeFn (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa618).
