x_comment(x_subInformationOrigins,"An instance of #$BinaryRolePredicate that is used to indicate a source of of information being transfered in a particular instance of #$InformationTransferEvent (q.v.).  (#$subInformationOrigins TRANSFER ORIGIN) means that some of the information being transferred in TRANSFER comes from ORIGIN.  Contrast this with the specialized predicate #$informationOrigin, which is used to say that all of the information transferred in TRANSFER comes from ORIGIN. ORIGIN is either an instance of #$InformationBearingThing or an agent.   Note that if ORIGIN still exists after the ending of TRANSFER, it  presumably also still contains the information that was transferred.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa648).
