x_comment(x_WorkByForDuringFn,"An #$IndividualDenotingFunction, an expression of the form (#$WorkByForDuringFn AGENT SPEC INTERVAL) is used to represent an instance of #$WorkingEvent that is made up of all the smaller events where the #$IntelligentAgent AGENT has been working in accordance with the #$NormativeSpecification SPEC during the #$ContinuousTimeInterval INTERVAL. For instance, if SPEC is an instance of #$Assignment-Specification, then the functionally denoted individual would be the event that is composed of all the individual events that INTERVAL temporally subsumes, where AGENT was doing the type of work specified by SPEC. The functionally denoted event need not represent the fulfillment of SPEC.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa65a).
