x_comment(x_repaymentPlanForLoan,"(#$repaymentPlanForLoan REPAY-PLAN LOAN) means that\nREPAY-PLAN is the instance of #$RepaymentPlan that leads to the\ninstance of #$LoanAgreement LOAN becoming #$PaidInFull.  There may not\nexist a definate replayment plan, but rather the schedule might be\nflexible or perhaps a pay as one can schedule.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa66a).
