x_comment(x_geographicalSubRegionsOfCountry,"A specialization of #$geographicalSubRegions (q.v.) that relates a given #$Country (q.v.) to its subregions.  <code>(#$geographicalSubRegionsOfCountry COUNTRY SUB-COUNTRY)</code> means that the region <code>SUB-COUNTRY</code> lies wholly within the country <code>COUNTRY</code>.\nFor example, this holds: \n<code>(#$geographicalSubRegionsOfCountry #$Russia #$CityOfMoscowRussia)</code>.\nNote that, if either argument to #$geographicalSubRegionsOfCountry is an instance of #$GeopoliticalEntity, the assertion must be made in #$WorldGeographyDualistMt or a specialization thereof.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa675).
