x_comment(x_geographicalSubRegionsOfContinent,"A specialization of #$geographicalSubRegions (q.v.) that relates a given #$Continent (q.v.) to its subregions.  <code>(#$geographicalSubRegionsOfContinent CONTINENT SUB-CONTINENT)</code> means that the region <code>SUB-CONTINENT</code> lies wholly within the continent <code>CONTINENT</code>. \nFor example, this holds: \n<code>(#$geographicalSubRegionsOfContinent #$ContinentOfEurasia (#$TerritoryFn #$Russia))</code>.\nNote that, if either argument to #$geographicalSubRegionsOfContinent is an instance of #$GeopoliticalEntity, the assertion must be made in #$WorldGeographyDualistMt or a specialization thereof.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa676).
