x_comment(x_equivalentQuantities,"An instance of #$ReflexiveBinaryPredicate and #$TransitiveBinaryPredicate that relates equivalent instances of #$MeasurableQuantity.  (#$equivalentQuantities INT-1 INT-2) says that any thing for which INT-1 is its measured value is such that INT-2 is also its measured value.  For example, (#$equivalentQuantities (#$MinutesDuration 1) (#$SecondsDuration 60)) says that any time interval a minute in duration is thereby one of sixty seconds in duration, and vice versa.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa679).
