x_comment(x_unitPrefixMultiplier,"An instance of #$StrictlyFunctionalSlot. #$unitPrefixMultiplier takes an instance of #$MetricUnitPrefix PREFIX and relates it to a real number REAL.  Where UNIT is an argument to PREFIX, REAL is the the real number by which (PREFIX UNIT) is a multiple of UNIT.  For example, where UNIT is defined as a possible argument for #$Kilo, (#$unitPrefixMultiplier #$Kilo 1000) means that when converting from N kilo-units to arrive at M units (converting an expression of the form ((#$Kilo UNIT) N) to one of the form (UNIT M)), M is arrived at by multiplying N by 1000.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa67a).
