x_comment(x_RootAllotmentOfCollectionByAgentDuringFn,"An #$IndividualDenotingFunction, an expression of the form (#$RootAllotmentOfCollectionByAgentDuringFn COLLECTION AGENT INTERVAL) is used to pick out the instance of #$RootAllotment that the #$Agent-Generic AGENT has for the #$FirstOrderCollection COLLECTION during the #$ContinuousTimeInterval INTERVAL.  For instance, (#$RootAllotmentOfCollectionByAgentDuringFn #$CurrentCycorpEmployee #$Cycorp (MonthFn February (YearFn 2005))) would pick out the instance of #$RootAllotment that #$Cycorp has for instances of #$CurrentCycorpEmployee during February 2005.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa681).
