x_comment(x_allottedQuantityOfWorkTime,"An assertion of the form (#$allottedQuantityOfWorkTime ALLOTMENT QUANT) relates an instance of #$Allotment to an instance of #$Time-Quantity.  Instances of #$Allotment represent reservations or constraints on a resource (e.g., an agent's work time).  This predicate represents the actual quantity of work time that is being reserved.  To find out the interval when this reservation holds, see #$allotementForInterval.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa682).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa682,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
