x_comment(x_allotmentForInterval,"An assertion of the form (#$allotmentForInterval ALLOTMENT INTERVAL) relates an instance of #$Allotment to an instance of #$ContinuousTimeInterval.  Instances of #$Allotment represent a reservation on some resource (e.g, an agent's work time).  This predicate represents the period in which that reservation holds; however, in cases where time is reserved, this does not mean that the entire interval is reserved.  The predicate #$allottedQuantityOfWorkTime would express how much time is reserved during INTERVAL. ") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa683).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa683,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517aa683,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
