xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517aa684,[]).
x_comment(x_requestForInterval,"An assertion of the form (#$requestForInterval ALLOTMENT INTERVAL) relates an instance of #$ResourceRequest to an instance of #$ContinuousTimeInterval.  Instances of #$ResourceRequest represent the content of an attempt to reserve some resource (e.g, an agent's work time).  This predicate represents the period in which that reservation would hold; however, in cases where time is reserved, this does not mean that the entire interval would be reserved.  The predicate #$allocatedTimeQuantity and its specialization #$requestedQuantityOfWorkTime would express how much time is reserved during INTERVAL. ") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa685).
