x_comment(x_DemolitionsExpert,"An instance of #$PersonTypeByActivity and a specialization of #$Person.  Each instance of this collection is an individual who is at least somewhat proficient in blowing things up and does so or trains to do so on a fairly regular basis.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa68e).
