x_comment('x_keSuggestionPreds-InsSpec',"A #$KEFacilitationPredicate and #$RuleMacroPredicate.  <code>(#$keSuggestionPreds-InsSpec COL1 BINPRED COL2)</code> means that for every known instance <code>INS1</code> of <code>COL1</code>, it is suggested that there be some specialization <code>SPEC2</code> of <code>COL2</code> such that <code>(BINPRED INS1 SPEC2)</code> is known in the knowledge base.\n<p>\nFor example,\n<p>\n(#$keSuggestionPreds-InsSpec #$PersonTypeByOccupation #$agentTypePerformsWorkOfType #$PurposefulAction)\n<p>\nmeans that for every known instance <code>P-TYPE</code> of #$PersonTypeByOccupation, it is suggested that there be some specialization <code>ACT-TYPE</code> of #$PurposefulAction such that <code>(#$agentTypePerformsWorkOfType P-TYPE ACT-TYPE)</code> is known in the knowledge base.\n<p>\nSee also #$keSuggestionPredsInverse-InsSpec.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa6b1).
