x_comment(x_calculatedStrategyConfidence,"An instance of #$StrictlyFunctionalSlot that relates an instance of #$ProblemSolvingStrategy to a real number between 0 and 1 that represents a confidence in the success of any application of the strategy to an applicable problem.  Unlike other instances of #$StrategyConfidenceSlot, such as #$defaultStrategyConfidence and #$assignedStrategyConfidence, the #$calculatedStrategyConfidence is arrived at through inference, and not by stipulation.  Note that #$calculatedStrategyConfidence can be queried as a strategy is being executed, and the confidence of that strategy might be different from execution to execution, given differences in input and background conditions.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa6cb).
