x_comment(x_strategyConfidenceSlotOverrides,"(#$strategyConfidenceSlotOverrides SLOT-1 SLOT-2) says that when calculating the confidence of an instance of #$Strategy STRATEGY, the instance SLOT-1 of #$StrategyConfidenceSlot overrides the instance SLOT-2 of #$StrategyConfidenceSlot.  So, for example (#$strategyConfidenceSlotOverrides #$assignedStrategyConfidence #$defaultStrategyConfidence) means that when calculating the confidence of STRATEGY, if (#$defaultStrategyConfidence STRATEGY M) and (#$assignedStrategyConfidence STRATEGY N) and N trumps M when they differ.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa6cc).
