x_comment(x_InsuranceTypeBySituationTypeProtectedAgainst,"The collection of all subcollections of #$InsurancePlan whose instances are agreements to provide for the insured (see #$policyHolder) compensation for certain objects that are damaged as a result of a qualifying instance of a certain type of situation.  For example, each instance of #$FloodInsurance is designed to protect the insured against property-damage that results from an instance of #$Flooding.  See also #$policyTypeProtectsAgainst.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa6d8).
