x_comment(x_policyTypeProtectsAgainst,"A predicate that relates an instance of\n #$InsuranceTypeBySituationTypeProtectedAgainst to the type of situation against which instances of that policy-type are intended to protect.  (#$policyTypeProtectsAgainst POLICY-TYPE SITUATION-TYPE) says that POLICY-TYPE is a type of insurance plan (see #$InsurancePlan) that compensates the policy holder (see #$policyHolder) for damages to objects covered (see #$policyCoversObjects) where those damages are the result of some qualified instance of SITUATION-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa6d9).
