x_comment(x_GivingAGratuity,"A specialization of #$GivingSomething.  Each instance of #$GivingAGratuity is an event in which an agent gives a (usually small) sum of money -- a gratuity or \"tip\" -- to an agent who has provided him with a service.  In the United States, it is socially expected (though not legally required) that diners at a restaurant give a gratuity to their #$Waitperson (provided the service provided was satisfactory).  Other service workers who are commonly given gratuities (at least in the United States) are #$TaxiDrivers, #$Maids, #$HairStylists, and #$BaggagePorters.  Customs and social expectations regarding gratuities vary greatly from culture to culture.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa6e2).
