x_comment(x_UrbanGuerillaGroup,"A specialization of #$ParamilitaryOrganization and #$RevoltOrganization.  Each instance of #$UrbanGuerillaGroup is a paramilitary group that operates in a large urban area, fighting against the government in power or a foreign occupying force (as the case may be), in hopes of ousting it.  Urban guerillas are so-called because they adapt many of the tactics of traditional #$GuerillaForces (q.v.) to an urban setting.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa6e9).
