x_comment(x_vetoProhibitsActType,"A #$BinaryRoleTypePredicate that holds between an instance of #$VetoingSomething and a specialization of #$Action that the veto prohibits.  <code>(#$vetoProhibitsActType VETO ACTTYPE)</code> means that <code>VETO</code> prohibits or disallows any instance of <code>ACTTYPE</code> from being performed.  Such a <code>VETO</code> will normally occur in response to some agent's proposing to do an action of <code>ACTTYPE</code>.   Note that this does not imply that no acts of <code>ACTTYPE</code> are performed subsequent to <code>VETO</code>, since vetoes are sometimes disobeyed.\n<p>\nSee also #$lawProscribesActType.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa705).
