x_comment(x_StuffTypeWRTPredFn,"<code>(#$StuffTypeWRTPredFn PRED)</code> denotes the collection of collections that are stuff-like with respect to <code>PRED</code>.\n<p>\nFor every collection <code>STUFFTYPE</code> that is an instance of <code>(#$StuffTypeWRTPredFn PRED)</code>, if <code>STUFF</code> is an instance of <code>STUFFTYPE</code>, <code>(PRED STUFF STUFFPART)</code>, and <code>STUFFPART</code> is above the granularity level for <code>STUFFTYPE</code>, then <code>STUFFPART</code> is also an instance of <code>STUFFTYPE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa752).
