x_comment(x_agentTypeTypicallyLikesRoleInEventType,"A #$TernaryPredicate that relates a specialization of #$Agent-Generic to a #$BinaryRolePredicate to a specialization of #$Event.  <code>(#$agentTypeTypicallyLikesRoleInEventType A-TYPE ROLE E-TYPE)</code> means that instances of <code>A-TYPE</code> typically like playing <code>ROLE</code> in instances of <code>E-TYPE</code>.\n<p>\nFor example, (#$agentTypeTypicallyLikesRoleInEventType #$Dog #$objectTakenCareOf #$WalkingAPet) means that instances of #$Dog typically like playing the role of #$objectTakenCareOf in instances of #$WalkingAPet -- that is, dogs like to be taken for walks.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa753).
