x_comment(x_projectMarkerConstant,"(#$projectMarkerConstant PROJECT COLL-OF-CONSTANTS) holds just in case COLL-OF-CONSTANTS is the #$CycKBSubsetCollection that corresponds to PROJECT.  In essence, this relation holds whenever terms created by PROJECT need to be instances of COLL-OF-CONSTANTS.  Note that this relation essentially involves #$CycLConstants but is not quoted in any argument place.  This is because the first argument is the project and not the term for the project and the second argument is a collection of terms, not the term that refers to that collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa762).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa762,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
