x_comment(x_miniatureSizedVarietyOf,"A specialization of #$genls.  (#$miniatureSizedVarietyOf SUB-TYPE TYPE) identifies SUB-TYPE as the collection of miniature-sized instances of TYPE, an instance of #$OrganismClassificationType.  For example, (#$miniatureSizedVarietyOf #$Poodle-MiniatureSizedVariety #$Poodle) identified #$Poodle-MiniatureSizedVariety as the collection of miniature poodles. For this relation to hold between SUB-TYPE and TYPE, SUB-TYPE must be a recognized classification of \"miniatures\" (c.f., #$ConventionalClassificationType), though different authorities might disagree on membership.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa768).
