x_comment(x_standardSizedVarietyOf,"A specialization of #$genls.  (#$standardSizedVarietyOf SUB-TYPE TYPE) identifies SUB-TYPE as the collection of standard-sized instances of TYPE, an instance of #$OrganismClassificationType.  For example, (#$standardSizedVarietyOf #$Dachshund-StandardSizedVariety #$Dachshund) identified #$Dachshund-StandardSizedVariety as the collection of standard-sized dachshunds. For this relation to hold between SUB-TYPE and TYPE, SUB-TYPE must be a recognized classification by some authoritative group (c.f., #$ConventionalClassificationType), though different authorities might disagree on membership.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa769).
