x_comment('x_situationMightBeSubSituationType-ViaRolePlayerType',"An instance of #$SituationProfilingPredicate. <code>(#$situationMightBeSubSituationType-ViaRolePlayerType SIT SITTYPE SUBSITTYPE ROLE TYPE)</code> means that there is evidence to the effect that <code>SIT</code> is an instance of <code>SUBSITTYPE</code>, which is a sub-situation type (see #$subSituationTypes) of <code>SITTYPE</code>.  The evidence is based on knowledge that some instance of <code>TYPE</code> plays <code>ROLE</code> in <code>SIT</code>, and instances of <code>TYPE</code> are known typically to play the role <code>ROLE</code> in instances of <code>SUBSITTYPE</code> that are sub-situations of instances of <code>SITTYPE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa76b).
