x_comment(x_requestingAgent,"An assertion of the form (#$requestingAgent AGENT REQUEST ) states that that REQUEST, an instance of #$ResourceRequest (and, by extension, an instance of #$ConceptualWork) represents an allocation of resources that the #$IntelligentAgent AGENT wishes to be dedicated to the realization of some #$NormativeSpecification. An instance of #$ResourceRequest represents the content in the event of making a request.  Thus, this is the person who wants that content to be realized, rather than the person who actually expresses that content in a requesting event.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa773).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa773,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
