x_comment(x_instrumentalCW,"An assertion of the form (#$instrumentalCW ACTION CW) states that in the instance of #$PurposefulAction ACTION, the #$ConceptualWork CW was used by some agent in the #$doneBy or #$performedBy role in ACTION as an aid in performing the action. This is a very general role.  For instance, an instance of #$Map might be used to come up with a plan on how to drive to a particular location.  Alternatively, an instance of #$BugReport might be used to fix a particular software bug.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa774).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa774,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
