xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517aa77a,[]).
x_comment(x_determinationOfValueOfArgInReln,"(#$determinationOfValueOfArgInReln EVENT N PRED) means that in EVENT, an instance of #$DeterminingTheValueOfASlot, the value of the Nth argument of a formula FORMULA of the form (PRED . ARGS) where all of the argument-places in FORMULA were bound but for the Nth.  For example, (#$determinationOfValueOfArgInReln CalculatingTheAPROnLoan001 2 #$annualPercentageRate) says that in this particular event of calculating the APR on Loan001, the value of ?X in (#$annualPercentageRate Loan001 ?X) is determined.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa77b).
