x_comment(x_EjectingAnObject,"A specialization of #$EmittingAnObject (q.v.).  This is the collection of all events in which a tangible object is ejected from some object in which it was contained (see #$in-ContGeneric).  The ejected object might or might not be thrown completely clear of the container.\n\nExamples of #$EjectingAnObject include ejecting a cassette tape from a tape deck, a pilot ejecting from an aircraft, and a piece of toast popping up out of a toaster.\n\nAn important specialization of this collection is #$ProjectileLaunching.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa785).
