x_comment(x_closingCostItems,"(#$closingCostItems LOAN VALUE) identifies VALUE as one of the closing costs incurred for the instance of #$LoanAgreement, LOAN.  Note that this predicate is #$notAssertible.  Individual closing costs should be itemized using one of the specialization-predicates of #$closingCostItems, such as #$loanOriginationFee.  To represent the closing cost (the sum total of the closing cost items), use #$closingCost.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa78d).
