x_comment(x_MotorVehicleMechanics,"A specialization of #$TakingCareOfSomething. Instances of\nthis collection are events in which someone, who is specially\ntrained, performs maintenance, repair, or rebuilding of an instance of\n#$RoadVehicle that the average motor vehicle user would not perform\nthemselves.  Thus, rebuilding an instance of #$Carburetor would be an\ninstance of this collection, whereas an instance of\n#$FillingUpAtAServiceStation would not.  Borderline examples might be\nchanging the oil in one's car.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa790).
