x_comment(x_PresentingIDDocument,"A specialization of #$DisplayingSomething. In each instance\nof #$PresentingIDDocument, a person displays an #$IDDocument\n(purportedly belonging to her) to a second person or automated reader\nin order to satisfy a security requirement.  Common examples include a\ntraveller presenting a #$Passport to a #$BorderSecurityAgent, and a\nshopper showing a #$DriversLicense-Document to a #$RetailSalesClerk.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa794).
