x_comment(x_ksRangeInSpecification,"Predicate used for specifying the contexts in which to ask the antecedent and propagate the instantiated consequent of a rule stored as the #$InferenceSentenceParameter of a #$CycLRuleSpecification.  (#$ksRangeInSpecification #$RuleAntecedentParameter MT-SET SPEC) means that the antecedent of the rule given (via #$softwareParameterValueInSpecification) as the #$InferenceSentenceParameter of SPEC should be asked in the microtheoretic union of the elements of MT-SET and its upward closure under #$genlMt.  (#$ksRangeInSpecification #$RuleConsequentParameter MT-SET SPEC) means that the set of assertions resulting from instantitating the consequent of the rule given (via #$softwareParameterValueInSpecification) as the #$InferenceSentenceParameter of SPEC should all be asserted in each of the microtheories that is an element of MT-SET.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa7bc).
