x_comment(x_InstanceOfTypeWithIDFromOrganizationFn,"An #$IndividualDenotingFunction, an expression of the form (#$InstanceOfTypeWithIDFromOrganizationFn TYPE ID-STRING ORG) refers to the instance of TYPE, some sub-collection of #$SomethingExisting that is identified by the #$SubLString ID-STRING based on its origination from the #$Organization ORG.  For instance, this could refer to an instance of #$BankAccount, #$Passport, or any other thing where we can pin down individuals based on some identification in relation to a particular organization.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa7bd).
