x_comment(x_StreetNumberFn,"An expression of the form (#$StreetNumberFn NUMBER STREET) takes an #$Integer NUMBER and an instance of #$Street-Generic and returns the #$PhysicalContactLocation which is found at the address represented by NUMBER on STREET. For instance, (#$StreetNumberFn 100 (#$StreetNamedFn 'Boylston St.' CityOfBostonMA)) would represent 100 Boylston St. Boston, MA.   This is an instance of #$PartialFunction since it is possible to form expressions using this function that do not represent actual instances of #$PhysicalContactLocation.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa7bf).
