x_comment(x_obligationParticipants,"An assertion of the form (#$obligationParticipants OBLIGATION AGENT) means that the #$Agent-Generic AGENT is somehow involved in the #$Obligation OBLIGATION.  This is a more general relation than the predicate #$obligatedAgents.  It is intended to allow the introduction of parties to an #$Obligation where they are likely to be effected by the #$Obligation.  For instance, a mother may make a #$TravelReservation for her children.  Those children would bear the relation #$obligationParticipants from the #$TravelReservation.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa7c4).
