x_comment(x_decreasesSlotFor,"(#$decreasesSlotFor EVT OBJ SLOT) says that as a result of OBJ's participation in EVT, the SLOT for OBJ is decreased.  For example, (#$decreasesSlotFor ILoseWeight Me #$massOfObject) says that in the particular weight-loss event in question, my mass is decreased.  Note that where EVT is an instance of #$IntrinsicStateChangeEvent, (#$decreasesSlotFor EVT OBJ SLOT) is equivalent to (#$decreasesSlot EVT SLOT).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa7d1).
