x_comment(x_eventTypeOccurrencesScheduled,"(#$eventTypeOccurrencesScheduled SCHEDULE TYPE) means that the instance of #$Schedule SCHEDULE dictates when events of a certain type are to occur.  For example, (#$eventTypeOccurrencesScheduled AmortizationSchedule001 #$LoanPayment) says that the amortization schedule in question is a schedule that dictates when loan payments are to be made.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa7d5).
