x_comment(x_fromAgent,"An assertion of the form (#$fromAgent TRANS AGENT) means that the #$transferredThing in the #$GeneralizedTransfer TRANS orginates with the #$Agent-Generic AGENT.  This is a very general relation and does not assume that AGENT has any rights over the #$transferredThing.  See the more specialized predicate #$fromPossessor for cases where the #$SocialBeing has user rights over the #$transferredThing.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa7ff).
