x_comment(x_IncorrectRule,"A sub-collection of #$CycLPropositionalSentence and #$SentenceEvaluationOutput, each of which is a sentence with #$implies in the arg 0 position and which has been reviewed by some user.  All instances of this collection have been deemed to have some semantic flaw such that the implication that they represent is neither monotonically nor default true in the relevant context.  This collection has three notable sub-collections: #$SalvageableRule, #$IntelligibleRule, and #$NonsensicalRule, whose instances differ in how flawed their represented implications are.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa82b).
