xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517aa82d,[]).
x_comment(x_StandardDeviation,"#$StandardDeviation is a #$NumericQuantifier that computes the\nstandard deviation of a function's value over a set. That is, if FUNCTION is a\n#$UnaryFunction which returns a #$ScalarInterval, and SET is a set of\nelements, each of which is in the domain of FUNCTION, then (#$StandardDeviation\nSET FUNCTION) computes the result of applying FUNCTION to each element\nof SET, then taking the standard deviation of the resulting values.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa82e).
