x_comment(x_someAndOnlyTypePlaysRoleInSituationType,"<code>(#$someAndOnlyTypePlaysRoleInSituationType SIT-TYPE TYPE ROLE)</code> means that for any instance <code>SIT-TYPE-INST</code> of <code>SIT-TYPE</code>, there exists an instance of <code>TYPE</code> that plays the role <code>ROLE</code> in <code>SIT-TYPE-INST</code>, and that only an instance of <code>TYPE</code> plays that role.  Cf. the more general predicate #$onlyTypePlaysRoleInSubSituationType, which does not require an instance of <code>TYPE</code> to play <code>ROLE</code> in instances of <code>SIT-TYPE</code>, but rather requires that whatever plays <code>ROLE</code> in <code>SIT-TYPE</code> be of <code>TYPE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa885).
