x_comment('x_Passport-Agreement',"A specialization of #$AuthorizedAgreement and\n#$LegalAgreement. Each instance of Passport-Agreement is an\nauthorization issued by the government of some country to a person\nstating that he or she is allowed to leave the country and\nre-enter. This agreement typicaly includes a formal recognition that\nthe person is a legal citizen of the government's country, and may\nhave other privileges and qualifications.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa88c).
