x_comment(x_Salah,"An instance of #$CodeOfConduct and a #$subObligations of\n#$FivePillarsOfIslam.  These are the five daily prayers the faithful\noffer to God.  The prayers are named: Fajr, Dhuhr, Asr, Maghrib, and\nIsha'a.  They are named for the time of day the prayer is performed.\nThey are complusory for every #$MuslimPerson.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa88f).
