x_comment(x_Siyam,"An instance of #$CodeOfConduct and a #$subObligations of\n#$FivePillarsOfIslam. This obligation involves fasting during\n#$RamadanHoliday.  Specifically, the faithful should refrain from\neating and drinking, sexual intercourse, games of chance, and smoking\nduring the daylight hours.  There are groups of people exempt from\nobservances: young children, soldiers on the battlefield, pregnant\nwomen, the sick and elderly.  The faithful are encouraged to spend\ntime reading and/or listening to the Koran.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa891).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa891,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
