x_comment(x_PilgrimageToMecca,"An instance of #$CodeOfConduct and a #$subObligations of\n#$FivePillarsOfIslam. This obligation requires every able-bodied\nMuslim to make a pilgrimage to #$CityOfMeccaSaudiArabia, if he or she\ncan afford to do so.  See also #$Hajj-Pilgrimage, which the\nover-arching performance of the pilgrimage.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa892).
