x_comment(x_HavingPhysicalAccessToSomething,"A sub-collection of #$Situation, instances of #$HavingPhysicalAccessToSomething means that some instance of #$IndividualAgent can physically interact with, including entering, some instance of #$PartiallyTangible.  This is a very broad sub-collection of #$Situation and is subsumes situations where someone can walk into a particular #$Cave with an open mouth, being able to enter a locked building when one has a key, as well as being able to open an unlocked filing cabinet. Key roles for instances of this collection are #$accessibleObject and #$accessor.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa898).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa898,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
