x_comment(x_HavingEntryAccessToSomePlace,"A sub-collection of #$HavingPhysicalAccessToSomething.  All instances of #$HavingEntryAccessToSomePlace are those situations in which some #$IndividualAgent can physically enter into a #$Place.  In such situations, the relevant #$IndividualAgent would play the role of #$accessor and the relevant instance of #$Place would play the role of #$accessibleObject.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa899).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa899,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
