x_comment('x_indMightPlayRoleInSitType-Linkage',"An assertion of the form (#$indMightPlayRoleInSitType-Linkage IND ROLE SIT-TYPE) means that there is speculative evidence that the #$SomethingExisting IND might play the #$BinaryRolePredicate ROLE in an instance of the sub-collection of #$Situation SIT-TYPE.  By speculative evidence, we mean evidence that is based on other hypotheses.  Contrast with #$indMightPlayRoleInSitType-Evidential.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa8a5).
