x_comment(x_HomemadeArtifact,"A specialization of #$Custom-Made. Easch instance of this\ncollection is an #$Artifact produced by means of domestic manufacture.\nPositive examples of this collection would be the batch of strawberry\njam someone makes in his or her kitchen, and the clock someone makes\nin his or her woodshop. Negative examples of this collection would\ninclude those products mass produced by companies, #$CocaCola, for\nexample and even those mass produced items that claim to be\n'homemade,' think cookies.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa8b3).
