x_comment(x_homemadeTypeOfType,"An instance of #$BinaryPredicate that relates a\nspecialization of #$HomemadeArtifact to the specialization of\n#$PartiallyTangible of which they are homemade versions. Thus, (#$homemadeTypeOfType HOMEMADE-TYPE TYPE) means that the collection HOMEMADE-TYPE is the homemade subcollection of TYPE. For instance, (#$homemadeTypeOfType HomemadeCookie #$Cookie) means the collection HomemadeCookie is the collection of #$HomemadeArtifact that are also instance of #$Cookie (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa8b4).
