x_comment(x_literalCDT,"An assertion of the form (#$literalCDT LIT CDT) states that the #$CycLClosedDenotationalTerm CDT is the value of an argument of the (#$CycLObjectTypeFn #$CycLAtomicSentence) LIT. The collection #$CycLClosedDenotationalTerm covers a number of significant collections for the #$CycL syntax, including #$CycLConstant, #$SubLAtomicTerm (for handling the representation of strings and numbers), and #$CycLNonAtomicReifiedTerm.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa8d4).
