x_comment('x_normalizedLiteral-Positive',"An assertion of the form (#$normalizedLiteral-Positive SENTENCE LIT) states that when the (#$CycLObjectTypeFn #$CycLSentence) SENTENCE is represented in either Conjunctive Normal Form or Disjunctive Normal Form, then one of its literals is (#$CycLObjectTypeFn #$CycLAtomicSentence) LIT. Compare with #$normalizedLiteral-Negated.  If SENTENCE is itself a (#$CycLObjectTypeFn #$CycLAtomicSentence), the assertion (#$normalizedLiteral-Positive SENTENCE SENTENCE) is true.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa8d5).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aa8d5,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
