x_comment(x_polityHasRuralRegion,"(#$polityHasRuralRegion POLITY RURAL-REGION) holds just in case RURAL-REGION is the (possibly) discontinuous geographical region that consists of the whole region of POLITY minus the urban areas.  The is the corresponding predicate to #$RuralRegionFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa91c).
