x_comment('x_PersonTypeByNationality-Defunct',"A #$SecondOrderCollection.  Each instance of #$PersonTypeByNationality-Defunct is a #$PersonTypeByNationality whose corresponding #$Country (#$countryOfNationality) no longer exists (as a country).  Note that assertions of the form <code>(#$isa NATIONALITY #$PersonTypeByNationality-Defunct)</code> should be temporally qualified.  For example:\n<pre>\nMonadic Mt:     #$WorldPoliticalGeographyDataMt\nTime Interval:  (#$IntervalStartedByFn (#$YearFn 1991))\nTime Parameter: #$TimePoint\nHL Formula:     (#$isa #$SovietUnionPerson #$PersonTypeByNationality-Defunct).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa921).
