x_comment('x_requires-Underspecified',"A binary #$UnderspecifiedPredicate (q.v.).  <code>(#$requires-Underspecified THING REQUIREMENT)</code> means that there is some sense in which <code>THING</code> requires, needs, depends on, or is conditional upon <code>REQUIREMENT</code>.  See the many specializations of #$requires-Underspecified for the range of senses that this is meant to cover.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa94a).
