x_comment(x_relationInstanceMost,"A #$RuleMacroPredicate.  <code>(#$relationInstanceMost BINPRED THING SOC)</code> means that #$most instances <code>INST</code> of <code>SOC</code> are such that <code>(BINPRED THING INST)</code>.  It is equivalent to the more complex form\n<pre>\n(#$most SOC (#$SubcollectionOfWithRelationFromFn SOC BINPRED THING)).\n</pre>\nFor example, <code>(#$relationInstanceMost #$hasBeenIn #$TonyBlair #$EuropeanCountry)</code> means that Tony Blair has been in most European countries (i.e. most European countries are such that Tony Blair has been in them).  See also #$relationMostInstance.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa94b).
