x_comment(x_creationTemplateMembers,"(#$creationTemplateMembers TEMPLATE TERM) means that TERM is one of the terms that forms the instance of #$CycCreationTemplate, TEMPLATE.  If TERM is a FORT, this means that the code-level function associated with TEMPLATE (see #$creationTemplateForSUBLFunction) is responsible for the reification of an analogous FORT.  If TERM is an assertion, the code-level function is responsible for adding an analogous assertion to the KB.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa94d).
