x_comment(x_programActionTypeRules,"(#$programActionTypeRules PROCESS RULE) means that the instance RULE of #$CycRelatedProgramAction is relevant for inferencing in performances of PROCESS, a type of #$CycRelatedProgramAction.  Specifically, (#$programActionTypeRules PROCESS RULE) tells the system to consider RULE when performing a PROCESS.  Where the complete extent of #$programActionTypeRules is known for PROCESS (see #$completeExtentDecidableForValueInArg), the set of possible values of RULE form a closed set of all and only rules that will be used in inference during a performance of an instance of PROCESS.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa952).
