x_comment('x_CreditCard-RevolvingAccount',"A specialization of #$CreditCard and an instance of #$CreditCardTypeByBalanceCarryFeature.  Each instance of this collection is a credit card that allows one to carry a balance from month to month.  Most, if not all, charge some sort of interest on any balance carried over from the previous month.  Contrast this with \n#$CreditCard-NonRevolvingAccount which are credit cards in which the balance must be paid off each month.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa99c).
