x_comment(x_monitoringTypeOfFinancialAssetType,"A #$StrictlyFunctionalSlot that relates a specialization of #$FinancialAsset to a specialization of #$Monitoring.  (#$monitoringTypeOfFinancialAssetType ASSET-TYPE MONITOR-TYPE) means that MONITOR-TYPE is the collection of all #$Monitoring events in which an instance of ASSET-TYPE is monitored.  This is the predicate corresponding to #$MonitoringOfFinancialAssetTypeFn (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa9c1).
