x_comment('x_FOL-TermFn',"(#$FOL-TermFn TERM) denotes a first-order constant symbol\nbased on the CycL term TERM.  For example, (#$FOL-TermFn #$Dog)\ndenotes a first-order term based on the collection #$Dog,\n(#$FOL-TermFn 212) denotes a first-order term based on the integer\n212, and (#$FOL-TermFn #$isa) denotes a first-order term based on the\npredicate #$isa.  See also (#$FOL-PredicateFn #$isa 2) for the\nfirst-order binary predicate based on #$isa.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aa9c9).
