x_comment('x_TheHighCourt-UK',"An instance of #$Court-Judicial.  Part of the court system of England and Wales.  The High Court hears civil cases for amounts greater than 15,000 pounds, and also serves as a civil and criminal appellate court for cases from the subordinate courts (e.g. instances of #$CountyCourt-UK).  The High Court is based at the Royal Courts of Justice in central London, but also sits as District Registries all across England and Wales.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaa2f).
