x_comment(x_IncreasingTheBalanceOnAnAccount,"The collection of instances of #$AffectingAnAccountBalance in which the balance (see #$accountBalance) of an account (see #$transactionAccount) is increased, whether by transferring monies into the account (see #$toAccount) as in a deposit to a savings account, or by transferring monies from the account (see #$fromAccount) as happens when one makes a credit card purchase..  Note that #$IncreasingTheBalanceOnAnAccount is <b>not</b> disjoint with #$DecreasingTheBalanceOnAnAccount, as a single transfer can, and frequently does, involve multiple accounts (as in paying a bill with a check).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaa32).
