x_comment(x_preChangeValueOfQuantity,"(#$preChangeValueOfQuantity TEMPORAL-THING THING SLOT VALUE) means that the instance of #$TemporalThing TEMPORAL-THING changed the value of SLOT applied to THING from VALUE.  To specify what the value of SLOT applied to THING is changed to, use #$postChangeValueOfQuantity.  #$preChangeValueOfQuantity, #$postChangeValueOfQuantity, and #$changesQuantityByAmount can be used together to perform arithmetical calculations about the value of SLOT applied to THING with respect to TEMPORAL-THING.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaa3b).
