x_comment(x_productTypeFacilitates,"<code>(#$productTypeFacilitates OBJ-TYPE SIT-TYPE ROLE)</code> holds just in case instances of OBJ-TYPE make it easier (in some sense) to play ROLE in instances of SIT-TYPE.  For example, <code> (#$productTypeFacilitates #$CreditCard #$FinancingByBorrowing #$borrower)</code> holds because having a credit card makes it easier to be the borrower in an instance of #$FinancingByBorrowing -- you just use the card, there is no need for you to fill out any form to get the money to make the purchase/cash withdrawal.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaa3f).
