x_comment(x_AcquiringAnObject,"A subcollection of #$GeneralizedTransfer.  Each instance of this collection is an act in which an agent acquires some tangible or intangible item.  Examples include stealing a sweater from a department store as well as buying a scarf from a boutigue.  Examples where the item is not a tangible good include acquiring the rights to a conceptual work (e.g. a song or story) or  purchasing stock.  Note that all acquirings whether legal or not count as instances of this collection.  For the collection of legal acquisitions of objects see the subcollection of this collection #$AcquiringAnObject-Legally.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaa40).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aaa40,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
