x_comment(x_primaryRoleForSituationType,"<code>(#$primaryRoleForSituationType SIT-TYPE BIN-ROLE-PRED)</code> holds just in case the most relevant role in a given situation that's an instance of SIT-TYPE is BIN-ROLE-PRED.  For instance, an instance of (#$UsingAFn #$CreditCard) is an instance of both #$UsingADevice and #$Buying.  Given that the #$seller in the event is not the one using the credit card, #$buyer is the most relevant role in the event.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaa48).
