x_comment(x_Spreadbetting,"A specialization of #$MakingAnAgreement and #$MoneyTransaction.  Each instance of #$Spreadbetting is a bet concerning the direction in which the price of a stock or other financial instrument will go.  A person making a spread bet will either bet that a stock will exceed the upper value of a given spread of prices within a certain time frame, or bet that the stock will go below the lower value of the spread within that time frame.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaa7c).
