x_comment(x_ContractForDifferences,"A specialization of #$MakingAnAgreement and #$MoneyTransaction.  Each instance of #$ContractForDifferences allows an investor to bet on the price movement of a stock or other finiancial instrument.  Instances of #$ContractForDifferences are thus similar to instances of #$Spreadbetting (q.v.), although profits from CFDs are subject to capital gains taxes while profits from spreadbetting are not, and one can often deal from inside the quoted spread in a CFD.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaa7d).
