x_comment('x_partiallyProtectedAgainst-RoleInType',"A ternary predicate, an assertion of the form (#$partiallyProtectedAgainst-RoleInType OBJ TYPE ROLE) says that OBJ is partially protected against playing ROLE in some instance of TYPE. The notion of protection here is to be cashed out in terms of an agent's interests or desires being promoted through the prevention of the occurrence of some instance INS of TYPE such that (ROLE INS OBJ).  It is possible that the relevant agent is not OBJ.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaa8c).
