x_comment('x_CreditCardInterestFreePeriod-Long',"A specialization of #$CreditCardInterestFreePeriod.  Each instance of #$CreditCardInterestFreePeriod-Long is a temporally continuous situation\nthat is instantiated under certain conditions after a purchase is made with a credit card.  It is the collection of long situations of this type offered by credit card agreements -- usually \"long\" in this context means between 4 and 8 weeks.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaabb).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aaabb,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
