x_comment(x_totalInvestmentEarningsForStockTypeBoughtDuring,"<code>(#$totalInvestmentEarningsForStockTypeBoughtDuring STOCK-TYPE VALUE TIME-PERIOD)<MT T PAR></code> holds in MT at T to PAR just in case the total earnings of stock of STOCK-TYPE bought during TIME-PERIOD is VALUE as of T (to a granularity of PAR).  Note that TIME-PERIOD refers to the date or time period during which the stocks were bought, not necessarily the period during which they gained or lost value. ") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaac3).
