x_comment(x_fosterMother,"An instance of #$FamilyRelationSlot and a specialization of\nboth #$fosterParent and #$mother. (#$fosterMother CHILD MOTHER) means\nthat the instance of #$FemaleAnimal MOTHER is the foster mother of\nCHILD. This means that although MOTHER is fulfilling the caregiving\nrole of #$mother for CHILD, typically only a temporary arrangement,\nMOTHER is not the legal mother of CHILD.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaac7).
