x_comment(x_organizationRecruitsAgentType,"<code>(#$organizationRecruitsAgentType ORG\nAGENT-TYPE)</code> relates an instance of #$Organization ORG to the\nspecialization of #$IntelligentAgent from which ORG actively seeks to\nrecruit members.<p> For example,\n<code>(#$organizationRecruitsAgentType #$LebaneseHizballah\n#$SunniMuslimPerson)</code> means that #$LebaneseHizballah recruits\nits members from the collection of #$SunniMuslimPerson.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaacc).
