x_comment(x_loanAgreementRequiresOfCreditor,"This ternary predicate is used to indicate that a creditor is required, by the terms of a loan agreement, to play a particular role in a particular kind of situation.  <code>(#$loanAgreementRequiresOfCreditor AGREEMENT SIT-TYPE ROLE)</code> means that the #$LoanAgreement <code>AGREEMENT</code> specifies that the creditor is required to play the #$Role <code>ROLE</code> in some situation that is an instance of the subcollection of #$Situation <code>SIT-TYPE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaad0).
