x_comment('x_stockPriceChange-CloseToLast',"A predicate used to state the difference in value that a share of a particular company's stock has undergone between the previous day's close and its most-recently quoted price on the current day.  (#$stockPriceChange-CloseToLast STOCK PRICECHANGE DATE EXCHANGE) means that PRICECHANGE is the difference in price between (i) the #$stockPrice-Close for a share of STOCK on EXCHANGE for the day before DATE and (ii) (#$stockPrice-Last STOCK PRICE DATE EXCHANGE).  See also #$stockPercentageChange-CloseToLast.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaae1).
