x_comment('x_stockPercentageChange-CloseToLast',"A predicate used to state the difference in value, in terms of percentage, that a share of a particular company's stock has undergone between the previous day's close and its most-recently quoted price on the current day.  (#$stockPriceChange-CloseToLast STOCK PERCENTCHANGE DATE EXCHANGE) means that PERCENTCHANGE is the percentage of increase or decrease in price for a share of STOCK between (i) the #$stockPrice-Close for a share of STOCK on EXCHANGE for the day before DATE and (ii) (#$stockPrice-Last STOCK PRICE DATE EXCHANGE).  See also #$stockPriceChange-CloseToLast.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaae2).
