x_comment(x_MarketPeak,"A specialization of #$Market.  Each instance of #$MarketPeak is an event in which a #$Market reaches a (temporary) peak, i.e. an event in which the market reaches a high value from which it proceeds to decrease to a significant degree (and for a significant amount of time).  Note that instances of #$MarketPeak are not necessarily instantaneous, as the market may stay at its \"peak\" level for an extended period of time.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaaec).
