x_comment(x_performingActionTypeDuringEventTypeFostersSitType,"A #$TernaryPredicate that relates an #$Action type to an #$Event type to a #$Situation type.  (#$performingActionTypeDuringEventTypeFostersSitType ACT-TYPE EVT-STYPE SIT-TYPE) means that performing an instance ACT-TYPE while EVT-TYPE is occurring makes it more likely that SIT-TYPE will obtain.  For example, (#$performingActionTypeDuringEventTypeFostersSitType #$TransportInvolvingADriver #$SnowProcess #$VehicleAccident) means that driving while it is snowing makes it more likely that a vehicle accident will occur.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaaef).
