x_comment(x_HeavyIndustryFacility,"A specialization of #$FactoryBuildingComplex.  Each instance of\nthis collection is a plant that engages in heavy industry\nmanufacturing activities.  These industries are those like the\n#$OilIndustry, which convert large volumes of raw materials or\npartially processed materials into products of higher value.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aab24).
