x_comment(x_unrefinedMaterialTypeOfType,"An instance of #$FunctionalPredicate which relates a type of\nunrefined substance, <b>UNREFINED-COLL</b>, to the type of substance COLL of\nwhich <b>UNREFINED-COLL</b> is the unrefined form.<p>\nFor example, <code>(#$unrefinedMaterialTypeOfType #$Petroleum-CrudeOil\n#$Oil)</code> means that #$Petroleum-CrudeOil is the unrefined form of\n#$Oil.  See also #$UnrefinedFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aab26).
