x_comment('x_LoanNote-Transferable',"A specialization of #$AuthorizedAgreement and #$TradeableSecurity.  Each instance of #$LoanNote-Transferable is an agreement that has been recorded in writing as a short-term promise of an issuer to repay a specified principal amount on a particular date, together with interest at a stated rate, payable from a defined source of anticipated revenue. Notes usually mature in a short period of time (usually one year or less) in contrast to bonds (see #$Bond-Agreement).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aab45).
