x_comment(x_PropositionalConceptualWorkTypeByStyle,"A specialization of #$ObjectTypeByStyle and a collection of collections. Each instance of this collection is a collection of #$PropositionalConceptualWorks that are of the same style. Instances of #$PropositionalConceptualWorks share a style if they are of the same genre or some other salient feature, like form. For example, #$Questionnaire-CW is an instance of #$PropositionalConceptualWorkTypeByStyle because its instances share a form, namely that the instances ask questions, or are in what could be considered the 'interrogative style.'") :- x_cid(a65b16517aab51).
