x_comment(x_PropagandaActivity,"A specialization of #$HumanActivity and #$CulturalActivity.\nEach instance of this collection is an event in which some agent (an\nindividual or organization) engages in an activity to promote, create,\nor distribute instances of #$Propaganda.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aab52).
