x_comment(x_orgCommunicationsTargetsAgentType,"<code>(#$orgCommunicationsTargetsAgentType ORGANIZATION\nAGENT-TYPE)</code> relates an instance of #$Organization\n<b>ORGANIZATION</b> to the specialization of #$IntelligentAgent its\ncommunications target.<p>\nFor example, <code>(#$orgCommunicationsTargetsAgentType\n#$PhilipMorris-Corporation #$HumanChild)</code> means that some communications\noriginating from #$PhilipMorris-Corporation are specifically aimed to\nappeal to or get some message to children.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aab53).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aab53,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
