x_comment(x_expatriateFrom,"<code>(#$expatriateFrom REGION PERSON)</code> means that\n<b>REGION</b> is the instance of #$GeographicalRegion in which\n<b>Person</b> is actaully a citizen of, but currently <b>PERSON</b>\nresides in some other instance of #$GeopoliticalEntity.<p> For\nexample, <code>(#$expatriateFrom Fred #$IrishRepublic)</code> means\nthat although Fred is a citizen of #$IrishRepublic, he resides in a\ndifferent instance of #$GeopoliticalEntity.<p> Please see also\n#$ExpatriateCommunity and #$expatriateCommunityOfTypeInRegion.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aab54).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aab54,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
