x_comment(x_agentOffersRewardForProcurementOfIndividual,"A #$TernaryPredicate that relates an #$IntelligentAgent to an #$MonetaryValue to an #$Individual.  (#$agentOffersRewardForProcurementOfIndividual AGENT REWARD INDIVIDUAL) means that AGENT is currently offering REWARD for the procurement (or information leading to the procurement) of INDIVIDUAL.\n<p>\nFor example, (#$agentOffersRewardForProcurementOfIndividual (#$GovernmentFn #$UnitedStatesOfAmerica) (#$Dollar-UnitedStates 25000000) #$OsamaBinLaden) means that the U.S. Government is offering 25 million dollars for the procurement (i.e. capture), or information leading to the procurement/capture, of Osama bin Laden.\n<p>\nSimilarly, (#$agentOffersRewardForProcurementOfIndividual Mario (#$Euro 50) MariosWallet) means that Mario is offering a reward of 50 Euro for the return (or information leading to the return) of his wallet.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aabbd).
