x_comment(x_orgCommunicationTargetsAgentTypeForIncreaseSitType,"An instance of #$TernaryPredicate.\n<code>(#$orgCommunicationTargetsAgentTypeForIncreaseSitType\nORGANIZATION AGENT-TYPE SIT-TYPE)</code> means that\n<b>ORGANIZATION</b> targets at least one of its communications at\ninstances of <b>AGENT-TYPE</b> for the purpose of increasing the\nnumber if instances of <b>SIT-TYPE</b> in an instance of\n<b>AGENT-TYPE</b> plays a <code>#$doneBy</code> role.<p>Consider for\nan example the assertion\n<code>(#$orgCommunicationTargetsAgentTypeForIncreaseSitType\n#$PhilipMorris-Corporation #$HumanChild #$SmokingACigarette)</code>. If true,\nthis assertion would mean that the #$PhilipMorris-Corporation\ndeliberately targets some of its communications to children with the\ngoal that more children would smoke.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aabde).
