x_comment(x_cityOfAddress,"<code>(#$cityOfAddress LOC CITY)</code> means that the  #$ContactLocation <code>LOC</code> is found in the territory of the #$City <code>CITY</code>. For example, as  #$CycorpHeadquarters is a #$ContactLocation for #$Cycorp, then  (#$cityOfAddress #$CycorpHeadquarters #$CityOfAustinTX) means that the  Cycorp Headquarters building is located in Austin, Texas.  Note that the  arg-constraint on the first argument should be an instance of #$ContactLocation  which serves as a #$pointsOfContact for an agent and not the agent itself.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aac33).
