x_comment(x_Dog,"A #$BiologicalSpecies (scientific name 'Canis familiaris') that is a specialization of #$CanineAnimal (q.v.).  Each instance of #$Dog is a canine animal that has either been bred to be a domestic pet (see #$DomesticatedAnimal) or is a wild canine animal that is not an instance of #$Wolf, #$Fox, or any other non-dog specialization of #$CanineAnimal. Note that although #$Dog and #$Wolf are considered distinct #$BiologicalSpecies, instances of the two can and do interbreed successfully. This species classification is therefore unusual, and in some circles, controversial.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aac3e).
