x_comment('x_declarationModes-Final',"An assertion of the form (#$declarationModes-Final DEC PRED SYMB LIST) is used to state that for the InductiveLogicProgrammingDeclaration DEC, one of its elements, the Predicate PRED, can be given the mode represented by SYMB and LIST, which is itself a list of instances of InductiveLogicProgrammingMode. In short, this allows us to pass out to a Prolog-ComputerLanguage based ILP system a mode declaration in a recognizable format that recognizes arg constraints among CycL predicates. Assertion using the predicate declarationModes-Final are generated in conjunction with assertions using the predicate declarationModesThroughArg.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aac40).
