x_comment(x_extractedFromCorpusUsingTool,"(extractedFromCorpusUsingTool THING CORPUS TOOL) means that the instance TOOL of ConceptExtractionTool was used to extract (identify a mention of) THING in the instance of Corpus CORPUS. Note that extractedFromCorpusUsingTool is an instance of TemporallyQualifiableRelation. (extractedFromCorpusUsingTool THING CORPUS TOOL) is true at time T iff there is an #$ConceptExtraction event that has completed at T or earlier, such that TOOL is the programUsed, CORPUS is the #$conceptExtractionSource and THING is the #$conceptExtracted.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aac49).
