x_comment(x_MultiplePerformerAction,"A specialization of #$MultipleDoerAction (q.v.). Each instance of #$MultiplePerformerAction is an action which must have more than one \"performer\" (see the predicate #$performedBy).  In order for a type of action (i.e. a specialization of #$Action) to be a specialization of #$MultiplePerformerAction, it must be true to assert, for any instance <code>ACT</code> of that type of action, both <code>(#$performedBy ACT X)</code> and <code>(#$performedBy ACT Y)</code>, for some <code>X</code> and <code>Y</code> that are different.  Notable specializations of #$MultiplePerformerAction include #$GettingToKnowSomeone and #$GoingOnADate.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aac72).
