x_comment(x_QuerySentenceOnlyTestVersionFn,"A unary function that takes a fully-specified KB content test (see #$KBContentTest-FullySpecified) to the sentence-only-specified test that is a generalization of it (see #$genlKBContentTests).  (#$QuerySentenceOnlyTestVersionFn TEST) is the #$KBContentTest-QuerySentenceOnly (q.v.) that has the same #$CycLSentence-Askable that TEST has as the value of its #$InferenceSentenceParameter (see #$softwareParameterValueInSpecification), but which has no specified values for any other #$InferenceParameters. \n<p>\n#$QuerySentenceOnlyTestVersionFn thus maps different instances of #$KBContentTest-FullySpecified that specify the same query-sentence to the same instance of #$KBContentTest-QuerySentenceOnly.\n<p>\nSee also #$QueryContentOnlyTestVersionFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aacdf).
