x_comment(x_CommunicatingByMeansOfFn,"#$CommunicatingByMeansOfFn is an instance of #$Function-Denotational that can be used to denote the collection of all instances #$Communicating in which the #$senderOfInfo uses some well-defined subcollection of #$Artifact-Communication.  \n<p>\n<code>(#$CommunicatingByMeansOfFn DEVICE)</code> denotes the collection of all instances of #$CommunicatingUsingADevice where the #$meansOfInfoTransfer-Artifact is some instance of <code>DEVICE</code>, where <code>DEVICE</code> is a specialization of #$Artifact-Communication.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aacea).
