x_comment(x_ThingDescribableAsFn,"(#$ThingDescribableAsFn WORD POS) denotes the collection of things which may be in some way be described by the adjectival form of WORD with speeech part POS (where POS is restricted to be some spec of #$Adjective). So, for example, (#$ThingDescribableAsFn #$Editorial-TheWord #$Adjective) denotes the collection of things which may be described as \"editorial\" in some sense.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaceb).
