x_comment(x_mobTypeOfObjectType,"A #$StrictlyFunctionalSlot that relates a specialization of #$Mob to a specialization of #$TemporalThing.  (#$mobTypeOfObjectType MOB-TYPE OBJ-TYPE) means that MOB-TYPE is the collection of all #$Mobs of instances of OBJ-TYPE.  This is the predicate corresponding to #$MobFn (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aacf1).
