x_comment('x_DonorFn-Agent',"#$DonorFn-Agent takes as argument any instance AGENT of #$Agent-Generic and returns the collection of all #$LegalAgents who donate money, goods, or services to AGENT. These donations are typically #$CharitableDonations intended to benefit the AGENT who receives them. For example, (#$DonorFn-Agent #$CornellUniversity) denotes the collection of all #$LegalAgents who donate money, good, or services to #$CornellUniversity. If the money, goods, or services are donated as part of a marketing strategy designed to benefit the donating agent, then the donating agent will be an instance of (#$SponsorFn-Agent AGENT) not (#$DonorFn-Agent AGENT).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aacf8).
