x_comment(x_objectiveOfTask,"(#$objectiveOfTask TASK OBJECTIVE) says that OBJECTIVE has the status of 'task objective' in the planned execution of TASK.  A task objective may be an instance of #$GeographicalRegion, #$ModernMilitaryUnit-Deployable, or #$Artifact, and it may be possible for other kinds of things to play this role as well.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad0b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aad0b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
