x_comment(x_allocatedObjects,"An assertion of the form (#$allocatedObjects ALLOCATION THING) relates an instance of #$ResourceAllocationSpecification to an instance of #$SomethingExisting.  Instances of #$ResourceAllocationSpecification represent a reservation (either actual or proposed) on some resource. Such an assertion means that THING is the thing that is reserved in ALLOCATION.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad17).
