x_comment(x_allottedAgents,"A specialization of #$obligatedAgents, #$agreeingAgents and #$specifiedActors (qq.v.) that relates an #$Allotment (q.v.) to the agent(s) to whom it is assigned.  <code>(#$allottedAgents ALLOTMENT AGENT))</code> means that <code>ALLOTMENT</code> is assigned to <code>AGENT</code>.  Depending on the nature of <code>ALLOTMENT</code> (and the actions, or inaction, of <code>AGENT</code> with respect to <code>ALLOTMENT</code>), the assignment might last for a few seconds or for a few years.\n<p>\nSee also #$assigner.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad18).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aad18,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
