x_comment(x_assigner,"A specialization of #$obligationOwedTo and #$agreeingAgents (qq.v.) that relates an #$Assignment-Specification (q.v.) to the agent who assigned it.  (#$assigner TASK ASSIGNER) means that TASK has been assigned to some agent(s) (see #$allottedAgents) by ASSIGNER.\n<p>\nNote that my informing you that you have a certain assignment does not necessarily make me the #$assigner of that task; for I might be acting on behalf of another agent (e.g. my supervisor or the organization you and I both work for) who is the actual assigner.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad19).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aad19,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
