x_comment(x_HoldingHostage,"The collection of events in which one or more persons are held hostage.  Each instance of #$HoldingHostages is preceeded by an instance of #$TakingHostage.  Usually, the #$TakingHostage and #$HoldingHostages events are subevents of a more general event (e.g. a bank robbery or a kidnapping) .  During the #$HoldingHostages event, the hostages are in the control of the perpetrators of the event.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad20).
