x_comment(x_HeldHostageFn,"This function takes an instance of #$HoldingHostages and an instance of #$Animal and returns the instance of #$HeldCaptive where that instance is a subevent of the #$HoldingHostages event and the instance of #$Animal is a #$captive in the #$HeldCaptive event.  Note that this is a partial function.  There will only be a value for the pair <HOLDING ANIMAL> when ANIMAL is a #$hostages in HOLDING.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad21).
