x_comment(x_PhysicalSchema,"A specialization of #$Schema-LogicalOrPhysical.  Each instance of #$PhysicalSchema is a schema that models the data types that are admissible in the fields of a knowledge source. Each #$PhysicalSchema is derived from at least one knowledge source (see #$physicalSchemaSourceMap).  Also, each #$PhysicalSchema will have a number of physical fields which corresponds to the columns found in a physical table (see #$physicalFields).  For example, the OFAC database contains three physical tables, which are represented as three #$PhysicalSchemas: #$OFAC-add-PS, #$OFAC-alt-PS, and #$OFAC-main-PS.  See also #$LogicalSchema.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad25).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aad25,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
