x_comment('x_StructuredKnowledgeSource-Complex',"A specialization of #$StructuredKnowledgeSource (q.v.).  Each instance of #$StructuredKnowledgeSource-Complex isa  a knowledge source that is composed of two or more subordinate knowledge sources.  For example, a database that contains two or more tables is such a knowledge source.  The individual database tables are the atomic components of the database.  For the concept of atomic knowledge sources, see #$StructuredKnowledgeSource-Atomic.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad28).
