x_comment('x_StructuredKnowledgeSource-Atomic',"A specialization of #$StructuredKnowledgeSource.  Each instance of #$StructuredKnowledgeSource-Atomic isa a knowledge sources that cannot be further subdivided into two or more\nparts.  For example, a database table is such a knowledge source.  contrast this collection with #$StructuredKnowledgeSource-Complex.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad29).
