x_comment(x_StructuredKnowledgeSource,"A specialization of #$StructuredInformationSource (q.v.).  Each instance of #$StructuredKnowledgeSource is an electronic source of propositional information combined with a conceptual schema that describes its semantic content. Examples include databases, spreadsheets, queryable web pages, and XML or DAML tagged text.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad2a).
