x_comment('x_GasField-Developed',"The collection of regions which are naturally rich in deposits of natural gas and are developed to the point of producing natural gas commercially.  A developed gas field has production facilities on site, such as a gas well or some sort of recovery mechanism.  There will also be means for transporting the natural gas once it has been brought to the surface (by gas tanker or gas pipeline for example).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad35).
