x_comment(x_OpeningAFile,"A specialization of #$AccessingAFile.  Each instance of #$OpeningAFile is an event in which a computer file is opened by another program, such as, for example, when Microsoft Word is used to open a \".doc\" file, or when an email client program is used to display an email.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad3a).
