x_comment(x_AdvocacyOrganization,"#$AdvocacyOrganization is a specialization of #$Organization (q.v.).  Each instance of #$AdvocacyOrganization is an #$Organization that lobbies or engages in activities with the purpose of advocating a particular position on social, economic, political, environmental matters.  Many instances of #$IdeologicalOrganization (q.v.) are also instances of #$AdvocacyOrganization, though not all advocacy organizations are ideological organizations, since ideological organizations are never motivated solely by self-interest.   Examples of #$AdvocacyOrganization include #$AmericanAssociationOfRetiredPersons, #$SierraClub, #$AmericanMedicalAssociation, and #$StateBarOfTexas.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad3b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aad3b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
