x_comment(x_AgentNowTerminated,"A specialization of #$Individual, and an instance of #$HistoricalCollection and #$PostExistenceCollection (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$AgentNowTerminated is an instance of #$Agent-Generic that has terminated. \"(#$isa AGT #$AgentNowTerminated)\" is true only after the ending point of AGT, when \"(#$isa AGT #$Agent-Generic)\" is no longer true.  Instances include defunct organizations and dead animals.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad44).
