x_comment(x_interAgentSupportTypeBasis,"The #$functionCorrespondingPredicate for #$InterAgentSupportTypeFn. (#$interAgentSupportTypeBasis SUPPORT-TYPE BASIS) means that any positive amount (see #$positiveAmountOf) of the support quantity SUPPORT-TYPE is, by definition, manifested in instances of BASIS, a specialization of #$HelpingAnAgent.  For example, (#$interAgentSupportTypeBasis #$EconomicSupport #$GivingEconomicAid) means that economic support is manifested in the giving of ecomonic aid.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad5f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aad5f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
