x_comment(x_intelligenceOperativeForGovernment,"(#$intelligenceOperativeForGovernment OPERATIVE GOVERNMENT) means that OPERATIVE is an instance of #$IntelligenceOperative who does work on behalf of the government GOVERNMENT.  Typically, this means that OPERATIVE stands in the #$intelligenceOperativeForOrg relation to some intelligence agency or military agency that is a sub-organization of GOVERNMENT.  GOVERNMENT need not know of OPERATIVE or even count OPERATIVE among its employees or charges.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad64).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aad64,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517aad64,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
