x_comment(x_assertionEvaluated,"(#$assertionEvaluated EVAL SENT) means that, in EVAL, SENT is either the assertion evaluated or is an EL sentence that was evaluated that canonicalizes into two or more assertions.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad7b).
