x_comment(x_argGenlsConstantModeForDetermination,"An assertion of the form (#$argGenlsConstantModeForDetermination PRED N TYPE DET) means that relative to the #$InductiveLogicProgrammingDetermination DET, the  Nth argument of the #$Predicate PRED should bea sub-collection of the #$Collection TYPE and that argument position has a constant mode (i.e., for the induction of rules, that argument must have a constant as its value and cannot take a variable).   The sense of mode here is derived from #$Prolog-ComputerLanguage.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad8a).
