x_comment(x_actsOnBehalfOf,"(#$actsOnBehalfOf AGENT-1 AGENT-2) means that AGENT-1 takes actions on behalf of AGENT-2.  Note that this is a reflexive relation, as every agent takes actions on his or her own behalf.  To make the more substantive claim that AGENT-1 takes actions on behalf of another, use #$hasAgents, which is a spec-inverse of #$actsOnBehalfOf.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aad9b).
