x_comment(x_TimeIntervalInclusiveFn,"A binary function that takes two instances of #$TemporalThing as arguments and returns an instance of #$ContinuousTimeInterval.  <code>(#$TimeIntervalInclusiveFn START END)</code> is the continuous time interval between, and including, <code>START</code> and <code>END</code>. Note that <code>START</code> must end no later than <code>END</code> ends, and <code>END</code> must start no earlier than <code>START</code> starts; in the limiting case, <code>START</code> and <code>END</code> may be #$cotemporal (q.v.).  \n<p>\nSee also the similar #$TimeIntervalBetweenFn, which returns an interval that excludes the temporal extents of its arguments.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aae13).
