x_comment(x_changeOfSymptomIntensity,"(#$changeOfSymptomIntensity TIME COND ORG QCA)\nindicates whether ORG is experiencing more or less discomfort\nas a result of COND over the time period TIME.  If QCA is #$PositiveChange it\nmeans that ORG is experiencing more discomfort from COND as TIME goes\nby.  #$NegativeChange indicates decreased discomfort from COND and #$NoChange\nindicates no change.  Note that this predicate can be taken to discuss the change in an entire physiological condition over a time period, not just an isolated symptom of it.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aae18).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aae18,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
