x_comment(x_levelOfEfficiencyWithRespectTo,"(#$levelOfEfficiencyWithRespectTo SYSTEM LEVEL EVTTYPE)\n says that SYSTEM\nhas a LEVEL level of efficiency with respect to \nEVTTYPE, a kind of activity.  For example,\n (#$levelOfEfficiency MySprinklerSystem \n (#$VeryLowAmountFn #$Efficiency) WateringALawn) says that my\nsprinkler system is inefficient with respect to\n lawn-watering activities.  Note, however, that\nMySprinklerSystem might be fairly efficient with \nrespect to other activities, such as spraying \npedestrians from a distance.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aae1d).
