x_comment(x_HasBeenReviewedInRolePredicateSweep,"A documentation constant.  Constants denoting instances of #$BinaryRolePredicate have been explicitly tagged as members of this collection just in case they have been reviewed and no other relevant tag has been asserted of the predicate.  That is, none of the following tags have been deemed appropriate for the predicate.\n<p>\n#$RolePredicateAgnosticTowardsPresentTenseTimeIndex\n#$PresentTenseVersionHoldsSomeTimeInDuration\n#$PresentTenseVersionHoldsThroughoutDuration\n<p>\nIn order to keep track of which predicates have been reviewed, the three collections above are asserted to be specializations of this collection.\n<p>\nAlso, we forwardly derive membership in this collection if the term appears in arg1 of any of the following predicates:\n<p>\n#$roleWithEventTypeEntailsTimeIndex\n#$roleWithEventTypeEntailsSomeTimeInTimeIndex\n#$roleWithEventTypeAgnosticWRTTimeIndex\n<p>\n.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aae2e).
