x_comment(x_DefiningTimeUnitForCalendarCoveringTypeFn,"(#$DefiningTimeUnitForCalendarCoveringTypeFn DATE-TYPE) denotes the unit of time that is the #$definingTimeUnit for DATE-TYPE (the unit of time that defines DATE-TYPE, an instance of #$CalendarCoveringType.  For example, (#$DefiningTimeUnitForCalendarCoveringTypeFn #$CalendarWeek) denotes a function that takes as its argument one or two real numbers MIN and MAX and returns the (properly interval-like) #$Time-Quantity of being at least MIN weeks and at most MAX weeks in duration.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aae37).
