x_comment(x_embarrassed,"(#$embarrassed AGT PROP) means that that the #$IntelligentAgent AGT is embarrassed that the proposition (#$CycLSentence-Assertible) PROP is true. For example, (#$holdsIn (#$YearFn 1998) (#$embarrassed #$BillClinton (#$sexualPartners #$BillClinton #$MonicaLewinsky))) means that it holds throughout 1998 that Bill Clinton is embarrassed that he and Monica Lewinsky were sexual partners.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aae41).
