x_comment(x_hasEpistemicEmotion,"(#$hasEpistemicEmotion AGT PROP) means that the #$IntelligentAgent AGT has an epistemic emotion whose propositional content is expressed by the #$CycLSentence-Assertible PROP. #$hasEpistemicEmotion is a generalization of more specific predicates that relate agents to specific epistemic emotions. These relationships are expressed in English using expressions such as 'S fears that p', 'S is worried that p', 's hopes that p'. See  #$hopes, #$fears. For the theory behind the classification of emotions as factive/epistemic, see #$SharedNoteOnFactiveVersusEpistemicEmotion.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aae42).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aae42,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
