x_comment(x_hasFactiveEmotion,"(#$hasFactiveEmotion AGT PROP) means that the #$IntelligentAgent AGT has a factive emotion whose propositional content is expressed by the #$CycLSentence-Assertible PROP. #$hasFactiveEmotion is a generalization of more specific predicates that relate agents to specific factive emotions. These relationships are expressed in English using expressions such as 'S is proud that p', 'S resents that p', 'S is thankful that p', 'S regrets that p' and 'S is embarrassed that p' (see #$embarrassed). For the theory behind the classification of emotions as factive/epistemic see #$SharedNoteOnFactiveVersusEpistemicEmotion.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aae43).
