x_comment(x_obtainsDuring,"#$obtainsDuring is a binary predicate relating a situation to a time interval during which it obtains.  <code>(#$obtainsDuring SITUATION TIMEINTERVAL)</code> means that the instance of #$Situation <code>SITUATION</code> obtains entirely within the the instance  <code>TIMEINTERVAL</code> of #$TimeInterval.  Thus, <code>(#$obtainsDuring SITUATION TIMEINTERVAL)</code> implies that <code>(#$temporallySubsumes TIMEINTERVAL EVENT)</code>. Where SITUATION is an instance of #$Event, use the more specific #$occursDuring.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aae47).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aae47,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
