x_comment(x_IslandRegion,"A specialization of #$LandTopographicalFeature.  Each instance of #$IslandRegion is either an island, a group of islands (such as an #$Archipelago), or an area that includes part but not all of an island (see #$IslandSubregion).  \n<p>\nNote that the instances of #$IslandRegion include certain groups of scattered islands that do not form a natural geographical area, but which are geopolitical areas and/or were historically significant. For example, #$FrenchPolynesia, #$Cyclades, #$OuterHebrides-Archipelago, and #$Grenadines-Islands.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aae68).
