x_comment(x_MobFn,"An instance of #$CollectionDenotingFunction.  When applied to any collection <code>COL</code> that is both an instance of #$ObjectType and a specialization of #$TemporalThing, #$MobFn returns a subcollection of #$Mob, namely the collection of those mobs whose #$groupMembers all are instances of <code>COL</code>.  \n<p>\nFor example, a clump of hair on a person's head is an instance of (#$MobFn #$Hair-Strand); the collection #$Galaxy is a specialization of (#$MobFn #$Star); and the collection #$Applauding-Clapping (i.e. all applause events) could be identified with (#$MobFn \"TwoHandsClappingEvent\").") :- x_cid(a65b16517aae72).
