x_comment(x_uncles,"(#$uncles PERSON UNCLE) means that UNCLE is one of PERSON's uncles, i.e., either a brother of one of PERSON's parents, or the husband of a sibling of one of PERSON's parents.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aae85).
