x_comment(x_grandmothers,"A #$FamilyRelationSlot relating an #$Animal to his or her grandmothers.  If (#$grandmothers ANIM GM), then GM is the female parent (#$mother) of one of the parents of ANIM.  In the case of #$NonHumanAnimals, there is a line of direct biological descent from GM to ANIM.  However, in the case of humans, because the #$children relationship can also arise due to a variety of social arrangements in addition to birth (e.g., #$Adoption, marriage, fostering), a person and their grandmothers may not be biologically related.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaeaa).
