x_comment(x_Valley,"A specialization of #$LandTopographicalFeature, #$CavityWithWalls, and #$InanimateObject-Natural. Each instance of #$Valley is of significantly lower altitude than the area surrounding it. A #$Valley is distinguished from a #$Basin by having sharper sides, and typically has #$Mountains (or smaller elevations) surrounding it.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaece).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aaece,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
