x_comment(x_Shoreline,"A specialization of #$LandTopographicalFeature. Each instance of #$Shoreline is a region along an edge of a #$BodyOfWater.  \n<p>\nSpecializations of #$Shoreline include #$Beach, #$Seacoast, and #$Riverbank.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaed2).
