x_comment('x_MilitarySite-Historical',"A specialization of #$HistoricalSite.  A #$MilitarySite-Historical is a facility or region formerly used for various aspects of or relating to military activity, and which is currently considered to be of historical interest.  Examples include historical battlefields, decomissioned military bases, and shipyards.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaeda).
