x_comment(x_taxonomicCousinCollections,"An assertion of the form (#$taxonomicCousinCollections COLL1 COLL2) states that the instances of #$Collection COLL1 and COLL2 are such that (1) they share a common generalization that is a sub-collection of #$Thing, (2) they are not disjoint, and  (3) neither bears the relation #$genls to the other.  This is a more general relationship than #$taxonomicSiblingCollections.  This predicate is useful for determining whether two collections can share common instances.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaedb).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aaedb,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
