xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517aaedb,[]).
x_comment(x_Crater,"A specialization of #$Basin-Topographical.  Each instance of #$Crater is a bowl-shaped depression on the surface of a planet, either (i) at the mouth of a volcano (see e.g. #$Caldera) or geyser or (ii) caused by the impact of a body such as a meteroid (see #$ImpactCrater).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaedc).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aaedc,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
