x_comment(x_stepmother,"(#$stepmother CHILD MOTHER) holds just in case MOTHER is the step mother of CHILD.  That is, just in case:\n  <pre>\n    (#$and\n     (#$stepchildren MOTHER CHILD)\n     (#$isa MOTHER #$AdultFemaleHuman))\n  </pre>\nThis relationship was established when one of the parents of CHILD married MOTHER,  after CHILD was already born or adopted by his or her parent.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaf09).
