x_comment(x_Well,"A specialization of #$FixedStructure and #$PhysicalDevice.  Each instance of #$Well is a device for extracting liquids, usually water or petroleum, out from a reservoir under the ground.  Generally, a well is a hole created by drilling or digging. Artificial lift devices (like #$Pump-Mechanical or #$Buckets) are also typically part of a well.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaf11).
