x_comment(x_FreshWaterLake,"A specialization of #$Lake.  Each instance of #$FreshWaterLake is a freshwater land-locked body of water.  Examples include #$LakeMaracaibo, #$LakeWinnipeg, #$LakeTanganyika, #$LochNess-Lake, #$LakeErie, and #$LakeTahoe.  Note that inland saltwater lakes, commonly referred to as `seas', belong to the collection #$InlandSea (q.v.), rather than to #$FreshWaterLake.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaf18).
