x_comment(x_PhysicalCompositionPredicate,"A specialization of both #$PartPredicate and #$CoexistingObjectsPredicate (qq.v.).  This is a collection of binary predicates that relate partially tangible things to their partially tangible parts or components, where those parts/components might be either spatially continuous or discrete.  As such, each physical-composition has both its argument-places constrained (see #$argIsa) to instances of #$PartiallyTangible or some subcollection thereof.  Each instance of #$PhysicalCompositionPredicate is a specialization (either via #$genlPreds or #$genlInverse) of the predicate #$physicalDecompositions (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaf32).
