x_comment(x_PredicateType,"A collection of collections, and a specialization of #$RelationshipType.  Each instance of #$PredicateType is a collection of #$Predicates.  The predicates in a given predicate category represented in the Knowledge Base are typically those sharing some common feature(s) considered significant enough that the collection of all such predicates is useful to reify.  Although what constitutes a \"significant common feature\" is difficult to specify precisely, there are many clear-cut cases. Instances of #$PredicateType include #$TemporalPartPredicate, #$QuantitySlot, #$FunctionalSlot, #$InterActorSlot, #$TransitiveBinaryPredicate, and #$PropositionalAttitudeSlot.  See also the comment on #$Predicate.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaf59).
