x_comment(x_affectedAgent,"The predicate #$affectedAgent relates a particular event to those agents who are affected by it.  (#$affectedAgent EVT AGT) means that AGT is harmed, benefitted, or otherwise acted upon in or as a result of EVT.  #$affectedAgent is not an instance of #$ActorSlot because it is not a specialization of #$actors -- if an individual is affected in or as a result of an event,  that individual need not participate in the event; indeed, that individual need not temporally intersect the event.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaf6f).
