x_comment(x_intendedReferent,"This is a specialization of #$referents which relates a #$LinguisticExpressionPeg to its most \"deeply embedded\" referent (cf. #$DiscourseReferentPeg) within the discourse context. Typically, for a given group of #$coReferring expressions, the most \"embedded\" referent will be the #$naiveReferent of whichever of these expresssions is intruduced first (least recently) within the  discourse. Thus (#$intendedReferent LINGPEG REFPEG) entails that REFPEG is the #$naiveReferent of the least recent #$LinguisticExpressionPeg (not nec. distinct from LINGPEG) which is #$coReferring with LINGPEG.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaf9c).
