x_comment(x_ConnectedSpaceRegion,"A specialization of #$HomogeneousExtendedSpaceRegion and #$SpatiallyContinuousThing (qq.v.).  This is the collection of self-connected space regions.  A homogeneous extended space region is an instance of #$ConnectedSpaceRegion if and only if it is \"connected\" in the sense of #$RegionConnectionCalculus8Theory (q.v.).   A connected region <code>REGION</code> is \"all in one piece\": it cannot be split in two mutually-disconnected homogeneous extended space regions whose sum is <code>REGION</code>.\n<p>\nFor example, the geographical location of Switzerland is a connected region; but the geographical location of the Italian-speaking part of Switzerland is a disconnected, 3-piece region.\n<p>\nCf. #$DisconnectedSpaceRegion, with which this collection makes up a partition of #$HomogeneousExtendedSpaceRegion.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaf9d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aaf9d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517aaf9d,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
xc_source_line(a65b16517aaf9d,11128).
