x_comment(x_genlsLinkedArgIsas,"An expression of the form (#$genlsLinkedArgIsas  PRED1 ARG1 PRED2 ARG2 COLLECTION) means that either (1)  the collection that is the #$argIsa value for the #$Predicate PRED1's ARG1th argument is a sub-collection of the collection that is the #$argIsa value for the #$Predicate PRED2's ARG2th value or (2) that the collection that is the #$argIsa value for the #$Predicate PRED2's ARG2th argument is a sub-collection of the collection that is the #$argIsa value for the #$Predicate PRED1's ARG1th value.  Further, the COLLECTION is one of those arguments' constraining collection and, so, is a common sub-collection of both argument's constraining collections.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aafb2).
