x_comment(x_InvertibleFunction,"A specialization of #$OneToOneFunction and #$UnaryFunction (qq.v.).  This is the collection of all functions that have well-defined inverses (see #$inverseFunctions).  A unary function is an instance of #$InvertibleFunction if and only if it is one-to-one: it never takes distinct arguments to the same value.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aafbc).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aafbc,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
