x_comment(x_ExtendingHandToShake,"An instance of #$TemporalStuffType and a specialization of #$NonVerbalCommunicating.  Each instance of #$ExtendingHandToShake involves one #$SocialBeing extending his hand to another person to shake hands.  If the other person reciprocates the action, then you have a #$ShakingHands event.   The person who initiates this action usually is attempting to convey to #$Friendliness and #$GoodWill.  By convention, this action is typically performed with the right hand (see (#$RightObjectOfPairFn #$Hand)).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aafcb).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aafcb,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
