x_comment('x_IMDB-PersonFn',"(#$IMDB-PersonFn NAME ID) denotes the person identified in\nthe Internet Movie database as having the string NAME as their name\nand the integer ID as their unique IMDb identifier.  For example,\n(#$IMDB-PersonFn 'Tom Hanks' 158) denotes the actor Tom Hanks.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aafcc).
