x_comment('x_IMDB-MovieFn',"(#$IMDB-MovieFn NAME ID) denotes the movie identified in\nthe Internet Movie database as having the canonical title string NAME\nas its title and the integer ID as its unique IMDb identifier.  For\nexample, (#$IMDB-PersonFn 'Star Wars (1977)' 76759) denotes the movie\n'Star Wars' that was released in 1977.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aafcd).
