x_comment(x_VolumeOfPeriodicalByVolumeNumberFn,"(EditionByVolumeFn PERIODICAL NUMBER) denotes the #$EditionOfCWSeries-Periodic of PERIODICAL that is released with volume number NUMBER. For instance, (#$EditionByVolumeFn #$HarpersMagazine-TheMagazine 20) denotes volume 20 of Harper's Magazine. Note that the #$EditionOfCWSeries-Periodic returned may be an instance of #$PeriodicalIssue or some subcollection of PERIODICAL. For example, (#$EditionByVolumeFn #$ComputationalLinguistics-Journal 19) denotes volume 19 of 'Computational Linguistics,' which happens to be the four issues published in 1993.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aafd9).
