x_comment(x_EditionByIssueNumberFn,"(#$EditionByIssueNumberFn PERIODICAL NUMBER) denotes the #$EditionOfCWSeries-Periodic of PERIODICAL that is released with issue number NUMBER. For instance, (#$EditionByIssueNumberFn #$HarpersMagazine-TheMagazine 20) denotes issue 20 of Harper's Magazine. Note that the #$EditionOfCWSeries-Periodic returned may be an instance of #$PeriodicalIssue or some subcollection of PERIODICAL. For example, (#$EditionByIssueNumberFn ComputationalLinguistics-Journal 1) denotes all the first-quarter issues of 'Computational Linguistics.'") :- x_cid(a65b16517aafda).
