x_comment(x_NonFluidlikeTangibleThing,"The subcollection of #$PartiallyTangible whose instances are not like fluids.  #$NonFluidlikeTangibleThings do not flow and have an intrinsic shape.  #$NonFluidlikeTangibleThing is primarily a collection union of #$SolidTangibleThing and #$SemiSolidTangibleThing.  It is useful as a genl collection for certain collections whose members can be both #$SolidTangibleThings and #$SemiSolidTangibleThings, like #$Deformable.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aafe1).
