x_comment(x_DiscontinuingAnActivity,"A #$TemporalObjectType and specialization of #$PurposefulAction.  Each instance of #$DiscontinuingAnActivity is an event in which an agent discontinues an activity.  This can involve deliberately bringing the performance of a particular #$Action to an end (as in \"She quit running after twenty minutes\"), or deliberately stopping the performance of an activity (type) that was previously performed often or regularly (as in, \"The airline discontinued its service to Austin\").  Note that an instance of #$DiscontinuingAnActivity must be performed deliberately; thus, e.g., a person's quitting snoring at some point during his sleep would not count as an instance of #$DiscontinuingAnActivity.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaff0).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aaff0,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
