x_comment(x_PostponingAnEvent,"A first-order collection and a sub-collection of #$PurposefulAction.  #$PostponingAnEvent is the collection of actions in which some agent makes a decision not to try to have some type of #$Situation occur. Most typically, this will involve deciding to delay an attempt to perform a #$PurposefulAction.  This refers to the decision making action, not the possible action that is the subject of the decision-making process.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aaffe).
