x_comment(x_cycLActors,"An expression of the form (#$cycLActors SIT EXPRESSION) means that the quoted #$CycLExpression EXPRESSION plays some role in the #$Situation SIT.  This is the most general predicate for relating instances of #$Situation to quoted instances of #$CycLExpression.  It is generic enough to subsume the relationship between a quoted instance of  #$CycLSentence-Askable and an instance of #$CycQueryRunning in which it is asked, or an instance of #$CycLConstant that is created during an instance of #$CreatingNewConceptInCyc. It specializations are preferrable in all of these cases.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab007).
