x_comment(x_AddingACycLTermToATool,"The collection of all events which involve the use of some tool for viewing or interacting with #$TheCycOntology and adding some #$CycLExpression to the tool.  For instance, after a search within a tool returns a number of results and only a few are satisfactory, if one of the instances of #$CycLExpression is selected for further work, then that event would be an instance of this collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab010).
