x_comment(x_openingCeremonyFor,"(#$openingCeremonyFor CEREMONY FOCAL-OBJECT) means that CEREMONY is the instance of #$OpeningCeremony that \"introduces\" or \"kicks off\" the instance of #$Individual, FOCAL-OBJECT.  Where FOCAL-OBJECT is an event, such as a conference or a sport season, CEREMONY will typically be the first sub-event (see #$firstSubEvents) or start shortly before FOCAL-OBJECT.  Where FOCAL-OBJECT is an instance of #$Artifact, so that CEREMONY is an instance of #$DedicationCeremony, the temporal extent of FOCAL-OBJECT will typically start prior to CEREMONY.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab016).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab016,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
