x_comment(x_cultureAdheresToCode,"(#$cultureAdheresToCode CULTURE CODE) means that CODE is a system of norms or an individual norm that is generally followed \nwithin CULTURE.  CODE may regard such things as morality, etiquette, honor, or religious observance -- see #$CodeOfConduct and its specializations.  Adherence to CODE helps determine the range of\nacceptable behaviors within CULTURE, and so helps determine some of its\ncharacteristic practices (see comment on #$HumanCulture). Note that a\nnon-conformist sub-culture of CULTURE (cf. #$subCultures-Unfriendly)\nmay repudiate some or all elements of COC, and in fact, doing so may\nhelp define that sub-culture.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab024).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab024,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
