x_comment(x_forbidUserEntryOnPosition,"(#$forbidUserEntryOnPosition TEMPLATE POS) means that, for TEMPLATE, the user is unable to type anything into replaceable position POS. This has the effect of restricting the user's actions to making choices from the drop-down menu, which is useful in many situations. Note, using this predicate on a position in conjunction with #$templateReplacementsInvisibleForPosition creates a replaceable position that can take no input at all.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab026).
