x_comment(x_investigationFocusSentence,"(#$investigationFocusSentence INVESTIGATION SENT) means that determining the truth value of SENT -- or, if SENT is an open sentence, what #$Tuples satisfy SENT -- is the primary focus of INVESTIGATION.\n<p>\nFor example, if Investigation01 is an investigation to determine who committed some #$CriminalAct Crime01, the following would be true:\n<p>\n(#$investigationFocusSentence Investigation01 (#$perpetrator Crime01 ?WHO)).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab027).
