x_comment(x_IntermittentCollection,"A specialization of both #$TimeDependentCollection and #$FirstOrderCollection (qq.v.).  This is the collection of all collections of which something can be an instance during (and only during) several non-overlapping periods.  \n<p>\nFor example, #$FamousHuman is an intermittant collection, as a person might be famous as a child, fade into obscurity as a young adult, and then become famous again as an older adult.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab02a).
