x_comment(x_LinguisticConceptExtraction,"A #$FirstOrderCollection and a sub-collection of #$LinguisticTranslationProcess.  #$LinguisticConceptExtraction is the collection of all events in which the elements of some representation using some #$Language are converted into representations in a different #$Language, with the end result not being made up of units that are smaller than complete sentences, even if the source representations do contain complete sentences.  For instance, a process that took the English term 'bulldog' from the phrase 'the pugnacious bulldog'  and mapped it to #$CycLConstant #$Bulldog would be an instance of the collection. This is collection does not assume that the events are successful.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab0bd).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab0bd,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
