x_comment(x_SpatialThingTypeByNumberOfDimensions,"A #$TotallyOrderedCollectionType and a specialization of #$SpatialThingTypeByDimensionality; a collection of collections of spatial things.  Each instance of #$SpatialThingTypeByNumberOfDimensions is a subcollection of #$SpatialThing (q.v.) consisting of all and only those things having the same particular number of spatial dimensions.  Instances of this collection include #$ZeroDimensionalThing, #$OneDimensionalThing, #$TwoDimensionalThing, and #$ThreeDimensionalThing.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab167).
