x_comment(x_AbandoningASituation,"A first-order collection and sub-collection of #$EndingASituation.  #$AbandoningASituation represents a generic form of intentionally stopping a subsuming #$Situation from holding with the implication that the goals or purposes of that larger #$Situation were not realized.  For instance, consider a person who is digging a well and decides to stop that process and perform some other action. The action that constitutes  stopping the digging would be an instance of this collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab16a).
