x_comment(x_cycLInputs,"An expression of the form (#$cycLInputs CREATE CYCL) means that during the instance of #$IBOCreation CREATE, the quoted instance of #$CycLExpression CYCL was brought into the process at the very beginning and used to some end.  For instance, the formulas contained in instances of #$TKBBuilderQuery are intended to plays this role in an instance of #$ComposingACycQuery. Contrast with #$cycLIntroduced.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab16f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab16f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
