x_comment(x_incorrectlyParsedSentence,"(#$incorrectlyParsedSentence SENTENCE) means that a reviewer who looked at the #$CycLPropositionalSentence SENTENCE felt that the information the sentence expresses is incorrectly parsed from a text source or a text sentence.  For example, (#$objectFoundInLocation #$KuKluxKlan #$BillingsMustangs-BaseballTeam) is an incorrect parse of 'Ku Klux Klan was located in Billings'.  Whether the sentence is correctly/incorrectly parsed depends on a reviewer's subjective judgement, the context within which the claim is being made, and what other information is available to the system.  Also see #$correctlyParsedSentence.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab1b2).
