x_comment('x_inheritRolePlayers-SitTypeToSubSitType',"A quaternary predicate. (#$inheritRolePlayers-SitTypeToSubSitType SUPER ROLE1 SUB ROLE2) means that every instance of SUPER has an instance of SUB #$subSituations, and furthermore  if (#$isa INST1 SUPER) and (ROLE1 INST1 ACTOR) and (#$subSituations INST1 INST2) then (ROLE2 INST2 ACTOR). For example, in #$BiologyMt,  (#$inheritRolePlayers-SitTypeToSubSitType #$KillingByOrganism-Unique #$organismKilled #$Dying #$bodilyDoer) would mean that every killing of a single organism has a subevent in which the killed organism dies.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab2c7).
