x_comment(x_DirectSpaceRegionSumFn,"A binary function that takes a pair of mutually discrete space regions to their mereological sum or union in the sense of #$RegionConnectionCalculus8Theory.  (#$DirectSpaceRegionSumFn <b>SUM REGION1 REGION2</b>) is the #$HomogeneousExtendedSpaceRegion <b>SUM</b> such that (i) <b>SUM</b> is the sum (see #$spaceRegionSum) of <b>REGION1</b> and <b>REGION2</b> and (ii) <b>REGION1</b> and <b>REGION2</b> are discrete from each other (see #$discreteSpaceRegions).\n<p>\nNote that this predicate is an #$ELRelation (q.v.) whose #$expansion is given in terms of #$SpaceRegionSumFn.  See also the corresponding predicate #$directSpaceRegionSum.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab2f4).
