x_comment(x_convexSpaceRegionSum,"A ternary predicate that relates a pair of space regions to the smallest convex region containing their mereological sum or union in the sense of #$RegionConnectionCalculus8Theory.  <code>(#$convexSpaceRegionSum CONVEX-SUM REGION1 REGION2)</code> holds if and only if <code>(#$convexSpaceRegionOf CONVEX-SUM SUM)</code> holds, where <code>SUM</code> is the unique space region (see #$HomogeneousExtendedSpaceRegion) such that <code>(#$spaceRegionSum SUM REGION1 REGION2)</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab2fe).
