x_comment(x_MinimalSubsumingConvexSpaceRegionFn,"A unary function that maps a given spatial thing to the space region enclosed by the thing's intangible \"convex hull\". (#$MinimalSubsumingConvexSpaceRegionFn  <b>OBJECT</b>) is the minimal #$ConvexSpaceRegion that #$spatiallySubsumes all of <b>OBJECT</b>.  Note that <b>OBJECT</b> might be a single object or a #$Group of spatially disjoint objects. \n<p>\nTo represent an object's intangible convex hull itself (rather than the entire space region it encloses), use #$ConvexHullFn.   \n<p>\nSee also the corresponding predicate #$convexSpaceRegionSubsuming-Minimal.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab36c).
