x_comment(x_OutsideOfSpaceRegionFn,"A unary function that takes a given non-universal space region (see #$HomogeneousExtendedNonUniversalSpaceRegion) to the maximal space region that is outside it (see #$outsideSpaceRegion).  \n<p>\nMore precisely, (#$OutsideOfSpaceRegionFn <b>REGION</b>) is the space region with which any space region <b>ANY-REGION</b> is connected (see #$connectedSpaceRegions) if and only if there is some region <b>OUTSIDE-REGION</b> that is outside <b>REGION</b> and connected to <b>ANY-REGION</b>.\n<p>\nNote that #$OutsideOfSpaceRegionFn is the function known as <i>outside</i> in #$RegionConnectionCalculus8Theory.\n<p>\nSee the corresponding predicate #$outsideOfSpaceRegion-Maximal; also see #$InsideOfSpaceRegionFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab36d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab36d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
