x_comment(x_incidentInExteriorOfSpaceRegion,"A binary #$SpaceRegionPredicate that is a specialization of #$spatiallyDisjoint and a contrary (see #$negationPreds) of  #$incidentInSpaceRegion (q.v.).  <code>(#$incidentInExteriorOfSpaceRegion POINT REGION)</code> means that <code>POINT</code> is incident in the exterior of <code>REGION</code>.  Thus, if <code>COMPLEMENT</code> is the complement (see #$spaceRegionComplement) of <code>REGION</code>, then <code>(#$incidentInInteriorOfSpaceRegion POINT COMPLEMENT)</code> holds. \n<p>\nSee also #$incidentInBoundaryOfSpaceRegion.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab398).
