x_comment('x_properlySpatiallySubsumes-Nontangential',"An asymmetric transitive #$RelativeLocationalPredicate that is a specialization of #$properlySpatiallySubsumes (q.v.).  <code>(#$properlySpatiallySubsumes-Nontangential SUPER SUB)</code> means that (i) the spatial extent of <code>SUB</code> properly subsumes the spatial extent of <code>SUPER</code> and (ii) <code>SUB</code> is #$spatiallyDisjoint from the boundary (i.e. each external surface, edge, and corner) of  <code>SUPER</code>.\n<p>\nSpecializations of this predicate include #$internalParts and #$nontangentialProperPartOfSpaceRegion-Inverse.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab39b).
