x_comment(x_CodeOfConductMicrotheorySpindle,"A specialization of #$MicrotheorySpindle.  Each instance\n#$CodeOfConductMicrotheorySpindle is a spindle composed entirely of\nmicrotheories (see #$mtSpindleMember) which represent the contents of\nsome or other #$CodeOfConduct.  More precisely, each instance of\n#$CodeOfConductMicrotheorySpindle contains just those normative\ncontexts that apply to or govern some particular particular entity --\ne.g., all the codes that operate in a #$Culture-Practice, that apply\nwithin a given #$Organization, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab39c).
