x_comment('x_properlySpatiallySubsumes-Tangential',"An asymmetric #$RelativeLocationalPredicate that is a specialization of #$properlySpatiallySubsumes (q.v.).  <code>(#$properlySpatiallySubsumes-Nontangential SUPER SUB)</code> means that (i) the spatial extent of <code>SUB</code> properly subsumes the spatial extent of <code>SUPER</code> and (ii) <code>SUB</code> #$spatiallyIntersects the boundary (i.e. intersects some external surface, edge, or corner) of <code>SUPER</code>.\n<p>\nSpecializations of this predicate include #$externalParts and #$tangentialProperPartOfSpaceRegion-Inverse.\n<p>\nCf. #$properlySpatiallySubsumes-Nontangential.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab39d).
