x_comment(x_KeepingAnAnimalAwake,"A #$FirstOrderCollection and specialization of #$KeepingInACertainState.  Each instance of #$KeepingAnAnimalAwake is an event in which something (e.g. a loud noise, excessive #$Caffeine, #$Fear) keeps an animal from #$GoingToSleep.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab405).
