x_comment(x_spaceRegionSum,"A ternary predicate that relates a pair of space regions to their mereological sum or union in the sense of #$RegionConnectionCalculus8Theory.  <code>(#$spaceRegionSum SUM REG1 REG2)</code> means that <code>SUM</code> is the unique #$HomogeneousPositiveDimensionalSpaceRegion such that any region connects with (see #$connectedSpaceRegions) <code>SUM</code> if and only if it connects with either <code>REG1</code> or <code>REG2</code>. \n<p>\nSee the corresponding function #$SpaceRegionSumFn.  Also see #$spaceRegionProduct and #$spaceRegionDifference.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab408).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab408,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
