x_comment(x_GeneralizedSpaceRegionProductFn,"A unary function that takes a set of equidimensional space regions (see #$EquidimensionalSpaceRegionSet) to their mereological product or intersection. (#$GeneralizedSpaceRegionProductFn <b>REGION-SET</b>) is the #$HomogeneousPositiveDimensionalSpaceRegion <b>PROD</b> that is the spatial product of all the regions in <b>REGION-SET</b>. If the members of <b>REGION-SET</b> do not all share a common region of overlap, then the function returns a #$NullSpaceRegion (q.v.). This function is an extension of the function #$SpaceRegionProductFn, which takes two regions to their product.\n<p>\nSee the corresponding predicate #$generalizedSpaceRegionProduct. Also see #$GeneralizedSpaceRegionSumFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab40c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab40c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
