x_comment('x_RCCBinaryPredicate-BaseEight',"A specialization of #$RCCBinaryPredicate (q.v.).  This collection has exactly eight instances, which constitute the jointly exhaustive and pairwise disjoint base relations in the #$RegionConnectionCalculus8Theory (q.v.).  Thus, for any pair of #$HomogeneousPositiveDimensionalSpaceRegions, there is exactly one RCC8 base relation that holds between them (see #$rcc8RelationHoldsBetween).\n<p>\nFor a list of all eight instances, see the \"Arg 2\" #$isa assertions on this collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab424).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab424,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517ab424,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
