x_comment(x_PreventingFromHappening,"A collection of events.  Each instance of #$PreventingFromHappening is an event which is the prevention of another event from taking place.  For example, the act of a police officer stopping a crime in progress would be the prevention of a crime.  To relate instances of #$PreventingFromHappening to the event types that they prevent, use the function #$PreventingFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab42a).
