x_comment(x_ReplacementEvent,"A #$FirstOrderCollection and specialization of #$GeneralizedTransfer.  Each instance of #$ReplacementEvent is an #$Event in which something is (in some sense) replaced with something else.  \n<p>\nNote that #$ReplacementEvent is not a specialization of #$PurposefulAction, or even #$Action.  For example, some water replacing some other water in a puddle (because of a flood, say) would count as an instance of #$ReplacementEvent.\n<p>\nA notable specialization of this collection which <i>is</i> a specialization of #$PurposefulAction is #$ReplacingSomething (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab432).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab432,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
