x_comment(x_Interfering,"A specialization of (#$AttemptingFn #$PreventingFromHappening) and #$ConflictEvent.  Each instance of #$Interfering is an #$Action aimed at thwarting or hindering another agent's action.  An instance of #$Interfering need not <i>prevent</i> an agent's action, but it must make that action more difficult for the agent to perform; otherwise, it is just an instance of (#$AttemptingFn #$Interfering).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab433).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab433,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
