x_comment(x_LearningThat,"This is the set of events in which an agent is acquiring knowledge in the 'know-that' sense, as opposed to the 'know-how' sense.  For the latter type of event, see #$LearningAnAbility.   #$LearningThat may be accomplished by perception, or by just sitting and thinking, and inferring new information from what is already known.  For events which involve gathering information from an information source, see the spec #$LearningFromInformationSource.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab436).
