x_comment(x_connectsWithAtomicTPPOfSpaceRegion,"A binary #$SpaceRegionPredicate and a specialization of #$connectedSpaceRegions (q.v.).  <code>(#$connectsWithAtomicTPPOfSpaceRegion REGION1 REGION2)</code> is true if and only if there is some <code>PART</code> such that (i) <code>PART</code> is an #$AtomicSpaceRegion, (ii) <code>PART</code> is a tangential proper part of <code>REGION1</code> (see #$tangentialProperPartOfSpaceRegion), and (iii) <code>PART</code> connects with <code>REGION2</code> (see #$connectedSpaceRegions).  \n<p>\nNote that this predicate was reified to simplify the defining axioms for #$skinOfSpaceRegion.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab450).
