x_comment(x_LevelOfDifficulty,"A #$TotallyOrderedQuantityType and specialization of #$EvaluativeQuantity whose instances pertain to subjective assessments, by a performer of a particular action, of the perceived or experienced level of difficulty involved in performing that action.  The instances of #$LevelOfDifficulty range from #$Easy to #$Difficult, and more precise values can be specified using #$GenericValueFunctions (e.g. #$NoAmountFn).  Note\nthat since #$LevelOfDifficulty reflects subjective (concurrent or ex post facto) assessments of the difficulty of particular actions by their performers, they are not related in any direct way to more objective standards of difficulty, such as the \"levels of difficulty\" assigned to types of dives in Olympic diving competitions.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab465).
