x_comment('x_LinearObject-OneDimensional',"The \"collection-intersection\" of #$LinearObject and #$OneDimensionalThing (qq.v.). #$LinearObject-OneDimensional is the collection of all and only linearly-shaped objects that are extended in only one spatial dimension.  They might be straight or curved, bounded or unbounded; being strictly one-dimensional, they are intangible.\n<p>\nSpecializations of #$LinearObject-OneDimensional include #$Line, #$Ray-Geometrical, and #$LineSegment.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab53b).
