x_comment(x_sufficientToAchieve,"An assertion of the form (#$sufficientToAchieve MOTIVE1 MOTIVE2) states that the #$NormativeSpecification MOTIVE1 has been adopted by some #$IntelligentAgent because its specification is perceived to be sufficient to bring about the specification of #$NormativeSpecification-Achievement MOTIVE2. If an agent were motivated to destroy a particular building (and so had the #$NormativeSpecification-Achievement M2), this motivation could give rise to the motivation to burn the building down (M1) and the following assertion would hold (#$sufficientToAchieve M1 M2).  This predicate is neutral on whether the specification of MOTIVE1 is sufficient to bring about the specification of MOTIVE2, see #$necessaryForAchieving for a predicate with that meaning.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab553).
