x_comment(x_goalProperSubSituationTypes,"<code>(#$goalProperSubSituationTypes PURP-ACT-TYPE SUB-SIT-TYPE)</code> indicates that instances of <code>PURP-ACT-TYPE</code>, which is a specialization of #$PurposefulAction, are performed with the goal of achieving instances of <code>EVENT-TYPE</code>.  This predicate is intended to complement temporal and causal predicates such that we can represent the reason why an #$IntelligentAgent would perform instances of <code>PURP-ACT-TYPE</code>.  More specifically, since an #$IntelligentAgent's goal can often be the satisfaction of another goal's preconditions, this predicate can help Cyc recognize causal chains that span several instances of distinct specializations of #$Situation during inference.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab576).
