x_comment(x_ModelMicrotheory,"A #$MicrotheoryType, all the instances of #$ModelMicrotheory are instances of #$Microtheory that contain a representation of the relevancy knowledge regarding some user of a #$UserProgram.  While instances of #$SoftwareInteractionSessionRecordMicrotheory are used to record the user's actions, knowledge that is inferred regarding what is relevant to the user is stored in an instance of #ModelMicrotheory.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab59f).
