x_comment(x_ModelMtByUserAndTaskFn,"An expression of the form (#$ModelMtByUserAndTaskFn PERSON TASK) denotes an instance of #$ModelMicrotheory that represents the context of the #$Person PERSON working on the #$Allotment TASK. Specifically, it is used to store inferred knowledge regarding the relevance of particular concepts, queries, or facts. Each instance of #$ModelMicrotheory bears a #$genlMt link to some #$TheoryMicrotheory and an instance of #$SoftwareInteractionSessionRecordMicrotheory denoted by (#$RecordMtByUserTaskAndApplicationFn PERSON TASK). It is from the contents of those microtheories that the contents of (#$ModelMtByUserAndTaskFn PERSON TASK) will be derived.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab5a0).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab5a0,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
