x_comment(x_actionRetaliatesFor,"(#$actionRetaliatesFor REVENGE ACTION) means that for any agent who performs REVENGE, there is someone who that agent believes to have acted deliberately in ACTION and has the goal of harming with REVENGE, 'at' the time frame of REVENGE as indexed by the date at which REVENGE is carried out.  It also means that where the performer of REVENGE believes ACTOR to be the #$directingAgent or #$performedBy of ACTION, the likelihood that ACTOR is the #$intendedMaleficiary of REVENGE is high, and that where INTENDED-VICTIM is known to be the #$intendedMaleficiary of REVENGE and AVENGER is the performer, AVENGER believes INTENDED-VICTIM to have acted deliberately in REVENGE, 'at the time frame of REVENGE as indexed by the date.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab5bd).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab5bd,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
