x_comment(x_RegularlyRecurringAssignment,"A specialization of #$Assignment-Specification (q.v.).  Each instance of #$RegularlyRecurringAssignment is an #$Assignment-Specification that requires that a particular sort of action be performed once during each of the intervals of a specified type (#$assignmentRepetitionPeriod (q.v.)) that fall within the asssignment's period (#$assignmentPeriod (q.v.)).  Thus, the chore of cleaning the kitchen every week for a month is a #$RegularlyRecurringAssignment because although it requires only four performances, those performances must be distributed across the individual weeks of that month.  For the type of #$Assignment-Specification where the emphasis is on the particular number of repetitions, see  #$IteratedAssignment.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab5ee).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab5ee,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
