x_comment(x_ScrewShapedObject,"An instance of #$ThreeDimensionalShapeType.  This is the collection of all screw-shaped objects, whether spatially-localized or abstract.  Each instance of #$ScrewShapedObject is roughly cylindrical or conical in shape, but has an external spiral \"thread\" starting at one end and running along most or all of its length.  A screw-shaped oject typically has a solid central axis.  \n<p>\nSpecializations of this collection include #$Screw-Connector and #$DrillBit.  Note that #$Corkscrews are usually <i>not</i> #$ScrewShapedObjects, but are instead instances of #$Helix.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab5f1).
