x_comment('x_LineSegment-Planar',"A specialization of #$LineSegment and #$LinearObject-Planar (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$LineSegment-Planar is a straight or curved intangible line-segment that remains in a single two-dimensional plane.  For example, an #$Arc is a planar line-segment.  Cf. #$LineSegment-NonPlanar.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab5fc).
