x_comment(x_earliestSubsumedIntervalOfType,"<code>(#$earliestIntersectingIntervalOfType TEMPORAL-THING INTERVAL TYPE)</code> means that the instance of #$TimeInterval <code>INTERVAL</code> is the earliest interval of type <code>TYPE</code> that is temporally subsumed by (c.f., #$temporallySubsumes) the temporal extent of the instance of #$TemporalThing <code>TEMPORAL-THING</code>. For example, \n<pre>    \n     (#$earliestSubsumedIntervalOfType #$WorldWarII \n        (#$YearFn 1940) #$CalendarYear)\n</pre>means that the year 1940 is the first full calendar year that occurs during WWII.  See also #$latestIntersectingIntervalOfType and #$earliestIntersectingIntervalOfType.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab65a).
