x_comment('x_LinearObject-Infinite',"A specialization of #$LinearObject and #$InfiniteSpatialThing (qq.v.).  #$LinearObject-Infinite is the collection of all and only linearly-shaped objects that are infinite in length.  They might be straight or curved, intangible or (at least in principle) tangible.  \n<p>\nAn important specialization of #$LinearObject-Infinite is #$Line, whose instances are strictly one-dimensional.\n<p>\nCf. #$LinearObject-Finite.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab680).
