x_comment('x_performsActsOfTypeInLocation-Number',"(#$performsActsOfTypeInLocation-Number AGENT ACTION-TYPE LOCATION NUM) holds just in case NUM of the instances of ACTION-TYPE that AGENT is known by Cyc to perform are performed in (#$eventOccursAt) location.  For instance, if 34 of the instances of #$TerroristAttack that Hamas is known to perform are performed in #$Israel, then (#$performsActsOfTypeInLocation-Number #$TerroristOrganization-Hamas #$TerroristAttack #$Israel 34) holds.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab686).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab686,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
