x_comment(x_FlatSurfaceRegion,"A specialization of #$SurfaceRegion.  Each instance of #$FlatSurfaceRegion is an (at least roughly) two-dimensional connected object that is (perfectly or nearly) flat.  Examples of flat surfaces include tangible objects like the top of a kitchen counter, and intangibles such as #$Planes.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab69d).
