x_comment(x_HalfPlane,"A specialization of #$TwoDimensionalGeometricThing, #$SurfaceRegion-SemiBounded, and #$FlatSurfaceRegion (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$HalfPlane is an semi-bounded portion of a #$Plane, having a single straight line as a boundary.  A straight line cuts any plane in which it lies into two half-planes.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab69e).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab69e,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
