x_comment(x_Plane,"A specialization of #$TwoDimensionalGeometricThing, #$SurfaceRegion-Unbounded and #$FlatSurfaceRegion (qq.v.).  This is the collection of all geometric planes.  Each instance of #$Plane is an unbounded, perfectly flat, two-dimensional region of space.  See also #$HalfPlane.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab69f).
