x_comment(x_relationExplicitlyInvokesType,"<code>(#$relationExplicitlyInvokesType RELATION COLL)</code> means that RELATION has a #$nearestArgIsa or #$nearestArgGenl constraint to COLL, and that where that explicit constraint holds, there is not a more specific explicit constraint.  For example, since \n<code>(#$nearestArg2Isa #$actionMotives #$Motive)</code> holds, <code>(#$relationExplicitlyInvokesType #$actionMotives #$Motive)</code> holds.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab6e8).
