x_comment('x_agentHasMotiveForAction-Ternary',"(#$agentHasMotiveForAction-Ternary AGENT ACT MOTIVE) means that the IntelligentAgent AGENT has the motive MOTIVE to see that Action ACT occurrs.  To say that AGENT has acted on MOTIVE so as to be the performer of ACT, use the more specific #$agentsActionHasMotive.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab6f3).
