x_comment(x_orthogonalArgGenlsWithLink,"An expression of the form (#$orthogonalArgGenlsWithLink  PRED1 ARG1 PRED2 ARG2 COLL1 COLL2) means that the collection that is the #$argGenl value for the #$Predicate PRED1's ARG1th argument and the collection that is the #$argGenl value for the #$Predicate PRED2's ARG2th argument are such that neither is a sub-collection of the other and are they are not disjoint. Further, COLL is the #$CollectionIntersectionFn of those arguments' constraining collections.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab713).
