x_comment(x_metaFunctionBasis,"<code>(#$metaFunctionBasis META-FUNCTION BINARY-PREDICATE)</code> means that <code>META-FUNCTION</code> is the instance of #$MetaFunction and #$BinaryPredicate such that for any instance <code>FN</code> of #$Function-Denotational such that <code>(META-FUNCTION FN THING)</code>, any thing <code>DENOTATION</code> that is denoted by <code>(FN . ARGS)</code> will be such that <code>(BINARY-PREDICATE DENOTATION THING)</code>.  <p>For example, <code>(#$metaFunctionBasis #$resultGenl #$genls)</code> means that where, for example, <code>(#$resultGenls #$FruitFn #$Fruit)</code>, <code>(#$genls (#$FruitFn TREE-TYPE) #$Fruit)</code> will hold, so long as <code>(#$FruitFn TREE-TYPE)</code> is defined (see #$undefined).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab735).
