x_comment(x_HomogeneousPositiveDimensionalSpaceRegionSet,"A specialization of #$Set-Mathematical.  This is the collection of all sets of homogeneous and extended (or null) space regions.  A thing is an instance of #$HomogeneousPositiveDimensionalSpaceRegionSet if and only if it is an instance of (#$SetOfTypeFn #$HomogeneousPositiveDimensionalSpaceRegion).  Indeed, the CycL constant <code>#$HomogeneousPositiveDimensionalSpaceRegionSet</code> is a #$rewriteOf the non-atomic term <code>(#$SetOfTypeFn #$HomogeneousPositiveDimensionalSpaceRegion)</code>.\n<p>\nSee also the specialization #$EquidimensionalSpaceRegionSet.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab761).
