x_comment('x_possiblyIdentical-NeedToReview',"This is a workflow constant which is used to mark potentially identical terms based on a shared lexification. (#$possiblyIdentical-NeedToReview OBJ1 OBJ2 STRING) means that OBJ1 and OBJ2 have been identified as potentially identical based on a shared lexification of STRING. In this case, their relationship should should be investigated and the objects should either be marked as different (#$different)  or should have their CycL terms merged. See also #$presumedDifferentDespiteSharedLexification, and #$notIdentical-AlreadyReviewed.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab778).
