x_comment('x_facilitates-EventEvent',"An #$AsymmetricBinaryPredicate that relates an #$Event to another #$Event.  (#$facilitates-EventEvent E1 E2) means that E1 facilitates E2, i.e. E1 makes it easier for E2 to be done or more likely that E2 will occur.  A notable specialization is #$causes-EventEvent.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab799).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab799,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
