x_comment(x_OpenGISGeometryCompositeBaseSet,"A specialization of #$HomogeneousSpaceRegionSet (q.v.).  This is the collection of all sets whose members are either #$Surfaces, #$LineSegments, or #$Points.  The CycL constant <code>#$OpenGISGeometryCompositeBaseSet</code> is the #$rewriteOf the term \n<pre>\n  (#$SetOfTypeFn (#$CollectionUnionFn (#$TheSet #$Point #$LineSegment\n#$Surface))) .  \n</pre> \nIt was introduced in order to simplify the definition of #$OpenGISGeometryComposite (q.v.).  ") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab7a2).
