x_comment(x_Torus,"A specialization of both #$RoundObject and #$ThreeDimensionalGeometricThing (qq.v.).  This is the collection of all tori, or \"donut-shaped\" objects, whether tangible or intangible.  More precisely, each instance of #$Torus is a three-dimensional object generated by the revolution of an ellipse (especially a circle) about any line in its plane and external to it. Cf. #$RingShapedObject.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab7c3).
