x_comment(x_RoundObject,"A specialization of #$ShapedObject. Each instance of #$RoundObject is a tangible or intangible thing with an (at least nearly) round or elliptical shape in a least one dimension.  A round object might be one-dimensional (e.g. a ring that bounds a 2-D #$Circle), two-dimensional (e.g. an intangible #$Ellipse) or three-dimensional (e.g. a #$Sphere or a chicken egg). \n<p>\nOther specializations of #$RoundObject include #$Cone, #$Ball, #$Hemisphere, and #$RingShapedObject.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab7c6).
