x_comment(x_extensionParametersOfObject,"This predicate relates an object to its quantified extensions in space.  (#$extensionParametersOfObject OBJ DIST) means that DIST is a magnitude in which OBJ is extended in some spatial dimension.  When making assertions about a particular object use a more specific predicate whenever possible, e.g. #$heightOfObject, #$widthOfObject, #$diameterOfObject.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab7cb).
