x_comment(x_servingTypeOfFoodOrDrinkType,"An instance of #$StrictlyFunctionalPredicate. (#$servingTypeOfFoodOrDrinkType SERVING-TYPE FOOD-OR-DRINK-TYPE) identifies SERVING-TYPE as the collection of all complete servings of instances of FOOD-OR-DRINK-TYPE.  This is the predicate that corresponds to the function, #$FoodServingFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab7d6).
