x_comment(x_fullName,"(#$fullName X STRNG) means that #$Person X has the #$HumanNameString STRING as his or her complete name.  This includes #$firstName, #$lastName, and #$middleName or  #$middleNameInitial, but excludes titles.  Minimally, #$fullName should include a #$Person's #$firstName and #$lastName (or #$givenNames and #$HumanSurname).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab7ea).
