x_comment(x_culturallyConnectedToBeliefSystem,"An assertion of the form (#$culturallyConnectedToBeliefSystem PERSON SYSTEM) states that the #$IndividualAgent PERSON is a member of a community that is characterized by the #$BeliefSystem SYSTEM; however, PERSON has not necessarily adopted the belief system. As an example, #$GeorgeCarlin bears this relationship to #$Catholicism because of his upbringing.  However, he does not conform to the strictures imposed by the religion and, so, it would be inaccurate to say (#$hasBeliefSystems #$GeorgeCarlin #$Catholicism).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab7eb).
