x_comment(x_ConceptTypeByDomain,"Each instance of #$ConceptTypeByDomain is a collection, all of whose elements can be considered concepts which belong to some domain of knowledge.  For example, #$FamilyRelationsConcept is the collection that includes predicates, such as #$siblings or #$children, collections, such as #$FamilyCohabitationUnit, and potentially other concepts that are part of the domain of family relationships.  It is important to note that instances of #$ConceptTypeByDomain are not quoted collections -- i.e., their elements are not the _terms_ used to represent the concepts, but instead are the concepts themselves.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab7f0).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab7f0,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
