x_comment(x_StormyArea,"An instance of #$OutdoorLocationTypeByWeather and \na specialization of both #$CloudyArea and #$AdverseWeatherArea. Each instance of #$StormyArea is an #$OutdoorLocation that has moderate or heavy cloud cover and is undergoing moderate to heavy precipitation (in the form of rain, snow, sleet, or hail).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab80e).
