x_comment(x_Prairie,"A specialization of #$Grassland.  Each instance of #$Prairie is an area where long grasses are dominant.  Praires are found in central North America, eastern South Africa and the Pampas of Argentina.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab818).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab818,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
