x_comment(x_Savannah,"A specialization of #$Grassland.  Each instance of  #$Savannah is an area in which grasses are interspersed with scattered thorn bushes or deciduous trees.  Savannahs are found to the north and south of the #$TropicalRainForest regions of South America and central Africa and around the desert fringes of Australia.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab819).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab819,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
