xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517ab82a,[]).
x_comment(x_fertilityRateInOfDuring,"An assertion of the form (#$fertilityRateInOfDuring PLACE TYPE N DATE) states that measurements made of the population of the type of #$Organism-Whole TYPE in the #$GeographicalRegion REGION for the period of DATE indicate that the average number of offspring for that population is N. For example, (#$fertilityRateInOfDuring #$Syria #$FemaleHuman 2.3 (#$YearFn 2000)) would state that records indicate that the women of #$Syria have an average of 2.3 children during 2005.  This represents a measurement and estimate.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab82b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab82b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
