x_comment(x_PlaneFigure,"A specialization of #$GeometricFigure, #$TwoDimensionalGeometricThing, #$SurfaceRegion-Bounded, and #$FlatSurfaceRegion (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$PlaneFigure is an intangible, self-connected, bounded, two-dimensional, geometrical figure that can be embedded in a #$Plane.  Specializations of this collection include #$Polygon and #$CircularRegion.\n<p>\nNote that the boundary of a plane figure is <i>not</i> itself an instance of #$PlaneFigure, but is rather a <i>one</i>-dimensional, planar, closed curve (see e.g. #$Circle).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab842).
