x_comment(x_OneDimensionalGeometricThing,"A specialization of #$OneDimensionalThing, #$GeometricallyDescribableThing, and #$ShapedObject (qq.v.).   #$OneDimensionalGeometricThing is the collection of all one-dimensional, self-connected objects that can be described in relatively simple geometric terms.  Specializations of this collection include #$Line-Straight, #$LineSegment-Straight, #$Arc, and #$Ellipse.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab848).
