x_comment(x_totalDebtDuring,"A statement of the form (#$totalDebtDuring PLACE QUANTITY DATE) is used to give an estimate of the total debt  (borrowings minus repayments) of the government of the #$GeopoliticalEntity PLACE during the #$Date DATE.  For instance, (#$totalDebtDuring #$Syria (Dollar-UnitedStates 1.8E10) (#$YearFn 2005)) would state that during 2005, the Syrian government had a total debt of $18 billion.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab850).
