x_comment(x_Tube,"A specialization of #$SurfaceRegion (q.v.). Each instance of #$Tube is a hollow \"side\" surface of #$Cylinder.  They might be straight or curved lengthwise.  Examples include both tangible objects (such as pipes and hoses) and intangible tubular space regions.  \n<p>\nEach #$CylindricalSurface (q.v.) has a two-dimensional #$Tube as a part.  The surface of an infinitely long cylinder with no \"top\" or \"bottom\" just <i>is</i> an infinite #$Tube.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab851).
