x_comment(x_contentModelFocalPeg,"(#$contentModelFocalPeg MT PEG) identifies MT as the most general microtheory for recording discourse modelling information involving the instance PEG of #$LinguisticExpressionPeg-CompleteUtterance.  The content model for a peg is to be distinguished from its interpretation microtheories (c.f., pegInterpretationMts, #$pegPartialInterpretationMts), each of which sees (c.f., #$genlMt) the contents of the content model.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab854).
