x_comment(x_specificationProscribesSituationType,"The predicate #$specificationProscribesSituationType relates an instance of #$NormativeSpecification SPECIFICATION to a sub-collection of #$Situation.  An assertion of the form (#$specificationProscribesSituationType SPECIFICATION SIT-TYPE) states that the realization of an instance of SIT-TYPE runs counter to the content of SPECIFICATION and so, such a situation would violate SPECIFICATION.  This is a very general predicate.  A more specific form of this predicate is #$lawProscribesActType.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab86c).
