x_comment(x_CubicalSurface,"A specialization of #$RectangularParallelepipedSurface (q.v.).  Each instance of #$CubicalSurface is the two-dimensional, non-planar, unbounded surface of a #$Cube (q.v.); it is the spatial sum of six #$Squares that are edge-connected at right angles.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab886).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab886,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
