x_comment(x_PyramidalSurface,"A specialization of #$PolyhedralSurface (q.v.).  Each instance of #$PyramidalSurface is the two-dimensional, non-planar, unbounded surface of a #$Pyramid (q.v.); it is the spatial sum of an n-sided polygon that is its <i>base</i> with n-1 triangles that meet at a common vertex.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab888).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab888,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
