xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517ab89c,[]).
x_comment(x_ContentModelForPegFn,"(#$ContentModelForPegFn PEG) denotes the the most general microtheory in a microtheoretic structure for representing and reasoning about the possible interpretations of an utterance (or info-transfer, generally) for which PEG has been introduced.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab89d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab89d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
