x_comment(x_creationTemplateIndexicals,"<code>(#$creationTemplateIndexicals TEMPLATE TERM)</code> means that <code>TERM</code> is an indexical concept that appears in creation-template assertions (see #$creationTemplateAssertions) for the instance <code>TEMPLATE</code> of #$CycCreationTemplate and whose referent must be resolved by the relevant code (see #$creationTemplateForSubLFunction) before the assertion can be made.  Thus <code>TERM</code> is not a creation template FORT (see #$creationTemplateFORTs)</code> that is reified when the code is run, nor is <code>TERM</code> a term that will appear in any assertions that result from the running of the relevant code.  Rather, <code>TERM</code> will be resolved to the appropriate term and that term will appear in the relevant assertions.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab8ad).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab8ad,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
