x_comment(x_StorageTower,"A specialization of #$Tower and #$ContainerArtifact.\n#$StorageTowers are freestanding, fixed structures that are used to\nstore various types of materials. Notable specs include #$WaterTower\nand #$GrainSilo. This collection is #$disjointWith\n#$CommunicationTower, which are used primarily for supporting\ncommunications.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab8cb).
