x_comment(x_RepublicanGuard,"A specialization of #$GovernmentMilitaryOrganization.  Each instance of #$RepublicanGuard is a part or branch of a nation's military force, separate from its regular forces, whose main purpose is to protect the nation's government, leader, or top officals.\n<p>\nFor example, during #$SaddamHusseinAl-Takriti's presidency, the Iraqi Republican Guard Forces Command were considered a branch of #$Iraq's military.  #$France and #$Syria also have republican guards.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab8dc).
