x_comment(x_editionOfPeriodicalByDate,"A #$TernaryPredicate.  <code>(#$editionOfPeriodicalByDate SERIES DATE ISSUE)</code> means that <code>ISSUE</code> is the #$PeriodicalIssue of the #$PeriodicalSeries <code>SERIES</code> for the #$Date <code>DATE</code>.  This is the predicate corresponding to #$EditionFn (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab8eb).
