x_comment(x_OwlSemanticDataType,"#$OwlSemanticDataType is the collection of Owl data types.  The datatypes can be characterized in two ways -- (1) by the type of thing it is; e.g. a positive integer, (2) by the way it is denoted; e.g. positive integers that are denoted by instances of #$SubLPositiveInteger.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab8ef).
