x_comment(x_TreeStructuredOrganization,"A specialization of #$Organization.  Each instance of #$TreeStructuredOrganization is an organization whose members (see #$hasMembers) and/or sub-organizations (see #$subOrganizations) are arranged in a strict command hierarchy tree (see #$TreeOrganizationalChart), with a single organization member at the root of the tree who commands the entire organization.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab8f2).
