x_comment(x_ParamilitaryOrganization,"A specialization of #$MilitaryOrganization.  Each instance of #$ParamilitaryOrganization is an organization formed according to a military structure, but not as a part of any mainstream military force.  Paramilitary organizations sometimes operate as auxiliaries to or in place of mainstream military forces (e.g. as border patrols or police units), but generally they operate independently of any government or national allegiance, often with loyalty to some political program or party.  \n<p>\nExamples of #$ParamilitaryOrganizations include the #$MilitiaOfMontana and the Ulster Defence Association (UDA), the Protestant militant group operating in Northern Ireland.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab8f8).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab8f8,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517ab8f8,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
