x_comment(x_DeliberatelyTouchingSomething,"In each instance of #$DeliberatelyTouchingSomething, the salient\ntouching (cf., #$PhysicalContactEvent) is a deliberate action on the\npart of at least one agent.  The following will both be\ntrue of that agent: (#$performedBy TOUCH AGT) and  (#$objectsInContact TOUCH AGT). \nIn cases in which two or more agents are in\nphysical contact (#$objectsInMutualContact, qv.), it is sufficient for the touching to be deliberate \nif just one participant is\nacting deliberately. E.g. if AGT1 grasps the hand of AGT2, this\ngrasping is an instance of #$DeliberatelyTouchingSomething, even if AGT2 is not\nparticipating voluntarily.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab8fa).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab8fa,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
