x_comment(x_Militia,"A specialization of #$ParamilitaryOrganization.  Each instance of #$Militia is a non-governmental military force.  Many #$Militias consider themselves patriotic; but they are often viewed with suspicion (and may be considered terrorist groups) by the government and the general citizenry.\n<p>\nNote that this collection reflects a different sense of <i>militia</i> than that sometimes used to describe certain auxilliary governmental military organizations, such as #$NationalGuardOrganizations.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab905).
