x_comment('x_UnifiedCombatantCommand-US',"A specialization of #$UnitedStatesMilitaryOrganization.  Each instance of #$UnifiedCombatantCommand-US is a US military organization composed of forces from two or more branches of service (see #$BranchOfMilitaryService) that has a broad and continuing mission.  Typically, a unified combatant command has operational control of the US combat forces within a particular geogaphical region.  Instances include #$US-PacificCommand-HonoluluHI.\n<p>\nSee also #$DefenseLINKMt.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab912).
