x_comment(x_formulaForStringPertinentToDegreeFromFolderOfType,"An assertion of the form (#$formulaForStringPertinentToDegreeFromFolderOfType STRING FORMULA DEGREE FOLDER-TYPE) states that the #$CharacterString STRING would translate into the #$CycLSentence-Askable FORMULA and be interpreted to have the #$Relevance DEGREE within the context of the activity type that is supported by the contents of instances of FOLDER-TYPE, a sub-collection of #$KEInteractionFolder.  For instance, (#$formulaForStringPertinentToDegreeFromFolderOfType \"When was Arafat born?\" (#$birthDate #$YassirArafat ?DATE) (#$HighAmountFn #$Relevance) #$FolderWithIntelligenceQueriesForSuggestion) would state that the string \"When was Arafat born?\" would be translated to the #$CycLSentence-Askable (#$birthDate #$YassirArafat DATE) and been deemed to have a high amount of relevance relative to queries that are stored in instances of #$KEInteractionFolder that are also instances of #$FolderWithIntelligenceQueriesForSuggestion.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab91d).
