x_comment('x_Fleet-MilitaryEchelon',"A #$MilitaryUnitTypeByEchelon and a specialization of #$ModernMilitaryUnit-Deployable.  #$Fleet-MilitaryEchelon is an instance of #$USNavyEchelon.  As a rule, fleets are composed of several large navy units equipped with sizeable #$ModernNavalShips.  In most country's orders-of-battle, fleets are commanded by admirals (see #$Admiral-Rank).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab948).
