x_comment(x_fontStyleFormat,"<code>(#$fontStyleFormat FONT FORMAT)</code> means that the instance <code>FONT</code> of #$FontTypeByStyle is the collection of characters (see #$Character-Abstract), strings formed from which are all formatted in the instance <code>FORMAT</code> of #$GraphicalStructureByFormat. <p>For example, <code>(#$fontStyleFormat #$BoldedCharacter #$BoldfacedFormat)</code> means that all bolded character strings are structures with a boldfaced format.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab94e).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab94e,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
