x_comment(x_markupTagIndicatesFontStyle,"<code>(#$markupTagIndicatesFontStyle TAG FONT)</code> means that the markup language tag <code>TAG</code> is used to indicate that the characters that comprise the tagged string are to be rendered as  <code>FONT</code> characters.<p>For example,\n<code>(#$markupTagIndicatesFontStyle #$I-HTMLTag #$ItalicizedCharacter)</code> means that the occurrence of \"i\" HTML tags around a string indicate that the characters that comprise that string to be rendered in italics.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab94f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab94f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
