x_comment(x_expectedTenureInUnitPosition,"(#$expectedTenureInUnitPosition COUNTRY BOS ECHELON POSITION DURATION) means that an agent who holds POSITION in a military unit of the branch-of-service BOS with #$sovereignAllegianceOfOrg COUNTRY and #$echelonOfUnit ECHELON is expected to hold that position for DURATION.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab95b).
