x_comment(x_IrregularForcesFn,"#$IrregularForcesFn is a unary collection-denoting function that maps a    given collection of the appropriate type to a certain specialization of that   collection.  More precisely: for any specialization BRANCH of #$MilitaryOrganization,   (#$IrregularForcesFn BRANCH) is the specialization IRREG of BRANCH such that   IRREG is the collection of all instances of #$IrregularMilitaryForce that are of   the type BRANCH.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab95c).
