x_comment(x_hyperlinkTo,"<code>(#$hyperlinkTo LINK AIS)</code> means that the instance <code>LINK</code> of #$Hyperlink is a link to the instance <code>AIS</code> of #$AbstractInformationStructure.  Note that though it is an instance of #$FunctionalSlot, #$hyperlinkTo is not <i>strictly</i> functional (c.f., #$StrictlyFunctionalSlot); two distinct arg2 values <code>AIS-1</code> and <code>AIS-2</code> can hold for a given arg1 value just in case one of those values is a sub-structure of the other: <code>(#$or (#$subInfoStructures AIS-1 AIS-2) (#$subInfoStructures AIS-2 AIS-1))</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab95e).
