x_comment('x_Face-SocialStanding',"A specialization of\n#$InterAgentQuantity. #$Face-SocialStanding is the collection of\namounts of 'face' that agents possess in various social\ncontexts. AGENT's 'face' is, roughly, a kind of esteem accorded to him\nby others, especially as regards his suitability to perform his\nassigned social roles. In many collectivist cultures, ensuring that\npersons maintain 'face' in social interactions is a central value, one\nthat underlies many behavioral norms. The concept is most often\ninvoked in US culture in references to 'saving' or 'losing' face.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab96d).
