x_comment('x_decreasesStatus-RoleInSitTypeWithRelationToSitType',"(#$decreasesStatus-RoleInSitTypeWithRelationToSitType relates\ncertain types of event sequences to certain types of social\nconsequences.  (#$decreasesStatus-RoleInSitTypeWithRelationToSitType ROLE\nSIT-TYPE SIT-RELATION RELATED-TYPE QUANTITY) means that, if an\ninstance of SIT-TYPE (INS-SIT-TYPE) and an instance of RELATED-TYPE\n(INS-RELATED-TYPE) are related by SIT-RELATION -- i.e., if\n(SIT-RELATION INS-SIT-TYPE INS-RELATED-TYPE) holds -- then the\nagent playing ROLE in INS-SIT-TYPE will suffer a decrease in the\n#$SocialQuantity QUANTITY.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab977).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ab977,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
