x_comment(x_supplyFromAmount,"(#$supplyFromAmount PT1 COL PT2 AMOUNT)\nmeans that the ScalarInterval AMOUNT is a measure of the amount of\ninstances of the Collection COL with which the instance of\nPartiallyTangible PT1 is supplied from the instance of\nPartiallyTangible PT2.  Like the predicate #$suppliedWith (q.v.), #$supplyFromAmount is very general. In various assertions PT1 might, for instance, be a #$Cell, a #$Person, a #$Business, or a #$GeographicalRegion; and likewise for PT2. The range of possible supplies is similarly broad.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab9c1).
