x_comment('x_Stalking-CriminalAct',"A specialization of #$CriminalAct. Each instance of #$Stalking-CriminalAct is a complex event consisting of repeated actions (such as repeatedly maintaining unwanted physical proximity to the victim, or repeatedly making verbal or written threats to the victim) by a stalker directed at a specific victim.   In order to constitute criminal stalking, the actions in question must induce in the victim fear of death or bodily injury to herself or to a member of her immediate family, this fear must be a reasonable response to those actions, and the stalker must (or should) know that his actions will produce that response in the victim.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab9df).
