x_comment(x_allotmentApproximateDuration,"An assertion of the form #$allotmentApproximateDuration  ALLOT QUANT) is used to represent an <b>approximation</b> of the duration of the interval for which the #$Allotment ALLOT is supposed to hold (as specified with an #$allotmentForInterval assertion).  For the sake of completing the calculations, it smooths over indeterminate points during intervals. For the sake of efficiency, it ignores some of the special cases involving the month #$February. This is intended to help inference in cases where allotments have complex time intervals.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ab9f9).
