x_comment(x_ThreeDimensionalCoordinateSystem,"A specialization of #$CoordinateSystem (q.v.).  Each instance of #$ThreeDimensionalCoordinateSystem is a frame of reference for specifying the locations of spatial things in a three-dimensional space.  Typically, such a system will have three coordinate-value predicates associated with it (see #$coordinateValuePredicateOfSystem).  A three-dimensional coordinate system might be a #$CartesianCoordinateSystem or a #$PolarCoordinateSystem (qq.v.).  \n<p>\nCf. #$TwoDimensionalCoordinateSystem.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aba07).
