x_comment(x_CriminalLaw,"A sub-collection of #$Law.  Each instance of #$CriminalLaw represents a particular law that restricts the performance of certain types of #$Action.  The performance of instances of those types of #$Action are considered #$CriminalActs and the #$maleficiary of those acts is either the #$Government or population of the region in which the event occurred. #$CriminalAct is the subcollection of #$IllegalAction in which the #$obligationsViolated is an instance of #$CriminalLaw.  Contrast with #$CivilLaw.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aba3b).
