x_comment(x_HavingGoneMissing,"A sub-collection of #$Situation.  Each instance of #$HavingGoneMissing is a situation where some #$SomethingExisting plays the role of #$missingIndividual such that the none of the places where the entity <i>should</i> be are occupied by the entity in the  #$missingIndividual role.  The existence of an instance of #$HavingGoneMissing is importantly related to the beliefs of individuals who have some interest in the entity that fills the #$missingIndividual role, especially since it is from those beliefs that the normative location is fixed.  However, instances of this collection only refer to the actual state of having moved from that location.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aba42).
