x_comment(x_UnitOfMeasureConcept,"A #$ConceptTypeByDomain (q.v.).  Instances of #$UnitOfMeasureConcept are collections and relations having to do with unit of measurement functions and the kinds of quantities they return as values.  Important specializations and instances of #$UnitOfMeasure, major specializations or #$ScalarInterval, and relations that are important to measurement theory are instances of this collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aba53).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aba53,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
