x_comment(x_postureConnotesFeelingToward,"(#$postureConnotesFeelingToward POSTURE FEELING THING) means\nthat POSTURE, an instance of #$Posture-Configuration, in some way communicates FEELING\ntoward THING.  More precisely, POSTURE communicates that the animal who is\n'in' POSTURE (see #$animalInPosture) has \nFEELING towards THING.  Note that it is possible that ANIMAL neither\nhas nor wishes to communicate such a feeling, but her being in POSTURE\nnevertheless suggests this.  For example, there are a number of bodily\npostures that, in Arab cultures, communicate a lack of #$Respect towards\nthe person to whom one is speaking.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aba54).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517aba54,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
