x_comment(x_termInSentenceOfQuerySpecificationOfType,"<code>(#$termInSentenceOfQuerySpecificationOfType TERM Q-SPEC FOLDER-TYPE)</code> means that the #$CycLTerm '<code>TERM</code>' occurs in the #$InferenceSentenceParameter '<code>SENTENCE</code>' associated with <code>Q-SPEC</code> (an instance of #$CycLQuerySpecification), where <code>Q-SPEC</code> is the query specification for a template that is a resource contained in <code>FOLDER-TYPE</code> (a specialization of #$KEInteractionFolder).") :- x_cid(a65b16517aba56).
