x_comment(x_testHasSentenceAndMtOnlyVersion,"An instance of #$StrictlyFunctionalPredicate and a specialization of #$genlKBContentTests. (#$testHasSentenceAndMtOnlyVersion KBCT-FS KBCT-SMO) means that the query specification for the #$KBContentTest-QuerySentenceAndMicrotheoryOnly KBCT-SMO has only the inference sentence and inference microtheory parameters specified, and these parameters are the same as those in the query specification for the #$KBContentTest-FullySpecified KBCT-FS (which also has other inference parameters specified). See also the function #$SentenceAndMtOnlyVersionOfTestFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aba5c).
