x_comment(x_LocalRoad,"A specialization of #$Roadway.  Each instance of #$LocalRoad\nis typically one lane with two-way traffic, frequent stops, and slow \ntravel.   #$LocalRoads tend to be short with a small volume of traffic.  \nMost streets - especially those in neighborhoods - are #$LocalRoads.") :- x_cid(a65b16517aba6c).
