x_comment('x_USHighwayRoute-Major',"A specialization of #$Freeway and #$USHighwayRoute.  Most \ninstances of #$USHighwayRoute-Major have controlled-access and \nmultiple lanes either way.  #$USHighwayRoute-Major typically either  \nruns for a long distance or connects major cities.  Route 66 is a famous \nexample; it extends 2448 miles and connects Chicago to Santa Monica, \nCalifornia.  #$USInterstateSystemRoute is \nan important specialization.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abae6).
