x_comment('x_StateRoute-Major',"A specialization of #$StateRoute and #$ArterialRoad.  Instances\nof #$StateRoute-Major are multi-laned and may extend many miles, but \nthey lack controlled-access in certain parts, especially via towns or\ncities.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abaeb).
