x_comment(x_AlternateRoute,"A specialization of #$Roadway.  An instance of #$AlternateRoute\nis a route that separates from a main route and returns to the \nmain route at a later point.  The #$AlternateRoute is often longer \nand of less construction quality as the main route.  The purpose of the \nalternate route is often to relieve congestion from the main route.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abaed).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abaed,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
