x_comment(x_BusinessRoute,"A specialization of #$CollectorRoad.  An instance of \n#$BusinessRoute is a route that separates from the main route in \norder to detour through the commerical district of a town or city. \nAfter passing through the commerical district, the business route\nreconnects to the main route.  The business route usually has easy \naccess to the surrounding stores and properties and several traffic\nstops.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abaee).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abaee,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
