x_comment(x_associates,"A specialization of #$affiliatedWith.  (#$associates AGT1 AGT2) holds just in case AGT1 and AGT2 have a certain sort of ongoing affiliation with each other.  In almost all cases, this is some sort of professional, organizational, or business relationship.  For instance, two individuals who are on the same committee in a particular charitiable organization may be considered associates if they interact sufficiently within the scope of their committee work.  Being members of the same organization is neither necessary nor sufficient for this relation to hold.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abb01).
