x_comment('x_LinguisticObject-NoParseAvailable',"A specialization of #$LinguisticObject.  Instances are objects that correspond to instances of #$TextString (either by being an actual text-string or by being a peg that stands for a contexualized text-string occurrence, as in a discourse model) for which it is known that there are no NL-to-CycL parsing methods that will produce a CycL interpretation.  As such, this is an instance of #$TimeDependentCollection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abb02).
