x_comment(x_CavityInteriorRegionFn,"A unary function that takes a tangible object to the sum of its interior spaces.  More precisely, <code>(#$CavityInteriorRegionFn OBJECT)</code> is the (possibly discontinuous) spatial sum of the interiors (see #$CavityInteriorRegion) of any #$Cavity[ies] (e.g. chambers, passages, pockets, bubbles, etc.) that occur inside of <code>OBJECT</code>.  Note that this does not include the walls of the cavities, just the interior space itself.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abb31).
