x_comment('x_EntireExternalSurface-Tangible',"A specialization of #$SurfaceRegion-Tangible and  #$SurfaceRegion-Finite.  This is the collection of all entire outer physical surfaces of tangible objects.  It this excludes mere patches or portions of the whole surface of an object.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abb48).
