x_comment(x_SemanticInterpretationHypothesisMicrotheory,"A specialization of #$HypotheticalContext.  Instances are microtheories that contain the assertions purporting to identify the correct interpretation of an instance of #$LinguisticExpressionPeg.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abb4d).
