x_comment(x_pcwInformationAbout,"(#$pcwInformationAbout <b>PCW</b> <b>TOPIC</b>\n<b>ABOUT-MT</b>) means that the expressions contained in\n<b>ABOUT-MT</b> capture the portion of the propositional content of\n<b>PCW</b> that is focally 'about' <b>TOPIC</b> (in the sense of the\npredicate #$containsInformationAbout-Focally, qv.).") :- x_cid(a65b16517abb5b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abb5b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
