x_comment(x_surfaceFeatureOfSurface,"A specialization of both #$surfaceFeatureOfObject and #$isa.  <code>(#$surfaceFeatureOfSurface SURFACE FEATURE)</code> means that the #$SurfaceRegion-Tangible <code>SURFACE</code> has the surface feature represented by the #$ObjectTypeBySurfaceFeature <code>FEATURE</code> over most or all of its external surface area.  Note that a given surface might have more than one such surface feature at the same time.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abb5e).
