x_comment('x_substring-CaseInsensitive',"<code>(#$substring-CaseInsensitive SUBSTRING STRING)</code> means that the <code>#$CharacterString SUBSTRING</code> is a substring of the <code>#$CharacterString STRING</code> with case ignored in both <code>SUBSTRING</code> and <code>STRING</code>. For case-sensitive tagging use the more specialized predicate, <code>#$substring</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abb6a).
