x_comment(x_techniqueAppliesNumericQuantifier,"<code>(#$techniqueAppliesNumericQuantifier TECHNIQUE QUANTIFIER)</code> means that the instance <code>TECHNIQUE</code> of #$TechniqueType is a collection of applications of <code>QUANTIFIER</code>, an instance of #$NumericQuantifier.  For example, <code>(#$techniqueAppliesNumericQuantifier #$DeterminingAMean #$Average)</code> means that #$DeterminingAMean is a problem-solving technique, instances of which are applications of the #$Average function against some set and function.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abb73).
