x_comment(x_viableProposedCoreferentInUDS,"(#$viableProposedCoreferentInUDS UDS PEG1 PEG2) means that PEG2 is a\npossible antecedent for PEG1 in the discourse structure UDS: more\nprecisely, (i) PEG1 is a discourse anaphor in UDS (cf. #$anaphoricDiscourseReferentInUDS), (ii) PEG2 is an available referent marker in UDS \n(cf. #$availableCoreferentInUDS), and (iii) PEG2 has not been\nexcluded by other semantic or syntactic constraints.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abbbb).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abbbb,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517abbbb,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
xc_source_line(a65b16517abbbb,17131).
