xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517abbc3,[]).
x_comment(x_DiscourseStructureBinaryRole,"The collection of binary predicates used to characterize\ndiscourse properties of instances of #$UnitDiscourseStructure (q.v.):\ncorresponding utterance, accessible (super-ordinate) discourse structures,\nnewly introduced pegs (cf. #$DiscourseReferentMarkers), etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abbc4).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abbc4,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
