x_comment(x_orgHasKeyIndividualMembers,"An assertion of the form (#$orgHasKeyIndividualMembers ORG PERSON) means that the #$Person PERSON is a member of the #$Organization ORG and that PERSON plays a significant role in guiding or implementing the actions of ORG.  Important specializations of this predicate include #$companyHasCEO, #$seniorExecutives, #$primeMinister.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abbcd).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abbcd,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
