x_comment(x_EtiquetteNorm,"An #$EtiquetteNorm is an individual rule of etiquette, i.e.,\na particular requirement on social conduct that is part of\nthe system of manners and social obligations within some culture (see\n#$cultureCodeOfEtiquette).  Note that some #$EtiquetteNorms are accepted by multiple cultures or groups, and so, belong to multiple systems of etiquette. To relate\nan instance of #$EtiquetteNorm to such a system, use\n#$subObligations.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abbd1).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abbd1,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
