x_comment(x_playsRoleTypicalOf,"(#$playsRoleTypicalOf OBJ OBJ-TYPE EVENT) means that, in a particular \ninstance of Event EVENT, one would usually expect an instance of \nOBJ-TYPE to play an instrumental role.  In this particular event, however,\nthat role is being played by OBJ, an object of another type.  For instance, (playsRoleTypicalOf JimsScalpel CarvingKnife CuttingTheTurkeyAtThanksgiving2000) means that there is some role in that particular #$CuttingAPieceOfFood event that one would expect to be played by a carving knife, but in this case that role is being played by Jim's scalpel.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abc02).
