x_comment(x_NaturalElevation,"A sub-collection of #$LandTopographicalFeature. Each instance is a raised or elevated geological formation.  Each instance is an area that has a greater elevation than the surrounding area, and thus includes more elevated parts of a whole, such as #$Summit and #$RidgeLine-Topographical.  The more specialized collection, #$VerticalProtrusion-Topographical, should be used for types of elevated areas that are in some sense whole, e.g., #$Hill or #$Mountain.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abc07).
