x_comment(x_MilitaryAirfield,"The collection of all military airfields. Similar to instances of its superset #$Airport-Physical, all #$MilitaryAirfields have a runway where airplanes take off and land. They generally also contain buildings for the military personnel that operate the military airplanes that are stationed at the airfield.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abc1a).
