x_comment(x_VeryHot,"#$VeryHot is a generic temperature quantity that corresponds to very #$Hot temperatures. Such temperatures are typically unpleasant to experience, and may be dangerous for animals exposed to them for long periods of time.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abc39).
