x_comment(x_BitterlyCold,"#$BitterlyCold is a generic temperature value that corresponds to temperatures that are extremely, or bitterly, #$Cold. Such temperatures are lower than #$VeryCold temperatures and exposure to them for long periods of time can be dangerous for animals.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abc3c).
