x_comment(x_ExpressionTypeByAgreementFeature,"The collection of specializations of #$LinguisticExpressionPeg whose instances share a common agreement feature (e.g., such as being singular or mass number).  Each instance of #$ExpressionTypeByAgreementFeature stands in the #$expressionTypeAgreementPredicate relation to some instance of #$TermPhrasesConstraintPredicate.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abc47).
