x_comment(x_ExpressionTypeWithAgreementPredicateFn,"<code>(#$ExpressionTypeWithAgreementPredicateFn PRED)</code> denotes the instance of #$ExpressionTypeByNumber whose instances are expressions introduced into a discourse or text-interpretation context by an instance of #$NLPhrase with the agreement property (such as being singular or plural) indicated by PRED.<p>For example, <code>(#$ExpressionTypeWithAgreementPredicateFn #$massNumber)</code> is the collection of mass number expressions -- i.e., pegs that mark the occurrence of a mass number phrase, such as \"pizza.\"") :- x_cid(a65b16517abc48).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abc48,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
