x_comment(x_ManufacturingRun,"A #$ManufacturingRun is a single iteration of a process that intentionally produces a stream of products.  A #$ManufacturingRun may consist of several steps, each of which is typically a #$Manufacturing.  A #$ManufacturingRun does not include ancillary events associated with the manufacturing, such as collection of materials, disposal of waste, or quality control inspection of the product.  Those other events are sibling #$subEvents of the #$ManufacturingRun, within a #$ProductionEvent.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abc55).
