x_comment(x_cisContainsStructure,"<code>(#$cisContainsStructure CIS STRUCTURE)</code> means that the instance <code>CIS</code> of #$ContextualizedInformationStructure contains (has a sub-structure (see #$subStructures) <code>STRUCTURE</code>, an instance of #$AbstractStructure.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abc5d).
