x_comment(x_WellGradedSoilRegion,"A specialization of #$CoarseGrainedWithoutFinesSoilRegion. #$WellGradedSoilRegion is the collection of #$GeographicalRegions where the soil consists of many different particle sizes and contains little or no fines. Well-graded soil is designated by the secondary letter of (W) in the #$UnifiedSoilClassificationSystem.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abc7f).
