x_comment(x_CoarseGrainedWithFinesSoilRegion,"A specialization of #$CoarseGrainedSoilRegion. #$CoarseGrainedWithFinesSoilRegion is the collection of #$GeographicalRegions where the soil consists of gravel or sand with 5% or more of fines. In other words, coarse-grained soil that is intermixed with silt, clay, or both.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abc80).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abc80,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
