x_comment(x_CoarseGrainedWithoutFinesSoilRegion,"A specialization of #$CoarseGrainedSoilRegion. #$CoarseGrainedWithoutFinesSoilRegion is the collection of #$GeographicalRegions where the soil consists of 5% or less fines (clay or silt). Sometimes soil with this quality is referred to as 'clean soil.'") :- x_cid(a65b16517abc8a).
