x_comment(x_RubbleStrewnArea,"A specialization of #$GeographicalRegion.  Each instance of #$RubbleStrewnArea is a region strewn with the remains of\n#$ConstructionArtifacts, to the extent that progress over the\nterrain might be slowed for the average person or vehicle.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abca8).
