x_comment(x_HighMountainousRegion,"A specialization of #$GeographicalRegion. Each instance of #$HighMountainousRegion is a region on the upper slopes of mountains at mid- and high-altitude.  Instances have little plant growth apart from mosses and lichens.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abcb2).
