x_comment(x_ratingConeIndex,"A #$TernaryPredicate that expresses the rating cone index of a soil type at a given degree of wetness. (#$ratingConeIndex SOIL-TYPE WETNESS INDEX) means that SOIL-TYPE has a rating cone index of INDEX when it has the degree of wetness WETNESS. The rating cone index of a soil type is an indicator of its trafficability. See also #$vehicleConeIndex.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abcb3).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abcb3,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
