x_comment('x_terrainFeatures-Soil',"A #$BinaryPredicate that holds between a #$GeographicalRegion and its dominant soil type. (#$terrainFeatures-Soil REGION SOIL-TYPE) means that #$GeographicalRegion REGION is an instance of the #$RegionTypeBySoilType SOIL-TYPE. For example, (#$terrainFeatures-Soil #$GreatSandyDesert #$SandySoilRegion) means that the Great Sandy Desert is a sandy soil region.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abcb5).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abcb5,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
