x_comment(x_vehicleTypeForTerrainType,"A #$BinaryPredicate that holds between types of vehicles and the types of terrain where they are suitable for travel. (#$vehicleTypeForTerrainType VEHICLE-TYPE TERRAIN-TYPE) means that some specialization of #$LandTransportationDevice VEHICLE-TYPE is suitable for travel over the specialization of #$RegionTypeByTerrain TERRAIN-TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abcb6).
