x_comment(x_ConvertingASpecificationToAnAIS,"The collection of all events in which an agent's knowledge of some #$Specification is used to generate an #$AbstractInformationStructure for some work that is motivated by the content of that specification.  For example, an instance of #$InformationNeed can lead to the generation of instances of #$TextString for use with a #$SearchEngine.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abcbf).
