x_comment(x_ObjectTypeBySurfaceFeature,"A second-order collection and a specialization of #$PartiallyTangibleTypeByPhysicalFeature (q.v.).  Each instance of #$ObjectTypeBySurfaceFeature is a collection of objects that share a particular surface feature.  Thus, these collections represent various surface properties of objects.  Instances include #$Slippery, #$Paved, and #$Imprinted.  To state that an object has a particular surface feature, use #$surfaceFeatureOfObject.  To state that the surface itself is of a certain sort, use #$surfaceFeatureOfSurface.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abcc2).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abcc2,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
