x_comment(x_dependsOn,"(#$dependsOn SET DEP-SLOT INDEP-SLOT) means that the values for DEP-SLOT are either positively or negatively dependent on\nthe values for INDEP-SLOT, for elements of SET.  Unlike the more\ngeneral #$correlatedWith (q.v.), #$dependsOn means that there is some\ncausal link from INDEP-SLOT affecting DEP-SLOT.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abcec).
