x_comment(x_pegDerivedSemanticInterpretationMts,"<code> (#$pegDerivedSemanticInterpretationMts PEG MT)</code> means that the #$Microtheory <b>MT</b> holds a semantic interpretation (call this interpretation <b>I</b>) of the instance <b>PEG</b> of #$LinguisticExpressionPeg, such that 1) there exists some other interpretation of <b>PEG</b>, call it <b>I2</b>, that entails <b>I</b> and, 2) <b>I</b> is true in the content model (see #$contentModelFocalPeg) of <b>PEG</b>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abced).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abced,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
