x_comment(x_considerSpecializing,"An instance of DocumentationPredicate that indicates a need for work that will improve KB hygiene and reduce one aspect of KB incompleteness. (considerSpecializing SPEC-COLL TOO-GENL-COLL) means that '(genls SPEC-COLL TOO-GENL-COLL)' is currently asserted, and that there either exists or should exist some collection LESS-GENL-COLL such that: 1) (genls SPEC-COLL LESS-GENL-COLL) is true and 2) the assertion (genls SPEC-COLL TOO-GENL-COLL) should be replaced in the KB with (genls SPEC-COLL LESS-GENL-COLL).") :- x_cid(a65b16517abcf2).
