x_comment(x_Tundra,"A specialization of #$PermaFrostRegion and #$Plain-Topographical. Each #$Tundra is a treeless plain characterized by year-round low temerature and a short growing season. The subsoil of #$Tundra is permafrost. Vegetation is predominantly grasses, mosses, lichens, rushes, and very few other forms of plant life.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abd25).
