x_comment(x_WoodedArea,"A specialization of #$GeographicalRegion. Each #$WoodedArea is a place with a lot of trees. Some wooded areas are in inhabitated regions. Some are not. For example, the area to the west of #$CycorpCorporateHeadquarters is a wooded area that is adjacent to `civilized' areas. #$Forests, on the other hand, are #$WoodedAreas that are large expanses most of which are very far from any civilized region.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abd27).
