x_comment(x_LSCOMObjectAndSituationOntology,"An instance of #$Ontology.  The LSCOM object and situation ontology is, at its most general level, an ontology of specializations of #$TemporallyExistingThing, with each concept in the ontology serving as the basis of the LSCOM Visual IBT ontology (#$LSCOMVisualIBTOntology), an ontology of specializations of #$VisualInformationBearingThing, nodes in which are defined in terms of various relations to nodes in this ontology.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abd34).
