x_comment(x_Taxonomy,"The collection of all taxonomic systems.  A taxonomy minimally includes a description of a domain along class/subclass lines (see #$ClassSubclassHierarchy), but can also include other binary relations (e.g., partonomic relations) in its description.  A taxonomy can be usefully contrasted with an ontology (see #$Ontology), the latter of which includes a rich description of a domain, often including non-binary relations and complex rules.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abd3d).
