x_comment(x_computerProcessAlgorithms,"A binary predicate that relates computer processes to the #$Algorithms (q.v.) followed via those processes.  <code>(#$computerProcessAlgorithms PROCESS ALGORITHM)</code> means that <code>PROCESS</code> involves carrying out <code>ALGORITHM</code> on one or more inputs.  \n<p>\nFor a specialization of this predicate that relates a computer process to the \"maximal\" algorithm followed via that process, see #$computerProcessMaxAlgorithm.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abd5b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abd5b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
