x_comment(x_considerMerging,"An instance of #$DocumentationPredicate that indicates a need for work that will improve KB hygiene. (#$considerMerging COLL-1 COLL-2) means that COLL-1 should possibly be merged onto COLL-2. Rules which generate taxonomies from KB content assumes the merge consideration to be correct. Accordingly, a forward rule asserts (#$taxonomyUseTermForTerm TAXONOMY COLL-2 COLL-1) for every taxonomy for which (nodeInSystem COLL-1 TAXONOMY) or (nodeInSystem COLL-2 TAXONOMY) is true. This is, in turn, used by taxonomy display functions to combine the terms in output and look to COLL-2 for lexification.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abd77).
