x_comment(x_InvitedDiningAtResidence,"A subcollection of #$SocialGatheringAtResidence.  In each\ninstance of #$InvitedDiningAtResidence, the focal sub-event is a meal\nprovided for the guest or guests (#$guestAtSocialGathering, qv.) by\nthe host.  Typically, the guest and host share the meal, often with\nothers (e.g., family members of the host).  It is also typical for the\nmeal to have been prepared by the host and/or some of her close\nassociates (family, roomates, servants), though it is possible for the\nmeal to be catered.  In some instances of #$InvitedDiningAtResidence,\nguests contribute to the meal in minor ways, e.g., by bringing side\ndishes they purchased or prepared.  But a true 'pot-luck' dinner would\nnot be an instance of #$InvitedDiningAtResidence.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abda4).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abda4,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
