x_comment(x_Boat,"The collection of boats -- surface watercraft (see  #$Watercraft-Surface) consisting of a hull (see #$Hull) and with some (at least intended) method of propulsion, such as a mast-and-sail rigging, an attached motor, or (the in-prinicple availability of) oars or paddles.  Boats are distinguished from instances of #$Ship by size (\"a boat can fit on a ship, but not vice versa,\" the saying goes) or convention (e.g., a sailing vessel with three or more masts is typically considered a ship, whereas one with fewer than three is considered a boat).") :- x_cid(a65b16517abdb3).
