x_comment(x_NumericIntervalSlot,"A specialization of #$ScalarIntervalSlot (q.v.).  Each instance of #$NumericIntervalSlot is a binary predicate that is used to attribute a property to a thing, by relating it to a #$NumericInterval of some sort, typically a #$RealNumber.\n<p>\nExamples of #$NumericIntervalSlot include #$pulseRate, #$bloodAlcoholContent, and #$iQ.\n<p>\nSee also #$MeasurableQuantitySlot.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abddb).
