x_comment(x_gamePlayingType,"<code>(gamePlayingType GAME ACTIVITY-TYPE)</code> identifies <code>ACTIVITY-TYPE</code> as the collection of instances of #$PlayingAGame in which the game being played (see #$Game) is <code>GAME</code>.  For example, <code>(#$gamePlayingType #$Cricket-TheGame (#$PlayingFn #$Cricket-TheGame))</code> means that <code>(#$PlayingFn #$Cricket-TheGame)</code> is the collection of events in which people are playing cricket.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abde0).
