x_comment(x_resultGenlWhenArgIsa,"<code>(#$resultGenlWhenArgIsa FN COLL NUM TYPE)</code> means that when the <code>NUM</code>th argument to a well-formed application of the function <code>FN</code> is an instance of the collection <code>TYPE</code>, that application of <code>FN</code> will denote a subcollection of <code>COLL</code>.  <p>For example, <code>(#$resultGenlWhenArgIsa #$FlagFn #$NationalFlag 1 #$Country)</code> means that any expression of the form <code>(#$FlagFn AGENT)</code> will denote a subcollection of #$NationalFlag if <code>(#$isa AGENT #$Country)</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abde2).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abde2,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
