x_comment(x_relatives,"A symmetric binary predicate that relates organisms (see #$Organism-Whole).  <code>(#$relatives ORGANISM1 ORGANISM2)</code> means that <code>ORGANISM1</code> is a relative of <code>ORGANISM2</code>.  In the case of organisms other than humans, a #$relatives relationship is established only via reproduction (sexual or asexual); see the specialization #$biologicalRelatives.  In the case of humans, however, a #$relatives relationship can be established also via certain social arrangements, such as #$Adoption, marriage, or fostering.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abdef).
