x_comment('x_performsActsOfType-Percentage',"(#$performsActsOfType-Percentage AGENT ACTION-TYPE-1 ACTION-TYPE-2 PERCENT) holds just in case the percentage of the instances of ACTION-TYPE-1 that AGENT is known by Cyc to perform that are also instances of ACTION-TYPE-2 is PERCENT.  For instance, if 40% of the instances of #$TerroristAttack that Hamas is known to perform are also instances of #$Bombing, then (#$performsActsOfType-Percentage #$TerroristOrganization-Hamas #$TerroristAttack #$Bombing 40) holds.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abdf1).
