x_comment(x_FullAngularDistance,"#$FullAngularDistance is the collection of all #$AngularDistances that are exactly equal to 360 degrees. In fact, this collection consists of exactly one member, <code>(#$Degree-UnitOfAngularMeasure 360)</code>, however it is valuable to create the single member collection so that we have specs of #$AngularDistance that correspond to the well established divisions of angular measures in geometry (acute, right, obtuse, straight, reflex, and full angles), and to serve as argument constraints on angle relating predicates, such as #$supplementaryAngles.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abe0f).
