x_comment(x_ReflexAngleFn,"If <code>ANGLE</code> is an #$AngularDistance that is greater than or equal to <code>(#$Degree-UnitOfAngularMeasure 0)</code> and less than or equal to <code>(#$Degree-UnitOfAngularMeasure 360)</code> then <code>(#$ReflexAngleFn ANGLE)</code> returns the <i>reflex angle</i> of <code>ANGLE</code>, that is <code>360 - ANGLE</code> degrees. Note that this function is defined only for angular distances within the above stated bounds, otherwise it is #$undefined.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abe12).
