x_comment(x_ConformalProjection,"A specialization of #$SurfaceProjection (q.v.).  Each instance of #$ConformalProjection is a surface projection function that preserves the sizes of angles.  That is, if a triple of points or pair of lines (or edges) in the function's domain are related via a certain #$AngularDistance, then their respective images in the function's range will be related via the same angular distance.  (See #$angleBetween, #$angleBetweenPoints, and #$angleBetweenEdgesOfObject.)") :- x_cid(a65b16517abea3).
