x_comment('x_CylindricalSurface-WithoutTopAndBottom',"A specialization of #$CylindricalSurface and #$Tube (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$CylindricalSurface-WithoutTopAndBottom is the two-dimensional, non-planar, tubelike \"side\" surface of a #$Cylinder (q.v.).\n<p>\nNote that a #$CylindricalSurface-WithoutTopAndBottom (like the cylinder it is the side of) might be finite or infinite in height.  If finite, it will be a proper part of some #$CylindricalSurface-WithTopAndBottom (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16517abf16).
