x_comment(x_keySuborganizations,"(#$keySuborganizations BIG-ORG LITTLE-ORG) holds just in case LITTLE-ORG is a key suborganization of BIG-ORG.  This predicate is similar to #$keyMembers except it deals with suborganizations of an organization instead of its members.  For example, (#$keySuborganizations #$InternationalFrontForJihadAgainstJewsAndCrusaders #$JihadMovement) holds because the terrorist group #$JihadMovement is a key suborganization of #$InternationalFrontForJihadAgainstJewsAndCrusaders.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abf38).
