x_comment(x_scoreRankForGame,"An assertion of the form (#$scoreRankForGame SCORE RANK GAME) states that, within a given context, there is a non-empty set of instances of #$GameEvent where the #$Game GAME was played.  Further, SCORE represents the final score that was achieved by some player in at least one of the elements of that set (see #$agentFinalScoreInGame).  Finally, if the set of scores of those games were ranked in order from highest to lowest, then SCORE would be the RANKth element of that list.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abf57).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abf57,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
