x_comment(x_ProcessingEvent,"The collection of individual processing events. In a processing event, something is acted on in a string of events that might change it somehow (e.g., processing cheese) or simply change its status in some system (e.g., processing a form).  The thing acted on  (the thing that plays the #$objectProcessed role) is neither created nor destroyed as a result of the processing. #$ProcessingEvent is to be distinguished from the general notion of a process, which we currently represent at the type-level via #$CumulativeEventType.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abf59).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abf59,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
