x_comment(x_conceptPertinentToDegree,"<code>(#$conceptPertinentToDegree CONCEPT DEGREE)</code> means that <code>CONCEPT</code> is an instance of #$Thing that is, to the degree of relevance <code>DEGREE</code>, pertinent to an instance of information gathering #$InformationGathering.\n<p>\n<b>NOTE</b>: This predicate should only be used in microtheories which specify the appropriate qualifications of assertions made with it: e.g., for whom the concept is pertinent, on what task, at what time and place, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abf5d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abf5d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
