x_comment(x_Zeolite,"#$Zeolites are #$Minerals which have a porous structure, which permits a variety of #$Cations to occupy the space between their crystal lattices. These positive ions are rather loosely held and can readily be exchanged for others in a contact solution. This property makes #$Zeolites useful as #$catalysts in a variety of #$ChemicalReactions, notably in #$CrackingReactions.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abf69).
