x_comment(x_evaluationTypeAcceptanceThresholdForAgent,"A sentence of the form (#$evaluationTypeAcceptanceThresholdForAgent SENT-EVAL-TYPE N AGENT) means that, within a particular context, the #$Agent-Generic will 'accept' that any #$Sentence that has received N different evaluations of the value SENT-EVAL-TYPE (an instance of #$SentenceEvaluationOutput) has the property associated with that #$SentenceEvaluationOutput.  For example, the sentence (#$evaluationTypeAcceptanceThresholdForAgent #$TrueCycLSentence 1000 #$Cyc) says that if, in a given context, 1000 people assert that a particular sentence is true, then #$Cyc will accept that it is true in that context.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abf6d).
