x_comment(x_directionFromTo,"<code>(#$directionFromTo THING1 THING2 BEARING)</code> means that <code>BEARING</code> is the angular bearing from <code>THING1</code> to <code>THING2</code> where <code>BEARING</code> is the angle between the segment of the great circle joining #$AxialNorthPoleOfEarth and <code>THING1</code> and the segment of the great circle joining <code>THING1</code> and <code>THING2</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abf72).
