x_comment(x_cultureAdheresToSpecification,"(#$cultureAdheresToSpecification <b>CULTURE</b> <b>SPECIFICATION</b>)\nmeans that <b>SPECIFICATION</b> is generally followed within\n<b>CULTURE</b>.  Instances of #$Specification that are followed in this way include <b>CULTURE</b>'s social etiquette -- see #$EtiquetteOfCultureFn -- and its various customs.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abf97).
