x_comment(x_IndividualCustom,"A subcollection of #$CulturalConvention-Specification.  Each\ninstance of #$IndividualCustom is a particular convention that is\nfollowed within some culture.  More precisely, each #$IndividualCustom\nis the specification of some particular learned practice that forms part of some\noverall #$Culture-Specification.  For more on this notion of a\ncultural convention, see #$CulturalConvention-Specification") :- x_cid(a65b16517abfa0).
