x_comment(x_closureOfSetInTopologicalSpace,"If <code>SPACE</code> is a #$TopologicalSpace with base set <code>BASE</code> and <code>SET</code> is a subset of <code>BASE</code>, then the <i>closure</i> of <code>SET</code> is the set of all elements <code>THING</code> of <code>SPACE</code> for which the intersection of <code>SET</code> with every neighborhood of <code>THING</code> is non-empty. (See #$neighborhoodOfThingInTopologicalSpace) In CycL, this relation is expressed as <code>(#$closureOfSetInTopologicalSpace CLOSURE SET SPACE)</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abfb1).
