x_comment(x_frontierOfSetInTopologicalSpace,"If <code>SPACE</code> is a #$TopologicalSpace with base set <code>BASE</code> and <code>SET</code> is a subset of <code>BASE</code>, then the <i>frontier</i> of <code>SET</code> is the intersection of the closure of <code>SET</code> with the closure of the complement of <code>SET</code> in <code>BASE</code> In CycL, this relation is expressed as <code>(#$frontierOfSetInTopologicalSpace FRONTIER SET SPACE)</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abfb2).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abfb2,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
