x_comment(x_negationQuantities,"This predicate relates quantities that are mutually incompatible.  (#$negationQuantities QUANT1 QUANT2) means nothing has, or could have, both QUANT1 and QUANT2 as quantities at the same time.  This implies\nmore than mere material non-coincidence (e.g. being very happy and being very poor are not negation-quantities, even if there happen to be no very happy very poor people); but #$negationQuantities does subsume both \"physical\" and \"logical\" (or \"conceptual\") incompatibility between quantities.)") :- x_cid(a65b16517abfcd).
