x_comment(x_culturalSpecificationParts,"(#$culturalSpecificationParts <code>CULTURE</code>\n<code>SUB-SPEC</code>) means that <code>SUB-SPEC</code> is one of the\ncomponents of the overall #$Culture-Specification,\n<code>CULTURE</code>.  Common examples of such component specifications include\ninstances of #$CulturalCodeOfEtiquette and of\n#$CulturalConvention-Specification (qq.v.).  Note that\n#$culturalSpecificationParts may hold between two complete\n#$Culture-Specifications, in the case where <code>CULTURE-SPEC</code>\nis a specialized form of <code>SUB-SPEC</code> that includes and\nsupplements the guidelines of the latter.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abfce).
