x_comment(x_cultureContainsCulture,"(#$cultureContainsCulture <code>SPECIALIZED</code>\n<code>GENERAL</code>) means that <code>SPECIALIZED</code> is a\nspecialized form of the more general culture <code>GENERAL</code>.\nThat is, <code>SPECIALIZED</code> includes most of the component\nspecifications of <code>CULTURE</code> (see\n#$culturalSpecificationParts), but also includes additional directives\nand claims.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abfcf).
