x_comment(x_negligibleForces,"(#$negligibleForces SIT FORCE) means that in the #$Situation SIT,  FORCE is a #$ForceVector that is negligible.  This predicate is useful for describing physics problems where it is common to state that particular normal forces (e.g., friction, wind resistance) are not meant to factor in.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abfd2).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abfd2,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
