x_comment(x_ObliqueProjection,"A specialization of #$MapProjection (q.v.) instances of which are centered somewhere between the equator and the poles.  That is,  the target surface (see #$projectionTarget) -- or, if there is one, the intermediate surface  (see #$projectionIntermediate) -- used in the projection is tangent with the source #$Spheroid (an idealization of the the Earth's surface; see #$projectionSource) on either (i) a point that is between the equator and one of the poles or (ii) a line other than the equator that does not pass through the poles that is pole.  \n<p>\nCf. #$EquatorialProjection and #$PolarProjection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abfea).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abfea,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
