x_comment(x_RectangularProjection,"A type of map projection and a specialization of #$CylindricalProjection.  Each instance of #$RectangularProjection is similar to a #$MercatorProjection (q.v.) but has uniform spacing of the parallels.  Parallels of latitude(including the equator and poles) are represented by lines of equal length.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abff4).
