x_comment(x_SecantConicProjection,"A specialization of #$SimpleConicProjection (q.v.).   Each instance of #$SecantConicProjection is a simple conic projection whose intermediate conical surface (see #$projectionIntermediate) is tangent to the source spheroid along <i>two</i> lines.  Since distortion is low near either of the two lines of tangency, secant conic projections exhibit an increased useful latitude range compared to other simple conic projections.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abff9).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abff9,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517abff9,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
