x_comment(x_LambertConformalProjection,"A specialization of #$SecantConicProjection and #$ConformalProjection (qq.v.).   Each instance of #$LambertConformalProjection is a secant conic projection in which the spacing of the parallels on the conical surface is altered so that distortion along them them is equal to that along the meridians.") :- x_cid(a65b16517abffa).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517abffa,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
