x_comment(x_PolarProjection,"A specialization of #$AzimuthalProjection (q.v.) instances of which are centered on a pole.  That is, the flat target surface (see #$projectionTarget) used in the projection is tangent with the source #$Spheroid (an idealization of the the Earth's surface; see #$projectionSource) at one of its poles.  #$AzimuthalProjections are often also #$PolarProjections.\n<p>\nCf. #$EquatorialProjection and #$ObliqueProjection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac000).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac000,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
