x_comment(x_ObliqueGnomonicProjection,"A specialization of #$GnomonicProjection and #$ObliqueProjection (qq.v.).   In a #$ObliqueGnomonicProjection, all \"great circles\" in the spheroid appear as straight lines in the target surface, and the meridians appear as straight lines converging toward the nearer pole.  They exhibit a large amount of distortion as one moves away from the point of tangency.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac004).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac004,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
