x_comment('x_KillingByOrganism-Unique',"A specialization of both #$PhysicalDestructionEvent and #$KillingByOrganism.  Each instance of #$KillingByOrganism-Unique consists of one living organism ending (either intentionally or unintentionally) the life of one other living organism.  Events of this type start sometime prior to the death of the individual (We leave it open whether, in some cases, some of the events leading up the the death of the individual are part of the killing event) and ends at the last moment of the individual's death.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac01f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac01f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517ac01f,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
