x_comment(x_ProperSpheroid,"A specialization of #$Spheroid (q.v.). Each instance of #$ProperSpheroid is a spheroid that is not a #$Sphere.  Thus its polar radius is different than its equatorial radius (see #$polarRadiusOfSpheroid and #$equatorialRadiusOfSpheroid).  If its polar radius is longer it's a #$ProlateSpheroid; if its equatorial radius is longer it's an #$OblateSpheroid.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac02b).
