x_comment(x_Hemispheroid,"A specialization of #$Hemiellipsoid (q.v.). Each instance of #$Hemispheroid is a half- #$Spheroid.  Any great ellipse of a given spheroid (see #$greatEllipseOfSpheroid) divides it into two hemispheroids.\n<p>\nNote that, despite the collection's name, instances of #$GeographicalHemisphere do not approximate #$Hemispheres (cf.) as much as they do #$Hemispheroids.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac02c).
