x_comment(x_terminalPointOfLineSegment,"A binary predicate that relates a #$LineSegment to each of its terminal (or \"end\") #$Points. <code>(#$terminalPointOfLineSegment POINT LINESEGMENT)</code> means that <code>POINT</code> is a terminal point of <code>LINESEGMENT</code>.  A given line-segment might have zero, one, or two terminal points.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac042).
