x_comment('x_Dram-UnitOfVolume',"A #$USUnitOfMeasure and a #$UnitOfVolume (qq.v.).  A fluid dram is equal to one-quarter of a tablepoon (see #$Tablespoon-UnitOfVolume), or one-eighth of a fluid ounce (see #$Ounce-UnitOfVolume).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac071).
