x_comment(x_MillionOuncesTroy,"A #$UnitOfMass and a #$USUnitOfMeasure. A #$MillionOuncesTroy is equal to one 1,000,000 troy ounces (see #$Ounce-Troy).  It is used, e.g., to measure the size of a nation's gold reserves.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac07d).
