x_comment(x_Gram,"A #$UnitOfMass and an #$CGSUnitOfMeasure (qq.v.).  One gram is equal to 1000 (#$Milli #$Gram)s, and 1000 grams is equal to one #$Kilogram.  Also,  a gram is the mass of Avogadro's number of individual hydrogen atoms:\n<pre>\n  (#$Gram 1) = (#$AtomicMassUnit #$AvogadrosNumber)</pre>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac07f).
