x_comment(x_UnitOfRate,"A specialization of #$UnitOfRatio (q.v.).  Each instance of #$UnitOfRate is a function that returns an instance of #$Rate (q.v.) when applied to a real number (or pair of real numbers).  A given unit-of-rate <code>RATEUNIT</code> is the result of \"dividing\" some unit-of-measure <code>UNIT</code> by some #$UnitOfTime <code>TIMEUNIT</code>.  That is:\n<pre> \n   <code>RATEUNIT</code> = (#$PerFn  <code>UNIT TIMEUNIT </code>) \n</pre>\nSpecializations of #$UnitOfRate include #$UnitOfSpeed, #$UnitOfFrequency, and #$UnitOfPower.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac0ad).
