x_comment(x_PhysicalQuantityOrVectorFunction,"A sub-collection of #$IndividualDenotingFunction.  #$PhysicalQuantityOrVectorFunction  is a collection of functions that are used to denote the properties of objects within a physical system/event (e.g., a ball's velocity, acceleration or displacement along an X axis).  The various sub-collections of these functions differ based on the number of input values which their instances take as part of determining their output values.  For instance, #$PhysicalQuantityOrVectorFunction-SingleInput is a collection of functions that denote an object's properties during a physical event in cases where the function's output value depends on a single input value.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac0bb).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac0bb,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
