x_comment(x_functionFirstVariableDependsOnPropertyForEvent,"A sentence of the form (#$functionFirstVariableDependsOnPropertyForEvent FUNC THING PROPERTY-FUNCTION EVENT) means that the #$PhysicalQuantityOrVectorFunction  FUNC is dependent on the property of the #$Thing THING denoted by the #$PhysicalQuantityOrVectorFunction  PROPERTY-FUNCTION when it is calculated relative to the #$Event EVENT.  More specifically, the formula that represents the transformation of the input into the output has a 'first' variable (see #$functionPolynomialFunctionForSit and #$functionFirstInputUnitOfMeasureForSit) and the values that are plugged into this are based on the associated property of THING that is denoted by  PROPERTY-FUNCTION.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac0d0).
