x_comment(x_associatedCriminalActivity,"<code>(#$associatedCriminalActivity CRIMINAL-TYPE CRIME-TYPE)</code> means that <code>CRIMINAL-TYPE</code>, an instance of #$CriminalTypeByCrimeType, is the collection of instances of #$Criminal who have perpetrated an act of <code>CRIME-TYPE</code>, a type of #$ActsCommonlyConsideredCriminal.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac0f5).
