x_comment(x_UniformlyAcceleratedTranslationEvent,"A specialization of #$Accelerating-Translational. Each instance of #$UniformlyAcceleratedTranslationEvent is an event in which the magnitude of the acceleration constant is unchanging.  The motion of the #$primaryObjectMoving  in each instance of #$UniformlyAcceleratedTranslationEvent is in a straight line.  In physics, there are simple kinematic equations for constant acceleration that apply to instances of #$UniformlyAcceleratedTranslationEvent.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac0fa).
