x_comment(x_attackAgainst,"(#$attackAgainst ATTACK OBJECT) means that ATTACK was an event in which OBJECT was targeted or harmed in some way in ATTACK.  This is a very general predicate it it rarely should be used when entering knowledge.  The utility of this predicate comes from its use at query time.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac0fb).
