x_comment(x_cotemporalProperSubEventTypes,"An instance of #$RuleMacroPredicate.  A sentence of the form <code>(#$cotemporalProperSubEventTypes SUPER-EVENT SUB-EVENT)</code> has the same truth conditions as a sentence of the form, <code>(#$relationAllExists cotemporalProperSubEvents SUPER-EVENT SUB-EVENT)</code>, which means that every instance <code>INSTANCE</code> of <code>SUPER-EVENT</code> is cotemporal (#$cotemporal) with a distinct event of type <code>SUB-EVENT</code> that is a part of <code>INSTANCE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac132).
