x_comment(x_nominee,"An #$ActorSlot and a specialization of #$objectSelected and #$affectedAgent-Direct.  <code>(#$nominee NOMINATION AGENT)</code> means that in <code>NOMINATION</code>, <code>AGENT</code> is formally proposed for membership in, or for a particular position within (see #$PersonTypeByPositionInOrg), some #$Organization.\n<p>\nUnlike the recipient of a direct appointment (cf. #$appointees), a nominee must\nsuccessfully undergo a confirmation process or win an election in order to be granted the membership or position.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac138).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac138,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
