x_comment(x_imageSource,"<code>(#$imageSource VISUAL-IBT-TYPE IMAGE)</code> means that the instance <code>IMAGE</code> of #$VisualImage is a light wave propogation whose source is the instance <code>VISUAL-IBT-TYPE</code> of #$VisualInformationBearingThing.  For example, if <code>PICTURE</code> is the image (see #$Picture-Image) generated by subjecting a given printed developed photograph (see (#$HardcopyOfIBTTypeFn #$Photograph)) <code>PRINT</code> to the right amount of light, then <code>(#$imageSource PICTURE PRINT)</code> holds.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac148).
