x_comment('x_Graphic-VisualIBT',"A subcollection of #$VisualInformationBearingThing.  Instances of this collection are approximately 2-dimensional spatial objects that are the sources (see #$imageSource) of still images (see #$StillImage).  This collection includes many specializations of #$TwoDimensionalArtObject, such as paintings (#$Painting-ArtForm), as well as spatial regions where a still visual image is displayed (such as the area on a wall where an image might be projected).  Counter-examples include high-relief objects (sculptures), motion pictures, and text, though many graphics can include bits of text (and vice versa).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac150).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac150,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
