x_comment(x_objectOfStatusChange,"An #$ActorSlot and a specialization of #$objectActedOn and #$postActors (q.v.).  <code>(#$objectOfStatusChange EVENT OBJECT)</code> means that <code>OBJECT</code> undergoes some kind of change of conventional (i.e. social, legal, economic, historic, etc.) status in the #$ChangeOfStatusEvent <code>EVENT</code>.  <code>OBJECT</code> exists before and after <code>EVENT</code>, and might or might not be directly involved in <code>EVENT</code>. See also #$topicOfStatusChange.\n<p>\nNote that a change of status is an <i>extrinsic</i> change.  Cf. #$objectOfStateChange, which pertains to intrinsic changes (see #$IntrinsicStateChangeEvent).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac15d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac15d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
