x_comment(x_ResolvingPeacefully,"A collection of #$Actions.   An instance of #$ResolvingPeacefully is an event in which  some #$ConflictEvent is resolved peacefully, i.e. without one or other of the adversaries attacking or harming the other.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac16c).
