x_comment(x_nounLearnerConjecturedTypeForNoun,"(#$nounLearnerConjecturedTypeForNoun NOUN-STRING COLLECTION) means that, based on statistical analysis of its usages in some text corpus (like, perhaps, the New York Times from 2001), the Noun Learner conjectures that the noun NOUN-STRING denotes an instance or spec of COLLECTION.  For example, (#$nounLearnerConjecturedTypeForNoun \"rutabaga\" #$EdibleStuff) means that \"rutabaga\" is conjectured to denote an instance or spec of #$EdibleStuff.  Use non-plural forms of nouns in queries.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac16d).
