x_comment(x_IranianGuardianCouncil,"An instance of #$Council-Organization and an Iranian govenmental organization.  This is the most influential body in Iran.  It consists of six clerics appointed by the #$IranianSupremeLeader and six jurists nominated by the #$IranianHeadOfJudiciary and approved by the parliament (see #$Majlis-Iran).  The Guardian Council has the power to veto any bill passed by parliament that it deems inconsistent with the constitution or Islamic law.  \nThe Council can also bar candidates from running for parliament, the presidency, or membership in the #$IranianAssemblyOfExperts.  Members of the Council serve for terms of six years.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac172).
