x_comment(x_ConfirmationInOrganization,"A specialization of #$OrganizationalTransferIn (q.v.).  Each instance of #$ConfirmationInOrganization is an action in which some applicant or nominee for membership in an organization is officially approved for membership; it involves an instance of #$Evaluating (in which the applicant/nominee is judged with respect to the organization's membership criteria) and then an instance of #$Accept (in which it is decided that the evaluee meets the criteria).  Upon confirmation, the agent becomes a member of \nthe organization.\n<p>\nSee also #$ConfirmationForAPosition.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac173).
