x_comment(x_ceremonyOfBeliefSystem,"<code>(#$ceremonyOfBeliefSystem CEREMONY BELIEF-SYSTEM)</code> means that the instance <code>CEREMONY</code> of #$Ceremony is a ceremony that takes place as part of (#$subSituations) a larger system of practices and beliefs, the instance <code>BELIEF-SYSTEM</code> of #$BeliefSystem.  For example, a particular rite of passage, such as receiving a tribal tattoo, might instantiate a cultural practice of that tribe, and thus occur as part of that tribe's belief system.   To relate religious ceremonies to their respective religions, use #$ceremonyOfReligion.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac180).
