x_comment(x_illuminatedObjectTypeLightSourceType,"<code>(#$illuminatedObjectTypeLightSourceType OBJECT-TYPE SOURCE-TYPE)</code> means that <code>OBJECT-TYPE</code> is the instance of #$ObjectTypeByLightSource, a collection of illuminated objects/areas that share a common source-type of illumination, for which <code>SOURCE-TYPE</code> is that common source-type.  For example, <code>(#$illuminatedObjectTypeLightSourceType #$Sunlit #$Sun)</code> means that every object/area illuminated by sunlight has a sun (on earth, that would be our sun (#$TheSun)) as the source of that illumination.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac184).
