x_comment(x_IranianSupremeLeader,"A specialization of #$Leader and #$IranianPerson.  #$IranianSupremeLeader is the highest position in the post-revolutionary Iranian government.  The Supreme Leader appoints the #$IranianHeadOfJudiciary, six (of twelve) members of the #$IranianGuardianCouncil, and the commanders of all the Iranian armed forces.  The Supreme Leader is chosen by the #$IranianAssemblyOfExperts.\n<p>\nSince the #$IranRevolution-1978-1979 there have been two Supreme Leaders: Ayatollah Khomeini (see #$RuhollahKhomeini) and the current leader Ayatollah Khamenei (see #$AliKhamenei).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac189).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac189,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
