x_comment('x_semanticRelationForNCR-Inverse',"(#$semanticRelationForNCR-Inverse RULE RELATION) means that RELATION is the semantically noteworthy relation which is assumed to hold inversely between the head (arg2) and modifier (arg1) of a noun compound licensed by the #$NounCompoundRule RULE.  In general, we'll expect that RELATION will be either: i)  the arg0 of a NAT which appears as the arg2 of some #$ncRuleTemplate assertion; or ii) the second argument to some subcollection NAT which appears in this same position. See also #$semanticRelationForNCR.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac1c8).
