x_comment(x_IranianConstructionJihadMinister,"A specialization of #$Minister-Governmental and #$IranianPerson.  An #$IranianConstructionJihadMinister heads the ministry that oversees the <i>Construction Jihad</i> (a program to reduce poverty through rural development and construction), and is the member of the #$IranianCabinet who advises the president on matters involving the Construction Jihad.\n<p>\nThis position was created shortly after the 1979 Iranian revolution.  But note that there is (at least as of late 2005) no longer a Minister of Construction Jihad in the Iranian cabinet.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac1e6).
