x_comment(x_modalFeatureTransfers,"<code>(#$modalFeatureTransfers PRED-1 PRED-2 OPERATOR)</code> means that when <code>(PRED-1 . ARGS)</code> holds, <code>(OPERATOR (PRED-2 . ARGS))</code> also holds, where <code>OPERATOR</code> is a modal operator.  For example, <code>(#$modalFeatureTransfers #$foundingAgent #$createdBy #$willAlwaysBe)</code> means that when <code>(#$foundingAgent ORGANIZATION AGENT)</code> holds, <code>(#$willAlwaysBe (#$createdBy ORGANIZATION AGENT))</code> holds.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac1fd).
