x_comment(x_SpatialPredicate,"Each instance of #$SpatialPredicate is a spatial relation that can (only) hold between one or more #$SpatialThings, and is used to state something about its/their spatial location(s), position(s), orientation(s), size(s), or dimensionality.  \n<p>\nNote that when a #$SpatialPredicate has a #$Group as one of its arguments, a certain spatial relationship is usually being asserted to hold of all or most of the members of that group; but there are exceptions (e.g. #$in-Among) for which this is not the case.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac200).
