x_comment(x_sentenceWeight,"A #$StrictlyFunctionalSlot that relates a (quoted) instance of #$CycLSentence to a #$RealNumber.  <code>(#$sentenceWeight SENTENCE NUM)</code> means that <code>NUM</code> is the weight assigned to <code>SENTENCE</code> in the current context.\n<p>\nThis predicate is intended to be used for representing Markov logic networks in Cyc.  When used in this way, the weight associated with a sentence reflects its strength as a constraint on possible worlds.  The predicate may have other uses, however.\n<p>\n#$sentenceWeight should not be confused with #$likelihood (q.v.).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac233).
