x_comment(x_CableDrivenConveyance,"A specialization of #$Conveyance-Stationary. Each #$CableDrivenConveyance consists of a long loop of #$Cable that is mechanically cycled. Transport via a #$CableDrivenConveyance may as simple as a handle attached to the cable, or involve seats or entire cabins suspended from it. Examples include #$SkiLifts and cable cars. Trolleys are not #$CableDrivenConveyances, as the cable is not providing motive force.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac237).
