x_comment(x_anabranches,"A #$SpatialPredicate that is used to indicate the anabranches of a given stream or river. (#$anabranches STREAM ANABRANCH) means that STREAM has ANABRANCH as one of its anabranches. That is, ANABRANCH is a #$Stream (q.v.) that flows out of and later rejoins STREAM. Compare this predicate with its two negations <code>#$tributaries</code> and <code>#$distributaries</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac245).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac245,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
