x_comment(x_numberOfSearchResultsObtained,"<code>(#$numberOfSearchResultsObtained SEARCH N)</code> means\nthat in the instance of #$LookingForAThingOrTypeOfThing,\n<code>SEARCH</code>, the number of items found that meet the search\ncriteria is <code>N</code>.  For example, if in the event\n<code>Search001</code> a person sets out to find all of the unmatched\nsocks behind their washing machine, and they find 7 such socks, then\n<code>(#$numberOfSearchResultsObtained Search001 7)</code> is true.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac253).
