x_comment(x_rankOfResult,"<code>(#$rankOfResult OBTAINING-A-RESULT N)</code> means that in the\ninstance of #$ObtainingAStringBasedSearchResult,\n<code>OBTAINING-A-RESULT</code>, the result obtained (some instance of\n#$ComputerDataArtifact) is ranked <code>N</code> by the search engine\nthat is the #$searchEngineUsed in the instance of\n#$StringBasedSearching that is a super-event of\n<code>OBTAINING-A-RESULT</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac256).
