x_comment(x_focalBasisString,"<code>(#$focalBasisString OBTAINING-A-RESULT STRING)</code> means that\nin the instance of #$ObtainingAStringBasedSearchResult,\n<code>OBTAINING-A-RESULT</code>, <code>STRING</code> is the specific\nstring occurring within the result returned that qualifies the result\nas a result that meets the search criteria.  For example, if the\n#$searchStringUsed in the super-event of\n<code>OBTAINING-A-RESULT</code> which is an instance of\n#$StringBasedSearching is \"Austria is a *\", then it could be that\n<code>(#$focalBasisString OBTAINING-A-RESULT \"Austria is a democracy\")\n</code> holds.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac257).
