x_comment(x_primarySponsorOfEvent,"A specialization of #$sponsorOfEvent and (via #$genlInverse) #$responsibleFor (qq.v.).  <code>(#$primarySponsorOfEvent EVENT SPONSOR)</code> means that <code>SPONSOR</code> plays a crucial sponsorship role in <code>EVENT</code>, such that without <code>SPONSOR</code>'s support (everything else being equal) <code>EVENT</code> would not have occurred.  Primary-sponsorship roles include providing a significant portion of the funding, materials, incentive, or other support for <code>EVENT</code> and its participants.\n<p>\nNote that, although this predicate is not strictly functional in its second argument-place, a given social event will often have no more than one primary sponsor.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac25e).
