x_comment(x_WestAfrica,"A subregion of #$ContinentOfAfrica.  #$WestAfrica is generally taken to include the following countries: #$Benin, #$BurkinaFaso, #$IvoryCoast, #$Gambia, #$Ghana, #$Guinea, #$Guinea-Bissau, #$Liberia, #$Mali, #$Mauritania, #$Niger, #$Nigeria, #$Senegal, #$SierraLeone, and #$Togo.  It is considered by some also to include the island countries of #$CapeVerde and #$SaoTomeAndPrincipe.\n<p>\nNote that #$WestAfrica does <i>not</i> constitute all of (#$WesternRegionFn #$ContinentOfAfrica), but is rather a proper subregion of the latter.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac26f).
