x_comment(x_personTypeAssociatedClothingType,"A binary predicate that relates an instance of #$PersonTypeByActivity to types of clothing and accessories that instances of that person-type normally wear when performing the official duties or characteristic activities that type.  (#$personTypeAssociatedClothingType PERSON-TYPE SOMETHING-TO-WEAR-TYPE) means that if an instance of <code>PERSON-TYPE</code> is engaged in the characteristic activities associated with that type, he or she will be wearing (see #$wearsClothing) an instance of <code>SOMETHING-TO-WEAR-TYPE</code> during some significant portion of that activity.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac274).
