x_comment(x_controlsIndex,"(#$controlsIndex ORGANIZATION INDEX) means that the instance of #$Organization ORGANIZATION controls, or establishes the value of the #$EconomicIndexPredicate INDEX). For example, (#$controlsIndex #$FederalNationalMortgageAssociation #$conventionalFixedRateActualYield) means that Fannie Mae is responsible for setting the Conventional Fixed Rate Actual Yield, an index commonly used to determine the #$fullyIndexedRate for loans.  Other commonly used indexes are the Treasury Constant Maturity index, the 11th District Cost of Funds Index, and the prime rate.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac291).
