x_comment(x_Dome,"The collection of domes, man-made instances of #$HemisphericalSolid used most frequently as roofs (see #$DomedRoof) but also as stand-alone structures, particularly geodesic domes (see #$GeodesicDome).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac292).
