x_comment(x_syntacticNodeTypeCategory,"<code>(#$syntacticNodeTypeCategory NODE-TYPE CATEGORY)</code> identifies <code>NODE-TYPE</code> as the instance of #$SyntacticNodeTypeByCategory, every instance of which is a syntactic node (#$SyntacticNode, q.v.,) representing a sentential constituent (see #$SententialConstituent) of type <code>CATEGORY</code>, an instance of #$SententialConstituentType.  For example, <code>(#$syntacticNodeTypeCategory #$SyntacticNode-VP #$VerbPhrase)</code> identifies #$SyntacticNode-VP as the collection of nodes that represent verb phrases.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac2a0).
