x_comment('x_leaderTypeHasInfluenceOverActivityType-Definitional',"<code>(#$leaderTypeHasInfluenceOverActivityType-Definitional LEADER-TYPE ACT-TYPE)</code> identifies <code>LEADER-TYPE</code> as the subcollection of #$Leader whose instances use their leadership to help shape the unfolding or outcome of events of type <code>ACT-TYPE</code>.  For example, <code>(#$leaderTypeHasInfluenceOverActivityType-Definitional #$ReligiousLeader #$ReligiousActivity)</code> identifies #$ReligiousLeader as the collection of agents who, by their leadership, help define instances of #$ReligiousActivity.  Note that #$leaderTypeHasInfluenceOverActivityType-Definitional gives a necessary condition for being an instance of its arg1, and not a sufficient one.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac2b5).
