x_comment(x_GAFGathering,"A specialization of (#$AttemptingFn #$Learning) .  Each instance of #$GAFGathering is a process in which the goal is for Cyc to learn one or more #$CycL 'ground atomic formulas' (see #$CycLFullyGroundAtomicSentence) based on querying against some natural language corpus with some search string that is generated from a target #$Predicate and, typically, some values to its arguments.  Each successful result of the process requires at least that the resultant formula is semantically well-formed, though other requirements are possible.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac2bf).
