x_comment(x_TerroristSuicideBombing,"A specialization of #$TerroristAttack, #$SuicideAttack, and #$Bombing in which a  bomb is delivered  to a target location by one or more perpetrators. The perpetrators intentionally kill themselves in the attack.  This includes acts in which the perepetrator carries the bomb on their person as well as cases where a vehicle is loaded with high explosives and the perpetrator drives it to the target location and explodes it.  A vehicle bomb exploded remotely where the perpetrator does not intend to die in the blast is not considered an instance of this collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac2c8).
