x_comment('x_TerroristSuicideBombing-CarriedOnPerson',"A specialization of #$TerroristSuicideBombing in which a  bomb is delivered  to a target location by one or more persons who keep the bomb or bombs concealed until detonated. The perpetrators intentionally kill themselves in the attack.  This constant is intended to cover the stereotypical tactic in which a perpetrator carries (or wears) a conventional #$HighExplosive to a target. Driving vehicles loaded with explosives into a target are not considered to be instances of #$TerroristSuicideBombing-CarriedOnPerson.  For the general collection of terrorist suicide bombings that include vehicle delivered suicide bombings see #$TerroristSuicideBombing.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac2dc).
