x_comment(x_functionFirstInputValue,"A sentence of the form (#$functionFirstInputValue  FUNCTION QUANTITY) means that the #$PhysicalQuantityOrVectorFunction FUNCTION (some arbitrary function for use in calculating the value of some property of some system) tasks as its 'first' input a QUANTITY, some specific QUANTITY that is measured in the #$UnitOfMeasure that is related to FUNCTION by the predicate #$functionFirstInputUnitOfMeasureForSit. The notion of 'first' here is intended only to allow for knowledge about the function to be shared across the predicates #$functionFirstInputValue, #$functionFirstInputUnitOfMeasureForSit.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac2e3).
