x_comment(x_evincesKnownGAF,"<code>(#$evincesKnownGAF OBTAINING-A-RESULT GAF)</code> means that in the instance of #$ObtainingAStringBasedSearchResult, <code>OBTAINING-A-RESULT</code>, <code>GAF</code> is the #$CycLSentence-Assertible that is supported by the result returned as the fully-bound form of the #$gafGatheringTriggerSentence of the #$GAFGathering which is a super-event of <code>OBTAINING-A-RESULT</code>.  Further, <code>GAF</code> corresponds to the CycL sentence of an assertion in a reliable context in the Cyc KB.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac300).
