x_comment(x_KBDependentRelation,"A collection of relations.  Members of this collection are those predicates that are used (in the zeroth place of formulas) to express propositions whose truth depend on facts about the KB or functions whose mappings depend on the state of the #$CycKB (KB).  A good example of a #$KBDependentRelation is #$assertedSentence.  Whether or not it is true that (#$assertedSentence FORM) depends entirely upon whether or not FORM is asserted in the KB.\n<p>\nSee also #$KBDependentCollection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac302).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac302,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
