xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517ac306,[]).
x_comment(x_WNRankedSynonymStringsForWordAndPOSFn,"A #$BinaryFunction and #$EvaluatableFunction that returns a #$List of #$Set-Mathematical of #$CharacterStrings.   An evaluation of an expression of the form (#$WNAllSynonymStringsForWordAndPOSFn LEXICAL-WORD POS)  function consults the #$WordNetKnowledgeBase #$WordNet-Version2_0 to find synonyms for the #$LexicalWord LEXICAL-WORD based on the #$SpeechPart POS.  For each synset that in which LEXICAL-WORD appears, it will construct a set of strings for the terms in that synset.  The list is composed of those sets and the ordering of the list roughly reflects the frequency with which LEXICAL-WORD is used to express the meaning assocaited with that the synset.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac307).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac307,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
