x_comment(x_keRequirementInverse,"A #$KEFacilitationPredicate that is a specialization of #$requiredArg2Pred (q.v.).  <code>(#$keRequirementInverse COL BIN-PRED)</code> means that for every instance <code>INS</code> of <code>COL</code> that is known to (reified in) the knowledge base, there is an expectation that there exist some <code>VALUE</code> such that <code>(BIN-PRED VALUE INS)</code> is known to (asserted in) the knowledge base.\n<p>\nSee also #$keRequirementPreds.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac308).
