x_comment(x_MechanicalEquilibrium,"A physical situation is in mechanical equilibrium if and only if the sum of the applied forces is zero. See also, #$StaticEquilibrium, which is a special case characterized by the lack of all motion throughout the situation. For example, a book sitting on a table is in static equilibrium, whereas a child sliding down a slide is in mechanical equilibrium but not static equilibrium.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac30c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac30c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
