x_comment(x_PhysicalQuantityFunction,"A specialization of #$BinaryFunction whose instances measure some physical quantity of an object that can be determined by observing the object's state at a fixed time. By convention, we require that all instances of this collection have #$SpatialThing as their #$arg1Isa and #$TimeInterval as their #$arg2Isa. Example specializations include #$KineticEnergyFunction and #$PotentialEnergyFunction.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac320).
