x_comment(x_maximumValueOfFunctionForThingThroughoutEvent,"If <code>FUNCTION</code> is a #$PhysicalQuantityFunction, <code>EVENT</code> is a #$PhysicalEvent, and <code>THING</code> is an actor in <code>EVENT</code>, then <code>(#$maximumValueOfFunctionForThingThroughoutEvent FUNCTION THING EVENT MAXIMUM)</code> means that the maximum value of <code>(FUNCTION THING TIME)</code> where <code>TIME</code> ranges over all #$TimePoints subsumed by <code>EVENT</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac321).
