x_comment(x_multipleChoiceSingleOptionList,"<code>(#$multipleChoiceSingleOptionList TEST LIST)</code> means that for the KBContentTest <code>TEST</code>, the <code>LIST</code> whose first element is a CycL term and whose second element is a string corresponds to one answer choice out of several answer choices offered in the context in which <code>TEST</code> is asked.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac322).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac322,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
