x_comment('x_above-Overhead',"<code>(#$above-Overhead ABOVE BELOW)</code> means that <code>ABOVE</code> is directly above <code>BELOW</code> (see the predicate #$above-Directly), all points of <code>ABOVE</code> are higher than all points of <code>BELOW</code>, and <code>ABOVE</code> and <code>BELOW</code> do <i>not</i> touch.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac32c).
