x_comment('x_above-Directly',"<code>(#$above-Directly ABOVE BELOW)</code> means either that (1) the volumetric center of <code>ABOVE</code> is directly above some point of <code>BELOW</code>, if <code>ABOVE</code> is smaller than <code>BELOW</code>; or that (2) some point of <code>ABOVE</code> is directly above the volumetric center of <code>BELOW</code>, if <code>ABOVE</code> is larger than, or equal in size to, <code>BELOW</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac32d).
