x_comment(x_hookeSpringConstant,"In physics, <i>Hooke's law of elasticity</i> is an approximation which states that if an instance of #$Spring-Device is elongated by some distance, <code>x</code>, then the restoring force exherted by the spring is proportional to <code>x</code> by a constant factor. This predicate relates a spring to its constant of proportionality. That is, <code>(#$hookeSpringConstant SPRING CONSTANT)</code> means that <code>CONSTANT</code> is the constant of proportionality for the restoring force exerted by SPRING. Note that <code>CONSTANT</code> is a quantity of #$Pressure.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac334).
