x_comment(x_strategyForPred,"A sentence of the form (#$strategyForPred STRAT-TYPE PRED) means that the #$DisambiguationStrategy is a sub-collection of #$DisambiguationScoringStrategy and that the strategy is applicable (i.e., it rewards points to semantic hypotheses) based on the the #$Predicate PRED holding between at least some denotation posited by some #$SemanticInterpretationHypothesisMicrotheory.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac352).
