x_comment(x_strategyRewardsArg,"An assertion of the form (#$strategyRewardsArg STRAT N) means that the instance of #$DisambiguationScoringStrategy STRAT-TYPE awards hypotheses based on the holding of a particular predicate among the denotations of a set of hypotheses and that it will reward points to the hypotheses whose denotations can be proven to fill the Nth argument of a sentence involving the predicate that is associated with STRAT-TYPE (see #$strategyForPred).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac353).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac353,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
