x_comment(x_strategyParameterValueRange,"A sentence of the form (#$strategyParameterValueRange STRATEGY PARAMETER MIN-VAL MAX-VAL) states that the #$ScoringSoftwareStrategy STRATEGY incorporates the Parameter PARAMETER and some system employing STRATEGY can set PARAMETER to some value that is no less than the ScalarInterval MIN-VAL and no greater than the ScalarInterval MAX-VAL.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac358).
