x_comment(x_strategyGivesHypothesisScore,"A sentence of the form (#$strategyGivesHypothesisScore STRAT HYP SCORE) means that the #$ScoringSoftwareStrategy STRAT assigns the #$HypotheticalContext HYP a numeric score of SCORE within the context in which the sentence is asserted.  The value of SCORE that STRAT assigns to HYP can differ across context and can differ when STRAT's optimized form (see #$optimizedStrategyForm) differs.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac359).
