x_comment('x_accelerationOfObject-Translation',"This predicate relates an object to its magnitude of acceleration. <code>(#$accelerationOfObject-Translation OBJECT ACCELERATION)</code> means that the acceleration of <code>OBJECT</code> has magnitude <code>ACCELERATION</code>. Note that physically, acceleration is a vector valued quantity, possessing both a direction and a magnitude. This predicate is intended to relate only the magnitude of acceleration to the object, irrespective of the directional component of acceleration.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac362).
