x_comment(x_completeByExternalConvention,"An instance of #$CompletenessGroundsPredicate that is used to state, about a collection or predicate whose extent is inferentially complete (see #$InferenceCompletenessPredicate), that the completeness derives mainly from a conventional stipulation, rather than from the nature of the items in the extent themselves, and that the convention is not something stipulated by the designers of the Cyc system, but exists in the world outside of Cyc. For example, <code>(#$completelyAssertedCollection #$DayOfWeekType)</code> holds, and so does <code>(#$completeByExternalConvention #$DayOfWeekType)</code>.  Cf. #$completeByCycConvention.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac36c).
