x_comment(x_SharedNote,"A subcollection of #$DocumentationConstant.\nEach instance of #$SharedNote is a CycL constant whose #$comment is a piece of documentation that can be attached, via the predicate #$sharedNotes, to various CycL terms.\n<p>\nUse shared-notes in cases where doing so would be more effective or efficient\nthan putting the same (or very similar) information into a separate comment or cyclist-note for each of the relevant CycL terms.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac36e).
