x_comment(x_InductiveInferenceProcess,"A specialization of #$Reasoning.  Each instance of #$InductiveInferenceProcess is an inference in which a general fact or rule is generated in order to serve as an explanation of a less general fact or set of facts.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac374).
