x_comment(x_Thinking,"A specialization of #$IntentionalMentalEvent.  Each instance of this collection is a thinking process in which it is essential that an agent uses information about the current state of the world (or some portion of the world).  Notable specializations of #$Thinking include #$Evaluating, #$MakingAPlan, #$Negotiating, and #$InventingSomething.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac375).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac375,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
