xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517ac376,[]).
x_comment(x_InferenceToTheBestExplanation,"A specialization of #$Reasoning.  Each instance of #$InferenceToTheBestExplanation is an inference in which one generates hypotheses through abduction or induction (see #$AbductiveInferenceProcess and #$InductiveInferenceProcess), and then applies a selection mechanism to choose the best hypothesis out of the candidates generated.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac377).
