xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517ac37b,[]).
x_comment(x_AxiomaticTheory,"The collection of axiomatized #$ScientificTheory[ies].  Each #$AxiomaticTheory <b>T</b> includes a set of basic principles or <i>axioms</i>, and <b>T</b> is (or at least is uniquely determined by) the deductive closure of the set of its axioms.  For example, #$ZermeloFraenkelSetTheory is the theory of sets supported by the Zermelo and Fraenkel axiomatization.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac37c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac37c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
