x_comment(x_conceptExtractedViaReferenceInStructure,"<code>(#$conceptExtractedViaReferenceInStructure THING STRUCTURE)</code> means that the thing <code>THING</code> was first encountered by a Cyc-based data processing program (e.g., the TextLearner system (TheCycTextLearnerProgram)) that discovered a reference to it while processing <code>STRUCTURE</code>, an instance of #$AbstractStructure.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac37f).
