x_comment(x_extractedFromStructure,"<code>(#$extractedFromStructure THING STRUCTURE)</code> means that Cyc's knowledge of the existence of <code>THING</code> has its origins in the processing of a data-rich structure <code>STRUCTURE</code> performed by a Cyc-based data processing program (e.g., the TextLearner system (TheCycTextLearnerProgram)).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac380).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac380,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
