x_comment(x_theoreticalField,"(#$theoreticalField THEORY FIELD) means that the #$PhilosophicalTheory THEORY belongs to FIELD, a #$ScientificFieldOfStudy. Many theories can belong to a single field, for instance #$Systematics-Taxonomy knows of different theories that classify organisms. It is also the case when a field has many #$subFields such as #$Physics, any theories in one of the subfield of the latter will be a theory of the broader field. On the other hand, some theories may belong to more than one field.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac394).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac394,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
