x_comment(x_predicateForComparisonClassForFACTory,"(#$predicateForComparisonClassForFACTory BUCKET-TYPE BIN-PRED) holds just in case BIN-PRED is the predicate whose values are being compared in the specialization of #$FACToryObjectTypeValueBuckets BUCKET-TYPE.  For instance, (#$predicateForComparisonClassForFACTory #$FACToryObjectTypeVolumeBuckets #$volumeOfObject) holds because volumeOfObject is the predicate used to determine the similarity classes for volume that are the instances of FACToryObjectTypeVolumeBuckets.  Associate a particular value with an instance of FACToryObjectTypeValueBuckets with the predicate #$comparisonClassForFACTory.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac39d).
