x_comment(x_centerOfMass,"<code>(#$centerOfMass OBJ POINT)</code> means that <code>POINT</code> is the center of mass of the object <code>OBJ</code>.  In other words, <code>POINT</code> is the single point, relative to the parts of <code>OBJ</code> that, if it were a point mass, would move in the same way as <code>OBJ</code> were <code>OBJ</code> subject to the same external forces.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac3a2).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac3a2,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
