x_comment(x_ArtisticTypeByStyle,"A collection of collections. Each instance of #$ArtisticTypeByStyle is a collection of the things that are of the represented genre/school/type.  The various specializations of this collection are collections of collections that all are genres of a single type of thing.  For instance, #$ArchitecturalTypeByStyle is the collection of \ncollections of #$ConstructionArtifacts each one representing a particular architectural style.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac3aa).
