x_comment(x_LocallyEuclideanSpatialThing,"A specialization of #$SpatialThing.    Roughly speaking, a spatial thing is a #$LocallyEuclideanSpatialThing if it has no self-intersections.   For example, a line-segment is geometrically simple if it can be traced without visiting the same point twice; a two-dimensional region is geometrically simple if its boundary is simple.\n<p>\nMore formally, an <code>N</code>-dimensional spatial thing <code>THING</code> is geometrically simple if and only if, for every point in the interior of <code>THING</code>, there exists a neighborhood of the point contained in the interior of <code>THING</code> and a homeomorphism (open and continuous bijection) that maps the neighborhood onto an open subset of <code>N</code> dimensional Euclidean space.\n<p>\nWhile CycL currently lacks the vocabulary to codify the formal definition, we can state restricted forms of it for certain classes of spatial things, and do so in the cases that are of immediate interest.  For these, see the reified specializations of this collection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac3b4).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac3b4,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517ac3b4,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
xc_source_line(a65b16517ac3b4,20963).
xc_kb_names(a65b16517ac3b4,[]).
xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517ac3b4,[]).
x_comment(x_Parameter,"A sub-collection of #$AspatialInformationStore.  A #$Parameter is a component of some larger #$AspatialInformationStore that is capable of storing a value and having that value change.  An important sub-class of this collection is #$SoftwareParameter, but this collection is more general and includes such things as how much weight a college admissions officer gives to extracurricular activities when rating applications or how much a chess program values pawns when calculating the value of the board that results from a move.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac3b5).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac3b5,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517ac3b5,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
xc_source_line(a65b16517ac3b5,20968).
