x_comment(x_EnumerableSetOrCollection,"A specialization of #$SetOrCollection.  A set or collection is an instance of #$EnumerableSetOrCollection if and only if it is either finite (see #$FiniteSetOrCollection) or enumerably infinte (see #$DenumerableSetOrCollection) in size.  Thus, its #$cardinality is no greater than aleph-0 (i.e. #$PlusInfinity).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac3b8).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac3b8,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
