x_comment(x_hypothesisRelevantScoringSetsOrCollections,"A sentence of the form (#$hypothesisRelevantScoringSetsOrCollections HYP-MT SET-OR-COLL) relates a #$HypotheticalContext HYP-MT to a #$SetOrCollection SET-OR-COLL.  The sentence means that, relative to the current context, the evaluation of HYP-MT (for instance, in considering its #$hypothesisMtConfidence) can sensibly include reference to HYP-MT being an element of SET-OR-COLL.  In this case, membership in SET-OR-COLL will typically be a shorthand for a more complex set of properties and relations to other hypotheses or pieces of knowledge.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac3b9).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac3b9,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517ac3b9,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
