x_comment(x_FacetOfCollectionBasedOnTypeBinaryPredFn,"A binary function that takes a collection and a type-level binary predicate to the #$FacetingCollectionType (if any) that facets the collection on the basis of the predicate.  (#$FacetOfCollectionBasedOnTypeBinaryPredFn <code>COL BINPRED</code>) is the faceting-collection-type <code>FACET</code> such that both <code>(#$facets-Generic COL FACET)</code> and <code>(#$facetBasedOnTypeBinaryPred FACET BINPRED)</code> hold.\n<p>\nSee also the corresponding predicate #$facetOfCollectionBasedOnTypeBinaryPred.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac3c2).
