x_comment(x_totalRoledTypeInType,"<code>(#$totalRoledTypeInType NUM ROLE TYPE-PLAYING-ROLE TYPE)</code> means that <code>NUM</code> is the total number of things of <code>TYPE-PLAYING-ROLE</code> that played <code>ROLE</code> in situations of <code>TYPE</code>.  For instance, \n\n         <code>(#$totalRoledTypeInType 10000 #$organismKilled #$Person #$TerroristAttack)</code> means that, as far as we know in the KB, a total of 10000 persons were killed in terrorist attack.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac42f).
