x_comment(x_PhysicalPrincipleMicrotheory,"A specialization of #$PropositionalInformationThing.  Each instance of #$PhysicalPrincipleMicrotheory is a context containing assertions that express some particular more or less idealized aspect of the physical universe: some instance of #$PhysicalPrinciple (q.v.).  For example, some physical principles describe how objects behave under constant acceleration, which is an idealization that discounts any frictional forces.  See also the specialization of this collection, #$LawOfNatureMicrotheory.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac43a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac43a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
