x_comment(x_NewtonsSecondLaw,"An instance of #$LawOfNature (q.v.).  Newton's second law states that the net force acting on an object is equal to the mass of the object times its acceration.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac448).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac448,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
