x_comment(x_TriggeringOfEventTypeFn,"(#$TriggeringOfEventTypeFn <code>EVENT-TYPE</code>) denotes\nthe collection of #$Event sequences which culminate in an instance of\n<code>EVENT-TYPE</code>, and which begin with an event or events which\ncan be said to have 'triggered' that instance (cf.,\n#$TriggeringSomething).  Some degree of directness must hold of the\ncausal link between the triggering event (<code>TRIGGER</code>) and\nthe final event (<code>EVENT-INS</code>), i.e., there are limits on\nthe number and nature of intermediate steps between\n<code>TRIGGER</code> and <code>EVENT-INS</code>, though it is\ndifficult to state precisely what those limits are.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac44b).
