x_comment(x_InvestmentVehicle,"Each instance of #$InvestmentVehicle is an item that generally appreciates or depreciates in value, thereby affecting the financial worth of its owner.  Important specializations include some kinds of #$RealEstate,  #$TradeableSecurity, and #$CommodityFinancialProduct (qq.v).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac44f).
