x_comment(x_performsPercentageOfType,"(#$performsActsOfType-Percentage AGENT ACTION-TYPE PERCENT) holds just in case the percentage of the instances of ACTION-TYPE-1 that AGENT is known by Cyc to perform is PERCENT.  For instance, if 40% of the terrorist attacks in Israel are performed by Hamas, then (#$performsPercentageOfType #$TerroristOrganization-Hamas (#$CollectionSubsetFn #$TerroristAttack (#$TheSetOf ?ATT (#$eventOccursAt ?ATT #$Israel))) 40) holds.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac45c).
