x_comment('x_Shelf-Undersea',"A region of relatively shallow water with a gently sloping bottom, ringing or at least next to a continent or island.  Each #$Shelf-Undersea starts at the low water line and extends to the #$ShelfEdge-Undersea, beyond which the slope of the bottom drops off much more steeply.  Each #$Shelf-Undersea is next to a land mass, but not all land masses are completely ringed by or even next to shelves.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac46c).
