x_comment(x_LandMass,"A generalization of #$LandBody.  Each instance of #$LandMass is a large topographical features distingished from the surrounding features by abrupt and clearly delineated boundaries, generally by being of higher altitude. Examples include #$Continents, large #$Islands, and bulges rising above the 'datum' of planetary bodies are all elements of this collection. Instances include #$ContinentOfNorthAmerica on #$PlanetEarth, Ishtar Terra on #$PlanetVenus, Tempa Terra on #$PlanetMars, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac488).
