x_comment(x_BalancingReservoir,"A specialization of #$WaterReservoir.  Each instance of #$BalancingReservoir is a body of water contained in a holding basin in which variations in flow and composition are averaged. Such basins are typically used to provide a flow of reasonably uniform volume and composition to a treatment plant. Balancing reservoirs are also often called \"equalizing basins.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac48e).
