x_comment(x_damCreatesReservoir,"This predicate relates a dam to the reservoir it creates by damming a stream.  (#$damCreatesReservoir DAM RES) means that the #$Dam DAM creates the #$WaterReservoir RES. For example, (#$damCreatesReservoir #$HooverDam #$LakeMead) is true.  Note that some #$Dams don't really create a reservoir, but simply raise the water level of a small stream or divert water to a desired channel.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac499).
