x_comment(x_vectorMagnitude,"<code>(#$vectorMagnitude VECTOR MAG)</code> means that the magnitude of the #$VectorInterval <code>VECTOR</code> is the #$ScalarInterval <code>MAG</code>.  See also #$vectorPreciseMagnitude and #$vectorDirection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac4a3).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac4a3,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
