x_comment(x_primaryObjectConfigured,"This predicate relates an object configuration to the primary object configured in the situation.  <code>(#$primaryObjectConfigured CONFIG OBJ)</code> means that <code>OBJ</code> is the main thing configured in <code>CONFIG</code>.  All things besides <code>OBJ</code> configured in the situation, <code>SUBOBJ</code>, (i.e. bearing the #$configuredObjects relation to <code>CONFIG</code>), will be part (see #$parts) of <code>OBJ</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac4ac).
