x_comment(x_TranslatedDistance,"A specialization of #$Distance. #$TranslatedDistance is the collection of all distances that are translated by the primary objects moving in events (see #$distanceTranslated). Each instance of #$TranslatedDistance is the #$Distance between an object's starting location and ending location in a #$Movement-TranslationEvent.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac4ae).
