x_comment(x_sksiUnknownSentence,"A #$negationPreds of #$sksiSentence, #$sksiUnknownSentence is used in inference to translate CycL queries into SQL queries that employ the SQL subquery expression \"<code>NOT EXISTS SELECT ...</code>\". <code>(#$sksiUnknownSentence SENT)</code> is true if and only if <code>SENT</code> can be entirely translated into one or more SQL queries to some #$StructuredKnowledgeSource that is applicable within the context of the inference, and the SQL query \"<code>NOT EXISTS SQL-SENT</code>\" returns true for every SQL translation <code>SQL-SENT</code> of <code>SENT</code> and for every such structured knowledge source.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac4af).
