x_comment(x_sourceUnknownSentence,"A #$negationPreds of #$sourceSentence, #$sourceUnknownSentence is used in inference to translate CycL queries into SQL queries that employ the SQL subquery expression \"<code>NOT EXISTS SELECT ...</code>\". <code>(#$sourceUnknownSentence SKS SENT)</code> is true if and only if <code>SENT</code> can be entirely translated into one or more SQL queries to <code>SKS</code>, and the SQL query \"<code>NOT EXISTS SQL-SENT</code>\" returns true for every SQL translation <code>SQL-SENT</code> of <code>SENT</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac4b0).
