x_comment(x_KidnappingAndHoldingHostage,"A specialization of #$SeizingAndHoldingHostage.  In each\ninstance of #$KidnappingAndHoldingHostage, one or more #$Persons are\nkidnapped and subsequently held hostage.  Instances of this collection\nthus have instances of both #$KidnappingSomeone and #$HoldingHostages\nas sub-events.  Typically, the #$perpetrator issues demands for the\nrelease of the #$hostages, often for a ransom (see #$DemandingARansom)\nor for some action by government authorities.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac4b4).
