x_comment(x_Layer,"A specialization of #$SheetOfSomeStuff.  Each instance of #$Layer is a sheet-like object situated adjacent, surface-to-surface, to at least one surface or layer or region on one side, and possibly to other layers or surfaces on both sides.  An instance of #$Layer may be part of a larger object, or it may be an independent whole object, such as a hide confined in a stack of hides.  An instance of #$Layer is <i>not</i> an instance of #$FreeSheet.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac4c9).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac4c9,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
