x_comment(x_intendedMaleficiary,"<code>(#$intendedMaleficiary ACTION AGENT)</code> means that either (i) some agent who directs (see #$directingAgent) <code>ACTION</code> intends that <code>AGENT</code> be harmed in (see #$maleficiary) <code>ACTION</code> or (ii) there is no directing agent, but some agent who performs (see #$performedBy) <code>ACTION</code> intends that <code>AGENT</code> be a maleficiary of <code>ACTION</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac4ce).
