x_comment(x_damages,"<code>(#$damages EVT OBJ)</code> means that <code>OBJ</code> is acted on in <code>EVT</code> in such a way as to end up damaged.  Destruction is considered an extreme form of damage.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac4cf).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac4cf,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
