xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517ac4d0,[]).
x_comment(x_ElectronicTransferOfCWTypeFn,"(#$ElectronicTransferOfCWTypeFn <code>CW-TYPE</code>) denotes the\nsub-collection of #$InformationTransferEvent-Electronic events in\nwhich an instance (<code>CW-INS</code>) of <code>CW-TYPE</code> is the #$transferredThing.  Such\nevents typically involve transferring an\n#$AbstractInformationStructure corresponding to <code>CW-INS</code> (see\n#$infoStructureOfCW) by producing a new instantiation of this\nstructure through electronic means.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac4d1).
