x_comment(x_solutionStepResult,"(#$solutionStepResult STEP SENT) means that #$PhysicsWorkedSolutionStep STEP results in the addition of SENT to the worked solution of which it is a component.  This predicate is not functional in argument 2, for a solution step may have more than one result.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac4d4).
