x_comment(x_DeterminingTheNetForceOfASpecificTypeActingOnAnObject,"A specialization of #$DoingAddition and #$DeterminingACentralTendencyAmongASetOfValues. Each instance of #$DeterminingTheNetForceOfASpecificTypeActingOnAnObject\nis an event in which an agent determines the vector sum of all forces <i>of a specific type</i> (e.g. gravity, magnetism, or friction) acting on a particular object.\n<p>\nTo be precise, by \"a specific type\" of force, we mean: any <i>proper</i> specialization of #$ForceVector.  Hence this collection is disjoint with #$DeterminingTheNetForceActingOnAnObject, which involves determining the vector sum of <i>all</i> forces (of <i>any</i> type) acting on an object.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac4f1).
