x_comment('x_Demanding-Threatening',"A subcollection of #$Demanding-CommunicationAct.  In each\ninstance of #$Demanding-Threatening, an agent presents to another\na forceful request for a certain type of action, and threatens an\nundersirable result if this request is not fulfilled.  Instances of\n#$Demanding-Threatening are complex communication events in which both a\n#$Request and #$Threat are expressed and related in a certain way.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac4f9).
