x_comment(x_pegDerivedSentenceDrawsOnInterpretations,"<code>(#$pegDerivedSentenceDrawsOnInterpretations PEG CYCL MT)</code> means that the #$Microtheory <code>MT</code> represents a possible interpretation of the #$LinguisticExpressionPeg-CompleteUtterance <code>PEG</code> that properly contains (see #$termFormulas and #$different) a closed CycL sentence <code>S</code>, provable from the content model of <code>PEG</code> (see #$contentModelFocalPeg), that is also contained in <code>CYCL</code>, a CycL sentence that (thus) entails <code>S</code> and, like <code>S</code> is also true from the content model of PEG.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac4fe).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac4fe,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
