x_comment(x_sympathizers,"A specialization of #$positiveVestedInterest (q.v.). <code>(#$sympathizers AGENT SYMPATHIZER)</code> means that <code>SYMPATHIZER</code> is a sympathizer of <code>AGENT</code>; that is, <code>SYMPATHIZER</code> shares at least some of the ideological goals of <code>AGENT</code>, and hopes that <code>AGENT</code> will be successful in bringing about those goals.  For example, (#$sympathizers #$LabourParty-UK #$Bob) means that Bob is a sympathizer of the UK Labour Party.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac50b).
