x_comment(x_MGRSZoneCode,"The Military Grid Reference System is the geographic standard used by the United States Armed Forces and NATO for locating any point on the #$PlanetEarth with a 2 to 10 character #$Geocode. It is always displayed in an even number of numeral characters preceded by an alpha-numeric code describing the larger Earth area to which it belongs. A two digit numeral code after the alpha-numeric prefix implies a precision of 10km, and a ten digit code corresponds to a 1m precision with intermediate steps of 1km, 100m, and 10m.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac521).
