x_comment(x_ChangingWeaponMode,"A specialization of #$ChangingDeviceState. Each instance of #$ChangingWeaponMode is an event in which a weapon with multiple modes of use is switched from one mode to another. Instances of #$ChangingWeaponMode include changing a firearm from semi-automatic to fully automatic fire, and changing the orientation of a dagger from one suitable for slashing at an opponent to one suitable for throwing at an opponent.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac582).
