x_comment(x_DisambiguationStrategyFromPredAndRewardedArgsFn,"A #$ReifiableFunction and #$IndividualDenotingFunction.  An expression of the form (#$DisambiguationStrategyFromPredAndRewardedArgsFn PRED SET-OF-INTGERS) denotes an instance of #$DisambiguationScoringStrategy that is based on the semantic relation expressed by the #$Predicate PRED.  Further, the scoring strategy will assign points to a #$SemanticInterpretationHypothesisMicrotheory based on its hypothesized interpretation (call it, CYCL and see #$mtFocalContent and #$pegInterpretation-CycL) being able to enter into a provable formula that has PRED is its arg0 and CYCL as its Nth argument, where N is an element of SET-OF-INTEGERS.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac584).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac584,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517ac584,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
