xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517ac584,[]).
x_comment(x_ZoomingInOnSomething,"A specialization of both #$WatchingSomething and #$AidedVisualPerception. Each instance of #$ZoomingInOnSomething is an event in which an agent is watching something through a device such a motion-picture or television camera. During an instance of  #$ZoomingInOnSomething, the agent focuses in on some object in the visual field afforded by this device, making that object larger while keeping it in focus.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac585).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac585,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
