x_comment(x_ResettingAfterZoomingInOrOut,"A specialization of both #$WatchingSomething and #$AidedVisualPerception. Each instance of #$ResettingAfterZoomingInOrOut is an event in which an agent returns the focus to his or her original field of vision after zooming in or zooming out from that field. See the related collections #$ZoomingInOnSomething and #$ZoomingOutOnSomething.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac58e).
