x_comment(x_StrategyForPegSIHMRelationFn,"An expression of the form (#$StrategyForPegSIHMRelationFn PRED) is used to denote an instance of #$ScoringSoftwareStrategy based on a particular #$SemanticInterpretationHypothesisMicrotheory having a particular relationship to a #$LinguisticExpressionPeg.  Specifically, if (PRED PEG SIHM) holds for the #$BinaryPredicate and the #$LinguisticExpressionPeg PEG and the #$SemanticInterpretationHypothesisMicrotheory SIHM, then SIHM will receive some score based on its satisfaction of the #$ScoringSoftwareStrategy denoted by  (#$StrategyForPegSIHMRelationFn PRED).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac592).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac592,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
