x_comment(x_TerroristAttackTacticType,"A specialization of #$AttackType.  Each instance of this\ncollection is a collection of action types that are typically performed by terrorist agents as attacks.  For example, #$KillingPerson is not a specialization of #$TerroristAttacks, but it is typical of terrorist agents that their attacks are often instances of #$KillingPerson..") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac59c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac59c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
