x_comment('x_candidateExtractedContents-CycL',"<code>(#$candidateExtractedContents-CycL PEG CYCL)</code> means that the CycL expression <code>CYCL</code> is one of the CycL representations of content, either presupposed or directly contained, of the instance <code>PEG</code> of #$LinguisticExpressionPeg that is/has been under consideration.  Compare with #$candidatePegInterpretations-CycL and #$candidatePresupposedContents-CycL.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac59e).
