x_comment(x_playsRoleInSitTypeEnsuresRelnToA,"<code>(#$playsRoleInSitTypeEnsuresRelnToA ROLE SIT-TYPE AGENT COL RELN)</code> means that when <code>AGENT</code> plays the role <code>ROLE</code> in an instance of <code>SIT-TYPE</code>, the upshot is that <code>AGENT</code> comes to bear the relation <code>RELN</code> (expressed by a #$BinaryPredicate) to an instance of <code>COL</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac5a6).
