x_comment('x_offerInExchangeFor-PlaysRoleInSitType',"(#$offerInExchangeFor-PlaysRoleInSitType <code>OFFER</code>\n<code>OBJ</code> <code>SIT-TYPE</code> <code>ROLE</code>) means that\n<code>OFFER</code> has a conditional form, in which something is offered to the #$recipientOfInfo-Intended in exchange for some action on her part.  More specifically, what is asked in\nexchange is that the #$recipientOfInfo-Intended bring about some\ninstance of <code>SIT-TYPE</code> in which <code>OBJ</code> plays\n<code>ROLE</code>. For example, if <code>AGT1</code> offers to wash\n<code>AGT2</code> 's car in exchange for <code>AGT2</code>\nmowing <code>AGT1</code>'s lawn, then\n(#$offerInExchangeFor-PlaysRoleInSitType <code>OFFER</code>\n<code>AGT2</code> #$MowingGrass #$performedBy)") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac5a7).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac5a7,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
