x_comment(x_GeographicalSpaceRegion,"A specialization of both #$SpaceRegion-Empirical and #$GeographicalThing-Intangible-FixedLocation (qq.v.).  Instances of #$GeographicalSpaceRegion are pieces of space that are relevant to geographical reasoning. They are intangible points, lines, surfaces or three-dimensional areas that have a fixed location with respect to the region descriped by a map.  Specializations of #$GeographicalSpaceRegion include #$GeographicalPlace-0D, #$GeographicalPlace-1D, #$GeographicalPlace-2D and #$GeographicalPlace-3D.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac5b4).
