x_comment('x_ContentHypothesisMicrotheory-SentenceLevel',"The specialization of #$HypotheticalContext whose instances all hypothesize an interpretation or presupposed content of some contextualized information structure.  More precisely, every instance of this collection is such that its focal content (see #$mtFocalContent) hypothesize <code>(PRED STRUCTURE CYCL)</code> for some specialization (see #$genlPreds) <code>PRED</code> of #$pegExtractedContents-CycL, such that <code>(#$quotedIsa CYCL #$CycLSentence)</code>. ") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac5bd).
