x_comment(x_RescuingACaptive,"A subcollection of #$TransferringControlOfAnAgent.  In each\ninstance of #$RescuingACaptive, the #$captive in a #$HeldCaptive\nsituation is freed from the control of her #$captor through the actions of\na third party.  In such events, the erstwhile #$captor does not\nrelinquish control voluntarily (see also #$GettingFreeFromControl).\nNote that the rescued agent may be released immediately (in which case\nthe event is also an instance of #$GainingFreedom), or she may briefly \ncome under the control or custody of her rescuers (as is\nsometimes the case with police or military rescues).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac5c9).
