x_comment(x_ObjectTypeWRTPredFn,"A unary #$CollectionDenotingFunction that takes  a #$PartPredicate to the collection of all (and only those) collections that are object-like with respect to that part-predicate (see #$objectlikeWRTPred).  A collection <code>OBJECTTYPE</code> is an instance of <code>(#$ObjectTypeWRTPredFn PRED)</code> only if the following holds: if <code>OBJ</code> is an instance of <code>OBJECTTYPE</code> and <code>(PRED OBJ OBJPART)</code> holds, then <code>OBJPART</code> is <i>not</i> also an instance of <code>OBJECTTYPE</code>.\n<p>\nFor example, (#$ObjectTypeWRTPredFn #$properSubSituations) is the collection known more tersely as #$SituationalObjectType.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac5ca).
