x_comment(x_expressionPegAgreementPredicate,"<code>(#$expressionPegAgreementPredicate PEG PRED)</code> means that the instance <code>PEG</code> of #$LinguisticExpressionPeg has the agreement properties of <code>PRED</code>, an instance of #$TermPhrasesConstraintPredicate.  For example, where <code>(#$originalPhrase PEG \"a democracy\")</code>, </code>(#$expressionPegAgreementPredicate PEG #$singular)</code> would hold, as \"a democracy\" is a singular NP.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac5d4).
