x_comment(x_SearchStringInappropriateFunction,"Instances of <code>#$SearchStringInappropriateFunction</code> should be skipped when generating search strings for a web search.  For example, <code>#$TheSet</code> is a <code>#$SearchStringInappropriateFunction</code>, because <code>(#$TheSet A B C)</code> should not generate the string <code>\"{A,B,C}\"</code>, but rather the list of strings <code>(\"A\" \"B\" \"C\")</code>.  <code>#$MotherFn</code> on the other hand is <b>not</b> a <code>#$SearchStringInappropriateFunction</code>, because the search string <code>\"Chelsea Clinton's mother\"</code> would be an appropriate search string for <code>(#$MotherFn #$ChelseaClinton)</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac5e7).
