x_comment(x_nameStringForUSGSTopoMap,"<code>(#$nameStringForUSGSTopoMap NAME USGS-MAP)</code> means that the #$USGSTopographicMap <code>USGS-MAP</code> is identified by the name string, <code>NAME</code>. The name is produced by using the name of an important feature in the depicted area, and appending the two-letter state or territory abbreviation at the end after a comma. See also the function corresponding to this predicate, #$USGSTopographicMapNamedFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac611).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac611,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517ac611,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
