x_comment(x_TextLearnerDisambiguationResultsDistillationQuerySpecification,"The collection of instances of #$CycLQuerySpecification that are run by the Text Learner (see #$TheCycTextLearnerProgram) to distill the results of disambiguating text, so as to keep a permanent record of what the TextLearner has done without maintaining the enormous infrastructure (parse trees, etc.) used to do it. Like all instances of the more general collection, #$TextLearnerFinalizationQuerySpecification, these queries should mention (#$TheFn #$LinguisticExpressionPeg) -- for which will be substituted the peg for the sentence just read -- and return #$ist sentences suitable to be asserted and transmitted.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac64f).
