x_comment(x_structureSubstringForNthSentenceHasCandidatePresuppositionAndScore,"<code>(#$structureSubstringForNthSentenceHasCandidatePresuppositionAndScore STRUCTURE STRING N INTERPRETATION SCORE)</code> means that the <code>N</code>th sentence of the abstract structure (#$AbstractStructure, q.v.) <code>STRUCTURE</code> with corresponding string <code>STRING</code> has been assigned a semantic interpretation <code>INTERPRETATION</code> of its presupposed content with score <code>SCORE</code>.  See also #$structureSubstringForNthStructureOfTypeAtOffsetHasInterpretationAndScore, which is used to identify the possible semantic interpretations (versus presupposed content) of contextualized string-occurrences (see #$ContextualizedInformationStructure) and their scores.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac650).
