x_comment(x_prospectiveAntecedent,"A temporally qualifiable relation, <code>(#$prospectiveAntecedent ANE ANTE)</code> means that the linguistic expression <code>ANTE</code> is currently \"on the table\" as a candidate  antecedent for the anaphoric expression <code>ANA</code>.  As a discourse model develops and evidence about the grammatical and semantic properties of the two expressions are weighed, <code>(#$prospectiveAntecedent ANE ANTE)</code> can cease to hold.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac6bf).
