x_comment(x_GeostationarySatellite,"#$GeostationarySatellite is the collection of satellites\n(#$Satellite-Device) which orbit the #$PlanetEarth in the equatorial\nplane at an altitude of approximately (#$Mile 22300), which keeps them\nstationary with respect to a fixed point on the #$EarthsTopographicSurface. Often\n#$CommunicationsSatellites are put into geostationary orbits, since\ntheir fixed position enables Earth bound users to point their\nsatellite receivers at a fixed position in the sky.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac6d0).
