x_comment(x_JDBCDatatypeDescribedByFn,"(#$JDBCDatatypeDescribedByFn ID COLUMN-SIZE DIGITS TYPE-NAME) denotes a fully-specified #$ComputerDatatypeType described in the #$JDBCDatabaseProtocol's column metadata as having a base type identified by ID, an (optional) column size of COLUMN-SIZE (which gives the precision for numeric types and the string length or bit length for character or bit string types), an (optional) scale in the case of numeric types, and a DBMS-dependent type name of TYPE-NAME.  If values are not provided for the optional arguments, they are recorded as :NULL.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac6d5).
