x_comment(x_aggregateCNCResultForRuleWithThresholds,"(#$aggregateCNCResultForRuleWithThresholds RULE COMPOUND-THRESHOLD COMPONENT-THRESHOLD RESULT SEARCH-ENGINE) means that RESULT--a list of various data used in evaluating RULE--was obtained by evaluating RULE wrt. COMPONENT-THRESHOLD and COMPOUND-THRESHOLD.  The COMPOUND-THRESHOLD value represents a minimum number of hits which a compound-strings must have for candidate compounds to be regarded as sufficiently evident within a corpus to be of interest.  The COMPONENT-THRESHOLD value represents a minimum number of hits which the modifier- and head-strings for candiate compounds must have for candidates to count as vaild tests wrt. the corpus.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac6d8).
