x_comment(x_nearestCommonGenlsOfSet,"<code>(#$nearestCommonGenlsOfSet SET-OF-COLS NEAR-GENL)</code> means that\n<code>NEAR-GENL</code> is the nearest collection of which each element in <code>SET-OF-COLLS</code> is a specialization. \n<p>\nFor example, <code>(#$nearestCommonGenlsOfSet (#$TheSet #$Monarch-HeadOfState #$MaleAnimal #$FemaleAnimal) #$Animal)</code> means that #$Animal is the nearest collection of which #$Monarch-HeadOfState, #$MaleAnimal, and #$FemaleAnimal are each specializations.\n<p>\nSimilarly, (#$nearestCommonGenlsOfSet (#$TheSet #$FemaleAnimal) #$FemaleAnimal) is trivially true.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac701).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac701,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
