x_comment(x_maximalConsistentSubsets,"<code>(#$maximalConsistentSubsets SET SUBSET)</code> means that:\n<p>\n1. <code>SET</code>and <code>SUBSET</code> are sets of collections,<br>\n2. <code>SUBSET</code> is a subset of <code>SET</code>,<br>\n3. no element of <code>SUBSET</code> is disjoint with any other element of <code>SUBSET</code>,<br>\n4. every element of the complement of <code>SUBSET</code> with respect to <code>SET</code> is disjoint with some element of <code>SUBSET</code>.<br>\n<p>\nThis predicate is not functional in either argument position.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac716).
