x_comment(x_ImmediatelyRestrictingADatabaseModification,"#$ImmediatelyRestrictingADatabaseModification is the collection of events in which some database management system immediately restricts an agent from modifying a record in a database that is referenced by another record in the database. The difference between these events and #$LazilyRestrictingADatabaseModification is that here the database management system checks for integrity violation at the time that the modification is requested within a larger transaction block, whereas in the latter case the database management system checks the constraint at the end of a transaction block.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac724).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac724,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
