x_comment(x_LazilyRestrictingADatabaseModification,"#$LazilyRestrictingADatabaseModification is the collection of events in which some database management system lazily restricts an agent from modifying a record in a database that is referenced by another record in the database. The difference between these events and #$ImmediatelyRestrictingADatabaseModification is that in the latter case the database management system checks for integrity violation at the time that the modification is requested within a larger transaction block, whereas in this case the database management system checks the constraint at the end of a transaction block") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac725).
