x_comment(x_SpatiallyDisjointRegionType,"A collection of collections, and a specialization of #$RegionType.  Each instance of #$SpatiallyDisjointRegionType is a collection of geographical regions, where each of the regions in the collection is spatially disjoint with the other regions in the collection.  For example, the collection #$State-UnitedStates is an instance of #$SpatiallyDisjointRegionType, since the territories of U.S. states do not overlap.  Other instances of #$SpatiallyDisjointRegionType include #$CanadianProvince, #$IndependentCountry, #$City, and #$Colony-GeopoliticalEntity.  A non-example is #$EcologicalRegion, since ecological regions can overlap.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac72b).
