x_comment(x_GoalScoringRegion,"Players of certain games e.g. football, hockey, basketball, golf have the objective of getting a ball, puck etc in (see #$spatiallySubsumes) a particular element of #$GoalScoringRegion.  Typically success in this objective is a significant event of the game in question and typically entails that a point or several points is scored for the player's team.  Positive exemplars include the tube of space which a basket ball net surrounds, the space between football goal posts, an end zone in football, or the cavity of a golf ball hole on a golf course.  Negative exemplars include a football goal post, or a soccer goal net.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac737).
