x_comment(x_decreaseInValueReturnedBy,"The corresponding predicate of <code>#$DecreaseInValueReturnedByFn</code> (cf. <code>#$functionCorrespondingPredicate-Canonical</code>).  Where <code>FN</code> is an <code>#$EvaluatableFunction</code> whose value for admitted argument <code>ARG</code> changes over time, <code>(#$decreaseInValueReturnedBy FN ARG COL)</code> means that <code>COL</code> is the collection of <code>#$DecreaseEvents</code> where the scalar value returned by <code>(FN ARG)</code> is strictly greater at the start of the event than at the end.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac76c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac76c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
