x_comment(x_changeInValueReturnedBy,"The <code>#$functionCorrespondingPredicate-Canonical</code> of <code>#$ChangeInValueReturnedByFn</code>.  Where <code>FN</code> is a scalar-denoting function whose value on the <code>#$admittedArgument ARG</code> changes over time, <code>(#$changeInValueReturnedBy FN ARG COMPARE COL)</code> means that <code>COL</code> is the collection of all events such that the value given by <code>(FN ARG)</code> at <code>(#$EndFn COL)</code> has the relationship <code>COMPARE</code> to the value given by <code>(FN ARG)</code> at <code>(#$StartFn COL)</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac76d).
