x_comment(x_RelationTuplesFn,"(#$RelationTuplesFn ?PRED) :  A (#$ListOfTypeFn List) is returned, in which each element is a list of terms (a tuple) which are one set of bindings for the arguments of ?PRED.  The list returned contains such tuples for the entire extent of ?PRED.  In each tuple in the result, the order of the terms follows the argument order of ?PRED.  For example, (#$RelationTuplesFn #$capitalCity) would return a list whose elements include (#$TheList #$Japan #$CityOfTokyoJapan) and (#$TheList #$Italy #$CityOfRomeItaly).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac76f).
