x_comment(x_mostRecentImportantConceptEvent,"<code>(#$mostRecentImportantConceptEvent THING EVENT)</code> means that #$DeclaringConceptRelevanceOrIrrelevance\n<code>EVENT</code> is the most recent event that is important for assessing the relevance of the concept <code>THING</code> in the current context.\n<p>\nNOTE: This predicate should only be used in microtheories which specify the appropriate qualifications of assertions made with it: e.g., for whom the concept is pertinent, on what task, at what time and place, etc.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac794).
