x_comment(x_SecretServiceAgent,"The collection of law-enforcement agents who work for the United States Secret Service. Though many are uniformed officers, and though the USSS is tasked primarily with combatting counterfeiting, secret service agents are usually associated with the personal protection that the agency provides the US President and Vice President and their families.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac795).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac795,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
