x_comment(x_SpatialThingTypeByDimensionality,"A specialization of #$SpatialThingTypeByShape; a collection of collections of spatial things.  Each instance of #$SpatialThingTypeByDimensionality is a subcollection of #$SpatialThing (q.v.)  whose own instances are all and only those spatial things that have a certain something in common as regards their dimensionality.  Examples include #$ThreeDimensionalThing and #$PositiveDimensionalThing.  \n<p>\nSee also the specialization #$SpatialThingTypeByNumberOfDimensions.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac7d7).
