x_comment(x_SportsFranchiseTypeBySportFn,"A function that takes a sport (see #$Sport) and returns the collection of sports franchises (see #$SportsFranchise) built around a sports team for that sport. For example, <code>(#$SportsFranchiseTypeBySportFn #$Basketball-TheGame)</code> denotes the collection of basketball franchises, one instance of which, the Los Angeles Lakers (see #$LosAngelesLakers), is such that its focal sports team (see <code>(#$FocalTeamOfFranchiseFn #$LosAngelesLakers)</code> is a basketball team (see #$BasketballTeam).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac7e6).
