x_comment(x_sportsFranchiseTypeForSport,"<code>(#$sportsFranchiseTypeForSport FRANCHISE-TYPE SPORT)</code> identifies <code>FRANCHISE-TYPE</code> as the instance of #$SportsFranchiseTypeBySport whose instances are sports franchises (see #$SportsFranchise) whose focal team (see #$sportsFranchiseFocalTeam) is a <code>SPORT</code> team (i.e., a team whose primary function is to compete in performances of the sport <code>SPORT</code>).  For example,  <code>(#$sportsFranchiseTypeForSport (#$SportsFranchiseTypeBySportFn #$Basketball-TheGame) #$Basketball-TheGame)</code> identifies the denotation of <code>(#$SportsFranchiseTypeBySportFn #$Basketball-TheGame)</code> as the collection of basketball franchises, one instance of which, the Los Angeles Lakers (see #$LosAngelesLakers), is such that the team that it is built around (see <code>(#$FocalTeamOfFranchiseFn #$LosAngelesLakers)</code> is a basketball team (see #$BasketballTeam).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac7e7).
