x_comment('x_organizationName-Standard',"(#$organizationName-Standard TERM STRING) means that the #$ProperNameString STRING is one of the standard names for the thing denoted by TERM. These will normally be either the official name of an organization, or a slight variation on that name.  Thus, \"IBM, Inc.\" might be a standard name for #$IBMInc, just as \"IBM, Incorporated\" might be one.  A company should be related to its official name with #$organizationName-Official.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac837).
