x_comment(x_logicalSchemaFieldIndexicalOfTypeWithMultiplicity,"A quaternary predicate relating a logical schema, logical field, collection, and integer. <code>(#$logicalSchemaFieldIndexicalOfTypeWithMultiplicity SCHEMA INDEXICAL TYPE N)</code> means that:\n<p>\n1. <code>INDEXICAL</code> is a logical field indexical of <code>SCHEMA</code> (See #$logicalFieldIndexicals);\n<p>\n2. <code>INDEXICAL</code> is an indexical of a field of type <code>TYPE</code> (See #$indexicalForLogicalField and #$fieldIsa);\n<p>\n3. <code>INDEXICAL</code> is the <code>N</code>th indexical in <code>SCHEMA</code> corresponding to a field of type <code>TYPE<code>.\n<p>\nSee also the function corresponding to the second argument of this predicate, #$TheLogicalFieldValueFn.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ac83c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ac83c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
