x_comment(x_objectIDSubschema,"(#$objectIDSubschema ODS SET) means that the values taken on by list of indexical denoting terms SET serve together to uniquely determine the idobject of the object that instantiates the #$ObjectDefiningSchema ODS; that is, the membership of SET covaries with ODS instantiations (a change in instantiation entails that at least one field in SET changes its value, and vice versa) and SET is specified as the list of fields intended to uniquify the instantiating object.  This presupposes that every #$elementOf of SET is a #$LogicalField, and #$objectField of the #$ObjectDefiningSchema.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acae8).
