x_comment('x_join-left',"#$join-left is an #$ELRelation-OneWay designed to approximate a SQL left join in CycL.  It is a #$VariableArityPredicate whose arguments are #$CycLSentence-Askables.  <code>(#$join-left ARG1 ARG2 ... ARGN)</code> expands into a disjunction of increasingly long conjunctions of initial segments of its arguments: <code>(#$or ARG1 (#$and ARG1 ARG2) ... (#$and ARG1 ARG2 ... ARGN))</code>.  So a #$join-left sentence is true just in case some non-empty initial segment of its arguments is true ") :- x_cid(a65b16517acafd).
