x_comment(x_MapFunctionOverListSet,"A macro expanded evaluatable function, #$MapFunctionOverListSet is the composition of #$MapFunctionOverSet and #$MapFunctionOverList. If <code>FUNCTION</code> is a #$UnaryFunction and <code>LIST-SET</code> is a set of lists, i.e. an instance of <code>(#$SetOfTypeFn #$List)</code>, then <code>(#$MapFunctionOverListSet FUNCTION LIST-SET</code>) applies <code>FUNCTION</code> to each list member of each element of <code>LIST-SET</code> and returns a new set of lists. ") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb2c).
