x_comment(x_ExplicitRelationshipDefiningSchemaFn,"If <code>PREDICATE</code> is a #$Predicate and <code>ODS-LIST</code> is a list of #$ObjectDefiningSchemas, then <code>(#$ExplicitRelationshipDefiningSchemaFn PREDICATE ODS-LIST)</code> denotes the unique #$RelationshipDefiningSchema which is expressed in the Cyc ontology as logical sentences using <code>PREDICATE</code> and which relates the entities described by the members of <code>ODS-LIST</code>. Note that there are several well formedness conditions between the argument constraints on <code>PREDICATE</code> and the types of entities described by the members of <code>ODS-LIST</code> which must be met in order for the function to have a meaningful dentoatum.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb30).
