x_comment(x_commonShareholders,"<code>(#$commonShareholders CORPORATION AGENT)</code> means that the instance <code>AGENT</code> of #$SocialBeing is a shareholder (see #$shareholders) in the legal corporation (see #$LegalCorporation) <code>CORPORATION</code> with at least one share of common stock (see #$CommonStock).  Common shareholders have voting rights in the companies whose stock they hold.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb3c).
