x_comment(x_hasVotingRightsInOrganization,"<code>(#$hasVotingRightsInOrganization AGENT ORGANIZATION)</code> means that the instance <code>AGENT</code> of #$SocialBeing is able to vote in (some) elections held by and affecting the organization <code>ORGANIZATION</code>.  This is a very general relation, and does not specify what kinds of elections or what kinds of affects these elections have, or the degree to which <code>AGENT</code>'s \"say\" in such an election matters from the perspective of the organization.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb3d).
