x_comment(x_schemaIntegrationPredicateForInputExplicitRDSSet,"This relates a schema integration to a predicate and the set of explicitly defined relationship defining schemas relating source object defining schemas using the predicate. That is, <code>(#$schemaIntegrationPredicateForInputExplicitRDSSet INTEGRATION PREDICATE SOURCE-RDS-SET)</code> means that:<p>\n1. <code>SOURCE-RDS-SET</code> is the set of explicitly defined #$RelationshipDefiningSchemas that state relationships between the input object defining schemas in <code>INTEGRATION</code>;<p>\n2. <code>PREDICATE</code> is the predicate that states the meaning of the relationship between the participating object defining schemas.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb45).
