x_comment(x_schemaIntegrationTypeForInputExplicitRDSSet,"This predicate relates each of the object schema types for a schema integration to the set of explicitly represented relationship defining schemas that relate some object defining schema of the given type. That is, <code>(#$schemaIntegrationTypeForInputExplicitRDSSet INTEGRATION TYPE RDS-SET)</code> means that in the schema integration <code>INTEGRATION</code>, each #$RelationshipDefiningSchema in the set <code>RDS-SET</code> relates some #$ObjectDefiningSchema of type <code>TYPE</code> (determined via #$schemaIsa). See also #$schemaIntegrationTypeForInputImplicitRDSSet.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb46).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517acb46,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
