x_comment(x_schemaIntegrationTypeForInputImplicitRDSSet,"This predicate relates each of the object schema types for a schema integration to the set of relationship defining schemas that implicitly relate (See #$ImplicitRelationshipDefiningSchemaFn) some object defining schema of the given type. That is, <code>(#$schemaIntegrationTypeForInputImplicitRDSSet INTEGRATION TYPE RDS-SET)</code> means that in the schema integration <code>INTEGRATION</code>, each #$RelationshipDefiningSchema in the set <code>RDS-SET</code> implicitly relates some #$ObjectDefiningSchema of type <code>TYPE</code> (determined via #$schemaIsa). See also #$schemaIntegrationTypeForInputExplicitRDSSet.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb47).
