x_comment(x_Polyhedron,"A specialization of #$ThreeDimensionalGeometricThing and #$SimplyConnectedThing (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$Polyhedron is a 3-D, simply-connected, geometrically-describable object whose entire surface (see #$PolyhedralSurface) is a finite, unbounded #$SurfaceRegion that is the spatial sum of several (i.e. four or more) polygons (see #$Polygon).") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb5d).
