x_comment(x_obligationHasPriorityOverObligationForAgent,"<code>(#$obligationHasPriorityOverObligationForAgent PRIOR-OBLIGATION OBLIGATION AGENT)</code> means that the instance <code>AGENT</code> of #$IntelligentAgent is obliged to fufill the instance <code>PRIOR-OBLIGATION</code> of #$Obligation before fufilling the distinct instance of #$Obligation <code>OBLIGATION</code>.  Thus this predicate entails the existence of a third obligation that specifies which obligation takes priority.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb84).
