x_comment(x_SpatialOrderingPredicate,"A specialization of both #$SpatialPredicate and #$OrderingPredicate (qq.v.).  Each instance of #$SpatialOrderingPredicate is an antisymmetric, transitive, binary predicate that can be used for ordering a #$PhysicalSeries (or other series of spatial objects) in such a way that the predicate relates each element of the series to each subsequent element.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb85).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517acb85,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
