x_comment(x_seriesDefiningMemberType,"(#$seriesDefiningMemberType SERIES TYPE) identifies TYPE as the instance of #$Collection that defines SERIES as a SERIES of a given type.  Thus, for any instances of #$Series SERIES, a thing THING is a member of that SERIES (i.e., (#$seriesMembers SERIES THING) holds) if and only if THING is a part of SERIES (i.e., (#$parts SERIES THING)) and THING is an instance of TYPE.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb89).
