x_comment(x_MostCapturedFn,"A collection denoting unary function.  (#$MostCapturedFn COLL) denotes the subcollection of COLL that consists of the instances that have the most number of persons captured in the event.  There could be more than one \"most captured in\" event in because of ties.  Most often though, this will return a collection with a single instance.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb8b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517acb8b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
