x_comment(x_TermSuppressedAtTheTopLevelOfCycInference,"A specialization of #$CycLClosedDenotationalTerm.  Each instance of #$TermSuppressedAtTheTopLevelOfCycInference is a CycL term that, by default (with standard inference parameter settings), is filtered from the set of results returned by the Cyc inference engine as the result of a query. For example, because #$TheTerm is a specialization of #$TermSuppressedAtTheTopLevelOfCycInference, this query:\n<p>\n<pre>\n(new-cyc-query\n  '(#$isa ?PRES #$UnitedStatesPresident)\n  '(#$MtSpace #$CurrentWorldDataCollectorMt-NonHomocentric \n  (#$MtTimeWithGranularityDimFn \n   (#$MonthFn #$June \n     (#$YearFn 1995)) #$TimePoint))\n  `(:INFERENCE-MODE :MINIMAL\n    :MAX-TIME 30\n    :PROBABLY-APPROXIMATELY-DONE 0.9500000000000001\n    :ANSWER-LANGUAGE :HL\n    :CONTINUABLE? T)\n)\n</pre>\n<p>\nWill return this result only:\n<p> \n<code>\n#$BillClinton\n</code>\n<p>\nWhereas, if the inference parameter <code>:allow-indeterminite-results</code> is set to <code>t</code>, these answers will be returned:\n<p>\n<code>\n#$BillClinton\n(#$TheFn #$UnitedStatesPresident)\n</code>\n<p>\nThis collection is a useful tool for preventing Cyc from sounding like a \"wise guy\" by answering questions with trivial and uninformative correct answers.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb8c).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517acb8c,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517acb8c,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
xc_source_line(a65b16517acb8c,24203).
xc_kb_names(a65b16517acb8c,[]).
xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517acb8c,[]).
x_comment(x_TermExemptFromUniqueNamesAssumption,"A specialization of #$CycLClosedDenotationalTerm.  Each instance of #$TermExemptFromUniqueNamesAssumption is a CycL term that is not by default assumed to be #$different all other terms.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb8d).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517acb8d,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
