x_comment(x_memberOfTuple,"A binary predicate that relates a given #$Tuple to any of the items in that tuple.  <code>(#$memberOfTuple MEMBER TUPLE)</code> means that <code>MEMBER</code> is a  member of <code>TUPLE</code>.  Where <code>TUPLE</code> is an instance of #$List (q.v.), the more specialized predicate #$memberOfList will apply as well.  \n<p>\nSee also #$tupleIndexSet and #$tupleMemberIndex.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acb99).
