x_comment(x_CorporationSole,"The collection of all 'corporation soles' as defined in common law countries.  A #$CorporationSole is an individual #$Person who acts directly as a corporation (it is not a #$SoleProprietorship).   This form is used principally as the means of holding assets of a church or state under the control of one person, such as a bishop or king.  It also provides a means of passing the assets and authority of the entity to a successor.  One prominent example of a #$CorporationSole is the #$TheBritishCrown.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acbf9).
