x_comment(x_ObjectTypeByAdultHumanlyDoableAction,"A specialization #$FirstOrderCollection,  Each instance of #$ObjectTypeByAdultHumanlyDoableAction is a collection of objects on which ordinary adult humans can, under normal conditions, do actions of a certain sort.  For example, #$HumanlyHurdlableObject is an instance of #$ObjectTypeByAdultHumanlyDoableAction.  It is the collection of objects that, in ordinary circumstances, ordinary adult humans can overleap.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acc1f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517acc1f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
