x_comment(x_physicalFieldIndexicals,"(#$physicalFieldIndexicals SCHEMA INDEXICAL) means that INDEXICAL is an indexical used to denote the value in a row for a physical field in the physical schema, SCHEMA. This predicate is a #$typedGenlPreds of #$schemaFieldIndexicals. See also #$physicalFields for a similar predicate for relating a physical field to a physical schema.  Assertions using this predicate are typically inferred from forward rules.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acc20).
