x_comment(x_schemaIntegrationInputRDSSetHasTargetRDS,"This predicate is the analogue for #$RelationshipDefiningSchemas of #$schemaIntegrationInputODSSetHasTargetODS. <code>(#$schemaIntegrationInputRDSSetHasTargetRDS INTEGRATION INPUT-RDS-SET TARGET-RDS)</code> means that in the SKS schema integration <code>INTEGRATION</code> (see #$IntegratingASetOfKnowledgeSources), <code>TARGET-RDS</code> is the relationship defining schema in the target knowledge source that unifies all of the input relationship defining schemas in <code>TARGET-RDS-SET</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acc27).
