x_comment(x_schemaIntegrationTypeForInputODSSet,"If <code>INTEGRATION</code> is an #$IntegratingASetOfKnowledgeSources, <code>INPUT-ODS-SET</code> is the set of input object defining schemas to be integrated (see #$schemaIntegrationInputODSSet), and <code>TYPE</code> is one of the object field types associated with <code>INTEGRATION</code> (see #$schemaIntegrationObjectFieldTypeSet), then <code>(#$schemaIntegrationTypeForInputODSSet INTEGRATION TYPE ODS-SET)</code> means that each element of <code>INPUT-ODS-SET</code> is an object defining schema (see #$ObjectDefiningSchema) of type <code>TYPE</code> (see #$schemaIsa) that is associated with some element of <code>INPUT-SET</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acc33).
