x_comment(x_ObjectTypeByTaste,"A collection of collections.  Each instance of #$ObjectTypeByTaste is a collection of instances of #$PartiallyTangible that share some particular qualitative taste.  Some important instances are #$SaltyTaste, #$BitterTaste, #$SweetTaste, and #$SourTaste.  Instances of #$ObjectTypeByTaste can also be functionally denoted using #$TasteFn, e.g., (#$TasteFn #$Pizza) returns the collection of all instances of #$PartiallyTangible that have the taste of pizza.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acc37).
