x_comment(x_CoastlineFn,"<code>(#$CoastlineFn REG)</code> denotes the entirety of the coastline of the region <code>REG</code>. This may involve a few discontinuous pieces, as with (#$CoastlineFn #$Spain). The coastline of a region may include the coast of an #$InlandSea, if that inland sea provides easy access to #$EarthsOceanSea. For example, #$Iran's piece of the #$CaspianSea does not count as part of the (#$CoastlineFn #$Iran), since the #$CaspianSea provides no ocean access; but #$Ukraine's border with the #$BlackSea does count as part of the (#$CoastlineFn #$Ukraine), since the #$BlackSea provides access to the #$MediterraneanSea.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acc94).
