x_comment('x_instanceDiffersFromPrototypicalInstance-Addition',"(#$instanceDiffersFromPrototypicalInstance-Addition INST TYPE SCRIPT ADDITION) means that the assertion ADDITION references INST, and when INST is compared with a protototypical instance of TYPE generated by propagating the assertions in SCRIPT to deductive closure, no comparable assertion (an assertion formed by substituting occurrences of the prototype for occurrences of INST) is found for the prototype.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acca0).
