x_comment('x_instanceDiffersFromPrototypicalInstance-Conflict',"Where CONFLICT is an ordered pair of assertions, (#$instanceDiffersFromPrototypicalInstance-Conflict INST TYPE SCRIPT CONFLICT) means that the pair of assertions in CONFLICT is such that the first assertion references INST, and the second assertion is in the deductive closure produced by forward-propagating the assertions in SCRIPT on a hypothesized instance of TYPE, and if INST were substituted for the hypothesized instance occurring in the second assertion, a contradiction would result.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acca2).
