x_comment(x_namedAfter,"A binary predicate that relates one instance  of #$Thing to another.  <code>(#$namedAfter NAMED SOURCE)</code> means that a commonly used term for <code>NAMED</code> is derived from a commonly used term for <code>SOURCE</code>.  Many things may be named after a single thing.  For example, #$WashingtonMonumentInWashingtonDC and #$Washington-State are both named after #$GeorgeWashington.  Also, one thing can be named after more than one other thing.  For example, #$ZermeloFraenkelSetTheory is named after #$AdolfFraenkel and #$ErnstZermelo.") :- x_cid(a65b16517accb4).
