x_comment(x_lowToMediumAmountOf,"The instance of #$GenericValuePredicate (q.v.) that corresponds to (see #$correspondingGenericValuePredicate) the generic-value function #$LowToMediumAmountFn (q.v.).  <code>(#$lowToMediumAmountOf QUANTTYPE QUANTITY)</code> holds just in case <code>QUANTITY</code> is the #$GenericQuantity that corresponds to a <i>low-to-medium amount</i> of <code>QUANTTYPE</code>.\n<p>\nFor example, <code>(#$lowToMediumAmountOf #$Happiness (#$LowToMediumAmountFn #$Happiness))</code> holds.  And <code>(#$levelOfCompatibility OLDTHING NEWTHING #$lowToMediumAmountOf)</code> holds just in case <code>OLDTHING</code> and <code>NEWTHING</code> are compatible to a low-to-medium degree.") :- x_cid(a65b16517accff).
