x_comment(x_maritimeClaimOf,"(#$maritimeClaimOf GEO-ENTITY ZONE) means that ZONE is the belt of sea which forms the maritime claim of some coastal entity ENT. U.N. regulations specify how countries may figure their maritime claims. Typically, a country has control over the waters, ocean bed, and subsoil of its maritime claim region, as well as to the airspace over it.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd18).
