x_comment(x_SexualProductOrServiceEvent,"This is the collection of all #$Artifacts and #$ServiceEvents intended for the sexual entertainment of users, viewers, or participants.  In many societies, because of their explicit sexual nature, such things are particularly unsuitable for non-adults.  The collection includes, but is not limited to, #$InformationBearingThings that present sexually explicit content as entertainment (e.g., movies with an #$XRating), #$Events with high sex-relevant content (e.g., lap dances, #$Prostitution events), and #$PersonalProducts used by adults for #$SexualGratification (e.g., #$SexToys, #$Whips, hand cuffs).") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd1a).
