x_comment(x_predicateIsComposedOfThroughArg2Positions,"<code>(#$predicateIsComposedOfThroughArg2Positions  COMP-PRED PRED-1 PRED-2)</code> means that the binary predicate <code>COMP-PRED</code> is the composition of the binary predicates <code>PRED-1</code> and <code>PRED-2</code> such that if <code>(#$predicateIsComposedOfThroughArg2Positions COMP-PRED PRED-1 PRED-2)</code>, then <code>(COMP-PRED X Z)</code> if and only if there is something, <code>Y</code>, such that <code>(PRED-1 X Y)</code> and <code>(PRED-2 Z Y)</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd39).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517acd39,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
