x_comment(x_grandfathers,"A #$FamilyRelationSlot relating an #$Animal to his or her grandfathers.  If <code>(#$grandfathers ANIM GF)</code>, then <code>GF</code> is the male parent (#$father) of one of the parents of <code>ANIM</code>.  In the case of #$NonHumanAnimals, there is a line of direct biological descent from <code>GF</code> to <code>ANIM</code>.  However, in the case of humans, because the #$children relationship can also arise due to a variety of social arrangements in addition to birth (e.g., #$Adoption, marriage, fostering), a person and their grandfathers may not be biologically related.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd48).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517acd48,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
