x_comment(x_DetectionOfCollaborationOpportunityFn,"An instance of #$ReifiableFunction that signifies the detection of a potential collaboration opportunity between two or more CAE users. For example, (#$DetectionOfCollaborationOpportunityFn (#$TheSet (#$TheList USER1 CONCEPT1) (#$TheList USER2 CONCEPT2)) DATE) means that, on DATE, Cyc discovered a potential collaboration opportunity between users USER1, working on topic CONCEPT1, and USER2, working on topic CONCEPT2.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd50).
