x_comment(x_cwGenre,"(#$cwGenre WORK GENRE) states that the #$ConceptualWork ?WORK has the #$ArtisticTypeByStyle GENRE. For example,  (#$cwGenre #$GoneWithTheWind-TheBook (#$GenreFn #$LiteraryWork-CW #$PropositionalConceptualWork-RomanceGenre)) states that the book 'Gone With The Wind' has the attribute of being of the romance genre.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd52).
