x_comment(x_oppositeCollections,"This specialization of disjointWith (q.v.) relates incompatible collections that are \"direct opposites\" of each other. <code>(#$oppositeCollections COLL1 COLL2)</code> means that <code>COLL1</code> is the \"directly opposite\" collection of <code>COLL2</code> (and vice versa). The sense of \"opposite\" intended here is intuitively familiar, but difficult to define precisely.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd59).
