x_comment(x_ProductTypeByBrandVersion,"A collection of collections.  Each instance of #$ProductTypeByBrandVersion is a collection of all instances of a particular version of a #$ProductTypeByBrand. The level of specificity here can vary.  For example, VolkswagenJetta and VolkswagenJettaGTI would both be instances of #$ProductTypeByBrandVersion, since both pick out not just a #$ProductTypeByBrand (#$VolkswagenCar) but a specific, named version of that #$ProductTypeByBrand.  However, since it is a more specific subset, VolkswagenJettaGTI would be a spec of VolkswagenJetta.  Those instances of #$FormalProductType in which the product specification is restricted to a single #$brandNameOfProductType, such as PetcoGroomingPoodlePuppyCut are also instances of #$ProductTypeByBrandVersion.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd5c).
