x_comment(x_MentalState,"A specialization of #$MentalSituation whose instances \nare relatively enduring mental <i>states</i>, such as beliefs (and other propositional attitudes) and moods of particular agents, as opposed to the more dynamic mental <i>events</i> (see #$AtLeastPartiallyMentalEvent) such as thinking, perceiving, and experiencing pain.  (Note that, while generally more long-lived than a mental event, a mental state might exist for only a fraction of a second; e.g. \"For one fleeting moment the quarterback believed his team had won the game\".)") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd63).
