x_comment(x_expertRegarding,"<code>(#$expertRegarding AGT X)</code> means that the knowledge about <code>X</code> that the agent <code>AGT</code> has is extensive.  This predicate is stronger than #$knowsAbout in the sense that <code>(#$expertRegarding AGT X)</code> implies <code>(#$knowsAbout AGT X)</code>, but the converse does not in general hold.  For example, while many Americans know about #$Basketball-TheGame, few are experts regarding #$Basketball-TheGame.  See also #$fieldsOfCompetence and #$domainsOfSpecialization.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd67).
