x_comment('x_LineSegment-Straight',"A #$GeometricShapeType and a specialization of #$LineSegment, #$LinearObject-Straight, and #$LinearObject-Bounded (qq.v.).  This is the collection of straight line segments.  Each instance of #$LineSegment-Straight is a portion of a #$Line-Straight, having two end points and containing all colinear points between those end points.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd74).
