x_comment(x_SectorShapedObject,"A #$GeometricShapeType and thus a specialization of #$GeometricallyDescribableThing.  This is the collection of all  sector (i.e. \"pie-slice\") shaped objects, whether tangible or intangible.   A two-dimensional #$SectorShapedObject is bounded by two line segments with a common vertex and by an arc of a circle whose center is that vertex.  A three-dimensional #$SectorShapedObject has two parallel, congruent surfaces that are 2-D sector-shaped.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd77).
