x_comment('x_Ray-Geometrical',"A #$GeometricShapeType and a specialization of #$LinearObject-Straight (q.v.).  The collection of all geometric rays, or half-lines.  Each instance of #$Ray-Geometrical has a single end point and contains all the points on a #$Line-Straight (containing the end point) that lie in a given direction from that point.  Any given straight line can be divided at any point incident in it into two rays.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd78).
