x_comment(x_MetricUnitOfMeasure,"An instance of #$UnitOfMeasureTypeBySystem and a specialization of #$InternationalUnitOfMeasure.  Each instance of #$MetricUnitOfMeasure is a #$UnitOfMeasure that can be given an <i>exact</i> definition in terms of instances of #$SIUnitOfMeasure-Base (q.v.).  #$MetricUnitOfMeasure is a generalization of #$SIUnitOfMeasure, since some units of measure (e.g. #$MetricTon, #$Liter, #$MinutesDuration) can be defined in terms of SI base units only by introducing a numerical factor other than 1, which is forbidden by SI (and all other \"coherent\" systems of measurement--see #$UnitOfMeasureTypeBySystem-Coherent), but not by the \"metric system\" in the colloquial sense, which is what this collection is intended to represent.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd79).
