x_comment('x_sentencesInducedByProgram-OverSubsetsOfPopulatedPreds',"<code>(#$sentencesInducedByProgram-OverSubsetsOfPopulatedPreds PROG PRED-COUNT COMBO-COUNT MT SENTENCE-SET))</code> means that, after the ILP program <code>PROG</code> iterates through the extent in microtheory <code>MT</code> of each of the <code>PRED-COUNT</code> predicates in the sets of size <code>COMBO-COUNT</code>, <code>PROG</code> has sufficient evidence to induce the sentences in the set <code>SENTENCE-SET</code>.  \n<p>\nAt the code level, the size of <code>PRED-COUNT</code> is typically set to 6, and the size of <code>COMBO-COUNT</code> is typically set to 3.  These are generally the values that should be passed: using any other values could be very expensive.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd93).
