x_comment('x_sentencesInducedByProgram-InMt',"<code>(#$sentencesInducedByProgram-OverSubsetsOfPopulatedPreds PROG MT SENTENCE-SET))</code> means that, after the ILP program <code>PROG</code> iterates through the extent in microtheory <code>MT</code> of each of the 6 predicates in the sets of size 3 or less, <code>PROG</code> has sufficient evidence to induce the sentences in the set <code>SENTENCE-SET</code>.  \n<p>\nSee also #$sentencesInducedByProgram-OverSubsetsOfPopulatedPreds, which allows one to adjust the values that this predicate assumes will be 6 and 3 (the number of most-populous predicates found, and the maximumsize of the subsets passed to ILP.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acd94).
