x_comment(x_constantAngularAccelerationOfPrimaryObjectMoving,"<code>(#$constantAngularAccelerationOfPrimaryObjectMoving ROTATION RATE)</code> means in the #$Movement-Rotation <code>ROTATION</code> where the primary moving object (see #$primaryObjectMoving) is <code>OBJ</code>, <code>RATE</code> is rate angularAcceleration of <code>OBJ</code> throughout <code>ROTATION</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acddb).
