x_comment(x_TerroristAttackTargetTypeType,"A collection of collections.  Each instance of #$TerroristAttackTargetTypeType is a collection a specialization of which, TYPE, appears in a (#$relationInstanceExists #$intendedAttackTargets FOO TYPE) assertion for some FOO.  The instances which have been selected offer the most complete coverage of the collections appearing in those assertions.  It is useful, but not necessary, to think of this collection as a near faceting of the (non-reified) collection of things targeted in terrorist attacks.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acdfc).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517acdfc,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517acdfc,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
