x_comment(x_suggestionsForPredRelativeToGenlsInArg,"<pre>(#$suggestionsForPredRelativeToGenlsInArg PRED COLL-1 N COLL-2 M)</pre> holds just in case COLL-1 is the collection of terms that are suitable suggestions for substitution into arg N of PRED when an specialization of COLL-2 stands in arg M.\n\n<br><br>\nFor example,   \n<br><br>\n(#$suggestionsForPredRelativeToIsaInArg #$isa #$TerroristAttackTacticType 2 #$AttackOnObject 2)\n<br><br>\n means that instances of #$TerroristAttackTacticType should be offered up as suggested replacements in arg1 of #$isa literals when an specialization of #$AttackOnObject appears in arg1 of the literal.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ace02).
