x_comment(x_familyName,"<code>(#$familyName PERSON STRING)</code> means that #$Person <code>PERSON</code> is known by the #$HumanFamilyNameString <code>STRING</code> as his or her family name (surname).  E.g., (#$familyName #$Lenat \"Lenat\").  A person rarely has more than one family name at any one time.  Family names may change as a result of certain actions, such as marriages, deaths, etc., in various cultures.  In current (20th Century) Western cultures, #$familyNames are the same as #$lastNames, while in many Eastern cultures (Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Vietnamese) they are #$firstNames.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ace26).
