x_comment('x_Analyst-PertinentConcept',"An instance of #$ConceptTypeByDomain.  Generally speaking, instances of #$Analyst-PertinentConcept are concepts and relations such as are used by intelligence analysts reasoning about threat situations.  Specifically, all core concepts in this domain (see #$coreConceptOfDomain) are either 1) #$BinaryPredicates referenced in AKB Fact Entry Templates, 2) #$TernaryPredicates referenced in AKB Fact Entry Templates, 3:)#$FirstOrderCollections that are asserted to be #$argIsas of #$BinaryPredicates referenced in AKB Fact Entry Templates, 4) #$FirstOrderCollections that are asserted to be #$argIsas of #$TernaryPredicates referenced in AKB Fact Entry Templates, 5) #$FirstOrderCollections that are asserted to be #$argGenls of #$TernaryPredicates referenced in AKB Fact Entry Templates, or 6) concepts or relations that are instances of instances of #$TKBInterfaceCollection.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ace3b).
