x_comment(x_ComputerDataArtifact,"The collection of all pieces of computer data stored in hardcopy form or in computer memory. This collection includes all such information, such as data streams (e.g., bits or bytes of data in addressable memory) and more complex objects such as files in a filesystem (see the specialization of this collection, #$ComputerFileCopy).  Instances of #$ComputerDataArtifact are  <i>non-agentive</i> existing things; thus computer processes and software agents are not instances of this collection.  Instances of #$ComputerDataArtifact are actual physical objects  which encode information (e.g., via ink on paper or magnetic domains, holes in a piece of paper, or voltage fluctuations in a device corresponding to bits or bytes).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ace3f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ace3f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
