x_comment('x_Section-PCW',"The collection of all sub-works of instances of #$TextualPCW explicitly identified within the work (through numbering or some other indicator) as \"sections.\"  In CycL, this relationship is reified as #$textualPCWSections; membership in this collection is defined in terms of this relationship.  These sub-works typically appear in instances of #$Article-PCW, #$Chapter-PCW, or in textual instances of #$CodeOfConduct.  By definition, this collection excludes certain types of sub-works, such as #$Chapter-PCW, which are often, literally, numbered sections, but merely sections in the sense of #$textualPCWSubSections, and not in the sense of \"section\" intended to be represented here.  Also excluded from this collection are sub-works of works explicitly identified as \"parts,\" -- a category typically used to distinguish these sub-works from chapters, sections, appendixes, and the like.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acf1a).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517acf1a,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
