x_comment(x_textualPCWSections,"<code>(#$textualPCWSections PCW SECTION)</code> identifies <code>SECTION</code> as a sub-work of the #$TextualPCW <code>PCW</code> that is explicitly identified as a \"section\" (versus a \"chapter\" or \"part\" or other sub-work category) of that work.  See also #$Section-PCW, the collection of all values of <code>SECTION</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acf1b).
