x_comment(x_textualPCWSubSectionIDString,"<code>(#$textualPCWSubSectionIDString PCW ID-STRING)</code> means that the instance <code>PCW</code> of #$TextualPCW is a #$textualPCWSubSections of some larger work such that <code>PCW</code> has been assigned an ID string </code>ID-STRING</code> that serves to both identify <code>PCW</code> and order it among other, similar sub-sections of the same work.  For example, <code>#$textualPCWSubSectionIDString 16USC-ChapterIA \"IA\")</code> relates Chapter IA of Title 16 of the United States Code to the string \"IA,\" which serves both as a way to identify that chapter and to order it among other chapters of Title 16.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acf1d).
