x_comment(x_agreementAuthorization,"<code>(#$agreementAuthorization AGREEMENT AUTHORITY)</code> means that the #$agreeingAgents in the instance <code>AGREEMENT</code> of #$Agreement are authorized to enter into <code>AGREEMENT</code> by <code>AUTHORITY</code>, an instance of #$InformationStore, typically a code of conduct such as an instance of #$Law or a set of policies.  Hence <code>(#$agreementAuthorization AGREEMENT AUTHORITY)</code> entails that <code>(#$authorizationFor AUTHORITY ACTION)</code>, where <code>ACTION</code> is the instance of #$MakingAnAgreement that produced <code>AGREEMENT</code>.   Note that not all agreements will have this property.") :- x_cid(a65b16517acf6f).
