x_comment(x_ExchangeOfGunfire,"The collection of all #$ConflictEvents consisting primarily in an exchange of gunfire between aggrieved parties, which may be single individuals or groups of persons.  By 'exchange' we mean that the parties are firing at each other, using instances of #$Gun-Portable, with the intent to cause bodily injury or death:  we stipulate further that this is primarily what the event consists in.  At a minimum, every #$ExchangeOfGunfire consists in at least two instances of #$ShootingAGun-Portable:  where A and B are #$opponentsInConflict in the exchange, and are both persons, there must be at least one shooting at B by A and one shooting at A by B, and where A and B are groups of persons, at least one member of A must shoot at at least one member of B and at least one member of B must shoot at at least one member of A.  The shootings need not occur in any particular order and may be simultaneous.  Casualties are possible but not necessary.  Classic examples include the shootout at the Okay Corral and Butch and Sundance's last stand.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad185).
