x_comment(x_OrganSystem,"An instance of #$OrganismPartType.  Each instance of #$OrganSystem is a group of organs (see #$Organ) that are part of a single organism and, by applying conventions accepted in the field of anatomy, are considered to be related in a way that warrants treating the group as a cohesive anatomical part in its own right.  Organ systems are frequently classified as such due to function (see, e.g., #$UrinarySystem).  However, in some cases, they are classified because of common developmental origin in embryos (see, e.g., #$GenitourinarySystem.)") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad22b).
