x_comment(x_pathConveysType,"<code>(#$pathConveysType PATH COLL)</code> means that the particular instance of path <code>PATH</code> can carry instances of the type <code>COLL</code>, provided that <code>PATH</code> is functioning properly or in good repair.  For instance, a telephone line might carry information, a road might carry vehicles, etc. See also #$pathTypeConveysType.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad231).
