x_comment(x_subSystems,"<code>(#$subSystems SUPER SUB)</code> means that <code>SUB</code> isa a part of <code>SUPER</code> that can stand by themselves, i.e. have independent existence and still be more or less the same, e.g. the amp in a stereo system or the console of a computer, or the physical protocol in a layered protocol. However, the handle of a cup would typically not be a considered a subsystem of the cup, for it it were removed, it would cease to be a handle of anything. What qualifies as a subsystem of a larger system is often context dependent.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad265).
