x_comment(x_properGeographicalSubRegionTypes,"<code>(#$properGeographicalSubRegionTypes REGION-TYPE SUBREGION-TYPE)</code> means that every geographical region, or feature that is an instance of the collection <code>REGION-TYPE</code>, has at least one proper geographical subregion (via #$properGeographicalSubRegions) which is an instance of the collection <code>SUBREGION-TYPE</code>.  For example, \"every mountain has a summit\" may be expressed as (#$properGeographicalSubRegionTypes #$Mountain #$Summit).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad287).
