x_comment(x_attemptsToDoActType,"<code>(#$attemptsToDoActType ATTEMPTS ACT-TYPE)</code> means that <code>ATTEMPTS</code> is the collection of attempts to do acts of type <code>ACT-TYPE</code>.  Note that while some attempts are failures, some may be successful, so that <code>ATTEMPTS</code> and <code>ACT-TYPE</code> are not necessarily disjoint.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad292).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ad292,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
