x_comment(x_PreparingForSitTypeFn,"<code>(#$PreparingForSitTypeFn SITTYPE)</code> denotes the collection of all instances of #$PreparingForSituation that are preparings for instances of <code>SITTYPE</code> (which is itself some specialization of #$Situation). For example,  (#$PreparingForSitTypeFn #$VacationTrip) denotes the collection of all actions of preparing for a vacation trip.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad293).
