x_comment(x_assertionTrivialForJustificationParaphrase,"<code>(#$assertionTrivialForJustificationParaphrase ASSERTION)</code> means\nthat when <code>ASSERTION</code>, an instance of #$CycLAssertion, is used in a\ntransformation proof, it is deemed trivial. It is unnecessary to\nexplicitly mention <code>ASSERTION</code> as a support for returned bindings,\nbecause a human would regard it as obvious.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2bd).
