x_comment(x_objectRequiresNCapabilitiesOfTypeToSupportRoleInType,"<code>(#$objectRequiresNCapabilitiesOfTypeToSupportRoleInType OBJ N SET EVENT-TYPE ROLE)</code> means that <code>OBJ</code> requires other systems to provide at least <code>N</code> many of the capabilities in the set <code>SET</code> in order itself to play the role <code>ROLE</code> in an instance of <code>EVENT-TYPE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2be).
