x_comment(x_startsDurationAfterStartingOf,"A ternary #$TemporalPredicate that is used to state how long one #$TemporalThing starts after another starts.  <code>(#$startsDurationAfterStartingOf AFTER TIME BEFORE)</code> means that <code>AFTER</code> starts duration <code>TIME</code> after <code>BEFORE</code> starts.  That is, the #$startingPoint (q.v.) of <code>AFTER</code> is after the starting point of <code>BEFORE</code>, by an interval of #$Time-Quantity <code>TIME</code>.\n<p>\nSee also #$startsAfterStartingOf and #$startsDurationAfterEndingOf.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2c2).
