x_comment(x_startsDurationAfterStartOfInSituationType,"<code>(#$startsDurationAfterStartOfInSituationType SIT-TYPE AFTER-TYPE TIME BEFORE-TYPE)</code> means that in any instance <code>SIT</code> of <code>SIT-TYPE</code> (a specialization of #$Situation), if instances <code>AFTER</code> and <code>BEFORE</code> of <code>AFTER-TYPE</code> and <code>BEFORE-TYPE</code> occur as subsituations, then <code>AFTER</code> starts <code>TIME</code> after <code>BEFORE</code> starts.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2c3).
