x_comment('x_launchFromERHasStationCompromisedWRTCapability-WithRoot',"<code>(#$launchFromERHasStationCompromisedWRTCapability OP FACILITY FUNC-TYPE OBJ)</code> means that the rocket launch operation <code>OP</code> involves a range station <code>FACILITY</code> whose functionality, <code>FUNC-TYPE</code> is compromised in a manner that impacts the implementation of <code>OP</code>, due to a problem with <code>OBJ</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2d5).
