x_comment(x_scheduledStartDateOfSitOfTypeInScriptedSitOfType,"<code>(#$scheduledStartDateOfSitOfTypeInScriptedSitOfType\nSUB-SIT-TYPE SIT SIT-TYPE SCHED-DATE)</code> means that \n<code>SCHED-DATE</code> is the date that an instance <code>INST</code> of <code>SUB-SIT-TYPE</code> is scheduled to occur, at which time <code>INST</code> will be a sub-situation of <code>SIT</code>, which is itself an instance of <code>SIT-TYPE</code> that has <code>SUB-SIT-TYPE</code> as at least a candidate sub-situation type (see #$candidateSubSituationTypes).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2d6).
