x_comment(x_situationRequiresRepairOfObjToStartByDateForFutureStageOfType,"<code>(#$situationRequiresRepairOfObjToStartByDateForFutureStageOfType SIT OBJ DATE FUTURE-SIT-TYPE)</code> means that in order to have an instance of <code>FUTURE-SIT-TYPE</code> occur as a sub-situation of <code>SIT</code>, repair of <code>OBJ</code> must start by <code>DATE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2d7).
