x_comment(x_TermFromOntologyFn,"(#$TermFromOntologyFn ONTOLOGY) denotes the collection of terms created for the mapping of ONTOLOGY into Cyc. Many instances are special case terms that closely correspond to the OWL classes and properties. Those special case terms that prove generally useful may be renamed and made available for general use.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2d8).
