x_comment(x_launchSpaceLiftCommander,"(#$launchSpaceLiftCommander LAUNCH PERSON) means that on the day of LAUNCH, PERSON exercises final decision authority over the launch wing with controlling authority (see #$controllingLaunchAuthority-USAF over LAUNCH.  Responsibilities include approval to proceed with countdown and final clear to launch prior to liftoff.  The player of this role is accountable for public safety during the launch, and, in the event the mission is for the DOD, for the mission's success or failure.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2d9).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ad2d9,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
