x_comment(x_launchRangeOperationsCommander,"(#$launchRangeOperationsCommander LAUNCH PERSON) means that on the day of LAUNCH, PERSON is responsible for providing command and control of range operations capability, and for passing operations-related information to the SLCC and OD.  Here 'operations related' is defined as anything that affects range operations and safety capability.  The #$launchRangeOperationsCommander also provides go/no-go status for the range to the #$launchOperationsDirector.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2db).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ad2db,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
