x_comment(x_launchRangeControlOfficer,"(#$launchRangeControlOfficer LAUNCH PERSON) means that PERSON is the focal point of communications between the launch range and user during the countdown for LAUNCH.  This responsibility includes coordinating instrumentation configuration and testing and associated anomaly resolution activities with technical contracts.  The #$launchRangeControlOfficer also recommends changes to the range operations capability to the #$launchRangeOperationsCommander, and notifies the #$seniorMissionFlightControlOfficer of any range status changes.  Responsibility for determining range capability is delegated to the #$launchRangeControlOfficer when the #$launchRangeOperationsCommander is not on console.  Also, the #$launchRangeControlOfficer relays the range clear to launch to the launch agency.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2dc).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ad2dc,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517ad2dc,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
