xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517ad2dc,[]).
x_comment(x_launchAerospaceControlOfficer,"(#$launchAerospaceControlOfficer LAUNCH PERSON) means that during LAUNCH, PERSON is responsible for monitoring the status of aircraft in and around the launch restricted area for the launch range, insures that support aircraft are at pre-planned mission support positions prior to liftoff, and reports activity status and recommends final go/no-go to the #$seniorMissionFlightControlOfficer and #$launchRangeOperationsCommander.  Also, when a #$missionFlightControlOfficer issues an order that 'break away' instructions be sent to a support aircraft, the #$launchAerospaceControlOfficer directs the flight radar unit to relay these instructions.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2dd).
