x_comment('x_launch_AFLD-AFSD',"(#$launch_AFLD-AFSD LAUNCH PERSON) means that  PERSON manages Air Force and contractor team activities to ensure all booster, spacecraft and facility systems are ready for launch.  'AFLD' stands for 'Air Force Launch Director' and 'AFSD' for 'Air Force Site Director':  the two positions are ordinarily held concurrently and combined into one role.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2df).
