x_comment(x_currentStageOfTypeInScriptedSitOfType,"<code>(#$currentStageOfTypeInScriptedSitOfType SUB-SIT SUB-SIT-TYPE SIT SIT-TYPE)</code> means that:\n<br>\n(1) <code>SUB-SIT</code> is the currently occurring situation which is a sub-situation of <code>SIT</code>;\n<br>\n(2) <code>SIT</code> is of the type <code>SIT-TYPE</code>;\n<br>\n(3) <code>SUB-SIT</code> is of the type <code>SUB-SIT-TYPE</code>; and\n<br>\n(3) <code>SUB-SIT-TYPE</code> is at least a candidate sub-situation type (see #$candidateSubSituationTypes) of <code>SUB-SIT-TYPE</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2e9).
