x_comment(x_termExpansionExpected,"(#$termExpansionExpected TERM) indicates that assertions using TERM should be expanded into any and all possible component meanings.  For example, (#$isa #$HafezAlAssad (#$SubcollectionOfWithRelationFromFn #$Person #$president #$Syria)) would be 'expanded' into (#$president #$Syria #$HafezAlAssad).  Typically, this expansion will happen via rules in the KB, but it could just as easily be a directive that the inference engine takes into account when determine how to perform inference over assertions using these terms.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad2f2).
