x_comment(x_CreditCardAssociation,"A specialization of #$CommercialServiceOrganization, each instance of which sets the terms for banks who issue or collect payments on, and merchants who accept, credit cards of a particular brand (see #$CreditCardTypeByBrand).  Notable instances include VISA, MasterCard, Discover Financial Services, and American Express.  A credit card association may either have members who issue credit cards (as is the case with VISA and MasterCard), or it may be a bank that issues its own brand (as is the case with Discover and American Express).  Credit card asociations of the first type are instances of #$CreditCardAssociation-Cooperative; associations of the second type are instances of #$CreditCardAssociation-SelfIssuing.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad305).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ad305,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
