x_comment(x_behaviorIncapable,"<code>(#$behaviorIncapable OBJ SITTYPE ROLE)</code> means that <code>OBJ</code> is incapable of playing <code>ROLE</code> in any instance of <code>SITTYPE</code>.  Thus, <code>(#$behaviorIncapable HarryThePenguin #$Flying-FlappingWings #$doneBy)</code> means that <code>HarryThePenguin</code> is incapable of flying.   Cf. #$behaviorCapable and #$behaviorIncapable-CapabilityCompromised.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad317).
