x_comment(x_RocketPropelledDevice,"The collection of all devices designed to execute directed translations through a controlled application of Newton's Second Law, i.e., the principle that every reaction has an equal and opposite reaction.  In practice, this means that instances of #$RocketPropelledDevice obtain their motive power from the forcible ejection of mass, usually in the form of violently expanding gasses from a contained explosion, in the direction opposite the motion of the vehicle.  #$RocketPropelledDevices include all #$RocketEngines, as well as all devices which incorporate #$RocketEngines, including, e.g., bottle rockets as well as rockets designed for transport (see #$RocketPropelledTransportationDevice).") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad354).
