x_comment(x_Capability,"A first-order collection and a specialization of #$TemporalThing.  Each instance of #$Capability is an attribute that objects or agents can have.  Having an instance of the collection #$Capability indicates that an entity can play a role in a type of situation.  When an object OBJ has a capability, that does not entail that OBJ can unquestionably play the corresponding role in every such situation, since extrinsic factors may prevent it from doing so; for example, if OBJ is a tool, it may be in the wrong location or operated by a person lacking the requisite skills.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad35f).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ad35f,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517ad35f,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
