xc_mapping_rows(a65b16517ad35f,[]).
x_comment(x_ComplexCapability,"A first-order collection and a specialization of #$Group and #$Capability.  Each instance of #$ComplexCapability is a group of capabiliteis and also itself a capability.  For example, the ability to play golf is a complex capability, whose group members include both the capability to putt balls and the capability to drive balls.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad360).
