x_comment('x_GeographicalRegion-Declared',"The collection of all instances of #$GeographicalPlace whose physical extent is determined by the boundary declarations of some intelligent agent.  Instances include plots of real estate, such as individual homesteads, commercial zones, and educational districts; the territory (see #$territoryOf) any geopolitical entity (see #$GeopoliticalEntity) such as a country, province, state, township, etc.; and even playing fields (e.g., a football field) and their parts (e.g., the \"red zone\" the \"end zone,\").  In many cases, especially in regions of any large size, an instance of #$GeographicalRegion-Declared will be administered or managed by some intelligent agent -- these all belong to the sub-category #$GeographicalRegion-Administered.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad3c4).
