x_comment(x_suggestionGenlClassOrderedBy,"(#$suggestionGenlClassOrderedBy TERM REL NUM) means that if a specialization of TERM has suggestions generated for it, then it is reasonable to generate alternate hierarchical suggestion views with those suggestions using REL as the ordering relation.  One example use is in generating hierarchical drop down menus for the CAE or FET.  Arg3 indicates the direction of the ordering, e.g. terms ordered via #$genls are typically ordered more general to more specific; from arg2 to arg1, while terms ordered via #$physicalPartTypes are ordered from whole to part; from arg1 to arg2.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad3cd).
