x_comment('x_Cycle-IndefiniteTerminus',"The collection of all instances of #$Cycle-Situation for which it is not possible or practical to specify a well-defined temporal endpoint for local reasoning.  For example, the #$WaterCycle-Terrestrial for the whole of #$PlanetEarth will end at some future date a few billions of years into the future when the #$Sun starts burning #$Carbon and the oceans boil, but for purposes of temporally 'local' reasoning, the cycle can be regarded as non-terminating.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad406).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ad406,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
