x_comment('x_CommitteeAction-USFederalLegislating',"A specialization of #$LegalProceeding.  After a bill is introduced in the U.S. Congress, it is referred to an appropriate committee (see #$ReferralOfBillToCommittee-USFederalLegislating). Then the committee processes the bill by, for example, holding hearings or requesting information, or sending the bill to a sub-committee.  The collection #$CommitteeAction-USFederalLegislating denotes the collection of such potentially complex committee actions.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad477).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ad477,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
