x_comment(x_OilSpillPreventionAndLiabilityAct,"The #$OilSpillPreventionAndLiabilityAct strengthened the ability of the E.P.A. to prevent and respond to catastrophic oil spills, and established a trust fund (financed by a tax on oil production) which is available to clean up spills.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad4a7).
