x_comment(x_ResourceConservationAndRecoveryAct,"The #$ResourceConservationAndRecoveryAct established a solid waste program that encourages states to develop comprehensive plans for management of nonhazardous solid waste (industrial and municipal), set criteria for municipal solid waste landfills and solid waste disposal facilities, and prohibited open dumping of solid waste.  It also established a hazardous waste program that established a system for control of hazardous waste from the time it is generated until its ultimate disposal.  Finally, it created an undergound storage tank (UST) program for regulating underground storage tanks containing hazardus substances and petroleum products..  ") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad4a8).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ad4a8,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
