x_comment(x_ToxicSubstancesControlAct,"The #$ToxicSubstanceControlAct, or TOSCA, gave the #$EnvironmentalProtectionAgency the ability to track the industrial chemicals iproduced or imported into the #$UnitedStatesOfAmerica.  It also enables the #$EnvironmentalProtectionAgency to require reporting or testing of industrial chemicals that may pose an environmental or human health hazard, and allows the #$EnvironmentalProtectionAgency to ban the manufacture and import of chemicals that it judges to pose an unreasonable risk.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad4aa).
