x_comment('x_CourtCase-Appellate',"The class of all instances of #$CourtCase that are heard on appeal of an original case (see #$CourtCase-Original).  Each instance is tried in exactly one #$Court-Judicial and is presumed to include exactly one trial, and follows exactly one #$CourtCase-Original within a larger #$CourtCaseWithOneOrMoreAppeals, (although there may be intervening appellate cases within the same #$CourtCaseWithOneOrMoreAppeals.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad4ce).
