x_comment(x_agentInEcosystem,"(#$agentInEcosystem SYSTEM AGENT) means that AGENT acts constitutionally and on a regular basis in a way that directly contributes to the underlying self-regenerating process through which the overall 'operational parameters' of the #$Ecosystem SYSTEM are realized. ") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad4de).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ad4de,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
