x_comment(x_producerInEcosystem,"(#$producerInEcosystem ECOSYSTEM AGENT) means that, as part of the biological action which contributes to the overall 'autocatalysis' of ECOSYSTEM, AGENT implements endothermic processes which chemically store energy in a form that AGENT is then able to use as fuel to supply its continued metabolism.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad4df).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ad4df,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
