x_comment(x_consumerInEcosystem,"(#$consumerInEcosystem ECOSYSTEM AGENT) means that, in engaging in the actions which are part of the overall 'autocatalysis' of ECOSYSTEM, AGENT expends energy without storing it or engaging in biological actions which synthsesize fuel, so that it must actively seek out and consume chemically stored energy in order to continue functioning. ") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad4e0).
