x_comment(x_sourceFixesRelationArg,"<code>(#$sourceFixesRelationArg SOURCE PRED INT)</code> means that the structured information source <code>SOURCE</code> encodes the relation <code>PRED</code> to a series of arguments, where the <code>INT</code><i>th</i> argument of <code>PRED</code> is both implicit in <code>SOURCE</code> (i.e., not the value of any field in <code>SOURCE</code>) and has a fixed value for each proposition formed from <code>PRED</code> that <code>SOURCE</code> encodes.  To represent that the <code>INT</code><i>th</i> value varies for each such proposition, use the negation pred, #$sourceVariesRelationArg.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad529).
