x_comment(x_sourceVariesRelationArg,"<code>(#$sourceVariesRelationArg SOURCE PRED INT)</code> means that the structured information source <code>SOURCE</code> encodes the relationship <code>PRED</code> among a series of arguments, where the <code>INT</code><i>th</i> argument of <code>PRED</code> is both implicit in <code>SOURCE</code> (i.e., not the value of any field in <code>SOURCE</code>) and has a potentially distinct value for each proposition formed from <code>PRED</code> that <code>SOURCE</code> encodes.  To represent that the <code>INT</code><i>th</i> value is fixed for each such proposition, use the negation pred, #$sourceFixesRelationArg.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad52a).
