x_comment(x_OliverWendellHolmesJr,"The son of the poet, #$OliverWendellHolmesSr, and a noted justice on the #$UnitedStatesSupremeCourt.  Holmes is credited with being one of the first legal scholars to articulate the philosophy of legal positivism, defined roughly as the position that all laws in the human, legal sense are essentially arbitrary, deriving their authority solely from the power of the state, and not from any natural law or objective moral scheme.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad55e).
