x_comment(x_EdwardDouglassWhite,"A chief justice (#$chiefJusticeOfCourt) of the #$UnitedStatesSupremeCourt.  White presided over the noted case of SchenkVTheUnitedStates, in which #$OliverWendellHolmesJr, writing for the majority, first gave voice to the principle that speech constituting a 'clear and present danger' to the well-being of the #$UnitedStatesOfAmerica was not protected under the free speech provision of the #$FirstAmendment-USConstitution.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad55f).
