x_comment('x_SchenkVTheUnitedStates-CourtCase',"An important #$CaseHeardByTheSupremeCourt.  At issue was the question of whether the actions of #$CharlesSchenk, a prominent socialist who published pamphlets denouncing the draft and urging conscripts to resist enlistment, were protected by the #$FirstAmendment-USConstitution.  The court unanimously decided they were not.  #$OliverWendellHolmesJr, writing for the majority, authored an opinion stating that speech constituting a 'clear and present danger' to the welfare of the Republic was not permissable, insofar as it impugned or ran the risk of impugning, the rights of other citizens.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad560).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ad560,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
