x_comment(x_marketDemandIsPriceElasticWRTChange,"<code>(#$marketDemandIsPriceElasticWRTChange MARKET PRODUCT OLD-PRICE NEW-PRICE)</code> means that given a change in <code>MARKET</code>'s price of <code>PRODUCT</code> from <code>OLD-PRICE</code> to <code>NEW-PRICE</code> demand will change significantly; precisely speaking, the absolute value of the elasticity of demand in response to this change is at least 1.  To represent this value, use #$marketPriceElasticityOfDemand.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad57b).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ad57b,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
xc_source_file(a65b16517ad57b,'c:/snet/petta/repos/openworld_dr/KBs/fire/flat-files/nextkb/UniversalVocabularyMt.part06.krf').
