x_comment(x_marketPriceElasticityOfSupply,"A predicate that relates a market to the price elasticity of supply (the responsiveness of supply to changes in price) for a product-type in that market, in terms of a real numeric value. <code>(#$marketPriceElasticityOfSupply MARKET PRODUCT OLD-PRICE NEW-PRICE ELASTICITY)</code> means that given a change in <code>MARKET</code>'s price of <code>PRODUCT</code> from <code>OLD-PRICE</code> to <code>NEW-PRICE</code>, the elasticity of supply in response to that change has a numeric value of <code>ELASTICITY</code>.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad584).
xc_microtheory(a65b16517ad584,x_UniversalVocabularyMt).
