x_comment(x_MarketDependentGoodOrServiceCategoryType,"An instance of #$ThirdOrderCollection. Instances are categories of products, such that inclusion  in or exclusion from a category is dependent on the properties of the market (see #$Market) under consideration.  As such, for an instance <code>CATEGORY</code> of  #$MarketDependentGoodOrServiceCategoryType and an collection <code>TYPE</code>, a sentence of the form <code>(#$isa <code>TYPE</code> <code>CATEGORY</code>)</code> will hold only in microtheories that assume a certain market as well as certain features of that market at a given time and location.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad592).
