x_comment(x_predatorTypeHasPreyTypeInEcosystem,"(#$predatorTypeHasPreyTypeInEcosystem PREDATOR-TYPE PREY-TYPE SYSTEM) means that many instance of PREDATOR-TYPE consume instances of PREY-TYPE as resources in SYSTEM (#$consumerOfResourceTypeInSystem).  More specifically, this means that instances of PREDATOR-TYPE are capable of enacting (#$doneBy) subevents in the autocatalytic 'lifetime' of SYSTEM (#$autocatalyticProcessImplementsSystem) in which instances of PREY-TYPE are #$inputsDestroyed.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad5b9).
