x_comment(x_marketPriceCeilingIsEffective,"<code>(#$marketPriceCeilingIsEffective MARKET PRODUCT)</code> means that the price ceiling (see #$priceCeiling) imposed on <code>PRODUCT</code> in <code>MARKET</code> is lower than the actual price (see #$marketClearingPrice) for <code>PRODUCT</code> in <code>MARKET</code>, and so has a potential effect on <code>MARKET</code>, such as encouraging the creation of a black market or queuing costs due to an artficial shortage in supply.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad5bd).
