x_comment('x_metricComparisonTypes-Definite',"A #$RuleMacroPredicate that supports estimation of size comparisons.  Where TYPE1 and TYPE2 are specializations of #$SpatialThing-Localized, METRIC-PRED is a #$MeasurableQuantitySlot such as #$areaOfRegion, and COMP is a #$NumericComparisonPredicate such as #$greaterThan, (#$metricComparisonTypes-Definite TYPE1 TYPE2 METRIC-PRED COMP) means that for any instance INST1 of TYPE1 and any instance INST2 of TYPE2, if (METRIC-PRED INST1 QUANT1) is true and (METRIC-PRED INST2 QUANT2) is true, then the quantity QUANT1 bears the relation COMP to the quantity QUANT2.") :- x_cid(a65b16517ad617).
